window.AKK_VILLAINESS_GENTLE_SECOND_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_VILLAINESS_GENTLE_SECOND_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":101,"title":"Chapter 101: Didn't you promise to sleep with me","paragraphs":["An Ling never thought Mother Shen would come here; the chances of a neighbor coming upstairs were higher than this person showing up.","So she had not even considered that it might be Mother Shen.","Thinking of her reaction just now, An Ling's breath hitched, her eyelashes trembled, and her heart fluttered with panic.","Did Shen Linyan notice? After all, her usual reaction when facing Mother Shen was nothing like this.","No wonder...","No wonder he just looked at her without speaking.","An Ling pursed her lips tightly, her palms sweating nervously. She instinctively tried to pull her hand back, but the man held it tightly.","He gently rubbed the back of her hand with his thumb, his touch soft and slow, carrying a soothing undertone.","An Ling froze for a moment, then stopped moving.","While massaging his wife's hand, Shen Linyan looked at Mother Shen in front of him. \"What are you doing here?\"","Mother Shen sneered, \"Can I not come? I raised you for so many years, surely you owe me some gratitude for my upbringing?\"","Her gaze fell on their joined hands, her cold eyes shooting straight at An Ling, her lips curling in mockery:","\"You actually remarried, how interesting. An arranged marriage actually bred true feelings? I still remember when you were chasing Jing Shen, and now you like Shen Linyan? You are quite quick to change your affections.\"","Shen Linyan shielded An Ling behind him.","\"Is this all you have to say? If there is nothing else, I will take An Ling back to rest.\"","Mother Shen naturally would not have come all this way just to say these things. If it were not for business...","She took a document out of her bag and lifted her chin.","\"Shen Linyan, I know you are unemployed right now. I raised you for so long, after all. As long as you help your brother get the shares, I can offer you a job at the Shen Corporation. How about it?\"","This condescending tone made it sound as if giving Shen Linyan this job was a massive act of charity.","As her words faded, the hallway fell silent.","In the silence, a woman's quiet muttering suddenly drifted into the air.","\"Is her brain frozen stupid?\"","Hearing this, Shen Linyan chuckled softly.","With his hand behind his back, the man's fingertips intimately hooked her fingers, a tender gesture that seemed to signal his agreement.","An Ling paused, her eyelashes fluttering as her clear eyes lit up slightly.","A blush spread across her face, the corners of her lips turning up. She rested her forehead gently against the man's broad back, breathing in his warm cedar scent.","Mother Shen's face instantly darkened. Gritting her teeth, she snapped, \"An Ling, what did you say? Since when is it your turn to speak when I am talking to Shen Linyan!?\"","Hiding behind the man, An Ling poked her head out upon hearing this and blinked.","\"It is the truth. Why should my husband work for you? Where do you get the nerve? If Lu Jingshen is terrible at it, he should just practice more.\"","Shen Linyan had already signed a contract selling himself to her, yet this old woman still wanted to abduct him.","\"An Ling!!\" Mother Shen was so furious she could barely breathe, her whole body heating up despite the freezing weather. She gritted her teeth and pointed a finger at An Ling.","\"Do you think you can be so smug just because you have the An family backing you?! When the An family goes bankrupt, let us see how arrogant you can be then!\"","She glared angrily at Shen Linyan. \"Shen Linyan, I am only coming here this once! I am only giving you one chance! If you miss it, do not come begging me later!\"","The man merely chuckled, \"I listen to my wife.\"","Mother Shen was livid, her face turning ashen.","Simply unreasonable!!","\"You will regret this!\" Viciously dropping these words, Mother Shen turned and walked toward the elevator.","Once she left, the hallway returned to silence.","An Ling's gaze darted around, not quite daring to look at Shen Linyan's face.","Now that Mother Shen was dealt with, it seemed it was her turn.","But the man showed no intention of speaking.","He just quietly held her hand and walked toward the door, dragging the suitcase with his other hand.","Beep—","Pushing the door open and going inside, An Ling quickly changed her shoes.","Taking advantage of the moment the man was closing the door, she cast a glance before walking briskly toward her room without looking back.","Her lie had been exposed so suddenly; she needed to go online and search for an apology template first.","But maybe Shen Linyan had not noticed?","An Ling pursed her lips into a smile, thinking with a hint of wishful thinking.","She walked to the door and was just about to place her hand on the doorknob.","But the next second, a strong arm suddenly wrapped around her waist from behind, and an oppressive shadow fell over her, casting onto the door.","The man held her waist, resting his chin gently on her shoulder, his hot breath brushing against the side of her neck.","He unhurriedly grasped her hand, tilted his head to kiss her cheek, and chuckled softly.","\"Madam, you have gone to the wrong room. Did you not promise to sleep with me?\"","An Ling: \"...\"","Scared to death, it turns out she just went to the wrong room.","She thought he was going to interrogate her."]},{"number":102,"title":"Chapter 102: Is the Classic Plot of Wealthy Family Novels Finally Arriving","paragraphs":["After taking a shower, An Ling lay under the covers, holding her phone and quietly sending a message to Jiang Mai.","[I feel like Shen Linyan might have figured out I have face blindness.]","Jiang Mai: [Didn't you tell him that ages ago?]","An Ling: [I told him before that I only get face blindness after drinking.]","Jiang Mai: [So what was his reaction? Though I'm guessing Shen Linyan probably doesn't care about your condition.]","An Ling: [He didn't say anything and acted just like normal. The main problem is that I lied to him.]","Although she hoped Shen Linyan hadn't noticed so she could be the first to confess and admit her mistake, Shen Linyan was so smart that he had definitely caught on.","An Ling: [I'll wait until Shen Linyan gets out of the shower to talk about it. If worse comes to worst, I'll bring it up first.]","Jiang Mai on the other end fell silent for a minute.","[...Wait a second, are you guys sleeping together?]","An Ling was a bit confused: [Yeah, why?]","Jiang Mai: [Is the classic wealthy family romance novel plot finally happening?]","Seeing this message, An Ling froze. When she finally realized what Jiang Mai meant, her face flushed bright red.","She had been so worried about the face blindness thing that she hadn't even had the mind to think about that.","The pattering sound of water from the bathroom had stopped at some point.","Feeling the blanket being lifted, An Ling subconsciously locked her phone screen.","She kept her back to him, stiffly waiting for a few minutes, but he didn't say a word. Finally unable to hold back, she turned around, her eyes meeting the gaze of the man who was sitting on the bed looking over some documents.","The woman lay on the bed, half her face buried in the covers. Her messy, jet-black hair was scattered across the pillow, revealing a pair of moist, clear almond eyes. Her makeup-free face looked even more alluring.","Shen Linyan's eyes darkened slightly, his Adam's apple bobbing. His fingertips brushed against her hair as he softened his voice, \"Sleepy? Do you want me to turn off the light so we can sleep?\"","An Ling thought for a moment, then nodded.","Click.","In the pitch-black room, the only sound left was the rustling of fabric rubbing together.","The mattress dipped beside her. An Ling caught the faint scent of cedar from the man—crisp, clean, and deep, bringing her an inexplicable sense of security.","While she was still lost in thought, her hand was suddenly touched lightly.","An Ling's eyelashes fluttered, but she didn't pull away.","Sensing her tacit consent, beneath the covers, the man's long fingers slowly intertwined with hers, his fingertips gently grazing her palm.","\"Darling, I want to hold you.\"","In the dark room, the man's gentle, deep request was impossible to resist.","An Ling's face flushed slightly. She didn't speak, but gently pulled her hand back.","Then, she slowly shifted her body.","She reached out, but before she could embrace him, her waist was suddenly grabbed, and she was instantly pulled into a searingly hot embrace.","Shen Linyan lowered his head. In the darkness, his tall nose gently brushed against the woman's cheek. His breath fanned across her skin, sending a shiver through her.","He kissed the corner of her mouth, then parted his lips to gently take her lower lip, tenderly sucking and biting. His voice was husky, \"Such a good girl.\"","The woman's waist was slender and soft. A sweet fragrance emanated from her neck, mixing with the familiar scent of body wash. In the confined space, the scents intertwined and tangled together.","Shen Linyan's arm tightened slightly around her. His breathing unconsciously slowed as his nose gently nuzzled her, moving down inch by inch.","In the quiet room, only the soft, wet sounds of kissing could be heard.","Unable to see, her senses became all the more acute.","The man's soft hair brushed against her chin, bringing a slight tickle.","An Ling tilted her head back, letting out small pants, feeling his hot, thin lips plant kiss after kiss on her neck.","She noticed that Shen Linyan really liked kissing her neck.","Long fingers slipped under her pajamas. The man's fingertips were warm, bearing a thin layer of calluses, intentionally or unintentionally brushing against her waist.","A strange, tingling numbness crawled up her spine. A misty haze gathered in An Ling's eyes, and she couldn't help but let out a soft moan, the end of the note soft and enchanting.","In an instant, Shen Linyan's eyes darkened and his breathing grew heavy. He rolled over, hovering above her, and lowered his head to accurately capture her lips.","His tongue easily pried past her teeth. Unlike his usual gentle kisses, his movements now carried a sense of urgent plundering.","His burning breath almost made An Ling tremble. She was forced to open her mouth.","In the silent night, the cold wind outside was piercing, but inside the pitch-black room, it was filled with a warm, romantic atmosphere. The man's heavy panting echoed in her ears, brimming with an indescribable intimacy.","Taking advantage of a moment when he was kissing her cheek, An Ling wrapped her arms around his neck. Panting, she mumbled softly, \"Did you find out?\"","\"Hmm?\"","The man's voice was sexy, carrying a hint of hoarseness in the dark. He lowered his head, wanting to kiss her again. \"Find out what?\"","Sensing his breath drawing near, An Ling turned her head, so the kiss landed on her cheek. She whispered timidly, \"About that... my face blindness.\"","Shen Linyan lowered his eyes, kissed her face, and casually replied, \"Mhm.\"","An Ling didn't catch his absent-mindedness. She turned her head, took the initiative to kiss him, and blinked. \"I didn't mean to lie to you. Are you not mad anymore?\"","With her being so proactive, even if Shen Linyan had been angry, it should have faded by now.","In the darkness, An Ling couldn't see his expression, but she heard a soft chuckle rumble from his throat.","He lifted himself slightly and reached out to turn on the bedside lamp.","A dim, yellowish light illuminated the room. The woman lay on the bed, the collar of her pajamas in disarray. Her fair skin was bathed in a golden halo, and her scattered hair barely covered the marks underneath.","Her face was flushed, her beautiful eyes clouded with mist as she stared at him in confusion.","Shen Linyan's Adam's apple bobbed. \"You want me not to be mad?\"","He slowly leaned down, his lips brushing against hers as he gave them a light bite. The man raised his eyes to look at her. His handsome face was contoured with desire under the lamplight, and the breath he exhaled carried a husky laugh.","\"Darling, then let's do it with the lights on.\"","An Ling's face instantly exploded into a bright red.","A few seconds later, blushing furiously, she silently wrapped her arms around his neck.","The dark night deepened, and the temperature in the room soared.","The woman on the bed turned her head, trembling and panting. Her eyes were teary, and her broken moans trembled out of tune.","\"Slower...\"","Burning desire ignited the air.","An Ling let out a muffled groan, her trembling hands tightly gripping the bedsheets beneath her.","The man's warm palm covered hers, his long fingers sliding between hers until they were slowly interlaced.","He leaned down, kissed her cheek, and said with a slow smile: \"Actually, I was never mad.\"","An Ling was momentarily stunned.","When she realized what he meant, a deep scarlet flush spread from her face all the way down to her neck. Panting, she turned her head and bit down hard on his shoulder.","The man let out a soft grunt, gripped her waist, and chuckled softly. \"My mistake, darling.\"","...","After coming out of the bathroom a second time, An Ling lay on her stomach against the pillow, her cheeks flushed.","The man pressed against her from behind, his cool scent mixed with the damp heat of the shower. She closed her eyes, feeling drowsy.","Shen Linyan pulled her into his arms and called out softly, \"Darling.\"","The woman responded groggily: \"Hmm?\"","He lowered his eyes, his fingertips gently brushing her hair aside. \"Has anyone else ever noticed your face blindness before?\"","An Ling fell silent for a few seconds, then gave a slight nod.","She tilted her head to the side, resting with her eyes closed, her voice a bit hoarse. \"A very annoying person found out...\"","She paused, then suddenly opened her eyes. Grabbing the man's wrist, she pursed her lips and said in a small voice.","\"Shen Linyan, even though I can't recognize faces, I know who you are. You... you don't have to worry about me mistaking someone else for you. If someone comes to you and says anything, you have to remember to tell me.\"","Xu Huoqing knew about Shen Linyan's bankruptcy, so there was no telling if he would intentionally come looking for trouble.","The man's eyes curved into a gentle smile as he stroked her cheek.","\"I know. Go to sleep, my dear.\""]},{"number":103,"title":"Chapter 103: A Slap Worth Ten Thousand","paragraphs":["Nighttime, Golden Palace Club.","\"Mr. Xu, is it? Please follow me upstairs.\"","The waiter looked at the man in front of him, smiling as he bowed respectfully.","With his hands in his pockets, Xu Huoqing lazily looked up and clicked his tongue inwardly.","Bankrupt, yet he still has the money to come to a place like this.","But then again, the An family is quite wealthy.","Xu Huoqing and the waiter arrived at the door of a private room.","Pushing the door open, the main suite was incredibly spacious, with several bottles of expensive foreign liquor displayed on the table.","A man sat on the leather sofa. His features were cold and handsome, his aura noble and aloof. His long legs were casually crossed as he looked down at his phone, seemingly chatting with someone, faintly revealing a luxurious, expensive watch on his wrist.","Hearing the noise, he put down his phone and lifted his eyelids to cast a glance over.","Xu Huoqing took off his hat, walked over, and plopped down onto the sofa. \"You found out this quickly? I didn't lie to you, right? Just one test and you'd know.\"","The man set his phone aside, resting his arm casually on the back of the sofa. His tone was unhurried. \"When did you find out?\"","\"Me?\" Xu Huoqing poured himself a glass of wine and smirked. \"I already told you I've known An Ling for a long time. I was...\"","\"In junior high, right?\"","The man's flat voice interrupted him.","Xu Huoqing froze, blurting out subconsciously, \"How did you know?\"","Could it be that An Ling had told him?","But Shen Linyan merely chuckled upon hearing this.","He lowered his eyes, the corners of his lips curling into a peaceful arc. \"Does it matter? I also heard that An Ling transferred schools because of you.\"","\"Tsk, she told you, didn't she? It was just a joke back then. I didn't expect her to actually transfer schools over it.\"","Xu Huoqing didn't really want to discuss the past. He took a sip of his wine. \"Since you already know An Ling has face blindness, it makes things simple.\"","He pulled a bank card from his pocket and slapped it onto the table. Crossing his legs and leaning back on the sofa, he said, \"I know you're bankrupt and in desperate need of money. Here is two million. That shouldn't be a small amount for you. I want to make a deal.\"","Shen Linyan glanced at the card on the table, lightly tapping his fingertips against his knee. His tone was indifferent. \"Is that so? Let's hear it.\"","Xu Huoqing poked his inner cheek with his tongue. Remembering the hickey he had seen last time, he clicked his tongue again. \"An Ling must taste pretty good, right?\"","As his words fell, the man's movements suddenly halted, and the temperature in his eyes plummeted.","Xu Huoqing, however, was completely oblivious to the heavy, dangerous atmosphere around him.","His mind was filled with that woman's face, and he swallowed unconsciously. \"You know An Ling has face blindness, right? She wouldn't be able to tell anyway. Help me set up a date with her. Once I'm done, I'll give you another million. How about it?\"","Fuck, who told An Ling to treat him like that.","Xu Huoqing felt this wasn't a bad deal for Shen Linyan at all.","He lifted his chin. \"I know you're living off An Ling's money right now. You'll be earning from both sides anyway, and you don't have to worry about being found out. I've tried this before; if I change into your clothes, An Ling definitely won't recognize me.\"","The only response in the private room was an eerie, suffocating silence.","Seeing the man remain quiet, Xu Huoqing assumed he felt the money wasn't enough. \"If you think it's not enough, I'll add another million...\"","\"Heh.\"","The man on the sofa suddenly let out a low laugh.","He slowly took a cigarette from his pocket and lit it with a crisp click. The curling smoke obscured the icy coldness in his eyes, and his tone was unexpectedly calm. \"So you've done this before.\"","Just as Xu Huoqing was about to speak, the door beside him was suddenly thrown open. His expression froze, and as he looked up, he didn't even have time to see who it was.","\"Slap—!\"","A crisp, vicious slap echoed through the room.","\"Xu Huoqing!! What the fuck are you talking about!!\" A man's furious, teeth-gritting roar exploded in the private room.","Xu Huoqing's face was knocked to the side, a burning pain radiating from his cheek. But he had no time to care about the pain, staring blankly at the person in front of him.","\"...Uncle?\"","Why was his uncle here?","Guo Yu's face was dark with rage. Grabbing his nephew by the collar with furious disappointment, he couldn't resist slapping him hard across the face again. \"Didn't I tell you to stop provoking An Ling?! What the fuck are you doing here!\"","Provoking An Ling was bad enough, but to actually provoke Shen Linyan!","He grabbed the dazed Xu Huoqing and mercilessly kicked him in the calf.","\"Thump—\"","His knees slammed heavily against the floor. Xu Huoqing knelt pathetically in front of Shen Linyan, his face twisted in agony.","Guo Yu also dropped to his knees, his tone panicked and desperate.","\"Chairman Shen, my nephew is ignorant. Please be the bigger person and don't hold it against him. I will make him get out of your sight forever.\"","Watching his uncle's subservient, terrified demeanor, Xu Huoqing's delayed realization finally kicked in.","He looked up at the man on the sofa, his eyes filling with absolute terror, and swallowed hard. \"I...\"","Gu Xiaochi, standing to the side, didn't dare make a sound, his eyes full of pity.","This kid was completely doomed; his whole family might as well restart their lives in the next world with him.","Looking at the two men kneeling before him, Shen Linyan's expression remained perfectly indifferent as his long fingers slowly flicked his cigarette ash.","\"Let him go? Fine. If Mr. Guo slaps him twenty thousand times, I'll consider letting him go.\"","Guo Yu looked shocked. \"This...\"","How is that possible?","The man let out a soft laugh. \"You can't do it? Then we'll have someone else do it.\"","As soon as he spoke, the door to the private room opened.","Several heavily built, neatly dressed bodyguards marched in from outside.","Shen Linyan leaned back on the sofa and said lightly, \"Ten thousand per slap, until the two million is reached.\"","The bodyguards replied in loud, clear voices: \"Yes, sir.\"","Seeing those men walking towards him, all the blood instantly drained from Xu Huoqing's face. He finally realized Shen Linyan wasn't joking.","He really wanted his life!","A bone-deep chill spread from the soles of his feet, and a wave of pure terror surged up.","Trembling in all his limbs, Xu Huoqing crawled forward, his eyes wide with fear and his voice shaking violently. \"Chairman Shen, I was wrong! Just pretend I didn't say anything... I will apologize to An Ling, I won't say a word to anyone! Please let me go this time, I really won't say anything!\"","\"Apologize?\"","Shen Linyan crushed his cigarette out, stood up unhurriedly, and stepped his leather shoe firmly down onto Xu Huoqing's hand.","His thin lips curled up, but his pitch-black eyes were freezing cold, completely devoid of any warmth.","\"Are you implying that you still want to see my wife?\""]},{"number":104,"title":"Chapter 104: My Wife Is Waiting for Me at Home for Dinner (Word Count Supplemented)","paragraphs":["The atmosphere in the private room dropped to the freezing point, but no one dared to make a sound.","Pain spread across the back of his hand. Xu Huoqing was in so much pain that his breathing trembled, but he didn't even dare to beg for mercy.","Cold sweat soaked the back of his clothes. He knelt on the ground and shook his head frantically, his voice trembling: \"No, no, no!! I won't see An Ling again! Chairman Shen, I really won't go to see An Ling again!\"","Shen Linyan lifted his foot, his voice flat.","\"If you go looking for An Ling again, you won't be needing these eyes of yours.\"","Xu Huoqing nodded hastily, \"Yes, yes, yes...\"","Thinking the torture was finally over, he then saw the man slowly pick up the wine bottle from the table.","He looked up in terror, suddenly meeting a pair of icy black eyes.","\"Bang—!\" The wine bottle shattered upon impact.","Sticky wine mixed with blood flowed down. The marble floor was covered with broken glass shards, gleaming with a cold light.","Seeing Xu Huoqing unconsciously fall to the ground, Guo Yu's pupils shrank, but he didn't dare to say a word, his hands and feet trembling uncontrollably.","Shen Linyan took out a handkerchief and unhurriedly wiped his fingers, his tone calm.","\"The nephew drank too much and went crazy, and the uncle accidentally injured him. If there's a next time, you will lie here with him.\"","Guo Yu nodded frantically as if catching a lifesaver: \"Yes, yes, yes... I know, Chairman Shen, President Gu. Leave Xu Huoqing to me, I promise to keep him in line!\"","Gu Xiaochi stood to the side with his arms crossed. Looking at him like this, he couldn't help but click his tongue.","\"When I personally called you back then to tell you to keep Xu Huoqing in check, you really didn't take it to heart, did you.\"","Now look what happened, directly provoking Shen Linyan.","If it weren't for the fact that Guo Yu had just finished filming a variety show, and An Ling was in charge of this show, Shen Linyan wouldn't have let him off.","He walked over to Shen Linyan, \"Where are you going now? It's rare for you to come out. Do you want to call Wang Yihong and Liang Chen over for a drink?\"","The man took out his phone to check the time, his tone returning to its usual gentleness: \"My wife is waiting for me at home for dinner.\"","Gu Xiaochi: \"...\"","Don't think I don't know you're deliberately using the word 'wife'.","Married men are truly unbearable to look at.","Just as they were about to leave, the sound of footsteps suddenly rang out outside the private room.","Followed by a familiar male voice, \"Is Xu Huoqing in here?\"","\"Yes, President An.\"","Shen Linyan paused his steps, his eyes darkening slightly.","The private room door was pushed open.","In an instant, An Zhou met the gazes of over a dozen pairs of eyes.","He hadn't expected so many people to be inside, and couldn't help but freeze for a moment.","Seeing that Shen Linyan was also here, he frowned even more.","\"Why are you...\"","But when his peripheral vision caught the bloodstains on the ground and the unconscious Xu Huoqing, An Zhou's voice abruptly stopped.","He froze in place, his shocked and uncertain gaze scanning the room.","Holy crap... a murder?","And the suspect is his brother-in-law!?","Should he call the police?","As if seeing what he was thinking, the man said flatly: \"He's not dead, just passed out.\"","An Zhou's suspicious gaze shot unabashedly at Shen Linyan.","\"Did you do this?\"","Look what he said! He always said this guy Shen Linyan wasn't a good person! That girl An Ling still didn't believe it!","Then again, didn't An Ling say she didn't tell Shen Linyan? Or did these two already have a grudge?","Before Shen Linyan could retort, Guo Yu next to him suddenly shouted: \"No, no! My nephew drank too much and accidentally bumped into it! It has nothing to do with him!\"","Shen Linyan cast a sideways glance, then lifted his legs and walked towards An Zhou, his tone natural: \"I was just passing by and came in to take a look with a friend. What is President An doing here?\"","An Zhou's eyes were still full of suspicion, \"I came here to see Xu Huoqing about something.\"","He was naturally here to help An Ling warn Xu Huoqing.","But looking at the current situation, he probably couldn't warn him anymore.","\"Is that so?\" The man's expression remained peaceful, merely curling his lips, \"Then I'll head back first. An Ling is still waiting for me at home.\"","An Zhou frowned, glanced at the man's departing back, and then looked at the scene inside the room.","He suddenly spoke up: \"I'll go with you. I can check on An Ling while I'm at it. I just don't know if it would be inconvenient for me, as her brother, to visit so suddenly?\"","Hearing this, the man stopped in his tracks and turned his head to look over.","He curled his lips politely, but his tone was indifferent:","\"It is indeed a bit inconvenient.\"","An Zhou: \"...\"","Who cares! He was going anyway!","...","In the living room, An Ling was sitting on the sofa feeding snacks to Huihui.","The sound of the front door unlocking could be heard.","It seemed Shen Linyan was back.","She looked up, \"You're back...\"","But when she saw the man next to Shen Linyan, her voice paused, and she hesitantly glanced at his face.","A bit familiar...","Why did he look a bit like her brother?","The man met her gaze expressionlessly and called out her name: \"An Ling.\"","An Ling: \"...\"","It really was him.","Placing the snacks on the sofa for Huihui to eat by itself, she stood up and walked toward the door, \"Brother? Why are you here?\"","An Zhou coldly spat out two words: \"Free meal.\"","He walked through the door and was just about to speak when his peripheral vision suddenly caught the hickey on the woman's neck, causing his mouth to twitch fiercely.","But to be honest, it looked like a bug bite...","Suddenly realizing something, An Zhou's eyes froze.","Could the one from last time be...","After reacting, he glared fiercely at Shen Linyan, and then looked at An Ling with a gaze of disappointment.","An Ling: ?","Shen Linyan's expression didn't change at all as he walked over to the woman.","He quietly blocked An Zhou's appraising gaze and said softly: \"Did Madam not see the message I sent you?\"","An Ling shook her head, \"My phone is charging in the room.\"","If she left it in the living room, Huihui would always bite the cable.","Although she was a bit confused, she tilted her head and looked at An Zhou, \"Brother, take a seat anywhere. I'm going to get my phone.\"","After entering the room and closing the door, she asked, \"Why did you bring him back?\"","\"I just happened to run into him outside, and he said he wanted to come over.\"","The man stood in front of the wardrobe and took off his coat, revealing the crisp white shirt underneath. He casually rolled up his sleeves, his taut and powerful forearm bearing a silver watch, looking increasingly ascetic, his narrow waist and abdomen hiding a steady strength.","Especially when he was holding her in the bathroom last night...","She could feel that sensation even more.","Memories flooded her mind. An Ling's face reddened slightly, and she awkwardly shifted her gaze, walking to the bedside to unplug the charging cable, \"Then I'll go out first...\"","Before she could finish her sentence, she was suddenly hugged around the waist from behind. A burning chest pressed against her, and the man's chin rested gently on her shoulder.","An Ling put down her phone and turned to look at him, \"What's wrong?\"","The light in the bedroom shone on the man's handsome features, casting a shadow. He didn't speak, but just lowered his head and slowly pressed down.","The man's tall nose almost sank into her cheek. His palms cupped her face, his exhaled breath scorching, as he gently held her lips and kissed her little by little.","An Ling smelled a very faint scent of alcohol, turned around, and hugged his neck: \"Are you tired from socializing today?\"","The man softly hummed in agreement, his voice carrying an imperceptible trace of weariness, \"When we were discussing business tonight, someone outside drank too much and started a fight. Couldn't stop them.\"","Ever since she went to a social gathering last time, An Ling had become disillusioned with such events, which were all about drinking and forcing people to drink.","She looked at Shen Linyan's face, confirming he wasn't injured before speaking. \"You shouldn't get involved in fights between drunks. What if you get hurt? You didn't get hurt this time, did you?\"","\"No, I won't get involved next time.\"","The man curled his lips into a smile, lowering his head to kiss the woman's snow-white neck. \"Madam, change your clothes before you go out later.\"","An Ling subconsciously glanced at her collar, her eyes widening slightly as she realized what he meant.","She had taken off her silk scarf when she got home and completely forgot about this.","She covered her neck and gently pushed the man in front of her. \"This is all your fault. You always kiss my neck. You're not allowed to do it next time.\"","Shen Linyan's eyes curved with amusement as he parted his lips to speak. \"Then can I kiss where it can't be seen...\"","An Ling raised her hand to cover his mouth, her face flushing red. \"Fine, fine, fine! Stop talking!\"","Why was he even asking? Did this man not do exactly that last night?","...","An Zhou hadn't really come over with the intention of eating this time; he just wanted to see how An Ling was doing.","And also to talk about what happened today.","Walking over to the sofa, he saw Huihui munching away on some food. He hissed, his tone suddenly full of disgust.","\"Why did you get a cat?\"","He chose a seat far away from the cat and took out his phone. His secretary had sent a message a dozen minutes ago.","[President An, Xu Huoqing has been sent to the hospital. He has a mild concussion along with some minor injuries and is currently unconscious. Xu Huoqing's uncle is not pressing charges, so the Golden Palace is refusing to provide surveillance footage.]","An Zhou clicked his tongue. \"His head is pretty hard. To think it's only a mild concussion after all that.\"","Then again, the guy was thick-skinned too.","But did tonight's incident really have nothing to do with Shen Linyan?","Why did he find that so hard to believe?","[Tell me if Xu Huoqing wakes up.]","[Yes, sir.]","Having dealt with the matter, An Zhou had just put his phone away when a milky little meow suddenly sounded beside him.","Turning his head, he saw that Huihui had rubbed up against him at some point.","\"Damn, when did you get over here!\"","An Zhou hurriedly stood up and changed seats.","Although he didn't hate cats, he couldn't say he liked them either. He always felt these little creatures were too fragile and could just drop dead at any moment.","But Huihui seemed determined to go against him and chased after him again.","An Zhou: \"...\"","He stepped back to avoid the little guy and glanced toward the cat bed. \"Are you hungry? Didn't An Ling feed you?\"","Seeing some unopened snacks on the table, he picked them up, tore open the plastic bag, and warily handed it some dried meat.","\"Here you go, don't come any closer.\"","Huihui stopped instantly and lay on the sofa, eating the dried meat.","An Zhou laughed seeing this. \"An Ling really raised a foodie.\"","He looked at the little head bowed down eating and reached out to poke its ear.","Someone sent a message to his phone.","Qin You: [You can come pick me up in half an hour.]","Right, he almost forgot about this princess.","An Zhou: [Don't you still have two hours until your rehearsal ends? It's way too early for the movie.]","Both sets of parents said it was to foster their relationship, resulting in them having a fixed number of mandatory dates every week.","He had originally planned to just watch a movie tonight to get it over with, but this Miss Qin said she had to practice dancing until late, so they bought tickets for the 10:30 PM show.","Qin You: [Rehearsal ended early. Please bring me dinner. I want a diet meal: less carbs, more veggies, and no sauce.]","\"...\"","Was she treating him like a delivery guy?","An Zhou held back his frustration again and again. Remembering that inexplicable kiss from last time, he still hadn't let it go.","That was his first kiss!","His first kiss, kept for over twenty years, was suddenly just gone like that!","[I'm out at a social engagement right now and can't make it. Plus, why get delivery for a diet meal? Wouldn't it be better to just go eat at a restaurant.]","Qin You: [Okay.]","Qin You: [I'm dieting lately, so I'm not eating outside food.]","An Zhou's eye twitched. Looking at that \"Okay,\" he inexplicably felt a bit annoyed again.","[Send it, send it!! I'm almost done on my end too. Which place do you want to eat from?! I'll bring it to you later!]","Qin You: [(Link)]","Before An Zhou could even open the link to check the address, he heard the sound of a door opening.","Seeing the two of them come out of the room, he stood up from the sofa, pretending not to notice that An Ling had changed her clothes.","\"Something suddenly came up for me later, so I can't stay for dinner. You guys eat by yourselves.\"","Right before leaving, he suddenly stopped in his tracks and turned to look at An Ling.","\"An Ling, walk me out. I have something I want to tell you in private.\"","As he said this, he intentionally or unintentionally glanced at Shen Linyan beside her.","But the man showed no strange reaction at all; he simply held the woman's hand. \"Madam, remember to wear a coat. The wind outside is cold.\"","An Zhou: \"...\"","He just looked more and more suspicious!","After exiting the front door, waiting for the elevator doors to close, An Zhou finally spoke. \"I went to look for Xu Huoqing today.\"","An Ling could already guess it was about this. She had her hands stuffed in her pockets, her palms warm; Shen Linyan had slipped a hand warmer to her right before she walked out.","She nodded. \"Did you threaten him then?\"","\"No.\" An Zhou's tone was slightly heavy. \"When I got there, he had already been knocked unconscious on the floor, and there was blood all over the ground.\"","An Ling's eyes widened slightly, and she hesitantly asked, \"Dead...?\"","\"Not dead.\"","\"Oh...\"","\"?\"","An Zhou turned his head in astonishment. \"What kind of reaction is that??\"","\"What's wrong?\" An Ling gave him a strange look. \"Not dead means he's alive. What other reaction do I need? Am I supposed to be happy or disappointed?\"","An Zhou was left speechless.","That seemed to make sense too.","His expression was somewhat subtle as he slowly said, \"More importantly, do you know who was at the scene?\"","An Ling turned her head. \"Who?\"","\"Shen Linyan.\"","Hearing this, An Ling looked slightly startled and blinked. \"...Shen Linyan?\"","\"Yeah.\"","An Zhou described it vividly. \"You have no idea. The moment I pushed open the door to that private room, there were several people inside, the floor was covered in alcohol and blood, and Shen Linyan was just standing right there in the crowd...\"","An Ling looked thoughtful. \"Is that so...\"","An Zhou asked her, \"Did you mention Xu Huoqing to Shen Linyan?\"","\"No,\" An Ling shook her head.","Although they did talk about the incident last night, she remembered she hadn't mentioned Xu Huoqing's name.","\"Ding—\"","The elevator doors opened, and the cold night wind rushed in. An Zhou subconsciously shrank his neck.","He turned his head and said worriedly, \"Anyway, I've said it before, Shen Linyan isn't a good guy. Even though Xu Huoqing's uncle said it had nothing to do with Shen Linyan, the fact that he appeared there...\"","\"He went there for a social engagement.\"","An Ling spoke up, interrupting him. \"Shen Linyan already told me. Some people got drunk and started fighting, and he just went to take a look.\"","Saying this, she paused. \"However, Xu Huoqing knows of Shen Linyan, so it can't be ruled out that he intentionally went looking for him.\"","An Zhou choked on his words, staring at her with a complicated expression. After a long silence, he said, \"An Ling, you need to have a little bit of caution when it comes to Shen Linyan. Don't just foolishly believe whatever he says.\"","Saying things like this made it seem like he was trying to break them up.","But An Zhou really didn't mean it that way.","He just felt that An Ling had this absolute trust in Shen Linyan. Her good-guy filter for him was way too thick.","He had never even seen her trust her own biological brother this much!","\"Business matters aside, what if Shen Linyan really was the one who bashed Xu Huoqing? Didn't you marry him in the first place because you thought he was gentle? This is the exact opposite of your ideal type.\"","An Ling froze for a moment. She tightened her grip on her hand warmer and stayed silent for a while before finally speaking.","\"Brother, stop saying things like that. Shen Linyan isn't that kind of person. He is my husband, and even if he did hit him... that should still count as self-defense, right?\"","\"...\"","An Zhou had already anticipated this answer. He waved his hand in exasperation. \"Just keep taking your husband's side. I was only bringing it up casually anyway. Hurry up and go upstairs.\"","Watching An Zhou leave, An Ling stood at the entrance in a daze for a moment.","The cold wind hit her face, snapping her back to reality. She blinked, looked down at the time, and then turned around to step into the elevator.","Meanwhile, upstairs.","The man sat quietly on the sofa, his phone screen displaying a live surveillance feed. Seeing the woman get into the elevator, he lowered his gaze and took off his earphones.","Huihui, having eaten and drunk its fill, was resting beside him when its head was suddenly patted.","It lifted its head, only to see its male owner staring intently at something.","Huihui stood up and caught a glimpse of the screen on the man's phone.","There, on the search engine page, a typed question was prominently displayed:","Can a person's ideal type change?"]},{"number":105,"title":"Chapter 105: I Want to See the Madam [Word Count Replenished]","paragraphs":["After the incident that day, An Ling did not go to see Xu Huoqing, but she learned the ins and outs of the matter from An Zhou.","She heard that Xu Huoqing had drunk too much and threw a drunken fit in the private room, even trying to attack others. To prevent any chaos, Teacher Guo directly cut the Gordian knot and knocked his nephew out.","Moreover, Teacher Guo also found out about the things Xu Huoqing had done and taught him a severe lesson.","She didn't know how he was taught a lesson, but An Zhou said that when he went to find Xu Huoqing and explained his purpose, Xu Huoqing directly knelt down to apologize, crying and saying he would never dare do it again.","An Zhou even thoughtfully mentioned that he had recorded a video and asked if he should send it to her to watch.","An Ling flatly refused. She couldn't recognize Xu Huoqing anyway, nor did she want to see that ugly face.","Afterwards, Teacher Guo specially came over to apologize to her.","[I'm sorry, Miss An. When Xu Huoqing was young, his parents worked abroad, so no one really supervised him, and his temperament was spoiled. I'm sorry for causing you trouble. I will contact his parents and send him back abroad.]","An Ling: [The matter has been resolved, please don't take it to heart.]","Teacher Guo: [Xu Huoqing will not speak of those things either, so Miss An can rest assured. To show my apology, I know many screenwriter and actor friends, and I can introduce them to you.]","An Ling: [Okay, thank you.]","After sending it, she continued typing.","[If possible, is it convenient to ask about that night...]","Her fingertips hesitated on the screen. After a few seconds of silence, An Ling deleted this sentence.","Just as she put down her phone, a colleague's voice came from behind, Ah Leng, Teacher Chen is calling you.","She turned her head and stood up, Coming.","When Teacher Chen saw her come in, he looked up from the documents and picked up an invitation letter. This is the invitation to the jewelry banquet tomorrow night. Teacher Guo Yu had someone deliver it, saying it's an apology gift for you.","This kind of banquet usually invites many wealthy young ladies and masters, taking the opportunity to introduce the brand's new seasonal products at the party.","The An family had received such invitations before, but An Ling had never attended. After all, there were too many people to greet, and she couldn't recognize them at all.","But for producers, there would also be many brand representatives and investors at such banquets, making it very suitable for expanding connections. If she attended in the name of the company, it wouldn't attract too much attention either.","Was this what Teacher Guo meant by helping with introductions?","An Ling took the invitation letter. I will go. Then, Teacher Chen, you get back to your work.","As if remembering something else, Teacher Chen smiled and said, By the way, it seems your identity can't be hidden anymore. Even Lin Ya came to ask me if you are that An Ling. I told them to ask you directly if they wanted to know.","An Ling looked slightly stunned, then her face turned a bit red, feeling a little embarrassed.","She knew she was going to be found out.","During the lunch break, An Ling went to Jiang Mai's coffee shop.","There were quite a few people at this time. An Ling sat in her seat and waited for a while before Jiang Mai hurried over.","She pushed the bag on the table over. Have you not eaten lunch yet? I brought you a sandwich.","Leng Leng, you are so nice.","Jiang Mai picked it up, sat down, opened the plastic bag, and took a bite of the sandwich. Are you not busy today? Or is there something going on? Why did you suddenly come to see me?","Today is okay. An Ling touched her nose, her eyes wandering. Can't I come hang out with you just for fun?","Jiang Mai glanced at the expression on her face and instantly understood. She leaned back in her chair and snorted twice. Spit it out. One look and I know something's up. It's not that Xu Huoqing again, is it? Is he still harassing you?","No. An Ling shook her head. Xu Huoqing won't come looking for me anymore.","Really?","Jiang Mai was a bit skeptical. Didn't Xu Huoqing use your face blindness to threaten you last time? Did he just give up like that?","An Ling picked up the hot chocolate on the table and took a sip. He got his head smashed by someone a few days ago. I heard he was bleeding and hospitalized. My brother went to talk to him, and he apologized to me, saying he won't come looking for me again.","Oh my god. Jiang Mai couldn't help but smile. He finally got what was coming to him. This is a good thing. It's just a pity I wasn't there, otherwise I would have punched him too.","An Ling paused slightly, silent for a moment before speaking, Do you think breaking...","The words character persona got stuck on her lips, and An Ling silently swallowed them back.","She really wanted to scold An Zhou.","It was all his fault for always talking about it, causing her to start thinking about these nonsense things.","As the coffee shop got more crowded, Jiang Mai finished eating and turned to look. Then I'll get back to work.","Okay, go ahead. An Ling nodded. I'll be heading back to the company soon too.","After Jiang Mai left, she glanced at the time, and a message suddenly popped up on the screen.","Shen Linyan: [Is my wife here ^^]","She was slightly taken aback, and then the corners of her lips curled up.","An Ling: [Hubby, I'm here ^^]","Shen Linyan: [I got the project we discussed that night. Now I have money to buy a ring.]","An Ling: [(◍•ᴗ•◍) Buy it! We'll pick it out together when you come back tonight.]","An Ling put away her phone in a very good mood.","See, she had said that Shen Linyan really went to a business dinner that night, and only An Zhou didn't believe it.","On the other side, in the office, Secretary Chen looked at the man who was engrossed in messaging.","He couldn't help but remind him, Chairman Shen, it's time. President An and President Wen are waiting for you.","Hearing this, the smile on the man's face instantly faded. He put away his phone, stood up, and said indifferently, Let's go.","...","An Zhou had specially come to Dahl Company today to discuss the project.","After winning the bid last time, Damian quickly returned to his country, saying that another person in charge would talk to him.","But he didn't expect this person in charge to be an old acquaintance.","Following the employee into the office, when he clearly saw the man in front of him, surprise flashed in his eyes. You are the person in charge of Dahl Company?","Wen Yuche smiled and reached out his hand to him. It's me. Thanks for taking the trouble to come all this way, Brother An.","You hid yourself quite deeply, kid! An Zhou shook his hand back, beaming with a bright smile, his tone still carrying surprise.","It's in the bag!","The acting CEO of Dahl Company was actually an acquaintance!","Why didn't you tell us last time we had dinner at home?","Wen Yuche poured tea for him and replied, It wasn't confirmed last time. I only took office after Damian left.","An Zhou took the tea handed to him and suddenly realized. No wonder Damian chose us. Did you recommend us?","He had wondered why they didn't choose the Shen family, but chose the An family instead.","It turned out they had an insider!","Hearing this, Wen Yuche's movements paused, and the smile on his face was a bit forced. Well... my recommendation wouldn't have played much of a role.","An Zhou just thought he was being modest. He smiled and patted his shoulder. Don't be polite. The An family being able to win the project this time is all thanks to you. If there's anything you need in the future, feel free to come to the An Group. I'll definitely help if I can.","It was just a pity that a girl like An Ling insisted on liking that big bad wolf, Shen Linyan.","If she were together with Wen Yuche, then the An Group surpassing the Shen Group would be just around the corner!","Thinking of this, he said seriously again, I'm really sorry about the blind date. I didn't know that girl An Ling was still in contact with her ex-husband. Actually, our family at that time...","Hearing this, Wen Yuche immediately widened his eyes.","He hastily waved his hands, his gaze darting to the door in a panic as if terrified someone might walk in. His tone was inexplicably urgent: \"Hahaha, Brother An, you don't need to say that. No, no! When we went on that blind date, An Ling and I were just treating it as friends!\"","Oh, Brother An! You can't just say whatever you want!","Seeing Wen Yuche's reaction, An Zhou also glanced toward the door, instantly understanding.","He got it. As the newly appointed acting chairman, there were bound to be many eyes on him. He really did need to be cautious.","He dropped the subject and, as if recalling something, changed the topic: \"By the way, do you know about the newly established AL Group? I heard it was started by some foreign investor.\"","This company had been established so suddenly and quietly that, at first, no one paid any attention to it.","It wasn't until they signed several major projects and their stock prices skyrocketed that everyone finally noticed this dark horse that had come out of nowhere.","Hearing this, Wen Yuche's expression turned slightly subtle. \"...I know. The boss of that company is friends with Damian.\"","\"So they're friends,\" An Zhou nodded.","No wonder they had massive funding and startup projects right out of the gate.","Wen Yuche checked the time.","\"He's coming today too. He should be here soon.\"","Saying this, he looked at An Zhou again, hesitating before adding, \"And... he wants to meet with you.\"","\"Me?\" An Zhou was surprised. \"To collaborate with the An Corporation?\"","Just as Wen Yuche was about to speak, a knock sounded at the door, followed by his secretary's voice.","\"President Wen, Chairman Shen is here.\"","Hearing the voice, both men in the room paused.","An Zhou wondered to himself why that boss was also surnamed Shen.","But when the door opened and he saw the man's familiar face, he felt as if he had been struck by lightning.","Wen Yuche stood up to introduce them: \"Um... President An, this is Chairman Shen of the AL Group.\"","Wen Yuche was still hesitating whether to continue the introduction, but the man raised a hand to stop him, his voice cold and clear.","\"President An. A pleasure.\"","The man standing before him was tall and straight, with broad shoulders and a narrow waist. Dressed in a well-tailored dark suit, his handsome features exuded a calm, noble sense of detachment.","If it wasn't Shen Linyan, who else could it be?","An Zhou stood up in shock, his face full of disbelief.","This had to be fake, right?","\"You started AL Group?\"","This guy actually started a company? What kind of terrifying speed was this?","Remembering what Wen Yuche had said earlier, An Zhou's face cycled through a spectrum of colors.","So the reason Damian chose them before was because...","The man sat down on the sofa. \"I started it.\"","\"...\"","An Zhou furrowed his brows.","Everyone said Shen Linyan was bankrupt now, and even his sister firmly believed it.","But now, he had rapidly established an enterprise and even knew Damian.","To have such means, Shen Linyan was definitely not as down-and-out as the outside world claimed. The money and power in his hands were far greater than anyone imagined.","An Zhou blurted out, \"You didn't go bankrupt? You lied to An Ling?\"","Damn it! He had told An Ling long ago not to trust this guy!","An Zhou turned, wanting to leave.","The man's voice came from behind him.","\"I can keep collaborating with the An Corporation on the AL and Dahl projects.\"","An Zhou's footsteps instantly halted.","He turned around. \"What do you mean? What does the Dahl project have to do with you?\"","\"Dahl is also under my control. Even the project President An secured previously was recommended by me.\"","An Zhou: ?","He turned to look at Wen Yuche in astonishment, only to receive a complicated and helpless nod.","\"He is a shareholder.\"","\"...\"","An Zhou opened his mouth, furrowing his brows. \"Shen Linyan, what are you trying to do?\"","The man didn't speak; he merely lifted his eyelids and glanced at Wen Yuche.","Wen Yuche instantly understood and opened the door to leave.","Once only the two of them were left in the office, Shen Linyan slowly spoke:","\"I hope President An will stop interfering in the matters between me and my wife.\"","Hearing this, An Zhou remained silent for a few seconds, his brows slowly knitting together. \"You're doing all this just to trick An Ling into remarrying you?\"","This was too dramatic.","An Zhou still found it somewhat hard to believe. \"Are you really not after the An Corporation?\"","\"...\"","The air was quiet for a moment before the man spoke in a mild voice, \"I have no interest in the An Corporation. I even gave AL to An Ling.\"","An Zhou's expression froze.","After snapping back to reality, he couldn't help but click his tongue. \"Damn.\"","That girl was truly lucky. Shen Linyan had actually given the company to her; she could just sit at home and collect the money.","Meanwhile, here he was, being threatened by someone.","Should he choose to let his sister know the truth about her marriage, or choose the bright future of the An family?","An Zhou raised his hand without hesitation.","\"Fine, I won't say anything. I choose the projects.\"","As long as Shen Linyan didn't target the An family, it was fine.","This was the husband An Ling had chosen for herself, so let her believe in him!","As if realizing something, An Zhou asked again, \"So you were indeed the one behind what happened to Xu Huoqing, right?\"","The man didn't speak. He just lowered his eyes and drank his tea, seemingly acquiescing.","An Zhou cast him a glance.","It really was him.","\"Shen Linyan, I can keep my mouth shut, but you'd better pray that when she finds out, An Ling won't be angry.\"","An Zhou hissed lightly. \"But let me tell you first, your true colors probably won't soften An Ling's heart. That girl likes the gentle types.\"","The man's movements instantly halted, his fingertips tightening slightly.","He lowered his eyes, his dark irises as deep as a bottomless lake, and said softly:","\"I know. She won't find out...\"","As long as An Zhou didn't tell her.","She would never find out.","...","After work, An Ling returned home.","Shen Linyan was going to be home late today. After taking a shower and turning on the heating, she sat on the sofa, planning to pick out rings first.","This diamond was too big; skip.","This one was too flashy; skip that too.","This one was both ugly and expensive; absolutely not.","Shen Linyan suited simple yet exquisite designs, something that exuded elegance in a low-key manner.","After selecting a few styles, drowsiness gradually washed over her. The living room was quiet and warm, making for a very comfortable sleeping environment. She pulled the blanket tighter around herself, tilted her head, and lay down on the sofa to take a short nap.","An unknown amount of time passed before a beep sounded from the front door.","As soon as Shen Linyan walked in, he saw the woman lying on the sofa.","He paused slightly, then gently closed the door, lightened his footsteps, and walked over.","Under the dim light of the floor lamp, the dark blue blanket made the woman's figure look even more petite. Half of her face was quietly buried in the blanket, her long eyelashes casting faint shadows. She looked beautiful and pure.","He crouched down, resting his hand on the sofa. After a few seconds of silence, he slowly lowered his head and planted a kiss on the woman's face.","The man's movements were very gentle, as if afraid of waking the sleeping woman.","As his warm breath washed over her, the woman's eyelashes fluttered slightly, and she slowly opened her eyes.","Slow to react, she turned her head, her clear eyes looking at him with a hint of daze. She seemed to be trying to recognize him, her voice soft and sleepy: \"Shen Linyan? You're back?\"","\"It's me,\" Shen Linyan lowered his head and nuzzled her cheek. \"Why didn't my wife go back to the bedroom to sleep?\"","An Ling felt a bit ticklish from his nuzzling and tilted her head, giggling. \"I was waiting for you to come back. If I fell asleep in the bedroom, you wouldn't wake me up, and then I wouldn't know you were home.\"","Hearing this, the man's movements froze.","He suddenly looked up at her. His dark eyes were exceptionally deep in the night, swirling with countless unspoken emotions. His voice was incredibly soft.","\"Did my wife want to see me?\"","An Ling blinked. Her eyes curved into a playful smile as she deliberately held back her answer. \"Guess.\"","The man let out a low chuckle and lowered his head, pressing a tender, doting kiss to her eyes.","\"Well, I wanted to see my wife.\""]},{"number":106,"title":"Chapter 106: Honey, Don't Bite [Restored]","paragraphs":["A gentle kiss landed on her eyes, and a scorching breath washed over her.","The man carried a faint scent of tobacco, but it wasn't pungent; instead, it was crisp and soft. His features were deep and exquisite, and paired with a sharp, well-tailored suit, it gave him an air of restrained asceticism.","An Ling always thought Shen Linyan looked incredibly handsome in a suit, exuding a refined and aristocratic charm.","\"How much did you miss me?\" she asked, deliberately teasing him as she reached out and gently tugged on his tie.","Shen Linyan rested his long legs on the sofa, kneeling as he braced his hands on either side of the girl.","\"Does my wife really want to know? I can prove it.\" He chuckled softly, leaning down to kiss her earlobe, his warm lips lingering by her ear.","A tingling sensation traveled down from her ear straight to her lower back. An Ling's waist went soft. She initially thought her ears were just overly sensitive, only to realize that the man's hand had slipped under her clothes at some point.","His palm was warm, and the rough pads of his fingers brushed against the skin of her waist, sending a shiver through her. She instantly realized what this proof meant.","\"Aren't we going to look at rings?\" An Ling pressed down on his arm, wanting to put up a token struggle.","The man looked up at her, his eyes slowly curving into a smile.","\"Wife, it's still early. We can look at them after we're done.\" His gentle voice dissipated as their lips and teeth intertwined.","The floor lamp cast a dim, yellow halo. The blue blanket slipped off the edge as fair, slender arms wrapped around the man's neck. In the next second, she was lifted up, firmly supported by her thighs. An Ling instinctively wrapped her legs tightly around the man's solid waist.","Panting, she rested her head on his shoulder. Her eyes grew misty as she stared at his neck, and suddenly, she leaned in and gave it a bite.","The next moment, a faint, muffled groan reached her ears. It was different from usual—husky and incredibly sexy.","Thinking she had bitten him too hard, An Ling blinked and leaned in again, pressing a kiss to the spot she had just bitten in a slightly coaxing manner.","Bang.","As soon as they entered the room, the man pressed her against the door.","His breath was scorching. His tongue slipped in, and an urgent, burning kiss rained down on her, making An Ling's body tremble.","Pressed tightly together, their thin clothing could not hold back the searing heat.","The temperature rose, igniting the air around them.","In the dimly lit room, on the messy bed, the man's large hand with well-defined knuckles grasped hers, the veins on the back of his hand bulging.","The woman's silk-like hair spread across the bedsheets, rippling like waves. Her face was flushed, and though she bit her lip, fragmented pants uncontrollably escaped the corners of her mouth.","\"Honey, don't bite.\" Her chin was pinched as the man leaned down to kiss her lips. His breath grew even hotter. Low groans mingled with heavy panting, echoing in her ears again and again.","The man buried his head in the soft, damp, and fragrant crook of the woman's neck, gently kissing away the beads of sweat.","\"Wife...\" He turned his head slightly, his deep, hoarse voice brushing lightly against her ear, seemingly whispering something.","Unfortunately, An Ling's mind was a mushy, dizzy haze at that moment, and she didn't catch a single word he said.","In the end, there was no time to look at the rings they had previously picked out.","The next day, An Ling stood in front of the mirror brushing her teeth, tilting her head to inspect the hickey on her collarbone.","The man, now fully dressed in a suit, hugged her from behind, resting his chin on her shoulder. \"Wife, I didn't leave it on your neck this time.\"","Why did he sound so proud of himself?","Looking at her husband's handsome face, An Ling expressionlessly reached out and covered it with her hand. Biting down on her toothbrush, she mumbled indistinctly, \"You said it was still early and we'd look at the rings after we were done.\"","Yet someone had kept at it until the early hours of the morning.","\"My fault.\" The man smiled, taking her hand and pressing a kiss to her palm.","After rinsing her mouth, An Ling recalled last night and turned to ask, \"Did you say something last night? I didn't hear it clearly.\"","Hearing this, the man paused slightly. He lowered his eyes, his lips curling into a smile as he said gently, \"It was nothing.\"","An Ling washed her face and left the bathroom, heading to the walk-in closet to pick out an outfit.","A moment later, the woman's muffled voice drifted out. \"By the way, I have to attend a jewelry banquet tonight, so I might be back a bit late.\"","The man, who was sitting on the sofa looking at his phone, looked up. \"Don't you dislike attending these kinds of events, Wife? Do you need me to go with you?\"","\"I'm going on behalf of the company, so no one should recognize me.\" An Ling came out dressed in a long, pastel pink dress that gave her a clean, elegant aura, her long hair cascading over her shoulders.","\"Besides, I've never been to one, so I'll just treat it as going out for fun.\"","She took the hand the man offered and naturally sat on his lap, smiling as she wrapped her arms around his neck. \"If you go, I'd have even less fun. You should just focus on your work.\"","Shen Linyan wrapped his arms around her waist, lowering his head to gently kiss the corner of her lips. \"Alright. I'll pick you up tonight. Buy whatever catches your eye. There's no need to save; the company has money now.\"","An Ling smiled brightly and kissed his cheek. \"Okay.\"","See, she had said it before—Shen Linyan could make a fortune anywhere. There was absolutely no need to worry about him going bankrupt.","...","The banquet was held at a private club.","In the main hall, crystal chandeliers hung down like a waterfall of stars, refracting soft, fragmented light that spilled across the marble floor.","The long dining tables were covered in satin tablecloths. White lilies of the valley twined around silver candelabras, where warm candle flames flickered gently, intertwining with the cool, crystalline light and shadows in a display of exquisite luxury.","By the time An Ling arrived, the hall was already quite full. She took a glass of champagne from a passing waiter and looked around.","Just as she was about to find an inconspicuous corner to stay in, a voice rang in her ear.","\"Producer An!\"","Following the sound, she saw a man walking toward her.","There was only one person here who would call her that.","When the man approached, she smiled and shook his hand. \"Mr. Guo.\"","\"I've been waiting for you. My screenwriter friends are here, and a few artists are over there too. Shall I introduce you?\" Guo Yu gestured toward a particular direction.","Following his gesture, she indeed saw a few people gathered together.","An Ling gave a casual glance, then smiled and shook her head. \"No need. I'm just here to take a look around today. You can go ahead and busy yourself; don't worry about me.\"","She hadn't come here with the genuine intention of expanding her network. She suffered from face blindness and was hopeless at this kind of socializing anyway. She was only here to accept Mr. Guo's apology.","After all, she was Ms. Chen's student, and Ms. Chen and Mr. Guo would have other collaborations in the future. It wouldn't be good to make things too awkward because of her.","More importantly, she was genuinely curious about what this kind of banquet looked like.","Hearing this, Guo Yu didn't force the issue. He nodded and smiled, \"Alright, just call me anytime if you need anything.\"","\"Okay.\"","The sound of their conversation attracted the attention of the people over there. One of the women looked up and happened to lock eyes with An Ling, a look of surprise crossing her face.","She said something to her group and then walked over.","\"An Ling?\"","An Ling's gaze landed on her red hair. She paused slightly for a moment, then took a few more looks at the woman's face.","\"Shen Fuyuan?\" After looking at so much material over the past few days, An Ling had a very deep impression of Shen Fuyuan's facial features.","Fuyuan hadn't expected to run into her here. \"Did you come alone? Big Brother didn't come?\"","\"No, I came by myself.\" An Ling paused, then added, \"Plus, I'm here representing the company.\"","For some reason, running into an acquaintance like Shen Fuyuan here gave her a bad premonition.","Ever since Shen Linyan left the Shen family, Shen Fuyuan hadn't seen him.","When they were filming the show, her eldest brother wasn't at home either.","\"I don't even dare go to your house to see the cat anymore. My mom is keeping a really close eye on me.\"","Shen Fuyuan seemed to have found an outlet to vent and talked non-stop, \"And do you know how oppressive the atmosphere at home has been since my eldest brother left? I feel like Mom and Dad and... mmpf!\"","An Ling quickly covered her mouth. \"There are so many people here, don't talk about this here.\"","Everyone knew Shen Fuyuan was the eldest daughter of the Shen family. There was media everywhere, and if she wasn't careful, she'd be filmed and exposed.","The Shen family's reputation aside, the real problem was that Shen Fuyuan would definitely be scolded to death by Mother Shen.","\"Try not to call me by my name, either. I don't want to expose that I'm An Ling. I'm just here to have some casual fun.\" Seeing the girl quiet down, An Ling let go of her hand.","If Shen Fuyuan hadn't approached her first, she wouldn't have greeted her even if she recognized her.","Shen Fuyuan didn't quite understand. \"Why don't you want to expose yourself?\"","\"Because it's troublesome.\"","\"But Zhou Wen is here too, and she'll definitely call out to you.\"","\"...\"","An Ling's eyelid twitched. \"She's here too? What about Lu Jingshen?\"","A banquet, the female lead, and the vicious female supporting character.","All the elements were gathered, missing only the male lead.","Shen Fuyuan pondered for a moment. \"Hard to say. They had a fight recently.\"","\"Huh?\"","An Ling's ears instantly perked up. She pulled Shen Fuyuan into a hidden corner and blinked curiously. \"A fight?\"","\"Yeah, the last time I went home, I accidentally overheard Zhou Wen venting to Mom.\"","Shen Fuyuan didn't pay much attention to this kind of thing, so she only caught the gist. \"I heard that Second Brother lost several projects and got scolded by Dad. When he came home, Zhou Wen asked him out of concern, but Second Brother just yelled at her, and that's how the argument started.\"","Getting frustrated at the company, suppressing his anger, and then coming home to take it out on his wife.","An Ling couldn't help but click her tongue.","What a coward. She had warned them long ago that Lu Jingshen was a man prone to anger.","No wonder Mother Shen came looking for Shen Linyan a few days ago, wanting him to go back. It turned out her own son was just too incompetent.","Just as they were talking, a woman's voice came from beside them.","\"Shen Fuyuan, so you're here...\"","The two of them turned to look at the same time.","When she saw An Ling, Zhou Wen froze for a moment. Her fingertips dug into her palms, and the smile on her face stiffened slightly. \"An Ling, you're here too?\"","Although An Ling didn't recognize her right away, she guessed who it was.","She nodded somewhat coldly.","It was better not to run into them in this kind of accident-prone danger zone typical of novels.","\"I'm just going to look around. I'll get going first.\" She waved at Shen Fuyuan.","Just as she turned around, Zhou Wen's voice suddenly rang out.","\"How has Eldest Brother been doing lately?\"","Her footsteps stopped instantly.","The woman turned her head to stare at her but didn't say a word.","Being stared at by her, Zhou Wen explained, \"I haven't seen Eldest Brother in a long time. I sent him a message before asking how he was doing, but he didn't reply to me...\"","\"Does he need to report to you? Are you his boss?\" An Ling's tone was calm, but it carried a hint of imperceptible displeasure.","Were they that close? Did she really need to ask how he was doing?","When they previously sought out Shen Linyan to clean up Lu Jingshen's mess, she didn't see her offer a single word of greeting.","Hearing this, Zhou Wen paused, and then her brows furrowed.","Her mood instantly soured a bit. \"What report? I'm just concerned about Eldest Brother because he used to care about me too.\"","She simply hated An Ling's temperament. It was the same before; even though she hadn't done anything and was just giving a normal gift, An Ling still targeted her like this, deliberately calling her tie ugly.","Eldest Brother had probably seen An Ling's reaction, been nagged by her, and out of respect for An Ling's status as his wife, had changed his attitude.","And now he wouldn't even reply to her messages.","Thinking of this, Zhou Wen's frown deepened, and her eyes carried a hint of blame. \"An Ling, not everyone is like you, coveting other people's husbands. I did work as Eldest Brother's secretary back then, but there was nothing between us. We're just simple friends. Showing concern is perfectly normal. If I really wanted something to happen with Eldest Brother, it would have happened a long time ago.\"","If she had wanted to be with Shen Linyan back then, An Ling wouldn't have even been in the picture.","\"Do you really like Eldest Brother? If you like someone, you shouldn't use your status as his wife to restrict his friendships, or even treat his friends with this kind of attitude.\"","Zhou Wen's voice wasn't loud, but she sounded so self-righteous that she instantly attracted the attention of most of the people around them.","The Shen family's daughter, the Shen family's second daughter-in-law, and a strange woman—it looked like there was some major gossip to be had. The gazes of the crowd fell upon them one after another.","Several of Zhou Wen's friends walked over and asked curiously, \"Zhou Wen, who is this?\"","\"This...\" Zhou Wen only then realized that her words had likely been heard by others. She bit her lip, a trace of panic flashing across her face.","She had been fighting with Lu Jingshen these past few days. Although Lu Jingshen eventually apologized, his attitude was extremely perfunctory, completely lacking his former thoughtfulness.","It was useless to talk to Mother Shen, as she naturally favored her son. Zhou Wen had been holding in a lot of pent-up anger.","She subconsciously wanted to find Shen Linyan to pour out her grievances, but he wouldn't even reply to her messages.","She knew that Shen Linyan's life must be difficult after being kicked out. The Shen family wouldn't let him off easily, and now he was being suppressed by An Ling.","Noticing the gazes of her friends and the surrounding crowd, and catching sight of someone already raising their phone to record out of the corner of her eye, Shen Fuyuan paused, her eyes flickering.","That's right, she could help her eldest brother and let everyone else see what kind of person An Ling really was.","She pursed her lips and spoke up, \"This is An Ling.\"","\"An Ling? The daughter of the An family?\" Her friend's tone was shocked as she looked back and forth at An Ling's face.","Zhou Wen nodded. \"Yes.\"","As soon as these words came out, the entire venue was instantly in an uproar, and whispers broke out.","\"Is it really An Ling?\"","\"I finally get to see her in person today. So this is what she looks like. She's quite pretty.\"","\"She's also Shen Linyan's wife, right? Were they just talking about Shen Linyan?\"","Hearing these voices, the corner of Shen Fuyuan's mouth twitched.","Holy crap.","She glanced at the silent woman beside her, discreetly covered her mouth, and lowered her voice. \"I told you you'd be exposed. You're going to be famous.\"","An Ling didn't speak; she merely glanced at the media off to the side.","She had wondered why she had a bad premonition. So it was waiting for her right here.","She simply hadn't been able to resist snapping at the female lead, and the plot had immediately seized the opportunity to push forward.","And the way it developed really pissed her off.","What did she mean by, \"If I really wanted something to happen with Shen Linyan, it would have happened a long time ago\"?","Was that something you could say right to a man's wife?","An Ling looked at Zhou Wen in front of her, the corners of her lips pulling into a cold sneer.","Then let's play.","Since her identity was already exposed anyway, she wanted to see just how far this damn plot could go."]},{"number":107,"title":"Chapter 107: He'll have to take out a loan to buy it for me, understand","paragraphs":["The atmosphere in the hall was somewhat subtle.","After all, no one expected to run into the reclusive daughter of the An family here.","Sizing, scrutinizing gazes surged from all directions, and camera lenses were quietly aimed her way.","At that moment, the banquet's host took the stage, breaking the tense atmosphere in the room.","\"Thank you all for being here. The banquet officially begins now. I will introduce this season's new arrivals, and if you see something you like, you are more than welcome to place a bid.\"","As his voice fell, a diamond necklace appeared on the large screen.","The diamond was crystal clear and brilliant, with a soft yet vibrant pink hue that refracted a dazzling light.","\"The Pink Kiss. Starting bid is twenty million, highest bidder wins.\"","As soon as the host finished speaking, the bidding began.","\"Thirty million.\"","\"Thirty-five million.\"","Catching a glimpse of An Ling's empty hands, a flicker of obscure light flashed through Zhou Wen's eyes. She curled her lips into a shallow smile and raised her paddle. \"Forty million.\"","Shen Fuyuan also noticed that An Ling had nothing in her hands and lowered her voice. \"The invitation tiers are different. Ours allows us to bid, but the tier of your invitation is too low.\"","Guests who received high-tier invitations were given a catalog of the evening's new arrivals before the banquet, making it easier for them to choose their favorite jewelry to bid on.","But the invitation Guo Yu gave An Ling was a supplementary one, restricted only to entry with no other privileges.","Initially, An Ling just planned to come for fun, so it made no difference to her what kind of invitation she had.","But now, as the eldest daughter of the An family, lacking even a formal invitation naturally plunged her back into the center of gossip.","After all, everyone knew that An Ling's husband had gone bankrupt.","As the An family heiress, An Ling hadn't shown her face in years, leading to long-standing rumors that the An family had abandoned this daughter.","Previously, it was just a rumor, but looking at the current situation, it seemed this speculation was about to be confirmed.","\"An Ling caused so many scandals before; the An family has already done more than enough for this daughter.\"","\"I had dinner with CEO An before, and I heard him say he froze An Ling's cards. Now she's remarried to her bankrupt ex-husband and has absolutely no money on her. I don't even know how she got in here.\"","\"The An family didn't let her show her face before, probably because they didn't want this daughter to embarrass them. Who would have thought she'd jump out on her own.\"","Every word reached her ears, but to An Ling, it sounded increasingly familiar.","Because similar words had appeared in the original plot.","In the final ending, she was kicked out of the Shen family, and the An Group was completely swallowed by the Shen Group.","Not long after, her photos were dug up, and everyone mocked the once high-and-mighty eldest daughter of the An family for falling into such a miserable state.","The only silver lining was that, unlike the original plot where the An family marched toward ruin alongside her, it had now changed to the An family abandoning her.","Her cards had indeed been frozen by An Zhou. The system had done too many stupid things using her body, and An Zhou simply couldn't take it anymore. In a fit of anger, he cut off her cards, thinking this would make her settle down.","Even on the night she regained control of her body, the bar she tricked Lu Jingshen into going to was a cheap one.","No wonder when she first woke up, all she could smell was cheap alcohol and cigarette smoke.","Even knowing she had this part of the plot, experiencing it firsthand still gave An Ling an indescribable feeling.","It was as if... the scene of her own death was flashing right before her eyes.","No matter how she tried to avoid it, the destined plot points still arrived, just presenting themselves in a different form.","An Ling's silence, in the eyes of others, looked like a tacit admission to the rumors.","The murmurs of discussion grew louder.","Shen Fuyuan didn't know if what they were saying was true or not, but in all the time they had been married, she had never seen the An family come to visit An Ling. And there had been no news of her eldest brother since he left the Shen family.","Could it be they were truly out of money?","No wonder she went to be a producer and made excuses about coming here on behalf of the company.","Thinking of this, Shen Fuyuan's gaze became complicated.","Bankrupt, yet still keeping a cat.","What would happen to Huihui staying with them? Would he even have enough to eat?","\"Are you really broke? How about you use my paddle to bid, and I'll pay for it. At worst, my mom will scold me, but I'll consider it paying you back for those luxury goods from before...\" Shen Fuyuan thought that this way, she could also buy some food for Huihui.","It was just that if her mom found out she was helping An Ling, she would definitely be scolded.","But it wouldn't be the first time she got scolded anyway.","\"No need,\" An Ling rejected Shen Fuyuan, turning her head to address a waiter. \"Please apply for a bidding paddle for me.\"","\"Certainly, please wait a moment. May I ask under whose name it should be registered?\"","Hearing this, An Ling glanced at the media not far away.","She slowly uttered a name:","\"Shen Linyan.\"","Zhou Wen, who was nearby and overheard their conversation, turned to look. \"An Ling, if you want to bid, then bid. Why use Eldest Brother's name?\"","The woman ignored her completely, flipping through the catalog of the evening's new arrivals handed to her by the waiter, nodding in continuous approval. \"These new pieces tonight are all so beautiful...\"","\"I really want to take them all.\" She sighed with emotion, slowly raising her head and curving her eyes into a smile at Zhou Wen. \"Right?\"","Zhou Wen's expression turned somewhat ugly.","The waiter brought the bidding paddle over. Just as An Ling was about to raise it, she seemed to remember something and turned back to Zhou Wen. \"You just bid fifty million, right?\"","Without waiting for a reply, she had already raised her paddle.","\"Sixty million.\"","Zhou Wen's brows instantly furrowed. \"An Ling, are you using Eldest Brother's money to bid? If you don't have money, just let it go. There's no need to put up a false front here.\"","\"I'll use it if I want to. Who told him to remarry me? If I like this, I must have it. As for whether Shen Linyan has money or not...\"","The woman took an unhurried sip of champagne.","She raised her eyebrows and smiled, her beautiful face displaying a flamboyant arrogance.","\"He'll have to take out a loan to buy it for me, understand?\"","As soon as the words left her mouth, the entire hall fell silent.","It seemed no one expected An Ling to say such a thing.","\"That rumor is true. People have been saying for a long time that An Ling has a bad temper and is hard to please...\"","\"No wonder the An family didn't want this daughter. Who could stand this...\"","\"Shen Linyan is quite pitiful. Bankrupt and still being used by his ex-wife.\"","\"Tens of millions, that's no small sum. The interest alone is enough to choke on. He might as well jump off a building after taking out that loan.\"","Even Shen Fuyuan was startled by her, excitedly lowering her voice. \"Are you crazy?! Don't just bid in the heat of the moment!\"","How could her eldest brother possibly get his hands on so much money right now? And there was no way An Ling could earn that much as a producer!","Zhou Wen's face darkened. She furrowed her brows and gave An Ling a deep look.","\"An Ling, you don't deserve Eldest Brother at all. You've already made him into someone he's not. Do you want to ruin his entire life now?\"","If she hadn't met Lu Jingshen first and seen his status as a CEO, she might have chosen Shen Linyan. She only found out later that Shen Linyan was the true heir to the Shen Group.","But by then, it was too late for regrets.","Such a gentle and noble man, yet he had the misfortune of encountering a wife like An Ling. If she were Shen Linyan's wife, things definitely wouldn't be like this.","Zhou Wen's feelings were somewhat complicated as she raised her paddle. \"Sixty-five million.\"","The next second, An Ling raised her hand without hesitation.","\"Seventy million.\"","Zhou Wen's pupils constricted as he gritted his teeth.","\"Are you intentionally driving up the price against me?\""]},{"number":108,"title":"Chapter 108: Eighty Million","paragraphs":["Hearing Zhou Wen's words, An Ling simply curved her eyes into a smile.","\"What do you mean, driving up the price? If you can't afford it, I'll just take it.\"","Zhou Wen clenched her jaw. Looking at the woman's impervious attitude, she only felt infuriated.","There was simply no reasoning with such a wicked person! She had absolutely no bottom line when it came to money!","After mentally preparing herself for a moment, Zhou Wen took a deep breath and raised her paddle again.","\"Eighty million!\"","After speaking, she snapped her gaze to the side.","The girl, however, was currently looking curiously at the desserts on the table.","As if sensing everyone's gaze, she looked up, still holding half a macaron in her hand. One side of her cheek bulged slightly, and her eyelashes fluttered as if she were puzzled.","\"Oh, bidding, right,\" the girl nodded in sudden realization.","She was just about to raise her hand, but stopped halfway. Setting it down unhurriedly, she said with a beaming smile,","\"Never mind, you can have it. I thought about it, and Shen Linyan can only take out a loan once. What if there's something I like even more later?\"","Hearing this, Zhou Wen's pupils shrank slightly as the auctioneer's voice rang in her ears.","\"Eighty million, going once.\"","\"Eighty million, going twice.\"","\"Eighty million, going three times.\"","With the fall of the hammer, a loud \"bang\" instantly locked in the price.","\"Congratulations to Miss Zhou for winning the Pink Kiss.\"","Amidst the surrounding applause, Zhou Wen secretly clenched her fists and glared daggers at An Ling.","This price far exceeded her budget, and she had recently been arguing with Lu Jingshen. She couldn't let the other party lead her by the nose like this anymore.","During the second and third rounds of bidding, neither Zhou Wen nor An Ling placed a bid.","In the fourth round, Zhou Wen set her sights on a fully diamond-encrusted bracelet.","She raised her paddle, \"Five point three million.\"","An Ling leisurely followed up, \"Five point five million.\"","Zhou Wen gritted her teeth, \"Six million!\"","\"Six point two million.\" It was still that lazy female voice.","Zhou Wen choked, whipping her head around. \"An Ling, is it fun for you to target me like this?\"","This person was definitely doing it on purpose!","Deliberately following with the minimum bid increment.","Hearing this, An Ling blinked innocently. \"I'm not. I like it too. Ever since Shen Linyan went bankrupt, I haven't bought a bracelet in ages.\"","Furious, Zhou Wen waved her hand grandly, \"Eight million!\"","An Ling: \"Okay, you can have this one too.\"","\"...\"","Beside them, Shen Fuyuan almost couldn't hold it in, desperately suppressing the upward curve of her lips.","The first time she met An Ling at the company, she had also been played with like this by An Ling, and she had been furious!","Now that the roles were reversed and she was a bystander, this was just too satisfying!","Zhou Wen was so angry her hands were shaking. She opened her mouth to say something, but catching sight of the media and the crowd from the corner of her eye, she swallowed her anger back down, forcing herself to endure it.","Fine, okay, this was exactly what she wanted!","Then her eldest brother would know exactly what kind of person An Ling was!","But with this amount nearing a hundred million, Mother Shen would definitely question her later. She had to shift the blame onto An Ling.","An Ling was taking small sips of her wine, waiting for the auctioneer to announce the next item, when she suddenly saw Zhou Wen walking towards her.","She paused, lazily crossing her arms and eyeing the other woman as she came to stand beside her.","Zhou Wen lowered her voice, \"You're going to keep matching my bids, aren't you?\"","An Ling raised an eyebrow, her speaking pace unhurried, giving the same answer as before.","\"No, I just want to buy what I like. It's just that after looking at the first few, I suddenly didn't like them anymore.\"","Zhou Wen sneered, \"Then do you like the next one?\"","An Ling looked up at the screen. The auctioneer was introducing the finale jewelry piece.","It was an exquisite and delicate ring inlaid with a blue gemstone. Its interior was pure and flawless, an absolutely rare natural colored gem.","She chuckled softly, \"Guess?\"","The auctioneer announced the price: a starting bid of sixty million, with a minimum increment of ten million.","Zhou Wen directly raised her paddle, \"Eighty million.\"","An Ling glanced at her and also raised her paddle.","\"One hundred million.\"","Zhou Wen's eyes flickered.","Just as she expected, and she still dared to deny it.","She had already seen through An Ling's routine. This person would definitely follow her to drive up the price and then back out.","Zhou Wen instantly put her paddle away and smiled, mimicking An Ling's previous manner.","\"Sorry, I'm out.\"","Hearing this, An Ling slightly raised her eyebrows.","Zhou Wen curled her lips at her, carrying a hint of smugness.","However, before she could be happy for long, someone immediately raised a paddle and called out, \"I bid two hundred million.\"","Obviously, they weren't the only two buyers. Besides, as the finale jewelry piece, naturally many people had their eyes on it.","After all, this kind of top-tier jewelry would easily sell for hundreds of millions at major auction houses.","A faint, sighing chuckle from the woman reached her ears, \"What a pity. Looks like I can't make Shen Linyan take out a loan after all.\"","Zhou Wen's face instantly darkened.","Great. From start to finish, An Ling hadn't spent a single dime, whereas she herself had been played by An Ling multiple times.","The others also didn't seem to expect such a plot twist, and the air stagnated for a moment.","\"Was An Ling deliberately driving up the price just now?\"","\"She never intended to make Shen Linyan take out a loan at all, did she?\"","Hearing the surrounding whispers, Zhou Wen's face paled slightly. She pressed her lips together tightly, her nails digging into her flesh. She even felt a sense of humiliation that made her wish she could flee the scene immediately, yet she dreaded going home to face Mother Shen.","An Ling was the one who had gone bankrupt. Why did things turn out like this?","The reason she had kept outbidding An Ling earlier was that she was genuinely worried An Ling would make Shen Linyan take out a loan.","She only matched the bids for Shen Linyan's sake. Why was An Ling getting to play the good guy now?!","Zhou Wen gritted her back teeth, her heart sinking instantly. A streak of cold gloom flashed through her eyes. Unable to suppress the anger at the bottom of her heart, her gaze flickered.","An Ling looked down at the time, feeling it was about right.","She wondered if Shen Linyan was done with his work. Having had a few glasses of wine, she felt a bit dizzy and decided she might as well call him to pick her up.","Just as she turned around, someone suddenly bumped into her arm.","She frowned in pain, her grip subconsciously loosening, and her wine glass instantly dropped.","\"Crash—\"","A woman's gasp sounded beside her. Immediately after, she saw Zhou Wen standing there, looking down at her dress in feigned dismay.","On that expensive champagne-colored dress, there was a glaring dark stain.","Zhou Wen looked up, her eyes filled with disbelief, her tone accusing, \"An Ling, what are you doing?!\"","An Ling: \"...\"","If she remembered correctly, it seemed you bumped into me yourself.","Wait a minute, this scene...","An Ling's mouth twitched slightly, silently praying: No way, right?","Are these plot tropes just coming one after another? But she just wanted to go home to Shen Linyan.","She rubbed her temples in slight annoyance. Just as she was about to speak, a displeased male voice suddenly sounded from behind her.","\"An Ling, what are you doing?\"","Turning her head to look at the man's unfamiliar face, An Ling paused and expressionlessly lowered her hand.","She had just been wondering where the male lead went. Well, look at that, here he is."]},{"number":109,"title":"Chapter 109: Your husband will definitely be very happy.","paragraphs":["An Ling didn't actually recognize Lu Jingshen.","But this questioning tone was too familiar.","Besides, the current plot was just missing the male lead saving the damsel in distress.","Sure enough, the man walked briskly up to them, took off his suit jacket, and draped it over Zhou Wen's shoulders.","\"An Ling, what the hell are you doing here!?\" He frowned deeply, his tone unkind.","\"Ask her, she hit my arm.\" An Ling lifted her chin.","She didn't know how much force Zhou Wen had used, but her arm still hurt a bit from the elbow strike just now.","\"I did not!\" Zhou Wen flatly denied it.","She quickly glanced at the media recording around them, her eyes darkening slightly as she gripped the jacket on her shoulders tightly.","It was An Ling who had targeted her first at the auction.","She should have diverted the topic for her.","When she looked up again, the gloom in her eyes had dissipated, replaced by tears that made her look pitiful and slightly wronged. \"An Ling even deliberately tricked me into bidding. Will Mom scold me when we get back?\"","\"No, that little bit of money doesn't matter. I'll handle Mother,\" Lu Jingshen comforted her. After speaking, he turned to look at An Ling, his eyes sharp, his words carrying a hint of threat.","\"An Ling, did you hear that? Apologize to Wenwen! Don't think I don't know about you intentionally driving up the price.\"","\"You know?\"","An Ling laughed.","So the male and female leads arguing needed her to act as a catalyst for their relationship?","Her eyes curved into a smile as she enunciated every word under everyone's gaze, \"What's the use of you knowing? I intentionally drove up the price, and I'm targeting you. So what?\"","Anyway, she carried the title of the vicious female supporting character. No one would believe her even if she told the truth, and she would end up as the target of public criticism regardless.","Rather than that, she might as well clap back directly.","The woman's arrogant attitude made the others cast sidelong glances, whispering among themselves.","Hearing the surrounding voices, Zhou Wen, who was looking down to adjust the hem of her dress, had an imperceptible upward curve at the corners of her mouth.","Lu Jingshen narrowed his eyes, a trace of inquiry flashing in them.","He suddenly spoke, \"Did Shen Linyan teach you to do this?\"","An Ling: ?","\"Do I need Shen Linyan to teach me to hate you people?\"","Why bring up her husband for no reason?","\"How interesting. Zhou Wen says I corrupted Shen Linyan, and you say Shen Linyan corrupted me.\"","She glanced at Zhou Wen, the corners of her lips curling up. \"Who exactly is telling the truth?\"","\"No!\" Zhou Wen quickly turned to explain, \"Jingshen, I just thought Big Brother was too pitiful! I didn't mean anything else!\"","Lu Jingshen's face had already darkened.","Given the lesson from the last birthday banquet, Lu Jingshen didn't lose his temper in front of so many people.","With a dark expression, he released his arm from around the woman, his originally decent mood instantly collapsing.","\"He's not even a member of the Shen family anymore and you still call him Big Brother. You're quite kindhearted, even pitying him!\" Lu Jingshen practically gritted his teeth as he said this.","He only found out today that the boss behind the AL Group, which had snatched away the Shen family's projects over the past few days, was none other than Shen Linyan.","Because of this, he was scolded by his dad at the company for being useless. That group of old shareholders also constantly mocked him with cold sarcasm. Returning home to face his mother's nagging, he was already so annoyed he was about to explode.","Shen Linyan, it was all Shen Linyan!","To put it bluntly, if his dad had given him the company to manage, let alone the AL Group, he could crush any BLCL Group!","It was just because none of them believed in him!","Even Zhou Wen paid attention to Shen Linyan every day.","Lu Jingshen's eyes were gloomy and fierce. He grabbed the woman's wrist and pinched her chin, his gaze dark. \"Zhou Wen, we will have a good talk when we get back.\"","\"Jingshen—\"","Before she could finish speaking, Zhou Wen stumbled as she was dragged away.","An Ling considerately made way.","Truly a classic domineering CEO plot and domineering CEO quotes.","Zhou Wen was indeed worthy of being the female lead; she could actually tolerate this kind of quick-tempered man.","As the two passed by her side, Zhou Wen suddenly turned her head, her eyes actually carrying some resentment.","An Ling's expression paused.","She looked thoughtfully at their departing backs for a while before slowly withdrawing her gaze.","She ignored the gazes of the crowd and turned to look at the bewildered waiter. \"Call someone to clean this place up. Also, I want to take another look at the ring exhibits.\"","The waiter was taken aback, then reacted and gestured, \"Okay, please come with me. I'll have my colleague bring the exhibits to introduce them to you.\"","An Ling had only taken a few steps when footsteps suddenly sounded behind her.","Her clothes were lightly tugged. She turned around and met a pair of expectant eyes.","\"Sister-in-law, are you going home? Is Big Brother coming to pick you up, or are you going back by yourself?\"","Sister-in-law?","It was truly rare to hear this form of address from Shen Fuyuan's mouth.","\"I'll go back a little later. What's wrong?\" She glanced at the door. \"Zhou Wen and the others have all gone back, aren't you going back?\"","Shen Fuyuan shook her head: \"I don't live with them anyway. Their going back has nothing to do with me.\"","After saying that, she suddenly cleared her throat, her smile a bit embarrassed: \"If it's inconvenient for Big Brother, I can actually take you back. It's just that when the time comes...\"","An Ling: \"Be straightforward.\"","Shen Fuyuan: \"Can I go to your house to see Huihui?\"","\"...\"","An Ling looked at the girl in front of her in amusement and nodded: \"Sure, we can leave together after I finish buying my things.\"","Shen Fuyuan's eyes lit up, and she nodded hastily: \"Okay!\"","As early as when she was looking at the list, An Ling had already chosen what she wanted to buy.","She had absolutely no intention of bidding on those luxury jewels.","Sitting on the sofa, she picked for a while and picked up a men's ring from the exhibits. \"Please wrap this up for me.\"","\"Okay.\"","The waiter introducing the rings hadn't been in the hall just now and didn't know what had happened there.","She smiled and spoke politely, just like when she entertained previous guests: \"Miss has a great eye. This men's ring is very beautiful. Is it a gift for your husband?\"","An Ling had just finished sending a message to Shen Linyan. Hearing this, she looked up and smiled: \"Yes.\"","The waiter packed the item and smilingly handed the gift bag over.","\"Your husband will definitely be very happy.\"","Upon leaving the private room, An Ling carried the gift bag in one hand when her phone rang.","Seeing the caller ID, she answered and said with a smile: \"Aren't you still socializing? How can you make a phone call?\"","On the other end of the phone, there were noisy voices and the sound of people urging others to drink. Shen Linyan had told her earlier that a friend had suddenly invited him for drinks tonight.","\"It's fine. Is Madam's banquet over?\" Amidst the noisy background sounds, the man's deep voice clearly reached her ears.","\"I don't want to play anymore, there's nothing interesting to see later anyway.\"","After such an incident, everyone probably wouldn't dare to greet her, so she might as well leave early.","An Ling originally wanted to talk about what happened tonight, but remembering that Shen Linyan was busy, she decided not to take up too much of his time. It would be the same to tell him when she got home.","\"Besides, there's nothing good to eat here. It made me miss dinner. I'll have to go back and eat something later.\"","Hearing the woman's complaint, the man seemed to chuckle. \"Alright, then I'll come pick Madam up now.\"","\"It's okay, you stay busy over there. It's still early anyway, I can go back by myself.\"","An Ling saw the girl not far away and recognized her as Shen Fuyuan by her clothes. She smiled and said, \"Besides, Shen Fuyuan is here too. She just told me she wants to go home with me to see Huihui, so I can just take her car back.\"","Shen Linyan was just about to reply when he vaguely heard someone mention his name. The private room was a bit noisy. He casually lifted his eyes and glanced over; the others seemed to be looking at something on their phones.","He did not pay much attention to it. Checking the time, he figured it would take over twenty minutes for her to get back. \"Then remember to text me when you get home, darling.\"","\"Okay,\" An Ling's voice lifted slightly at the end. \"Make sure you don't drink too much. I will be waiting for you at home.\"","The man chuckled softly. \"Alright.\"","An Ling wanted to say something more, but she heard a loud burst of laughter from his end, followed immediately by a dead silence.","She froze for a moment, not quite understanding what had happened. Just as she was about to ask, the man's gentle voice came through the receiver.","\"Darling, something suddenly came up on my end. I will see you when I get home.\"","\"Okay, go do what you need to do.\"","After hanging up the phone, she walked over to Shen Fuyuan.","Seeing that the other woman was staring at her phone, she spoke up, \"What are you looking at? Shall we go?\"","Shen Fuyuan looked up, her brows tightly knitted and her expression grave.","\"The news is out.\""]},{"number":110,"title":"Chapter 110: How do you want to die, you trash, if my wife hears this","paragraphs":["\"What news?\"","An Ling didn't react at first, but then Shen Fuyuan shoved her phone screen right in front of her face.","Instantly, several heavily bolded headlines caught her eye.","[The An Family's Daughter Appears at Jewelry Gala: True Photos of An Ling Exposed!]","[An Ling Suspected of Being Kicked Out of the An Family? Currently in a Desolate State?]","[An Ling's True Colors Revealed: Admits to Forcing Husband to Take Out Loans for Tens of Millions in Jewelry, Even Harasses Zhou Wen in Public! Intentionally Drives Up Auction Prices and Spills Wine on Zhou Wen's Dress!]","In a flash, the hashtag #JusticeForShenLinyan Meeting the Most Vicious Ex-Wife surged to the top of the trending topics.","Shen Fuyuan had been scrolling through this for the last ten minutes. She was dumbfounded and even a little furious.","\"Someone leaked your photos. And regarding the loan thing, they completely left out the fact that you didn't even spend the money. You told me to talk less, but look at how you're being taken out of context.\"","An Ling's gaze fell on the trending tags. She clicked on the top one about her photos.","Sure enough, she saw pictures of herself inside.","She scrutinized them for a moment and frowned in slight dissatisfaction.","The angles weren't very flattering...","Shen Fuyuan added, \"Plus, the things Zhou Wen said about you have become their proof. They're saying even the Second Lady of the Shen family came out to testify that An Ling treats Shen Linyan horribly.\"","Hearing this, An Ling paused, then handed the phone back to her.","\"Let's go home.\"","Seeing her bland reaction, the righteous indignation on Shen Fuyuan's face dissipated. \"How are you so calm?\"","\"Because it's all fake. There's nothing to be angry about. We just need to clarify the truth.\"","An Ling carried her gift bags and walked forward. When she had seen all those cameras pointed at her earlier, she had guessed this would happen.","But she hadn't expected the news to come out so fast.","It was truly swift. Moreover, the fact that Zhou Wen and Lu Jingshen were completely omitted from the narrative made it hard not to guess who was behind this.","Her footsteps suddenly halted.","Should she tell Shen Linyan?","But after taking out her phone, An Ling stopped again. She lowered her eyes, pursed her lips, and after a moment of silence, put it away.","Forget it. She would wait until Shen Linyan came home to talk about it.","Shen Fuyuan caught up with her. Seeing the gift bags in her hands, she asked curiously, \"What did you buy? Do you even have the money for this right now?\"","Thinking of the bidding war just now, she couldn't help but click her tongue. \"You were really bold, though. Weren't you afraid Zhou Wen and the others would stop bidding?\"","After all, that last bid was a hundred million. She had genuinely been worried for her older brother.","\"If they didn't follow, I would have just bought it.\"","Caught off guard by the woman's words, Shen Fuyuan froze: \"What?\"","\"I said, if they didn't follow up the bid, I would have just bought it. I actually quite liked those items anyway.\" An Ling was currently texting An Zhou to explain the cause of tonight's events.","She looked up and blinked:","\"You didn't know? Shen Linyan didn't tell you he started a new company? Besides, how could my family ever kick me out?\"","She had assumed Shen Fuyuan was just playing along earlier.","Shen Fuyuan: \"...\"","Did they know? She and her brother had deceived so many of her feelings.","...","After the news broke, the first to notice was Gu Xiaochi.","Tonight's drinking party was organized by Wang Yihong. He said a few investors wanted to pull them into a collaboration for a new project, so he invited him and Shen Linyan over, primarily wanting Shen Linyan to evaluate it.","While drinking, he accidentally glanced at his phone and realized his secretary had sent him dozens of messages.","Upon opening them, Gu Xiaochi's ears instantly started ringing.","Watching the situation ferment online, only one word filled his mind.","Doomed.","The secretary said the posts were being frantically shared and it was already too late to take them down.","Terrified, he was just about to turn and tell Shen Linyan, but saw the man was on a phone call.","In his moment of hesitation, an investor next to him suddenly leaned over and brazenly threw an arm around his shoulder.","\"President Gu! Let me tell you! This project is definitely going to succeed! Believe me... hic...\" The investor's face was flushed red, and as soon as he opened his mouth, his hiccups reeked of alcohol.","Catching a glimpse of the screen on Gu Xiaochi's phone, he narrowed his eyes and stared at it for a moment. \"What's this? ...An Ling? Why is Chairman Shen's name here too?\"","Gu Xiaochi hurriedly turned off his phone, clicking his tongue inwardly.","No wonder ever since Shen Linyan came in, he just smiled and nodded at whatever these two said without offering any opinions. He was completely treating them like fools.","That kid Wang Yihong was also an idiot for believing these guys when they said the project would make money.","He quietly pushed the man away. \"It's nothing.\"","Another investor seemed to have seen the news on his own phone: \"Isn't this Chairman Shen's wife? She was in the news several times a while ago, and now she's making headlines again.\"","The drunk investor collapsed onto the sofa. Hearing this, he leaned over, took a few looks, and then suddenly realized.","\"Yeah! I remember now! That news just now was talking about Chairman Shen's wife, right?\"","Perhaps the man's consistently placid attitude since entering the room had given them a false impression, causing them to speak without thinking.","He sat back up and said with a laugh, \"I was wondering why that name sounded so familiar. I saw the news back then too, saying that Chairman Shen and his wife didn't have a very good relationship.\"","Gu Xiaochi's eyelids twitched violently as a sudden bad premonition rose within him.","Oh my god, bro, I'm begging you. Shen Linyan just recently remarried and is in a good mood, please don't fan the flames!","Opposite them, Shen Linyan, who was on the phone, seemed to have heard their chatter and cast a casual glance their way.","Before Gu Xiaochi had time to stop it, he saw the drunk investor suddenly burst into loud laughter:","\"Chairman Shen is so young and promising, it's a pity he married a wife like that who goes around causing trouble every day. When are you getting a divorce, Chairman Shen? I have a younger sister who is much more obedient than that woman.\"","As soon as the words left his mouth, the room instantly fell silent.","Gu Xiaochi silently retracted the hand he had reached out to cover the man's mouth, not knowing whether he should light incense for these guys or for Wang Yihong.","Just because of this kid's drinking party, Shen Linyan was completely unaware of what had happened at the gala.","In the deathly silence, the investor finally realized in hindsight that something was wrong, sobering up a bit.","His face turned pale as an indescribable panic surged into his heart. His body sounded the alarm of danger, and he opened his mouth helplessly: \"Um... Chairman Shen, I was just...\"","The man, however, didn't even look at him. He spoke gently into the phone, then hung up and slowly raised his eyes.","His eyes were pitch-black, and the smile on his lips remained gentle, but his tone sent shivers down one's spine.","\"If my wife heard that, how would a piece of trash like you want to die?\""]},{"number":111,"title":"Chapter 111: Madam, Who Bullied You [Word Count Supplemented]","paragraphs":["On the pitch-black road, a Maybach drove smoothly.","Inside the car, it was quiet. The atmosphere was heavy, a tense and oppressive feeling spreading through the air.","The man sat in the backseat, his long legs crossed. With an extraordinary aura, he lowered his eyes to watch a news video on his phone.","He tapped play. In the video, a woman stood in the center of a crowd, and various gossiping voices could be heard.","The man kept his eyes lowered and quietly watched all the videos before turning off the screen.","He tapped his fingertips against his knee. His expression was calm, but it felt like the silence before a storm as he uttered two words: \"Explain.\"","Those two emotionless words were so cold they made one's scalp tingle.","Secretary Chen's heart tightened, and he hurriedly reported the information he had found.","\"Chairman Shen, I'm very sorry. The news broke so suddenly that we couldn't react in time to intercept it. However, we have already found out who is behind it. Both Ms. Lu and your father are involved.\"","\"As for the things the media mentioned, we have also verified them through the jeweler. During the auction, the Madam did intentionally drive up the price against Zhou Wen. The talk about a loan was just a joke; in reality, the Madam didn't win any bids in the end.\"","\"But regarding the part about throwing wine, the surveillance cameras didn't capture the specific details.\"","\"The posts have been suppressed now, and the clarification statement is ready to be sent out at any time.\"","The man gently rubbed his phone with the pad of his thumb. He looked down at the empty messaging interface, his eyes darkening slightly.","He got out of the car, stood at the entrance of the building, and took out his phone to text Shen Fuyuan.","Shen Linyan: [Come down. Now.]","The simple message was full of murderous intent.","Shen Fuyuan's hand, which was petting the cat, instantly froze. Holding her phone, her eyes were filled with absolute panic.","I'm doomed, I'm doomed. Big Brother definitely saw the news.","Ignoring the cat, she typed furiously.","[Big Brother, that matter really has nothing to do with me! It was Zhou Wen who exposed Sister-in-law's identity! During the auction, I even asked Sister-in-law if she wanted to use my paddle to bid! I didn't know Sister-in-law never left the An family; Sister-in-law didn't say anything herself!]","Shen Linyan: [One minute.]","Shen Fuyuan: [I'm leaving, I'm leaving!!]","Upstairs, Shen Fuyuan reluctantly gave the cat one last pet and shoved her phone back into her pocket.","She stood up, looking toward the kitchen with a forced smile. \"Um, Sister-in-law... I have something to take care of, so I'm leaving first.\"","An Ling was reading the cooking instructions on the back of a bag of frozen dumplings. Hearing this, she nodded and waved at her. \"Bye-bye. Drive safe.\"","\"Okay.\"","Hearing the door close, An Ling put down the bag in her hand and looked at her phone, which remained completely silent beside her.","Had Shen Linyan not seen the news yet?","An Ling sighed. Losing the mood to read the instructions, she stuffed the dumplings back into the freezer.","Too much trouble.","I'm not making them. I'm not hungry anymore anyway.","Sitting back on the sofa, she casually unwrapped a piece of candy, popped it into her mouth, and checked the comments online.","Sure enough, it was still a sea of curses.","The living room was brightly lit. A well-fed Huihui jumped onto the sofa, and An Ling patted its round head.","\"How many treats did Shen Fuyuan feed you? Why does it feel like you're getting fatter and fatter?\"","Harsh words chill a cat even in midsummer.","Huihui arrogantly swished its tail and jumped right back down.","An Ling leaned back against the sofa, her fingertips hesitating as she tapped the screen twice.","In truth, she couldn't guess how Shen Linyan would react when he saw the news. After all, she had indeed targeted Zhou Wen tonight.","She just found Zhou Wen's way of speaking extremely annoying.","The way the other woman showed concern for Shen Linyan crossed the line, yet somehow seemed like it didn't.","When Zhou Wen said she was Shen Linyan's friend, An Ling hadn't made a sound.","Because she wasn't sure if that was true either.","Shen Linyan treated people with gentleness and kindness, and could make friends with anyone. Even if he wasn't friends with the female lead, their relationship should still be better than normal people's. After all, the female lead had almost acted as Shen Linyan's salvation back then.","She hugged her knees, resting her chin on them. Her tongue pushed against the candy in her mouth, the sweet and sour taste spreading. She muttered softly, \"It's not like I restricted him from making friends...\"","If Zhou Wen really was Shen Linyan's friend, did that mean she had bullied Shen Linyan's friend?","Thinking of this, An Ling caught sight of the gift bag on the table and was just about to pick it up.","\"Beep—\" The sudden sound of the door unlocking was exceptionally clear in the air.","An Ling thought Shen Fuyuan had forgotten something and looked up. But when she saw the familiar figure of the man at the door, she froze. Thinking she was seeing things, she swallowed the words on the tip of her tongue.","\"You're... back.\" An Ling hesitantly glanced at her phone screen.","Had Shen Linyan sent her a message?","The man wore a black overcoat over a suit, his posture upright and his noble aura completely natural. With a stride of his long legs, his steps were steady.","He stood in front of the sofa, quietly looking at her.","Dark hair fell over his forehead, and the man's pitch-black eyes sank into the shadows like a deep lake. Beneath the seemingly calm surface hid countless emotions.","Just as expected, Shen Linyan had seen the news.","An Ling looked at him eagerly, but before she could speak.","The man suddenly spoke: \"Has Madam eaten dinner?\"","An Ling paused and blinked. Her gaze moved down, and only then did she notice that the man was carrying a bag in the hand resting by his side.","Inside a translucent white plastic container were piping hot wontons.","Shen Linyan sat down beside the woman and placed the bag on the table.","He untied the plastic bag, lowered his eyes, and said gently, \"Madam said there was no food at the banquet. Auntie Cheng isn't home, and I didn't know if Madam would be able to make dinner...\"","Before he could finish speaking, the hem of his clothes was lightly tugged.","Looking down, he saw the woman's fair, slender fingers, and her voice sounded in his ear.","\"Shen Linyan, did you see the news?\"","His gaze halted, and his movements stopped. His Adam's apple bobbed slightly, but he didn't speak.","In the quiet living room, an unknown amount of time passed before the man's very light voice sounded.","\"Does Madam not trust me?\"","Hearing this, An Ling was stunned and subconsciously asked, \"Why do you ask that?\"","\"Then why didn't you tell me the moment something like this happened?\"","The darkness in the man's eyes suppressed his emotions, and his jaw tightened. \"Madam, I told you that ours is not a marriage of convenience. I am your husband. I should, and I want to, handle these things for you.\"","Looking at the girl's stunned expression, his Adam's apple bobbed with a bitter feeling. He slowly opened his mouth, his voice hoarse.","\"You didn't tell me... is it because I, as your husband, am not worthy of your trust? Or did I do something wrong?\"","His wife had been bullied, but he was the last to know.","Even An Zhou knew before he did.","An Ling hadn't expected Shen Linyan to say that.","Seeing the bitterness hidden in the man's eyes, her feelings became complicated. Her gaze darted away slightly, and she clenched her hands.","\"I don't distrust you... I just saw that you were too busy and didn't want to bother you. I originally wanted to wait for you...\"","But as she spoke, she fell silent.","After finishing the phone call back then, An Ling had a chance to tell Shen Linyan about it, but she still hadn't.","Because she couldn't see Shen Linyan's expression and didn't know how the man would react to hearing that she had targeted Zhou Wen.","It was different from the situation at the Shen family home before. Last time, Mother Shen had made the first move, but this time, she had actively targeted Zhou Wen.","She didn't want to test whether Shen Linyan would favor the female lead or her.","An Ling pressed her lips tightly together, her eyes gradually stinging, and her eyelashes trembled. She hurriedly turned her head away, but in the next second, the man gently cupped her face.","\"Darling, who bullied you? Will you tell me?\"","The man's large palms cradled her face, warm and gentle.","By the time An Ling reacted, she was already sitting in his lap.","The crisp scent of cedar mixed with a faint hint of tobacco, and his hot breath brushed against her skin.","Wrapping an arm around her waist, the man tilted his head to kiss the corner of her eye. His voice was gentle. \"I don't mean to blame you. I just feel bad for my wife. Won't you tell me?\"","An Ling clung to his shoulders. The tip of her nose was slightly red, and her eyelashes were damp. She looked at him with watery eyes, her voice a bit muffled.","\"Have you seen the news?\"","\"Yes, I saw it.\" Shen Linyan kissed her cheek. \"But I want to hear it from my wife.\"","An Ling pursed her lips. \"Then did you see me driving up the price against Zhou Wen? And the drink-spilling incident?\"","\"I saw.\"","Shen Linyan kissed the tip of her nose, his voice deepening. \"Why didn't my wife win anything at the auction? Why didn't you keep bidding on that last item?\"","An Ling: ?","An Ling was a little stunned by his words. She blinked and emphasized again, \"I drove up the price on Zhou Wen on pur-pose.\"","\"Okay,\" the man's voice remained mild.","An Ling paused slightly, then added, \"But spilling the drink wasn't on purpose. She grabbed my arm first.\"","Hearing the latter half of her sentence, the man frowned slightly. He looked down and touched her arm. \"Where did she grab you? Does it hurt?\"","An Ling was taken aback by his reaction.","What kind of reaction was this...","Seeing that the man was genuinely inspecting her arm, she pursed her lips, pressed her hand over his, and said directly:","\"Shen Linyan, I don't like Zhou Wen.\"","As she spoke, An Ling's voice faltered, and she unconsciously tightened her grip.","\"I also know that Zhou Wen used to be your personal assistant for a while.\"","Hearing this, the man's movements suddenly stopped. He silently raised his eyes to look at her.","Meeting the man's quiet gaze, An Ling stayed silent for a moment before speaking slowly:","\"I don't know how you and Zhou Wen got along in the past. Judging by the gifts you exchanged before, I know that to you, she's definitely better than those people in the Shen family. She told me today that she's your friend, and even asked me how you've been doing lately...\"","At this point, she lowered her eyes to avoid his gaze, her voice growing soft.","\"But I don't like her asking about you like that. Just like before, when she asked you to help with Lu Jingshen's matter and you agreed. Actually, I didn't like that day either.\"","The living room fell quiet for a moment. Just as An Ling was about to look up to see the man's expression, the back of her head was suddenly cradled.","The man tilted his head and gently captured her lips. His prominent Adam's apple bobbed in the air, and his warm breath slipped between her parted lips.","\"Darling, she and I were never friends.\"","He tenderly pecked the woman's soft lips and whispered, \"The personal assistant title was just in name. That gift from before was also the first time she ever gave me anything. As for helping out, that was a task my mother gave me at the time; she just happened to mention it.\"","His feather-light kisses trailed downward. He lowered his head to kiss the side of her neck, sucking with a bit of force.","The slight sting made An Ling's eyes widen instantly. Her waist went soft, and she let out a muffled whimper.","But immediately after, the mark was gently licked.","\"So my wife has been misunderstanding my relationship with her all this time?\"","The man narrowed his eyes and lightly bit her earlobe with a hint of punishment. \"Why didn't my wife just ask me directly about the personal assistant thing? Hmm?\"","An Ling rested her head on his shoulder, turning her face to the side, guiltily pretending she hadn't heard him.","After a while, she mumbled,","\"You didn't delete her WeChat.\"","The man paused, then let out a helpless laugh, nuzzling the top of her head. \"Who said that? I've already deleted her. Do you want to check?\"","An Ling stayed silent for a moment before slowly turning her head back.","She stared at his profile for a second, then suddenly tilted her head up and kissed his chin.","\"I believe you, Shen Linyan.\"","She sat up straight. \"This news breaking out was entirely within my expectations. I deliberately didn't mention the An family just so I could drive up the price against Zhou Wen. So I'm not really sad about the news. You don't need to worry about me.\"","She looked into his eyes, her tone serious.","\"Besides, you're a good husband. If I couldn't handle today's situation, I definitely would have called you over.\"","Shen Linyan looked at her. \"Really?\"","\"Really!\"","Remembering the gift bag on the table, An Ling's eyes lit up, and she suddenly turned to grab it.","\"I also bought a gift for my husband.\"","She picked up the bag from the edge of the table, opened it to reveal the gift box inside, and raised an eyebrow at the man.","\"Do you want to guess what's inside?\"","Shen Linyan's gaze fell on the box. He looked slightly stunned, but then his eyes softened and the corners of his lips curled up slightly.","\"Darling, it's a bit obvious.\"","\"You still have to guess.\"","An Ling's eyes curved into crescents. \"If you guess right, I'll put it on you.\"","Shen Linyan kissed the corner of her eye and smiled as he spoke slowly, \"Then I guess... a ring?\"","\"You guessed right!\" An Ling opened the box with a bright smile.","She took out the ring, solemnly extended her hand palm up, and said, \"Alright, Mr. Shen, you can give me your hand now.\"","A smile rippled in Shen Linyan's eyes as he cooperatively placed his hand in hers.","The ring was slowly pushed onto his ring finger. The man had prominent knuckles and long, slender fingers. Under the light, the silver wedding band made his cool, pale skin stand out even more, adding a touch of aloof, self-restrained asceticism.","An Ling stared in satisfaction at the ring she had chosen and nodded in approval.","It really looked great.","She looked at the man with sparkling eyes. \"Do you like it?\"","Shen Linyan looked at the ring on his hand. A faint, almost imperceptible daze flashed through his eyes, and his gaze lingered on it for a long time.","Looking up to meet the girl's expectant gaze, his eyes slowly curved. He gently cupped her face and smiled, kissing her cheeks several times. His gentle voice was wrapped in a low sigh. \"I love it very much, wife.\"","An Ling threw her arms around his neck and whispered, \"Don't be too happy. I bought this with a loan. Everyone is calling me a bad woman.\"","Shen Linyan's movements paused. He lowered his head, lightly nuzzling her cheek with his nose, his tone laced with a smile. \"I'll handle the things online.\"","That same night the news broke, during the peak hours of its spread, several clarifying statements were released one after another.","An Group: [Regarding the various false rumors spreading online, such as \"An Ling being kicked out of the An family,\" our company has already preserved the evidence. We urge everyone to stop spreading rumors.]","Before the public could even react.","Immediately after, a new trending topic suddenly shot to the top.","#ShenLinyanResponds","They clicked into it, and a newly created account appeared before their eyes.","The account bore Shen Linyan's name.","Five minutes ago, this account posted its very first update. The content was a simple photo.","In the photo, the man seemed to be sitting on a sofa, his hand slightly raised.","On his ring finger, a silver ring was conspicuously worn.","Shen Linyan: [My wife bought it.]"]},{"number":112,"title":"Chapter 112: Will Madam... always like me [Word count supplemented]","paragraphs":["As soon as Shen Linyan posted the photo, it quickly spread across the internet.","The previous rumors were instantly debunked.","After all, what kind of vicious wife goes to a banquet just to buy a ring for her husband?","Guo Yu also issued a statement.","Guo Yu: I was the one who gave the invitation to Producer An. I am very sorry for the trouble this has caused Producer An.","With this, the internet completely exploded in debate.","The previous incidents could be explained, but the intentional price gouging and the wine-spilling incidents were still causing a massive uproar.","After all, An Ling had personally admitted to the former.","In response to this, An Ling did not make any public comments.","Instead, Shen Linyan issued another statement.","Shen Linyan: If the Shen family cannot afford it, I can buy it back for double the price, as my wife truly likes it. At the same time, regarding the incident at the banquet, I also hope President Lu will apologize to my wife.","Reading between the lines, he was mocking the Shen family for making a huge fuss over such a small amount of money.","However, the public did not get an apology from Lu Jingshen. Instead, Zhou Wen was the first to jump out.","Zhou Wen: The incident at the banquet was a misunderstanding, and I was also at fault. The wine was spilled on me by accident. Please, everyone, stop discussing this matter.","But before things could settle down, several comments suddenly popped up.","Does no one else think this Shen Linyan account is totally fake? When he inherited the Shen Corporation, and when he had scandals before, Shen Linyan never registered an account. But now that this happened, he suddenly registers one?","Actually, I am suspicious too. Could this be An Ling's burner account? Anyway, Shen Linyan is bankrupt now, so he would not be able to say anything no matter what she posts.","But the hand in that photo looks very real. I compared it with the ones An Ling posted before, and it really is Shen Linyan's hand.","Are you stupid? Technology is so advanced nowadays. It does not take long to photoshop a picture, and it can look very realistic.","Is their relationship really that good?","As a colleague from An Ling's company, let me share my personal experience. She admitted herself that her relationship with her ex-husband was not very good. When someone asked her before if she had a boyfriend, she also said no.","So the person behind this account is highly likely to be An Ling?","If you ask me, it is very possible. It was previously exposed that An Ling liked Lu Jingshen. Now she suddenly likes Shen Linyan? I find it hard to believe.","Seeing these comments, Jiang Mai was so angry she was about to explode.","She took screenshots of these comments and sent them over.","Seriously? These burner accounts are making it too obvious that they are trying to change the subject, right? Whose hired internet trolls are these?","An Ling, however, was accustomed to such comments.","She was already used to people not believing her anyway.","An Ling: It is fine, it is very normal. Do not take it to heart.","Jiang Mai: By the way, why did you directly confront the female lead? Did you not want to stay as far away from the main characters as possible before?","An Ling lay on her side in bed, thinking for a moment before replying.","I could not hold back.","At the time, she really did want to avoid her, but she simply could not hold it in.","At that moment, the words Zhou Wen said actually were not entirely unreasonable.","If she had not managed to regain control of her body, would Shen Linyan not have slowly fallen for Zhou Wen?","Or suppose she was not the vicious female supporting character and had absolutely no contact with Shen Linyan from start to finish.","Then, given her antisocial personality and a life trajectory completely different from Shen Linyan's, she probably would never have met Shen Linyan in her entire life.","As An Ling was lost in thought, she did not realize that the main light in the room had been turned off.","The blanket behind her was lifted, letting in a slightly cool breeze. The sound of fabric rustling filled the air, followed immediately by a warm, strong arm wrapping around her waist.","A firm chest pressed against her back, and a crisp scent mixed with the fresh fragrance of body wash enveloped her tightly.","\"What is my wife thinking about?\" The man lowered his head to kiss the tip of her ear, his voice carrying the deep, lazy drawl of someone who had just stepped out of the shower.","An Ling put down her phone and slipped her hand under the covers.","Beneath the blanket, her hand covered the man's hand. Tracing upward along his finger bones, she soon touched the ring on his finger, feeling a sudden burst of coldness.","Immediately after, her fingers were intertwined with his.","He buried his face in the crook of her neck. Catching her unique, subtle fragrance, he planted a gentle kiss. \"Hmm? What is it?\"","An Ling turned her head. Under the dim light of the bedside lamp, she met the man's gaze. She stared for a few seconds before blinking.","\"I am just belatedly realizing how amazing this feels. To think I actually married you. Two years ago, I never even thought about getting married, let alone marrying you.\"","The man chuckled and lowered his head to kiss her eyes. \"Why two years ago?\"","An Ling turned around, burying her face in his embrace, and closed her eyes without answering.","Why?","Because the past two years had not belonged to her.","After a moment of silence, An Ling still could not hold back. She opened her eyes, looked up, and stared at the man eagerly. \"Shen Linyan, I want to ask you a question.\"","Shen Linyan's eyes crinkled with a smile as he pulled her a little closer into his arms. \"Alright, ask away, my wife.\"","An Ling opened her mouth and blurted out without thinking, \"When Zhou Wen was your personal assistant, what did you think of her?\"","As soon as the words left her mouth, Shen Linyan's expression froze.","He opened his mouth, but just as he was about to speak, the woman covered his lips. \"Never mind, never mind! That is a bad question! You are not allowed to answer. Just pretend you did not hear it!\"","An Ling regretted it the moment she asked.","If Shen Linyan praised Zhou Wen, she would not want to hear it.","If Shen Linyan spoke ill of her, she would just think he was trying to coax her.","\"Let us just go to sleep.\" She let go, but the man caught her wrist.","The man lowered his eyes and gently kissed her palm, his tone carrying a hint of helplessness. \"Honey, where on earth did you hear these things? You always seem to think I have something going on with Zhou Wen.\"","An Ling thought to herself, where else? In the plot, of course.","She shifted her body, turning her back to him, and muttered softly, \"I was just asking casually. I was curious.\"","The man stretched out his long arm, scooping his little wife back into his embrace.","Resting his chin gently on top of her head, his voice was tender and slow in the darkness of the night. \"My impression of her was not very good.\"","An Ling paused and looked up. \"What? You are not lying to me?\"","\"I am not lying to you.\"","Shen Linyan lowered his head and kissed her neck. \"Because the workload was very light, Zhou Wen often skipped work to go out with Lu Jingshen. When she argued with Lu Jingshen, he would come looking for her, bringing flowers and gifts. Zhou Wen would refuse to accept them, and the two of them would argue right in the office area. It made it impossible for the colleagues in that section to focus on their work, and a few times, clients almost saw them.\"","This was the first time An Ling had heard about this.","With her back to the man, she stayed quiet for a few seconds before silently turning back around and saying dryly, \"Why are you telling me all this? I do not actually care that much. I was just asking out of curiosity.\"","The man's chest vibrated as a low chuckle escaped his lips. He wrapped his arm around her waist. \"Okay.\"","An Ling was just about to close her eyes and go to sleep when the man's voice sounded by her ear.","\"My wife, can I ask you a question then?\"","\"Hmm?\" She nodded with her eyes closed. \"Sure, go ahead and ask.\"","Shen Linyan lowered his eyes, quietly watching the woman in his arms, and slowly spoke:","\"Will my wife... always like me?\"","An Ling froze, then immediately looked up, only to meet a pair of deep, profound eyes.","Her eyes curved into a smile. \"Why are you suddenly asking something like that.\"","The man lowered his eyes, staring fixedly at her, and spoke softly,","\"I hope my wife will always like me, okay?\"","Even if she discovered his true nature in the future, she would still like him just as she did now.","An Ling blinked, smiled, and gave him a kiss.","\"Okay.\"","After the news broke, An Ling took a few days off from work.","Ms. Chen expressed her understanding and comforted her, telling her not to take the news to heart. She also promised to explain the situation clearly to their colleagues.","Her parents were furious when they found out about the news, insisting that An Zhou must clarify everything.","It took several days for the situation to gradually die down.","These events didn't really affect An Ling, but she noticed that Shen Linyan seemed to be getting more and more clingy lately.","\"Beep—\"","In the evening, the sound of the front door unlocking rang out.","An Ling was sitting on the sofa with a blanket draped over her legs, watching a show on her tablet. She was so engrossed that she didn't hear the door open.","It wasn't until a familiar, deep male voice sounded by her ear.","\"What is my wife watching?\"","She finally reacted and looked up. \"Watching a show. When did you get back?\"","The man unbuttoned his coat, revealing a crisp white shirt underneath. His suit vest further accentuated his broad shoulders and narrow waist, highlighting his excellent physique. His handsome and elegant features looked even more noble.","Shen Linyan raised a hand to loosen his tie, the silver wedding ring on his ring finger particularly eye-catching. He smiled, lowered his head to kiss the corner of her lips, and asked gently, \"Just got back. What did you have for dinner?\"","An Ling nodded and cooperatively kissed him back a few times, her eyes still glued to the show. \"Auntie Cheng made dumplings today. You should go take a shower first.\"","\"Is my wife going to the bedroom?\"","An Ling was sitting too comfortably and was reluctant to move. \"I'll go in a bit later, after I finish this episode.\"","As soon as she said that, the person in front of her went quiet.","Sensing that the man was standing there motionless, An Ling looked up at him.","Meeting her confused gaze, the man spoke in a mild tone, \"I can carry my wife back to the bedroom.\"","\"...\"","An Ling blinked. A few seconds later, she smiled and turned off the tablet. As if compromising, she reached out her arms to him. \"Then you have to remember to bring my tablet in later.\"","The man bent down to let her wrap her arms around his neck, kissed her cheek, and said, \"Okay.\"","By the time Shen Linyan came out of the bathroom, An Ling was still sitting on the bed watching her show.","He pulled back the covers and got in, turning to look at his little wife who was still completely absorbed in the screen.","His gaze lingered on the tablet screen for a moment. \"What show is my wife watching?\"","\"Hmm?\" An Ling turned her head and shifted the tablet slightly toward him. \"A Korean drama. Do you want to watch?\"","Shen Linyan nodded and reached out his hand. \"Let me hold it for you.\"","An Ling handed the tablet to him and rested her head on his shoulder.","An Ling was watching a romance drama. When she saw the male and female leads kissing, her gaze paused and her eyes began to dart around unsteadily.","It was fine when she watched this kind of scene alone.","But watching other people kiss together with Shen Linyan made her feel...","She originally thought she just needed to endure it for a moment, but unexpectedly, the leads didn't stop after the first kiss. What followed were several different camera angles of them making out.","In the quiet room, the only sounds left were the kissing noises coming from the tablet and the lingering, soft background music.","An Ling's face gradually turned red. She pursed her lips and quietly peeked up at him.","But the very next second, she crashed straight into the man's gaze.","He was quietly watching her, who knew for how long. His gaze was warm and serene, like the moon outside the window, wrapping an indescribable deep affection within its gentleness.","As their eyes met, An Ling seemed to be bewitched and took the initiative to lift her head.","The man lowered his head and captured her lips, sucking on them time and time again.","An Ling wrapped her arms around his neck, her eyelashes trembling as she closed her eyes.","The music from the show stopped at some point, and the tablet was set aside.","The man pulled her onto his lap. The tip of his tongue pried her teeth apart, and his hand slipped in under the hem of her pajamas.","The temperature in the air gradually rose. Their scorching breaths intertwined in a deeply passionate embrace.","An Ling was kissed until her head spun. When they finally parted, she gasped for air, clinging to the man's shoulders.","The man buried his face in the side of her neck. He had only kissed her a few times when An Ling remembered something and slightly turned her head.","\"Don't leave any marks. I have to go back to work tomorrow.\" Her voice was soft and accompanied by light pants. Her clingy tone was enough to melt anyone's heart.","Shen Linyan's Adam's apple bobbed gently. He looked up and kissed her lips. \"Okay.\"","He undid her buttons and lowered his head to drop light kisses on her beautiful collarbone.","Tracing down her soft skin bit by bit, he lowered his head and gently took her in his mouth. Instantly, the muffled moan of the woman, her ending note almost trembling, reached his ears.","This sound was like a spark falling into a haystack, instantly bursting into a crackling blaze.","Shen Linyan's arms tightened immediately, and he flipped over, pressing her against the bed.","The dim light shone on the bed. Underneath the highly arched blanket, the woman was completely covered by the man's body, only occasionally revealing a slender, fair arm covered in red marks.","Heavy panting mixed with muffled moans echoed intensely within the bedroom.","An Ling's forehead was covered in sweat, and her hair stuck to her cheeks. She opened her watery eyes, the corners of which were flushed red, and unconsciously murmured, \"So hot...\"","The man pulled her up into a sitting position, his movements never ceasing as he lowered his head to kiss her face. \"We'll shower later, baby.\"","An Ling leaned against his shoulder, her gaze landing on the tablet at the head of the bed. Her voice was fragmented and intermittent. \"Did you... did you even watch the show?\"","The man lowered his head to kiss her hair and spoke with a smile.","\"No.\"","\"I knew it!\" An Ling was so annoyed that she instantly punched him.","But her soft punch had no real strength behind it. Instead, the man caught her hand and kissed it.","These past few days, no matter what she did, even if she was just playing a mini-game on her phone, Shen Linyan would lean over, and it would ultimately turn into this.","She simply couldn't resist the temptation of his beauty.","By the time they finished showering again, An Ling lay on the bed, too exhausted to even lift a finger.","Feeling someone lie down beside her, she kept her eyes closed and grumbled.","\"Shen Linyan, if I'm late tomorrow, I'm blaming you.\"","In the pitch-black environment, the man's sexy, low chuckle rang out. Then, she was gently pulled into his embrace. \"I won't let my wife be late. I'll drive you to the company.\"","She kept her eyes closed, drowsy and on the verge of falling asleep.","But then, the man's very soft voice reached her ears again.","\"My wife, Lu Jingshen has become the acting chairman of the Shen Corporation.\"","In an instant, An Ling's sleepiness dissipated quite a bit.","She immediately recalled the plot from her previous life, where the An family was swallowed up and Shen Linyan eventually went bankrupt.","She opened her eyes and slightly lifted her head. \"He will target you.\"","It wasn't a question, but a tone of absolute certainty.","In the darkness, the man noticed her movement, lowered his head, and pressed a kiss to her forehead.","\"Don't worry, my wife. I am here, and I won't go bankrupt.\""]},{"number":113,"title":"Chapter 113: I Am Her Husband [Word Count Fulfilled]","paragraphs":["The next day, the alarm clock rang on time.","An Ling turned over and groggily turned off the alarm. She sat up slowly in bed, so sleepy that she couldn't even open her eyes.","Footsteps approached, and then a section of the bed sank down.","Her face was gently cupped by someone, and warm fingertips tenderly brushed against her cheek.","\"Still sleepy?\" the man's voice was deep, carrying a gentle smile.","An Ling didn't speak. She just opened her eyes and gave him a slow glance.","The woman's still half-asleep face clearly read, 'What do you think?'","Shen Linyan couldn't help but laugh out loud. He reached out and gently pulled his grumpy little wife into his arms, his hand resting on her waist and rubbing it softly. \"My fault. Does my wife want to take another day off?\"","An Ling lowered her head, resting her forehead against the shoulder of his suit. Every breath she took was filled with the man's crisp, woody cedar scent, steady and reassuring.","She closed her eyes and mumbled softly, \"No need, it's time to go to work.\"","It had been so long since the incident; logically, the hype should have died down by now.","But facts proved that An Ling was wrong.","As soon as she entered the company building, countless gazes instantly shot toward her.","These looks came from all directions—scrutinizing, curious, mixed with the sound of whispers, making them almost impossible to ignore.","An Ling's footsteps paused slightly, but she still naturally took the elevator up.","In the enclosed, cramped space, this scrutiny felt even more intense. An Ling could even hear someone ask in a low voice, \"Is it really her?\"","\"Ding—\"","The elevator doors opened, and she walked out briskly.","It wasn't until she sat back down at her desk that the uncomfortable stares gradually disappeared.","She leaned back in her chair and sighed.","She really wasn't used to the feeling of being famous.","Just as she turned on her computer, the faint sound of an argument came from behind her.","\"You go.\"","\"I won't, you go yourself.\"","\"Oh, how about we go together.\"","\"It's fine, just go directly.\"","\"That's easy to say, so why don't you go.\"","\"I'm not the one who needs a stamp.\"","She turned her head to take a look.","Two colleagues were pushing and shoving each other with documents in hand, their eyes occasionally darting in her direction.","After making eye contact with her, both of them froze, then flusteredly but pretending to be calm, looked away.","An Ling: \"...\"","She turned her head back.","It seemed the impact was still there.","Not long after, a tentative female voice came from beside her.","\"Um, Producer An, this form needs your stamp...\"","Looking up, her gaze fell on the other person's clothes.","It was one of the people from over there just now.","An Ling's expression remained unchanged. She nodded and took it. \"Okay.\"","After stamping it and handing the form back, the other party remained standing there, looking at her as if hesitating to speak.","An Ling spoke up first: \"Is there any other problem?\"","The girl opened her mouth, but suddenly, the document in her hand was snatched away by a hand, and a man's lazy voice sounded from behind.","\"Xiao Yang wants to ask if that news from yesterday was really about you?\"","\"Brother Nan!\" Xiao Yang's face instantly turned red, trying to stop him.","Nan Zhechuan sat on a nearby chair, glanced at the form, and then raised an eyebrow at her.","\"What? Isn't it? It's not just you.\"","As he spoke, he looked around the office again, his tone lazy.","\"Don't the rest of you want to ask too? I heard you all discussing this matter this morning.\"","The other colleagues who were quietly pricking up their ears: \"...\"","An Ling guessed this was the case and smiled, \"It's me. There's nothing you can't ask, though I originally thought you guys would have found out earlier.\"","Xiao Yang rubbed her nose. \"We were just guessing the past couple of days. We didn't expect it to be true.\"","Nan Zhechuan crossed his legs, looking smug. \"You guys are no good. I knew about it before the variety show even started filming.\"","As his words fell, others instantly exclaimed, \"Really? How did you find out so early?\"","Nan Zhechuan handsomely adjusted his hair. \"Of course An Ling told me. You have no idea how much effort it took for me to hold back from saying anything.\"","Every time he saw his colleagues discussing it, he felt like he had a god's-eye view.","With him saying this, the originally somewhat tense atmosphere instantly relaxed.","Xiao Yang looked a bit embarrassed.","She pursed her lips and stayed silent for a moment before saying, \"Producer An, we've already seen the news. Although we don't know the exact details of what happened, we all believe you.\"","Hearing this, An Ling's face blanked in surprise.","Before she could speak, she heard Nan Zhechuan say:","\"We all work in this industry, so we all know that those media outlets will say anything for a gimmick. Don't take the news to heart.\"","As his voice fell, other colleagues chimed in one after another in agreement.","\"Yeah, the news is purely to fool those who don't know any better. Don't we know what kind of person Producer An is?\"","\"When the news first came out, I knew it was fake. With Ah Leng's temper, how could she have taken the initiative to ask to film Shen Fuyuan back then?\"","\"Exactly! And the reason we were able to get so much sponsorship was because of An Ling. Otherwise, Chairman Shen would never have agreed to the filming.\"","Various voices of comfort reached her ears. An Ling's eyelashes trembled slightly, and a few streams of warmth flowed through her heart.","But this touch of emotion didn't last long, as she then heard a colleague change the subject.","\"It's just that Ah Leng is too unkind, actually hiding her identity from us.\"","\"Oh, don't even mention it. When we were setting up camera positions at Chairman Shen's house before, An Ling said she was staying behind to check things over. Was she really checking?\"","A colleague next to them turned to look, their eyes narrowing ambiguously. \"That red book that fell on the floor before wasn't just a notebook, was it?\"","Teasing voices rose one after another, and An Ling's face flushed with a guilty conscience: \"...\"","Fortunately, someone called her at this moment.","\"Ah Leng, Teacher Chen is calling you.\"","She hurriedly stood up, \"Okay.\"","After An Ling left, the office remained in a lively atmosphere.","Someone asked Nan Zhechuan when he found out.","\"When we went to the Shen family's house to set up the cameras before, remember Chairman Shen bought bread for us?\" Nan Zhechuan sighed with emotion. \"That wasn't for us. That was bought for An Ling by someone else.\"","\"That early?\"","Someone recalled that time period. \"They were still getting a divorce at that time, right? Their relationship was still that good even when getting a divorce.\"","Suddenly, someone spoke up.","\"Not necessarily. You didn't even see Shen Linyan. Maybe An Ling directed and acted the whole thing out herself and bought it.\"","As soon as these words came out, the office fell silent, and they instantly looked toward the source of the voice.","A woman sitting in a chair raised her head.","\"What's wrong? Am I wrong? It's possible she directed and acted it out herself. Aren't there people online saying that Shen Linyan's account is just An Ling's alt account?\"","Xiao Yang frowned and said, \"No way. If their relationship is bad, why would they remarry?\"","\"For commercial interests, to hype up popularity, for reputation—these all count as reasons, right? An Ling didn't let us find out before, maybe it was also because their relationship wasn't very good.\"","The woman picked up her phone and stood up. \"I also saw someone reveal this online. They said that according to Shen Linyan's personality, he wouldn't deliberately post an update just for a ring, so isn't it highly likely that it was self-directed and self-acted? Besides, have you guys ever seen An Ling and Shen Linyan appear together? Has Shen Linyan ever said it himself?\"","The others looked at each other in dismay, wanting to retort but finding themselves at a loss for words.","Let alone appearing together, they hadn't even seen Shen Linyan in person yet.","Even Xiao Yang's new blind-date boyfriend had been seen downstairs every day recently, picking her up from work. It was as sweet as could be.","Seeing them stay silent, the woman turned and went to the restroom.","Standing in front of the mirror, she took out her phone.","[I've said it.]","After sending the message, she put down her phone to wash her hands.","Just as she finished drying her hands, a message popped up on the screen.","[10,000 transferred]","She frowned and clicked her tongue.","\"Some Mrs. Shen she is. So stingy, only giving ten thousand yuan.\"","...","The work piled up over her few days of leave was quite a bit. After her meeting, An Ling placed the documents on her desk and got up to make a cup of coffee in the pantry.","While waiting for the coffee machine, she took a moment to check the news online.","She didn't know if it was her brother or Shen Linyan who had stepped in to control the comments.","The direction of public opinion online had gradually shifted, and the focus of the topic had been diverted.","It went from An Ling actively causing trouble in the beginning, to people saying that if Zhou Wen hadn't revealed An Ling's identity first, none of this would have happened.","She took a sip of her coffee and casually scrolled through the comment section.","Those comments Jiang Mai had sent her earlier were now all gone.","She didn't know if those people deleted them themselves or if the platform removed them.","As her eyes were fixed on the news, a message suddenly popped up.","Shen Linyan: [Madam, do you want to go out for a movie tonight? I heard there's a new release that's really good ^^]","An Ling blinked, the corners of her lips turning up slightly.","[I can't tonight. We have a dinner party, and my colleagues insisted I go. I'll accompany my hubby next time (^▽^)]","She had skipped the last few gatherings, and Sister Lin Ya said she absolutely couldn't escape this time.","Shen Linyan: [Alright, I'll come pick you up after it's over, Madam.]","......","The evening gathering was at a KTV. Sister Lin Ya had also invited eight or nine other close colleagues.","Everyone probably hung out together often; the atmosphere was very harmonious, and they started ordering songs as soon as they went in.","An Ling quietly shrank into a corner, listening to them sing from the sidelines and occasionally eating some fruit.","Sister Lin Ya noticed her and sat down next to her. \"Aren't you going up to sing?\"","The young woman shook her head, leaned in, blinked, and whispered softly, \"I'm a terrible singer.\"","Lin Ya was slightly surprised. \"Really?\"","\"Really.\" An Ling nodded repeatedly. \"The only song I'm probably good at is Happy Birthday.\"","Lin Ya was amused by her. \"Then let's play a game.\"","\"What game?\"","Lin Ya's gaze fell on the table next to them, and she picked up the dice. \"Let's roll dice.\"","She placed the dice in the cup and turned to look at the others listening to the music. \"Who wants to play dice?\"","Nan Zhechuan was the first to raise his hand. \"Me, me, me, me!\"","A few others also nodded and came over. \"Count me in!\"","An Ling spoke up weakly, \"But I've never played.\"","\"Then let's play a simple one, no skill required.\"","Nan Zhechuan put ten dice into the cup. \"We take turns rolling. Everyone guesses a number. If you guess right, you take away a die. If you guess wrong, you take a sip of alcohol until you guess correctly. The odds are high with ten dice, don't worry, there are six of us here.\"","After hearing Nan Zhechuan's explanation, An Ling felt it sounded quite simple.","That was until she failed to guess the number eight times in a row, and An Ling fell silent.","The colleagues beside her also fell silent.","Seeing the flush on the girl's face, Sister Lin Ya gently reminded her, \"Why don't we stop here? Don't get too drunk, or it'll be hard for you to get home.\"","\"It's fine.\" An Ling took a deep breath, not knowing if her face was burning from frustration or from being drunk.","She took off her jacket, rolled up her sleeves, and stubbornly shook the dice cup, her competitive spirit instantly flaring. \"I'll try a few more times.\"","What kind of luck was this? It was too terrible.","She refused to believe she couldn't guess a single number right!","Finally, on her tenth try, An Ling guessed the number correctly.","She instantly breathed a sigh of relief, feeling a heavy burden lifted, and passed the cup to the next person.","After a few rounds, An Ling clearly felt she couldn't handle much more.","If she kept drinking, she would definitely get drunk.","An Ling sat on the sofa and shook her head. Under the dim lights, her fair face was flushed a deep red. \"I'm not playing anymore, you guys go ahead.\"","The other colleagues nodded in agreement.","An Ling watched them play from the side, but the more she watched, the sleepier she got.","She had been kept up too late by Shen Linyan yesterday, woke up early today, and on top of that, had drunk several large glasses of alcohol. Drowsiness washed over her like a tidal wave.","Her eyelids were fighting each other. An Ling yawned and checked the time; there were still fifty minutes until their room reservation ended.","Everyone was having fun, so it didn't seem right to leave early.","Hugging her jacket, she leaned against the sofa, lazily closing her eyes as she watched her colleagues play. Amidst the music and the rhythmic shaking of the dice, she drifted off.","Inside the private room, the light was dim, and no one noticed that the girl in her seat had closed her eyes and fallen asleep.","She quietly lowered her head. Her hair slipped from her shoulder with the movement, covering the side of her face, and her eyelashes cast a shadow beneath her eyes.","The phone inside her jacket vibrated slightly, but this faint sound was instantly drowned out by the noisy music.","In the end, it was Xiao Yang who noticed something was off.","She turned her head, leaned over to take a look, and confirmed that An Ling was genuinely asleep.","Just as she was about to tell Sister Lin Ya.","A confused voice from another colleague suddenly rang out in the room.","\"Sir, are you in the wrong room?\"","She looked up,","only then noticing a unfamiliar man standing at the doorway.","At first, not many had noticed, but with this call-out, everyone else cast their gazes over.","When they saw the man's face, everyone was stunned.","The hallway light spilled in. The man had his hand resting on the door handle, his hair styled immaculately. His dark suit accentuated his sharp shoulder lines, and the silver ring on his ring finger gleamed coldly under the light. His features were handsome and refined, yet his entire being exuded an aloof, composed aura.","His gaze swept across the room, and upon seeing the girl on the sofa, his eyes flickered. His tense jaw slightly relaxed, and his clenched hand loosened a bit.","\"Apologies for the intrusion,\" he parted his thin lips, his voice gentle yet distant. \"I'm here to take An Ling home. She didn't answer my calls.\"","Lin Ya instinctively turned to look at An Ling. \"An Ling?\"","Xiao Yang hurriedly spoke up, \"Sister Lin Ya, Sister An Ling fell asleep.\"","Lin Ya was slightly taken aback. \"Asleep?\"","She hesitantly looked at the man. \"Um... are you An Ling's family member?\"","\"I am her husband.\"","This single sentence instantly made the private room even quieter.","The music had already stopped, and the scene suddenly became somewhat stiff.","Everyone present had seen Shen Linyan before, but only through occasional photos. Coupled with the dim lighting, they didn't immediately register that they were looking at the man himself.","Shen Linyan didn't say anything else and walked straight toward the sofa.","The girl sat on the sofa, her head lowered, hugging her clothes in her arms, her cheeks looking peaceful and pure.","He brushed aside her hair, reached out to cradle her face, and bent down to whisper softly in her ear, \"Madam, it's time to go home.\"","As if hearing someone call her name, An Ling groggily woke up from her sleep.","She slowly opened her eyes. Her head felt heavy from sleep, and for a moment, she couldn't register where she was.","Upon seeing the man's face in front of her and hearing the mention of going home, An Ling nodded subconsciously.","But immediately, a sharp ache shot through her neck. She frowned and let out a soft sound of discomfort.","Shen Linyan reached out and gently massaged the back of her neck.","An Ling sobered up slightly, but her mind was still foggy. She didn't even think about why Shen Linyan was here; her only thought was that she was going home.","She picked up the coat in her lap, quietly put it on, and held the man's hand as she stood up.","She stumbled as she rose, almost losing her footing, but the man steadily supported her by the waist.","Looking at her colleagues in the private room, An Ling's face was flushed, her eyes hazy with intoxication, but she still remembered her manners, giving them an earnest wave.","\"I'm leaving now.\"","All her colleagues stared at them blankly, so stunned that no one replied for a moment.","It wasn't until the two left the room that someone finally blurted out, \"Holy crap, I think that really was Shen Linyan...\"","The colleagues exchanged glances and, almost in unison, pulled the door open to peek out into the hallway.","In the corridor, they saw the couple take a few steps before suddenly coming to a halt.","The man bent down to whisper something in the girl's ear, then lowered his head to kiss her cheek. The girl nodded gently and obediently wrapped her arms around his neck.","The next second, the man scooped her up into his arms and carried her toward the exit.","As if hearing the commotion behind them, the man turned his head to look back.","After a brief meeting of eyes, he indifferently withdrew his gaze, turned around, and continued carrying the person in his arms out the door.","The group of colleagues who witnessed everything: \"...\"","Xiao Yang, looking utterly in disbelief, turned to Nan Zhechuan beside him: \"And you call that having no feelings for each other?\"","Nan Zhechuan: \"...\"","I never said that."]},{"number":114,"title":"Chapter 114: Then if... I change, will Madam still like me","paragraphs":["In the garage, the black Maybach came to a steady stop.","With a click, the seatbelt was unfastened.","The man bent down to carry her out of the passenger seat and strode into the elevator.","A clean, woody cedar scent lingered at her nose. An Ling's head felt heavy. She subconsciously reached out to wrap her arms around the man's neck and murmured softly, \"My neck is sore...\"","\"No wonder you didn't answer the phone. You fell asleep in there.\"","Shen Linyan lowered his head, his tall nose sinking into the girl's soft cheek. He sniffed gently and asked in a deep voice, \"How much did my wife drink?\"","An Ling thought for a moment.","\"I forgot.\"","She leaned against the man's shoulder as sleepiness washed over her. Closing her eyes, she slowly drifted back to sleep.","Shen Linyan quietly and gently kissed her forehead.","After entering the door, he placed her on the bed.","The moment she touched the pillow, An Ling immediately let go, turned her head to the other side, and happily closed her eyes to sleep.","Shen Linyan sat on the edge of the bed looking at her. After a few seconds of silence, he supported himself on the bed and slowly leaned over her.","He hooked a strand of her hair, lowered his head to kiss her cheek, and called, \"Wife.\"","An Ling answered vaguely, \"Hmm?\"","The man's deep voice brushed against her ear, \"Do you like me?\"","An Ling: \"...\"","Here we go again.","She nodded with her eyes closed and replied perfunctorily, \"I like you, I like you.\"","How could someone ask this kind of question every time before going to sleep?","Do you like me or not.","Will you always like me.","How much do you like me.","It was an essential routine every night before falling asleep.","Anyone who didn't know better would think Shen Linyan was trying to brainwash her.","Guessing that the man would continue to ask, An Ling turned around, covered his mouth with her hand, and answered preemptively, \"I will always like you, I like you very much. Alright, no more asking, I want to sleep!\"","The man seemed to laugh aloud. He grasped her wrist, lowered his head to kiss her palm, and the colors in his eyes gradually deepened.","\"Then what if... I change, will my wife still like me?\"","An Ling was quite surprised; there was actually a new question tonight.","Her mind was groggy. She hummed a few times with her eyes closed, \"I'd like you, but you'd better turn into Huihui, otherwise I'm afraid I won't recognize you.\"","Shen Linyan was stunned when he heard this, then laughed out loud.","He opened his mouth to say something, but looking at the girl's flushed and soft profile, he stayed silent for a few seconds and swallowed his words. He lowered his eyes, smiled, and touched her face, his voice softening.","\"Go to sleep, my wife.\"","...","Outside the window, the night was long, and the biting cold wind beat against the glass.","Inside the brightly lit villa.","In the living room, a woman was sitting on the sofa. She had been scrolling through the news, but seeing the shifting comments online, she secretly gritted her teeth.","You really have some nerve, An Ling, actually buying ghostwriters.","When she heard the door open, she turned her head.","Seeing the man returning from outside, she quickly got up to greet him. \"Jingshen, you're back. Why are you so late today? Did you see the news online? They're actually saying now that I provoked An Ling first...\"","\"Enough, I know.\"","Lu Jingshen had just finished a meeting and was already feeling irritable. Hearing this, he impatiently massaged his temples and looked at her with a twitching mouth.","\"Then go find Shen Linyan to deal with it. After all, when you published that statement back then, saying everything was a misunderstanding, wasn't it just to make Shen Linyan think highly of you? Then go ahead and keep begging Shen Linyan now.\"","Zhou Wen froze, a faint flicker in her eyes. She pursed her lips, \"You misunderstood. I was just worried about you, Jingshen. Shen Linyan has the AL Group behind him. If this matter blows up, it will affect your succession to the Shen Corporation, which is why I wanted to smooth things over.\"","\"Affect me?\"","Lu Jingshen unbuttoned his suit jacket and sneered at her words. He walked over quickly and grabbed her chin. \"Zhou Wen, are the things you do really for my own good, or are they to let Shen Linyan know how good you are?!\"","He stared at her intently, his grip unconsciously tightening. \"Don't think I don't know. Back when we were dating, you also liked Shen Linyan, didn't you!\"","\"What are you talking about!!\" Zhou Wen cried out in pain, instinctively trying to push him away, but the man was like a solid wall, impossible to move!","She also lost her temper and said angrily, \"Lu Jingshen, don't be crazy!\"","Ever since the auction that day, she had been scolded by Mother Shen upon returning home. She was told she was foolish enough to be played by An Ling, that she was useless, and only brought them trouble.","Could she really be blamed!? If An Ling hadn't intentionally hidden it, and if Lu Jingshen hadn't kept it a secret from her that Shen Linyan had started a new company, how could she have done that!","Damn it. If she had known Lu Jingshen was like this, she definitely wouldn't have chosen him.","If she could do it all over again, she might as well have chosen Shen Linyan. Shen Linyan was much more capable than Lu Jingshen.","She gritted her teeth. \"Lu Jingshen, I really did it for you. I have always been grateful to Big Brother. He helped us in the past, and I was just thanking him out of habit! Why do you have to overthink it!\"","Remembering Lu Jingshen's current status, Zhou Wen paused and gritted her teeth slightly.","She had finally made it this far; she couldn't let all her past efforts go to waste.","Her eyes flickered. Enduring the pain, she reached out to gently hug the man's waist, her tone softening. \"Jingshen, if you mind, I won't go looking for Shen Linyan anymore. I love you. Can't we just live our own lives well from now on?\"","Feeling the man's grip loosen slightly, Zhou Wen pressed her face against his chest and slid her hand down. She was just about to say something when the man roughly pulled her away.","Lu Jingshen's face remained gloomy. He looked at her, the emotions in his eyes unreadable, and coldly spat out a sentence, \"I'm sleeping in the study tonight.\"","Zhou Wen stood frozen in place. It wasn't until she heard the door close that she woke up as if from a dream, angrily throwing a pillow onto the floor.","She clenched her fists, her eyes full of resentment.","It was all An Ling's fault!","If she hadn't ruined everything, none of this would have happened!","Lu Jingshen was also becoming more and more different from before.","Zhou Wen could clearly feel that Lu Jingshen's feelings for her were fading.","In the past at the Shen family, when Mother Shen disliked her background and deliberately made things difficult for her, Lu Jingshen would help her. Now, he just pretended not to see it.","\"Tsk.\" She irritably ran a hand through her hair. Her gaze fell on her phone. She hesitantly found that name, typed out a message, and sent it.","[Big Brother.]","But the next second, a message instantly popped up in the chat box.","[Sorry, you are not yet his/her friend. Please send a verification message to add as a friend first.]","Zhou Wen grew even angrier and threw her phone directly onto the sofa.","Meanwhile, in the study, Lu Jingshen sat in his chair, anger still lingering on his face. The phone on the desk suddenly rang.","Seeing the caller ID, he paused but still answered it.","\"Mom.\"","Mother Shen's voice came from the other end. \"Did you tell her?\"","Lu Jingshen remained silent.","Hearing his silence, Mother Shen knew the result. Her tone was cold: \"Lu Jingshen, you are now the sole heir to the Shen family. It wasn't easy for you to secure this position in the first place, and those old geezers are always watching you. If you marry an ordinary person who is of no use to you like her, how are you going to surpass Shen Linyan?\"","\"Are you going to just watch the AL Group surpass the Shen Corporation and eventually acquire it?!\"","Hearing this, Lu Jingshen instantly clenched his fists and took a deep breath. \"I know. I'll find a time to tell her.\"","Mother Shen's tone was uncompromising. \"No, now is the perfect time. Bring Zhou Wen home tomorrow.\"","Hearing this, Lu Jingshen paused, his grip tightening slightly.","\"Alright.\""]},{"number":115,"title":"Chapter 115: Divorce","paragraphs":["The next day, at noon.","The nanny van parked at the entrance of the Shen family home.","Shen Fuyuan got out of the car. As soon as she walked into the living room, she sensed an unusually quiet atmosphere in the house.","On the sofas, Lu Jingshen was sitting on a single armchair, while Zhou Wen sat alone on the long sofa. Both of their faces looked rather grim.","Her mother was sitting right in the center of the sofa, looking as calm as usual.","Shen Fuyuan paused her steps slightly and cast a suspicious glance at them.","Did they have a fight?","But that was none of her business.","Shen Fuyuan found a seat and sat down. She took out her phone and flipped through her photo album. Looking at the little cat in the photos, her mood instantly improved. Sure enough, kittens were the best at healing the soul.","She just didn't know when she could go again.","Her oldest brother didn't seem to get mad last time, so she should be able to go again.","Today was the weekend; her sister-in-law should be free, right?","Shen Fuyuan happily opened the chat window and sent a message to An Ling.","[Sister-in-law~ Are you free this afternoon? Can I come over to see Huihui?]","An Ling: [Sure, I'll be home this afternoon. Come on over.]","Shen Fuyuan's eyes instantly lit up. Great!","Just as she was about to ask if her oldest brother would also be home, her mother's voice suddenly rang in her ears.","\"Lu Jingshen, how much longer are you going to wait before you say it?\"","At these words, Shen Fuyuan froze, instinctively putting down her phone to look over.","She saw Lu Jingshen frowning with his head lowered. His expression was solemn, as if he was in a very difficult position.","Shen Fuyuan was bewildered. What was he supposed to say?","She turned her head to look at Zhou Wen, only to find that the other woman's face was also full of confusion.","Mother Shen, seeing this, cast a cold sidelong glance at him.","Sure enough, she still had to do it herself.","She shifted her gaze to Zhou Wen and stated, \"Zhou Wen, divorce Lu Jingshen.\"","As soon as the words left her mouth, both Shen Fuyuan and Zhou Wen on the sofas were stunned.","Zhou Wen quickly snapped back to reality, her face suddenly turning deathly pale. \"Mom, what does this mean?\"","She looked at Lu Jingshen again, but the man kept his head down, his lips pressed tightly together in apparent tacit agreement.","Mother Shen shot her a disdainful look, her tone cold but exceptionally forceful. \"Can't you understand? With that kind of news on the internet, Jingshen is currently in the rising phase of his career, and you will only hold him back. Letting you marry into this family before was already a mercy. Now, it's time for a divorce.\"","Zhou Wen's pupils contracted, and her heart clenched. She stood up in disbelief, walked over to Lu Jingshen, and reached out to push him, her tone panicked. \"Lu Jingshen, are you really going to divorce me?!\"","Seeing the man remain silent, she became even more agitated, pushing him harder. \"Say something! Are you really divorcing me?!\"","Lu Jingshen gritted his back teeth, his knuckles clenched tight, letting her shove him without saying a word.","Watching this scene, Shen Fuyuan silently cursed holy shit in her heart, not daring to make a sound, quietly enjoying the drama.","Seeing the man's persistent silence, Zhou Wen's eyes suddenly widened.","She had guessed that Lu Jingshen didn't have much affection for her anymore.","But she never expected that things would lead straight to divorce.","More than sadness, a wave of nameless fury rushed to her head. She screamed angrily, \"Lu Jingshen! Say something! Are you really going to divorce me? I've been with you for so long, and you're actually divorcing me!? Are you even human!\"","Seeing her so emotional, Mother Shen calmly took a sip of tea and interrupted, \"Considering you've been married for so long, after the divorce, I will have Lu Jingshen give you a generous post-marital property settlement. Let's part on good terms and stop arguing here.\"","Part on good terms??","Zhou Wen's face was as ugly as it could get. She clenched her fists, her gaze piercing the man on the sofa like an ice pick.","\"Fine, so now that you're in the chairman's seat, you're going to kick me to the curb and marry a rich heiress, right? Okay, Lu Jingshen, go ahead and marry An Ling. She happens to like you, so this is exactly what you wanted, isn't it!\"","The more Zhou Wen spoke, the angrier she got. She ground her teeth and let out a cold laugh. \"I knew it! When An Ling asked you out to the bar back then, you didn't refuse. Tell the truth, you just wanted to sleep with An Ling!\"","\"Zhou Wen! What nonsense are you spouting!\" Lu Jingshen shouted furiously.","\"Nonsense?!\" Zhou Wen's eyes were icy, gripping her trembling fists in anger. \"Do you really think I don't know that you guys deliberately spread those rumors?\"","She had swallowed her pride in the Shen family for so long just to securely be Mrs. Shen.","Did they think she didn't know about the things An Ling told her before? She was just pretending not to know!","Exposing it would do her no good at all.","The only thing she needed to do was act like a gentle, kind, innocent flower, grasp Lu Jingshen's heart, and make him utterly devoted to her.","But now...","Zhou Wen twitched the corners of her mouth.","Sure enough, this kind of mama's boy was unreliable.","The resentment in her eyes grew deeper, and the anger that had been suppressed in her heart for so long exploded. \"If I had known it would be like this, I would have gotten together with Shen Linyan back then.\"","Upon hearing this, Lu Jingshen instantly blew up. His face darkened as he stood up and grabbed her by the neck. \"You really do like Shen Linyan, you bitch.\"","\"Cough, cough, cough!! Let go!\"","Zhou Wen coughed with difficulty, grabbing his wrist, and pulled out a mocking smile. \"What else? In what way can you compare to Shen Linyan? He has a good personality and is more capable than you. Right now, I just regret not choosing him instead of you.\"","As she spoke, Zhou Wen seemed to remember something. Her movements paused slightly, and a dark glint flashed in her eyes.","Wait... it's not too late now.","An Ling and Shen Linyan didn't have a good relationship. If she got divorced now...","She had already looked it up. Although the new company Shen Linyan founded was still small, she knew his capabilities.","Even if it couldn't compare to the Shen Group right now, there was no telling what would happen in the future, and even Lu Jingshen was wary of Shen Linyan now.","As Zhou Wen thought about this, she completely failed to notice Lu Jingshen's almost murderous gaze.","He forcefully shoved the woman onto the sofa, his eyes fierce and a cold sneer on his lips. \"It seems you're thinking of going to Shen Linyan after divorcing me. Zhou Wen, take a look at yourself. Do you think Shen Linyan would like a vain woman like you!?\"","Zhou Wen fell onto the sofa, coughing a few times while clutching her neck. She looked up at him and laughed hoarsely, her momentum not yielding in the slightest: \"Heh, what does that have to do with you? Maybe I will succeed. Lu Jingshen, do you think any other rich heiress would like you with your temper? Even An Ling despises you.\"","Shen Fuyuan, on the sidelines: \"...\"","Wow... so explosive. Coming here for a meal today was definitely the right choice.","So, should she tell her sister-in-law about this?"]},{"number":116,"title":"Chapter 116: Does the Female Lead Like Shen Linyan [Word Count Fulfilled]","paragraphs":["\"Ding-dong—\"","Hearing the doorbell, An Ling put down her book and got up to open the door.","Her gaze paused slightly, landing on the familiar head of red hair. She asked curiously, \"Don't you know the passcode? You could have just come in.\"","Shen Fuyuan peeked inside. \"Is Big Brother really not here?\"","An Ling stepped aside with an amused smile to let her in. \"I told you he had something to do and went out today. He won't be back until tonight.\"","How rare. Shen Fuyuan was actually afraid of Shen Linyan.","After entering, Shen Fuyuan made a beeline for the sofa.","She scooped up Huihui, who was sunbathing, and showered the cat with frantic kisses. \"Baby Huihui! Did you miss your auntie?\"","Huihui's short little legs struggled wildly, but to no avail, and finally gave up.","Watching their interaction, An Ling found it a bit funny. She turned and went into the kitchen, put on oven mitts, opened the oven, and then fell silent.","After getting her fill of sniffing the cat, Shen Fuyuan turned and saw An Ling in the kitchen.","Remembering what happened at noon, she put Huihui down and walked over. \"Sister-in-law, do you know what I saw at noon...\"","When she saw the contents of the baking tray, she instantly exclaimed, \"Holy crap! What is this tray of black, mushy stuff?\"","Inside the baking tray lay a dozen or so black, charred, unidentified rectangular objects.","An Ling, without changing her expression, picked one up and handed it to her.","\"Chocolate cookies I made myself. Try one.\"","Shen Fuyuan took it suspiciously, examined it from all angles, and leaned in to sniff it. \"Are you serious? Aren't these burnt?\"","An Ling also picked one up for herself. \"You'll know once you taste it.\"","Seeing this, Shen Fuyuan took a half-believing bite. A few seconds later, her chewing abruptly stopped.","A bitter taste instantly filled her mouth, like eating a mouthful of sweetened Chinese medicine dregs raw.","Holding the cookie, Shen Fuyuan stood frozen in place, her expression indescribable, wanting to spit it out but not daring to.","Looking at her expression, An Ling silently put down the cookie in her hand. She took a bottle of water from the fridge, thoughtfully unscrewed the cap, handed it to her, and said with a smile, \"Sorry, it looks like they really are burnt.\"","Shen Fuyuan: \"...\"","After spitting out the cookie and chugging several mouthfuls of water, she looked at the cookies on the tray.","\"Why are you suddenly baking cookies yourself? Auntie Cheng should know how, right? You could ask her to teach you.\"","\"I saw a video about it and just wanted to try.\" An Ling had originally wanted to let Shen Linyan taste them, but now that probably wasn't going to happen.","She took a picture of the burnt cookies and then turned back to the sofa.","Shen Fuyuan had originally wanted to talk about what happened at noon, but with this interruption, she almost forgot.","She quickly followed her. \"Oh right, do you know what huge gossip I heard at noon?\"","An Ling picked up her phone and sent the picture to Shen Linyan.","[Baking failed. TT]","Hearing this, she turned back to Shen Fuyuan: \"What huge gossip?\"","Shen Fuyuan cleared her throat tactically. \"Second Brother and Zhou Wen are fighting and getting a divorce.\"","An Ling blinked, and after a good while, she slowly let out an \"Oh.\"","Shen Fuyuan was astonished: \"What kind of reaction is that!? You weren't like this the last time I said they were fighting.\"","Isn't a divorce more explosive than a fight?","An Ling also wanted to gossip, but she really didn't have the energy for it.","The last time she gossiped a bit, she ended up being dragged into the mess.","At this moment, Shen Linyan replied to her message.","[Next time I'll keep my wife company and we'll remake them together ^^]","An Ling: [Okay (⸝⸝•‧̫•⸝⸝)]","She put away her phone, picked up the book on the table, and said lazily, \"Those two will eventually make up anyway. Divorce is impossible.\"","She just didn't know what method they would use to make up this time.","They couldn't possibly use her again, could they?","Seeing this, Shen Fuyuan leaned in closer and lowered her voice. \"This time is different. They're fighting really fiercely! It's like a fight to the death, completely throwing away all dignity.\"","Pausing, she hesitantly added, \"And there's another super, super explosive piece of news. I'm only telling you, you absolutely cannot tell Big Brother I said it.\"","Explosive news?","An Ling glanced at her, not taking it to heart. She didn't want to get involved in anything related to the male and female leads anyway. She looked down, turned a page of her book, and asked casually, \"What is it?\"","Shen Fuyuan spoke mysteriously:","\"Zhou Wen used to like Big Brother.\"","An Ling's movements instantly stopped. She looked up at her. \"Who said that?\"","\"Zhou Wen herself, of course!\"","Shen Fuyuan quickly explained, \"I told you they were fighting really fiercely. Second Brother wants a divorce so he can marry a wealthy heiress of equal status and secure his position as chairman. Zhou Wen said if she had known it would be like this, she would have gotten together with Big Brother back then. She even said she'd go find Big Brother after the divorce.\"","\"...\"","An Ling paused slightly and closed her book.","...The female lead likes Shen Linyan?","Before she could sort out her thoughts, she heard Shen Fuyuan speak again:","\"And then Zhou Wen also said that the previous scandal was intentionally spread by Second Brother.\"","An Ling actually knew about this.","But... Zhou Wen actually said it out loud?","Back then, when she had specifically told Zhou Wen, hadn't the other party refused to believe it? She had even told An Ling not to think like that.","An Ling frowned slightly, sensing that something was off.","\"Are you sure Zhou Wen said all this? How could those two fight like this? Doesn't Zhou Wen really like Lu Jingshen?\"","Shen Fuyuan scoffed, leaning back on the sofa disdainfully. \"What 'like'? I was confused at first too, but looking at their reactions later, Zhou Wen seemed more furious than anything. She was angry that Second Brother kicked her to the curb right after becoming chairman. I've seen this kind of thing a lot in my circles—just climbing the social ladder for money.\"","Over the past few years, Shen Fuyuan had seen all sorts of monsters and demons in the entertainment industry; people like Zhou Wen were nothing new.","Hearing this, An Ling didn't speak, but her frown deepened.","She stayed silent for a long while before looking down at her book again.","\"Don't worry about their affairs. In the end, the divorce probably won't happen...\"","Shen Fuyuan found it strange. \"Why? Even though Mom brought it up, Second Brother agreed to it too. Right now it's just Zhou Wen making a fuss because she's unsatisfied, but I'm guessing if they give her money, she'll agree.\"","\"...\"","An Ling kept her head down, but in reality, she wasn't taking in a single word of the book.","The phrase \"Zhou Wen used to like Shen Linyan\" kept echoing in her mind.","After a moment of silence, she closed the book and sighed.","\"Then let's talk about it if they actually get divorced.\"","Shen Fuyuan thought about it and agreed. Those two had fought so many times, and every time they miraculously made up despite being angry. Maybe a miracle would happen this time too. So she put it out of her mind and went back to playing with Huihui.","An Ling sat on the sofa, her gaze falling on the person and the cat. Then she slowly withdrew her gaze, gently rubbing the corner of the page with her thumb, her eyes looking thoughtful.","At first, she only felt that the male lead didn't match the description in the plot, and now it was the female lead too.","Earlier at the banquet, she had indeed noticed some anomalies.","But she had never completely considered that the female lead would actually have an issue.","If it kept rotating like this...","An Ling's movements suddenly stopped.","Her eyes grew slightly sluggish as she stared blankly ahead.","Shen Linyan?","Would Shen Linyan also have a problem?","Impossible... right?","An Ling didn't know why the plot had turned out like this.","At night, she lay in bed, staring wide-eyed at her phone on the nightstand, her mind a mess.","Zhou Wen and Lu Jingshen might get a divorce.","Zhou Wen might like Shen Linyan.","The character settings of the male and female leads might be at risk of collapsing.","Shen Linyan might change too.","If Shen Linyan changed, what would he be like?","An Ling fell silent for a moment, slowly rolled over, and looked up quietly at the sleeping face of the man in the dim light of the night lamp.","When she first got together with Shen Linyan, it was exactly because she had taken a liking to his gentle second-male-lead persona, which was why she had shared all her secrets with him.","An Ling pursed her lips, clutched the blanket tightly, and turned to roll over again.","The next second, she was gently embraced from behind, and a crisp cedar scent enveloped her.","\"Can't sleep, my wife?\" His hot breath brushed the top of her head. The man's voice was deep and gentle, carrying a newly awakened huskiness that sounded like the vibrato of a cello.","An Ling turned her head to meet his gaze. \"Did I wake you?\"","In the night, the man's dark eyes rippled with tenderness. His eyes curved as he lowered his head to kiss her cheek. \"No, I was waiting for you to fall asleep so I could hold you.\"","Ever since she was caught intentionally watching Korean dramas last time, An Ling, considering her need to go to work, had forbidden Shen Linyan from seducing her anymore. Even hugging was off-limits, because hugging always led to him getting handsy.","Shen Linyan had originally planned to wait until An Ling fell asleep, but he hadn't expected his little wife to keep tossing and turning, unable to sleep.","He kissed her eyes. \"What is my wife thinking about?\"","In the darkness of the night, the man's deep voice, warm embrace, and familiar crisp scent enveloped her completely.","It was as if she had fallen into a warm spring; she felt no suffocating pain, but was instead pulled down to slowly drown in it.","It was an almost addictive indulgence.","She had long grown accustomed to Shen Linyan's gentleness, and she couldn't imagine what it would be like if he were to change.","An Ling blinked at him and called out softly, \"Shen Linyan.\"","\"Hmm?\" The man looked down at her. After watching her for a moment, his eyes suddenly curved into a smile, and he lowered his head to rub his nose against her cheek. \"I'm here, my wife. What's wrong?\"","An Ling pursed her lips, the words pausing at the tip of her tongue.","She closed her eyes, shifted her body forward, and buried her face in the man's chest. Her voice was muffled.","\"I can make an exception today and let you hold me while we sleep.\"","Perhaps there was no need to worry about what Shen Fuyuan had said today.","Maybe the female lead had just said that on purpose to provoke the male lead.","It was possible that she was just using Shen Linyan as a shield this time.","If that was the case, it would make sense.","The dim bedroom returned to silence. Shen Linyan held the woman in his arms, his chin resting gently on the top of her head.","He lowered his head to place a slow kiss there, his eyelids drooping carelessly.","His wife... was hiding something from him.","...","Early the next morning, Shen Fuyuan was awakened from her sleep by the ringing of her phone.","She rubbed her hair, looking furious. \"Damn it, who is calling this early in the morning!\"","All her morning crankiness instantly vanished into thin air when she saw the caller ID.","[Eldest Brother.]","Her eyes immediately froze, and all her sleepiness dissipated.","Her eldest brother never looked for her unless something was wrong; if he called, it meant trouble.","Did An Ling tell him about what happened yesterday?","Shen Fuyuan answered the phone and spoke cautiously, \"...Eldest Brother?\"","The man's familiar, cold voice came through the phone. \"Shen Fuyuan, did you come to my house yesterday?\"","\"Uh... y-yes, I did. What's wrong, Eldest Brother?\" Shen Fuyuan felt a bit guilty.","\"What did you say to your sister-in-law yesterday?\"","\"Huh?\" Shen Fuyuan was stunned.","Sister-in-law didn't tell him?","She hesitated before speaking, \"I... I didn't say much. I just mentioned that Second Brother and Zhou Wen are getting a divorce, and also said...\"","She paused here.","After hesitating for a moment, she opened her mouth and blurted everything out.","\"Eldest Brother, Zhou Wen said she used to like you. She said it herself, and she also said she plans to come find you after the divorce. I don't know if it's true or not, but that's what they said when they were arguing, and I just told Sister-in-law everything.\"","Whatever!","These words were said during Zhou Wen and Second Brother's argument anyway; she was just passing the message to her sister-in-law.","Hearing no response from the other end of the line, she quickly added, \"Eldest Brother, I really didn't exaggerate anything. Zhou Wen said it all herself! Sister-in-law didn't even believe it at first, and I didn't keep going...\"","Before she could finish her sentence, the call was already disconnected.","The man stood by the window and put down his phone.","He lowered his eyes, his dark pupils staring at the screen. It was impossible to tell what he was thinking. His fingertips tapped gently against the edge of the phone, the corners of his lips pressed into a straight line.","...","For three consecutive days, An Ling didn't hear any more news about the male and female leads getting a divorce.","At noon, she went out to visit the filming set. The weather was gloomy and drizzling. Taking advantage of her lunch break, she went to Jiang Mai's cafe to sit for a while.","After she went inside, the rain outside grew heavier. The wind howled, and the rain poured down, pattering loudly against the eaves.","An Ling sat at a window seat. She withdrew her gaze from the rainy scenery outside, picked up her coffee cup, and looked at Jiang Mai, who was playing on her phone across from her.","\"Chatting with your online boyfriend again?\"","Previously, Jiang Mai had suddenly messaged her saying she was in a relationship. What surprised An Ling the most was that this relationship was an online one.","She heard that when Jiang Mai posted a video online, someone private messaged her asking for her contact info, thinking she was pretty and wanting to get to know her.","Over time, the two of them developed feelings through their chats.","Jiang Mai looked up from her phone. \"I told you it's not online dating. We live in the same city, he's just working out of town right now. We're going to meet up in person soon.\"","\"...\"","Isn't that online dating?","An Ling changed the subject and asked curiously, \"Do you guys chat every day? Can you really develop feelings without meeting?\"","\"Of course you can. Chatting is all about emotional value.\" Jiang Mai put down her phone and cupped her face with a smile. \"Plus, his voice is really nice. He calls to coax me every night. Who wouldn't fall for that?\"","Saying that, she raised an eyebrow. \"Before you and your husband remarried, didn't you two also get all lovey-dovey on the phone every night?\"","An Ling's face flushed, and she turned her head to cough lightly.","Put like that, she could somewhat understand.","Back when she used to talk on the phone with Shen Linyan, his voice was indeed very pleasant. Every time she listened to it, she would feel sleepy.","An Ling suddenly thought of something and looked at her. \"So when are you guys meeting up?\"","Jiang Mai had shown her a photo. The guy in the photo looked clean and handsome, and he also worked out. He was definitely Jiang Mai's type.","She just didn't know what he was like offline.","Jiang Mai looked down to reply to a message. \"Probably in the next few days. It seems like he's coming back soon.\"","She glanced at the front counter. \"There are quite a few people because of the rain. I'm going to get back to work.\"","\"Alright, go ahead.\"","An Ling checked the time on her phone and felt it was about time to head back to the company.","Just then, a message suddenly popped up on her screen.","Shen Fuyuan: [Holy crap, Second Brother and Zhou Wen actually got a divorce!]"]},{"number":117,"title":"Chapter 117: From Beginning to End, Shen Linyan Was Never the Gentle Second Male Lead","paragraphs":["When An Ling found out that Zhou Wen and Lu Jingshen had divorced, her first reaction was pure bewilderment.","Outside, the weather was gloomy. The rain pattered down, and the fierce wind rustled the leaves. Inside the cafe, people came and went, and the bright lights were almost glaring.","Sitting in her seat, she felt an inexplicable sense of absurdity. She froze for a moment before slowly typing:","[Really?]","Shen Fuyuan: [Absolutely true! After I went back, I happened to see my mom looking for a blind date for my second brother. I asked about it and found out they're already divorced! I heard he gave Zhou Wen a ten million divorce settlement and even gave her the house.]","An Ling didn't know how to describe her current mood.","She suddenly felt as if she was seeing the world after a novel's ending.","Because this was a plotline she had never been involved in.","The male and female leads actually got divorced.","Could it be that in the original plot, the male and female leads also divorced after she died?","After all, she had already logged off by then and couldn't see how the story developed.","The things she was experiencing now overlapped somewhat with the ending in her memory, but they didn't match perfectly.","Some plot points appeared early, while others appeared late.","Shen Linyan had gone bankrupt, and the male lead had indeed taken the position of chairman of the Shen Group.","The only difference was that the An family hadn't gone bankrupt yet, and she hadn't died.","Thinking of this, An Ling's eyes suddenly grew distant.","After a moment of silence, she opened WeChat and removed Zhou Wen from her blacklist.","Just as she was about to send a message, she paused.","On her phone, several new messages suddenly popped up.","The sender was a string of unknown numbers.","[An Ling, are you satisfied now?]","[Your tricks are getting more and more impressive. Well, now you've achieved your goal.]","It was painfully obvious who sent these messages.","An Ling thought it was quite a coincidence. She had just been looking for Zhou Wen, and the other party delivered herself right to her door.","[Zhou Wen?]","After sending it, the other side fell silent.","An Ling took the initiative to call her.","Once the call connected, the woman on the other end spoke first. \"An Ling, you must be very proud of yourself right now, aren't you? I finally divorced Lu Jingshen. Isn't this what you've always wanted?\"","An Ling picked up her coffee and took a sip. \"What does your divorce have to do with me? Why should I be proud?\"","Zhou Wen's voice suddenly pitched higher. \"How does it not have anything to do with you! If it weren't for those news reports, why would he divorce me...\"","\"Isn't it because he wants to marry someone else?\"","At those words, Zhou Wen's voice instantly caught in her throat.","After a long while, she let out a cold sneer. \"But if you hadn't constantly gotten in the way, Lu Jingshen's feelings for me wouldn't have faded so quickly. Before, he loved me so much he could even go against his mother. How could he have turned out like this?\"","An Ling thought to herself, what did this have to do with her?","Previously, her body had been hijacked by the system to become a tool to promote their relationship, and she didn't see Zhou Wen thanking her for that.","An Ling put down her cup, her tone carrying a hint of a sigh. \"So you also knew that Lu Jingshen loved you to death? Were all those fights before just for show?\"","The system had done so much, thinking it was making the female lead jealous, but it turned out it was all just an act.","In reality, Zhou Wen had known all along just how much Lu Jingshen loved her.","She had to admit, the female lead's tactics were indeed formidable.","It was just a pity that no one expected Lu Jingshen to be such a massive mama's boy.","An Ling rubbed her thumb against the rim of her cup, raised her eyes to glance out the window, and slowly said, \"Zhou Wen, I'm quite curious. Were you with Lu Jingshen just for the money from the very beginning?\"","Hearing this, the woman fell silent for a moment before suddenly letting out a mocking sneer. \"What? Are you trying to trick me into saying something so you can tell Shen Linyan? Do you think Shen Linyan will believe you?\"","\"Tell Shen Linyan?\"","An Ling smiled and said, \"You seem to have misunderstood. I'm just a little surprised that you and Lu Jingshen were actually these kinds of people from start to finish...\"","But then she paused and slowly lowered her eyes.","After a few seconds of silence, she added with a soft smile:","\"You guys... hid your true colors quite well.\"","Zhou Wen frowned. \"What do you mean by that? What true colors?\"","An Ling's tone was cold. \"Literally what I said.\"","Zhou Wen twitched her lips. \"An Ling, your plan succeeded. I'm divorced now, so shouldn't you divorce Shen Linyan too?\"","An Ling: \"Why would I divorce Shen Linyan?\"","\"Didn't you marry into the Shen family just to make it easier to target my relationship with Lu Jingshen?\"","\"...\"","That was her previous marriage.","An Ling pinched the bridge of her nose. She wanted to retort, but she felt that arguing with this kind of person was a waste of time. \"Think whatever you want.\"","Just as she was about to hang up, Zhou Wen's voice came through again.","\"An Ling, do you think if I could hook Lu Jingshen, I couldn't hook Shen Linyan? I was the one who approached Shen Linyan first. Who knows, if you divorce him, he might just get together with me.\"","An Ling's movements froze.","A moment later, she smiled and sighed.","\"Then go tell Shen Linyan. You can have him come and ask me for a divorce.\"","Hanging up, the smile faded from An Ling's face.","She put down her phone, leaned back in her chair, and turned to quietly watch the rain outside the window.","The phone on the table suddenly buzzed.","She glanced at it.","Shen Linyan: [Madam, shall I pick you up tonight?]","Her gaze lingered on the screen for a moment. She picked up her bag and stood up, dialing a number as she walked out the door.","Jiang Mai saw her leaving and originally wanted to say hello.","But seeing the woman on the phone, the expression on her face froze again.","What was going on?","Did something happen at the company?","Pushing open the cafe doors, the cold wind wrapped in icy rain hit her face, and a chill seeped into her collar.","An Ling's eyelashes fluttered. She instinctively shrank her neck and gently pursed her lips.","\"Beep... Beep...\"","The call connected, and a surprised male voice came from the other end.","\"An Ling? Why are you calling me all of a sudden?\"","She pinned the phone between her ear and shoulder and opened her umbrella. \"Brother, are you free right now?\"","An Zhou answered in confusion, \"Yes, I'm at the company. What's wrong?\"","Holding the umbrella, An Ling grabbed her phone, lowered her eyes, and spoke softly:","\"I want to ask you some things. About Shen Linyan.\"","...","Inside the CEO's office at the An Group.","The secretary placed a glass of water on the table and smiled. \"Miss An, please have some water.\"","An Ling nodded slightly. \"Thank you.\"","The secretary left, thoughtfully closing the door behind her.","An Zhou sat to the side drinking tea, his gaze quietly studying the girl calmly drinking water on the sofa.","Why did she feel a bit intimidating...","He put down his teacup, his tone carrying a hint of probing. \"What do you want to ask about Shen Linyan?\"","Has that kid finally failed to hide his true colors?","An Ling paused. After a long while, she parted her lips and spoke slowly, \"Brother, before... you said Shen Linyan wasn't a good person. Was it just because he snatched the company's project?\"","An Zhou's movements froze.","His eyes darted around. He picked up his teacup again and muttered a hesitant \"Yeah.\" \"What else would it be? Why are you suddenly asking this? Have you finally realized that kid isn't a good person? Congratulations.\"","An Ling looked at him calmly.","\"I want the truth.\"","\"...\"","An Zhou's face stiffened imperceptibly for a second. \"Why are you asking this? Knowing won't do you any good...\"","But faced with the girl's silent, steady gaze, his voice trailed off.","Finally, he let out a helpless click of his tongue. \"Alright, alright, I'll tell you. Wasn't your body controlled by the system before? You did some foolish things, and Shen Linyan sent all the evidence of those incidents to me. How do you think those public relations crises were suppressed? If I hadn't handed those projects over to him, he would never have agreed to keep things quiet.\"","An Ling's fingertips stiffened. She twisted her fingers together, her eyelids drooping slightly. Her voice betrayed no emotion. \"So Shen Linyan used me to threaten you many times, didn't he?\"","Seeing her like this, An Zhou sighed. \"...Look, I knew you would blame yourself again. I didn't even want to mention it. That is all in the past, and besides, you weren't the one who did it. Wasn't it the system using your body? Furthermore, losing a few projects isn't a big deal. The An family can still keep going just fine.\"","\"Brother, it's not like that...\"","The young woman interrupted softly, her voice a bit hoarse. \"If I hadn't come back that day and stopped all of this, the An family might have been destroyed by Shen Linyan, and I might have ended up dead on the streets.\"","An Zhou's face froze in shock.","He watched as An Ling slowly raised her head.","The young woman's eyes were rimmed with red, yet she still managed to curve them into a slight smile as tears rolled down from the corners of her eyes. Her voice was practically trembling.","\"I told my secret... to someone I couldn't be certain of.\"","From beginning to end, Shen Linyan was never the gentle second male lead.","From the very start, his only reason for marrying An Ling was to swallow up the An family.","There was no such thing as being forced by circumstances, and there was no such thing as salvation. It was all a lie."]},{"number":118,"title":"Chapter 118: I Time-Traveled from Two Years Ago","paragraphs":["Hearing the news of the male and female leads' divorce, An Ling was terrified.","She was afraid of what would happen if Shen Linyan changed too.","If he became like them, his persona collapsing, completely losing the way he used to be.","To the point where she never considered that their personas might have been exactly like this all along.","When she called Zhou Wen, An Ling's mind was already a mess.","She didn't know which answer she wanted to hear.","Or perhaps... she already had the answer.","She just hadn't wanted to face it.","She was unwilling to believe it, unwilling to dig deeper,","but now, reality was laid bare right in front of her.","The male and female leads' personas were fake.","Shen Linyan's persona was fake too.","Her storyline had ended the moment she died.","But everyone else's storyline was still continuing.","She wouldn't even live to see the day their true colors were exposed.","She was a sacrifice, and the An family was a sacrifice.","An Ling forgot how she eventually left the An Corporation.","She only remembered staying in An Zhou's office for a whole afternoon, and finally, An Zhou drove her back.","Before she got out of the car, he hugged her gently and said softly,","\"It's okay, An Ling. The system did all of that. Neither I nor Mom and Dad have ever blamed you.\"","They didn't blame her...","They didn't blame her...","But she blamed herself.","It was because she was the supporting female character, because her body was hijacked by the system to do those stupid things, that the An family ended up in this situation.","And now, she didn't even know if Shen Linyan would continue to target the An family.","What if he did?","After all, he wasn't the gentle second male lead.","He had originally planned to swallow up the An family.","What guarantee was there that he wouldn't do it in the future?","\"Beep—\"","The front door opened, and cold air drifted from the house, gently brushing against her hair. The woman's eyelashes trembled, the corners of her eyes still holding a faint redness from crying, as she stood quietly at the door without going in.","In the dim living room, the sound of rain pattered against the windows, like a cold, man-eating cage.","It swallowed her up silently.","And she was completely unaware of it, even feeling happy.","After an unknown amount of time, An Ling finally lifted her leg slowly.","She put down her bag, sat on the sofa, and lowered her head, staring blankly at her own hand. On her slender, pale ring finger was the same wedding ring as Shen Linyan's.","\"Meow~\" A very soft cat's meow came from beside her.","Huihui was lying on the sofa looking at her, its tail swishing back and forth behind it.","An Ling blinked, collapsed onto the sofa, and tilted her head to look at it.","Huihui turned its head to glance at her, then walked over and nestled into her arms.","In the freezing living room, the furry little ball felt exceptionally warm, like holding a small heater.","An Ling's eyes curved in a smile as she lowered her head and rubbed its head.","\"It's rare to see you so well-behaved.\"","\"Buzz—\" The phone in her pocket vibrated.","She took out her phone, saw the caller ID, and pressed decline.","She opened the chat window.","The screen was full of messages.","Shen Linyan: [Madam, shall I pick you up tonight?]","An Ling: [No need.]","Shen Linyan: [Are you working overtime?]","An hour passed. Having received no reply, the man sent another message.","Shen Linyan: [What would you like to eat tonight, Madam? ^^ Do you want to eat out? I've booked a restaurant.]","Another hour passed.","Shen Linyan: [The rain seems to be getting heavier, can I come pick you up?]","Shen Linyan: [I want to see you.]","An Ling: [Fine, wait for me in the car.]","This felt more like a kind of revenge against Shen Linyan.","But this revenge didn't bring her any joy.","An Ling scrolled up through the chat history, her gaze slowly sweeping over the words, before finally turning off the screen.","Looking at these chat records now, she even felt they were full of hypocrisy.","Calculating the time, her colleagues should have all gone home by now. Shen Linyan probably noticed something was wrong, which was why he called.","An Ling hugged Huihui tightly in her arms, closed her eyes, and lay on the sofa.","She didn't know how long it had been, when a familiar sound came from the front door.","\"Beep—\"","The man stayed silent at the door for a while, then stepped inside.","The footsteps drew closer and closer, then stopped in front of her.","\"Madam.\" The man's voice was very soft, as if he was afraid of disturbing the woman on the sofa.","An Ling's eyelashes fluttered slightly. She opened her eyes, her gaze staring blankly ahead, unfocused.","After a few seconds, she slowly shifted her gaze, her eyes landing on the man.","Shen Linyan stared intently at her, an imperceptible nervousness hidden in his dark eyes, the corners of his lips pulled tight.","His usually meticulously styled hair was now scattered across his forehead, and his shirt collar was slightly unbuttoned, making him look somewhat flustered.","An Ling slowly curved her eyes into a smile. \"I lied to you. I didn't go to the company at all this afternoon. Are you angry?\"","Shen Linyan's Adam's apple bobbed.","\"It's okay, I'm not angry...\"","He stepped closer and sat on the sofa. Just like usual, he reached out his hand, wanting to touch the girl's face.","\"Why didn't you turn on the heating...\"","The next second, however, the girl dodged it without any warning.","Shen Linyan's eyes suddenly froze.","His heart skipped a beat.","His fingertips stiffened in mid-air, and he stared blankly downward.","Huihui jumped out of her embrace. An Ling propped herself up on the sofa to sit up, putting some distance between herself and the man.","She acted as if she hadn't noticed his stunned expression, busying herself with fixing her tousled hair.","Once her hair was tidy, she turned her head to meet the man's helpless gaze.","\"Shen Linyan, are you really not angry?\"","Her pace was even as she slowly repeated, \"Because I'm not entirely sure if you're just pretending.\"","Shen Linyan froze, clenching his fingers tightly.","He was just about to answer, but immediately after, the girl's words made his pupils contract sharply.","\"After all, if I make you angry, I'm afraid you might just swallow up the An Corporation.\"","His heart gave a violent jolt. His eyes looked dazed, and he subconsciously lowered his voice. \"...What?\"","\"Do you not understand?\"","An Ling tilted her head to look at him.","She curved her eyes, but there was not a hint of a smile in them. Her red lips parted slightly as she enunciated every word clearly, \"Didn't you marry me before just because you wanted the An Corporation?\"","Shen Linyan's pupils trembled slightly, freezing in place as he looked at her.","An Ling slowly lowered her eyes.","\"I'm right, aren't I?\"","Outside the window, a violent storm poured down.","Inside the room, there was a dead, suffocating silence.","After what felt like an eternity, the man's hoarse and strained voice finally rang through the air.","\"...Yes.\"","His voice was very soft, the trailing notes carrying a slight tremor. \"But that was in the past, Madam. We aren't just a marriage of convenience now...\"","An Ling's eyelashes fluttered lightly.","She turned her head slightly, her jet-black hair cascading down her shoulder, hiding her pale profile.","She pressed her lips together tightly, her slender fingers gripping the blanket beneath her.","\"In the past...\"","After a moment of silence, An Ling lifted her head.","\"Shen Linyan, I told you before that if it were two years ago, I never would have imagined marrying you. Didn't you ask me why I specifically said two years ago?\"","Under the man's stunned gaze, she spoke softly:","\"Because, I transmigrated here from two years ago.\""]},{"number":119,"title":"Chapter 119: Since I'm Not the Gentle Supporting Male Character, Does My Wife Not Like Me Anymore","paragraphs":["\"Rumble—\"","Thunder roared outside the window, and the rain grew heavier.","\"It's hard to believe, isn't it?\"","An Ling said with a lowered head and a faint smile. \"When I transmigrated here, I also found it incredible. In the two years my body was taken away, so much has happened.\"","Even though they were all bad things.","\"You might not know what it means to have a body taken away.\"","An Ling looked up. Her eyes were exceptionally bright under the light, yet devoid of any emotional warmth.","Looking at the man, she spoke slowly.","\"Shen Linyan, for the past two years, my body was hijacked by a system. It used my body to play the vicious supporting role against the male and female leads. My only mission was to pursue the male lead and bully the female lead. As for who they are, you can probably guess—Lu Jingshen and Zhou Wen.\"","In the living room, the woman's voice was soft yet calm, as if narrating a trivial matter of no importance.","\"I transmigrated over while in a bar. At that time, the novel had already reached its end. The very last plot point was smashing Lu Jingshen. You might not believe it, but this is...\"","Before the word \"truth\" could be uttered, she was interrupted by the man's hoarse voice.","\"I believe you.\"","\"I know. My wife has face blindness...\"","Even without the face blindness, he had long noticed how different An Ling was from before.","Hearing this, An Ling froze for a moment, then lowered her head and gave a small laugh. \"Ah... yes, I almost forgot about that myself...\"","After that, there was a long silence.","The air was heavy, weaving a dense web of silence.","It had never been this quiet between them.","So quiet that they could hear each other's breaths, so quiet that their heartbeats roared in their ears.","An Ling looked down, twirling the ring on her finger.","\"Shen Linyan, do you want to know what your character is?\"","Without waiting for the man to answer, she continued:","\"I thought you were the gentle second male lead of the novel.\"","At those words, Shen Linyan stiffened.","His eyelids slowly lowered, casting a shadow, and his fingertips dug into his palms.","An Ling didn't notice the man's unusual reaction and kept her head down, continuing to speak:","\"That's why An Zhou told me many times that you weren't a good person, but I never believed him. It seems that was all my illusion... Your true character settings aren't like that at all.\"","Whether it was about An Zhou, Wen Yuche, or Xu Huoqing, she had selectively ignored it all.","Thinking of the past, she lowered her eyes and let out a soft laugh. \"I used to think you would get bullied and even said I'd teach you how to be a bad guy. No wonder you laughed at me...\"","\"So, are you disappointed in me, my wife?\"","\"What?\" Interrupted out of nowhere, An Ling was taken aback and instinctively looked up.","The man's pitch-black eyes were locked tightly onto her, dark and unfathomable.","\"Because I'm not the gentle supporting male character, do you no longer like me?\"","\"I know you like that kind of person, but the internet says ideal types can change. I thought... I thought you already liked me enough.\"","A barely perceptible pain hid in the depths of the man's dark eyes. The corners of his eyes were tinged with a faint red, making him look all the more fragile against his cold, pale skin.","He spoke hoarsely, his words wrapped in a heavy bitterness, every syllable uttered with extreme difficulty.","\"An Ling, you promised me...\"","\"You said... you would always like me.\"","Hearing this, An Ling's expression blanked.","At this moment, she finally understood just how profound a meaning the man had attached to those perfunctory promises she had casually made over countless nights.","She gripped the blanket in her hands tightly and remained silent for a moment before speaking:","\"Shen Linyan, do you remember the ending I told you about before? I said you eventually went bankrupt and I died out on the streets. But those were just the plot points before my death; I don't know what happened after.\"","\"And before that, there was another ending I didn't tell you about.\"","She lifted her head, her eye sockets gradually turning red, and spoke softly:","\"To be precise, after the An Corporation was swallowed up by the Shen family, I froze to death on the street.\"","With the corners of her eyes flushed red, she slowly curved her eyes into a smile.","\"I always thought it was the male lead who targeted the An family after taking power. I never imagined that it would be you pulling the strings.\"","In an instant, Shen Linyan's gaze trembled violently.","In the quiet living room, the air seemed to freeze.","The only sound was the man's heavy breathing—rapid, panicked, and wrapped in unconcealable terror—striking against the air again and again.","\"No...\"","\"I wouldn't... my wife.\"","Disregarding everything else, he reached out and grasped the woman's hand. His eyes were red, his voice trembling and hoarse. \"My wife, I'm sorry. I would never do that to you... Please believe me, okay?\"","His tone was almost pleading, yet Shen Linyan couldn't utter a single word of defense.","Because it was him. He was the one who caused An Ling's death.","He swallowed the An family, leaving An Ling with no way out, forcing her to her death.","An Ling silently let him hold her hand. After a moment, she said softly:","\"Shen Linyan, I never intended to blame you for that ending. Besides, it wasn't something I experienced myself, so you don't need to feel so guilty. My body was hijacked by the system. It insisted on marrying you, insisted on doing foolish things to destroy the An family. It just wanted to push me toward a dead end. Even without you, it would have been the same. You just went along with the flow.\"","An Ling was very clear on who the real culprit was.","As for Shen Linyan...","She said softly, \"I just don't know how to face you anymore.\"","What happened had happened. It was like a crack in a mirror that could never be healed.","She could no longer face Shen Linyan with her previous mindset.","\"The reason I remarried you and told you these secrets was because I thought your identity as the gentle second male lead meant you would never betray me. But now... I can't see through your character anymore.\"","She didn't know when Shen Linyan might betray her, or even if this love was just an act.","\"Your disguise is too good, Shen Linyan. I don't know which is the real you, and I don't know if I can truly accept your real side.\"","The man's movements instantly stiffened.","An Ling slowly pulled her hand back.","\"But I won't divorce you...\"","After a moment of silence, she raised her eyes to look at him and softly added:","\"So, please don't tell anyone my secrets, don't take advantage of my face blindness, and don't target the An family, okay? If you want to back out of that agency contract we signed before, I'll agree to it anytime. If you have any other requests, you can bring them up.\"","In just a few short sentences, she had completely transactionalized their marriage.","Shen Linyan's pupils contracted sharply. His lips trembled slightly as he looked at her in panic and helplessness. His throat felt tight as he forced out a single word, his heart feeling as if it were being ruthlessly squeezed by a giant hand.","Don't be like this...","Don't treat him like this...","Don't draw a line between them like this.","\"My wife...\" he uttered, his voice trembling so much it was almost a whisper. \"I really do love you...\"","Hearing this, An Ling's movements paused. She kept her head down, pressing her lips tightly together. Her hair hid the expression on her face, and her fingertips twisted together tightly.","After a long while, the girl gave a soft \"Mm.\" Her voice was light, carrying a hint of hoarseness.","\"That's why... I haven't divorced you.\"","Because of his love, she wouldn't divorce him.","In that instant, Shen Linyan's breath hitched.","His gaze trembled lightly as something in the depths of his eyes slowly shattered and extinguished, turning into a bottomless, pitch-black void.","After a brief silence, he slowly reached out and cupped her face. Lowering his head, he pressed a gentle kiss to her skin, tasting the bitter salt of her tears. His voice was hoarse as he murmured softly,","\"My wife, I am so sorry... Please do not be afraid of me, alright?\"","An Ling looked up.","Her eyes were red-rimmed as she stared quietly at the man before her.","He had the same familiar face, the same familiar crisp scent, and the same familiar gentle voice. Yet, her rational mind kept screaming at her about how incredibly dangerous this man truly was.","He could destroy the An family on a whim. He could plunge her into absolute ruin at any given moment.","Large tears rolled down from the corners of her eyes. She slowly parted her lips, her voice trembling with a choked sob.","\"I hate you, Shen Linyan...\"","Her wonderful husband was gone.","The Shen Linyan she could always trust and rely on, she just could not find him anymore."]},{"number":120,"title":"Chapter 120: You Don't Need to Pretend to Be a Gentle Person in Front of Me Anymore","paragraphs":["That night, they still slept in the same bed.","An Ling hadn't mentioned moving out, and Shen Linyan hadn't asked her to move either.","When Shen Linyan came out of the bathroom, An Ling was sitting on the bed watching TV.","Hearing his footsteps, she looked up.","After their eyes met, she lowered her gaze, put away her tablet, and quietly lay down, turning her back to him.","Shen Linyan paused, pursed his lips, and with light steps, pulled back the covers and lay down beside her.","Click - the lights went out, and the room instantly plunged into darkness.","Everything seemed exactly as it used to be.","Yet, somehow, everything had changed.","Outside the window, the night was hazy. The rain had gradually lessened, leaving a fine, continuous patter. There was no thunder, only a gentle yet slightly cold sound.","In the quiet bedroom, the dim light shone on the girl, casting a soft glow over her. Through her dark hair, the tip of her small, pale ear was visible.","Her hair was scattered across the pillow. He slowly reached out, carefully touching it, and gently twined a strand around his fingertips.","\"Wife...\"","He lowered his eyes and said softly, \"Do you still like me?\"","He was answered by a quiet silence.","The girl lay with her back to him, completely motionless, seemingly already asleep.","Shen Linyan's eyelashes trembled.","His Adam's apple bobbed with difficulty as he continued to speak:","\"Wife... on the day you came back, I actually had the security footage of you hitting Lu Jingshen, but I didn't give it to An Zhou. Since then, I haven't made any moves against the An family.\"","\"You teaching me how to be the bad guy was also very useful to me.\"","\"So please don't be afraid of me, okay? I won't hurt you...\"","He wanted to go back to how things used to be.","But the room remained unusually quiet.","The pattering rain enveloped their quiet breathing.","Shen Linyan pursed his lips, his voice growing fainter. \"Honey, shall we go see a movie tomorrow night? It's been a long time since we...\"","\"Okay.\"","The girl suddenly interrupted. It was a single, brief word, spoken in a calm tone that betrayed no emotion.","Shen Linyan's voice came to an abrupt halt.","As if his reaction was half a beat too slow, he remained silent for a long time before slowly withdrawing his hand. \"...Sorry. Go to sleep.\"","The room was quiet for a moment before the girl suddenly let out a very soft sigh.","\"Shen Linyan, there is no need for you to pretend to be a gentle person in front of me anymore.\"","The man's eyes widened in stunned silence.","It felt as though his heart had been struck by a heavy hammer, and a dull, aching soreness spread through his chest.","His gaze trembled slightly, and his lips twitched with a bitter feeling. The word \"why\" was chewed over countless times in his mouth. His fingertips rubbed his wedding ring back and forth forcefully, the movement hiding a restless anxiety he hadn't even noticed himself.","But looking at the girl's back, he still answered softly and with difficulty, his lips trembling:","\"Okay.\"","The room returned to silence.","Half an hour passed.","A sudden movement of someone rolling over came from beside him, and Shen Linyan opened his eyes.","There was not a trace of sleepiness in his eyes; he was completely awake as he turned his head.","The girl had already turned around. She was breathing steadily with her eyes closed, her long eyelashes casting light shadows under her eyes, and the corners of her eyes were still slightly red.","Just as he expected, she had fallen asleep very quickly.","After a moment of silence, Shen Linyan reached out and pulled her into his arms.","The man looked as if he had regained a lost treasure. He lowered his eyes, bowed his head, and cherishedly kissed the girl's forehead.","His movements were very light, as if afraid of waking the person in his arms. He lightly sniffed the warm, faint fragrance on the girl, and only then did he slowly close his eyes while listening to the sound of the rain.","The sound of the rain outside the window remained the same, but the long-cooled air inside the room finally began to warm up.","...","The next day, the alarm clock rang.","An Ling slowly opened her eyes and reached out to turn off the alarm. She rubbed her somewhat sore eyes and turned her head to look.","The other side of the bed was empty.","Sitting up, she saw that the room was also empty.","An Ling reached out to touch the other side of the bed and found that it was already completely cold.","She paused slightly, pursed her lips, and threw off the covers to get out of bed and wash up.","Opening the bedroom door and stepping out, Auntie Cheng was feeding the cat. Seeing her come out, she smiled and said, \"You're awake, Madam.\"","An Ling nodded, her gaze pausing for a moment on the empty dining table.","Before she could speak, Auntie Cheng stood up and walked over.","\"Sir had something to do and left early. There is something he left for you on the table.\"","An Ling looked over and indeed saw a bag on the table.","She picked up the bag and found a long velvet box inside.","Opening it, a blue diamond necklace immediately caught her eye. It sparkled brilliantly in the sunlight, looking quite expensive at first glance.","Auntie Cheng walked over to take a look, sounding surprised.","\"It's a necklace, how beautiful! Would you like to try it on now, Madam?\"","An Ling's gaze lingered on it for a moment before she slowly closed the box. \"I won't try it on. I'll eat breakfast first. Auntie Cheng, could you help me serve a bowl of...\"","Before she could finish her sentence, she suddenly noticed a sticky note in the bag out of the corner of her eye.","The handwriting on it was lean and sharp, the strokes ending very cleanly without any messiness. It was clearly Shen Linyan's handwriting.","[A gift I bought for my wife last week. I hope my wife likes it.]","There were originally two ^^ symbols after this sentence, but they had been crossed out by the man.","An Ling stared down at this sticky note and slowly blinked.","Just as Auntie Cheng was about to go serve her some porridge, the girl's voice sounded behind her.","\"Auntie Cheng, could you help me put this on?\"","Turning around, she saw that the girl had reopened the box and was curiously examining the necklace in her hand.","The sunlight fell on her face, her small and pretty face flushed with the rosiness of having just woken up. Her skin was fair and delicate, but the corners of her eyes were red. Anyone with experience could tell at a glance that she had cried last night.","Auntie Cheng recalled the scene from that morning.","The man had also stood in this spot. With his handsome features and crisp suit, he carried the noble air of an elite. Yet at that moment, he looked as if he had lost his soul, standing there in a daze, completely lacking his usual sharpness.","He lowered his eyes, his fingertips gently rubbing the gift bag, and softly instructed:","\"If she says she doesn't want it... could you ask her not to throw it away?\"","\"Also, please have her use some eye drops, and don't tell her I said so.\"","Seeing him like that, it was obvious that something had happened between the two of them last night.","It didn't look like a fight; it was more like they were at odds with each other.","Auntie Cheng smiled and walked over.","\"Of course, Madam.\"","Throw it away?","Sir was worrying far too much.","She helped the girl put on the necklace and said, seemingly casually, \"Madam, you should take better care of your health. Don't work too hard. Your eyes are a bit bloodshot. Would you like some eye drops? I'll go get them for you.\"","An Ling nodded. \"Okay.\"","She picked up the mirror in the living room. The blue crystal was clear and exquisite, and the surrounding broken diamonds refracted the light, making her skin look even fairer.","It was truly beautiful.","An Ling had never had any resistance to this kind of diamond. She nodded in satisfaction, picked up her phone, and took a picture.","Out of habit, she wanted to send it to Shen Linyan, but she paused and silently canceled the message.","[I saw the necklace, thank you.]","The man replied very quickly.","Shen Linyan: [Okay, you're welcome.]","Her gaze lingered on this message for a moment. An Ling blinked and slowly put her phone away.","...","In the afternoon, after work.","An Ling picked up her bag and walked toward the elevator.","The phone in her pocket vibrated slightly.","She took it out and looked at it.","Shen Linyan: [I'm already downstairs.]","An Ling: [Okay.]","Stepping into the elevator and pressing the floor button, An Ling's eyes swept over the screen a couple of times.","She had only exchanged two sentences with Shen Linyan today.","One in the morning.","And one just now.","Her fingertips paused on the screen for a moment before she sent a message to Shen Fuyuan.","[You there? I want to ask you something.]","Shen Fuyuan: [What is it?]","An Ling: [Do you and Shen Linyan usually chat?]","Shen Fuyuan: [?]","Shen Fuyuan: [No, we don't. Big Brother usually doesn't send me messages.]","Because if he ever did, it meant he was coming to settle a score with her.","Shen Fuyuan hesitated before typing: [Why are you suddenly asking me this?]","An Ling: [Nothing much, just curious about what it's like when he chats normally with you guys.]","Ding—","The elevator doors opened, and An Ling walked out.","Spotting the familiar license plate by the road, she opened the passenger side door and met the eyes of the man in the driver's seat.","There was a momentary silence in the air. She retracted her gaze, sat inside naturally, and casually confirmed, \"Are we watching the movie first and then eating?\"","Shen Linyan's gaze fell on the girl's neck. When his eyes touched the scarf, he pursed his lips and looked away.","He opened his mouth as if to say something, but seemingly thinking better of it, he closed it again. Lowering his eyes, he started the car and gave a soft \"Mm.\"","An Ling glanced at him.","Her phone kept vibrating. Ever since she sent that last message, Shen Fuyuan had been bombarding her with texts.","[What do you mean?]","[What do you mean by 'chats normally'?]","[Why don't I quite understand?]","[Do you think my brother's chats with you aren't normal?]","Judging from this reaction, the girl probably knew exactly what kind of person Shen Linyan was.","But that made sense. In the Shen family, only Shen Fuyuan had a decent relationship with Shen Linyan.","No wonder Shen Fuyuan used to be afraid of him; was it because she knew the truth?","An Ling thought for a moment, then looked down to reply to Shen Fuyuan.","[I mean, when I'm not around, what is it like when Shen Linyan interacts with you?]","Seeing this message, Shen Fuyuan immediately sat up straight, her face filled with horror. \"Holy crap, is Big Brother about to be exposed?\"","If this leaked out through her, her brother would absolutely slaughter her!","She hastily took a screenshot, just about to send the chat history to Shen Linyan.","As if guessing what she was about to do, An Ling beat her to the punch and sent another message.","[You don't need to tell Shen Linyan. I already know, I was just asking out of curiosity.]","Shen Fuyuan: \"...\"","Since when?","She typed cautiously: [What did you... discover?]","An Ling: [I roughly figured out... that Shen Linyan is not someone to be trifled with?]","Holy moly!","Shen Fuyuan was stunned!","[How did you know? Did you ask Big Brother? Or did he tell you!?]","She remembered that back when they had their arranged marriage, her brother had always maintained a gentle and modest attitude toward An Ling.","Even after they remarried, he hadn't changed at all.","Furthermore, she had noticed that her brother cared deeply about his image in front of An Ling.","When exactly did An Ling find out!?","An Ling: [I found out myself. I just wanted to ask, is Shen Linyan really that scary?]","Shen Fuyuan thought to herself, \"Scary\" doesn't even begin to cover it.","She could never even tell if her brother was happy or angry when he smiled.","But for the sake of her own little life, she picked her words carefully.","Shen Fuyuan: [I wouldn't say scary, it's just that Big Brother is actually very cold. His gentleness toward outsiders is all an act, so he's quite hard to figure out.]","Seeing this, An Ling turned her head to look at the man driving next to her.","That was certainly true...","Being stared at so intently by her, the man's posture stiffened slightly.","While waiting at a red light, he turned to look over.","But An Ling quickly turned her head back toward the window.","His eyes showed a hint of surprise, and then he silently turned his head back to the front.","His hands gripping the steering wheel tightened slightly.","The car arrived at the movie theater. Since it wasn't the weekend, there were fewer people than usual.","The movie wouldn't start for another thirty minutes, so they had to wait outside for a bit.","Shen Linyan was picking up the tickets while An Ling stood beside him.","She buried her face in her scarf, her gaze slowly landing on the popcorn counter.","Come to think of it, it had indeed been a long time since she last went to the movies.","She had come a few times with Jiang Mai before, but after starting work, they had less time to hang out, let alone watch movies.","After collecting the tickets, Shen Linyan turned around and saw the girl staring fixedly at a certain spot.","He followed her line of sight, and his gaze paused slightly.","An Ling was still lost in thought when the man's deep, calm voice suddenly rang in her ears.","\"Do you want to buy some?\"","She paused slightly, lifting her head to meet the man's deep eyes.","This seemed to be the first actual sentence Shen Linyan had spoken to her today.","An Ling blinked at him, thought for a moment, and gave a gentle nod.","The overhead lights cast a shadow under the girl's long eyelashes. Her dark eyes were clear and clean, perfectly reflecting his silhouette.","Shen Linyan's pupils dilated slightly, his heart feeling as though it had been lightly brushed by a feather. He averted his gaze, his Adam's apple bobbing slightly, and his fingertips curling inward.","He really wanted to kiss her...","A short while later, a bucket of popcorn was placed into An Ling's arms.","Sitting in a chair in the waiting area, she popped popcorn into her mouth, her eyes glued to the trailers playing on the theater's screen.","It was showing a recently popular animated movie.","It was the same one they planned to watch today; she had heard it was very good.","She turned to look at the man beside her, who was also watching the screen, and offered the popcorn. \"Do you want some?\"","The man fell silent for a moment before slowly shaking his head. \"No, thanks.\"","\"Okay.\"","An Ling pulled it back and ate it herself.","The heating in the cinema was on full blast. An Ling belatedly realized she was feeling a bit hot. She placed the popcorn on the table and raised her hands to untie her scarf.","Just as she folded the scarf and held it in her arms, she casually lifted her eyes and caught the man staring at her neck.","An Ling was taken aback at first, but then she realized what he was looking at. She forced herself to sit up straight, pretending to be calm, while the tips of her ears quietly flushed red.","She had completely forgotten about this...","She forgot to take it off after trying it on this morning.","Underneath, the girl was wearing a soft, off-white V-neck knit sweater. A blue diamond necklace rested in the hollow of her collarbone, its cold light glinting faintly, which only served to make her collarbone look even more slender and delicate.","Shen Linyan's gaze slowly swept across that inch of skin.","He could barely bring himself to look away. Countless emotions surged in the depths of his dark eyes, only to be forcibly suppressed. His voice was very soft, his tone kept as close to polite courtesy as possible.","\"It suits you very well.\"","An Ling's eyes blanked for a second, and she looked up at him quietly.","A few seconds later, she suddenly nodded solemnly. \"Thank you for the compliment, and thank you for the gift. I will get you a return gift.\"","Shen Linyan froze, his hand instantly tightening around the tickets he was holding.","He lowered his eyes and spoke softly, his voice a bit hoarse. \"There's no need for a return gift... The ring you gave me before is enough.\"","An Ling blinked. After a moment of silence, she spoke slowly, \"It's not the same. That was what I gave to my...\"","\"It is the same.\"","Before she could finish her sentence, her wrist was tightly grasped.","The man's pitch-black eyes stared fixedly at her, the depths of his eyes tinged with red. His voice was hoarse, his breath trembling, carrying an almost pleading tone.","\"It is the same, An Ling...\"","An Ling stared at him, then turned her head and popped a piece of popcorn into her mouth, her voice calm.","\"Let's go home, Shen Linyan.\"","\"I can't continue this date with this version of you.\""]},{"number":121,"title":"Chapter 121: It Was Madam Who Disdained Me First (Word Count Supplemented)","paragraphs":["By the time they returned, the sky had turned completely dark.","Beep.","The door opened, and An Ling walked in to change her shoes.","As she walked, she tried to take off the necklace around her neck.","Seeing her actions as he entered, Shen Linyan's breath hitched, but he froze in place, not daring to say a word.","He stood at the door, gripping the doorknob so tightly that his fingertips turned white.","An Ling walked over to the dining table, took off the necklace, and put it back into its box.","Silence filled the living room.","She looked up at the man standing quietly by the door. After a few seconds of silence, she suddenly spoke, \"Shen Linyan, go sit on the sofa.\"","Shen Linyan's eyelids fluttered slightly before he walked over and sat down on the sofa.","An Ling turned on the TV, put on a random movie, took off her coat, and sat down next to him.","The only sound left in the living room was the voices of the actors on screen.","After an unknown amount of time, the girl's voice suddenly reached his ears.","\"Do you think it's good?\"","Shen Linyan stiffened and gave a very soft, \"Mm. It's good.\"","\"Is it?\"","An Ling's tone was calm. \"As long as you think it's good. Once I finish watching this with you, I'll go to sleep.\"","Shen Linyan paused and turned to look at her.","The girl was leaning against the sofa with an indifferent expression, staring at the TV as if she were accompanying a stranger to watch a boring movie.","Seeming to notice his gaze, she turned to him and said slowly, \"Watching this with you like this, let's just consider it as us having gone out to the movies, okay?\"","Shen Linyan's pupils trembled. He clenched his fingers and opened his mouth slightly, but no sound came out.","An indescribable pain spread from the tip of his heart, tearing it in half.","He reached out and gently touched her fingertips, just about to hook his fingers around hers.","\"Where did my phone go?\" The girl suddenly raised her hand to grab the clothes beside her, quietly pulling her hand away.","Shen Linyan's movements froze, his eyes staring blankly.","The heart that had been suspended in midair finally crashed heavily to the ground, shattering into pieces.","After grabbing her phone, An Ling turned and met the man's gaze.","He looked dazed, as if he hadn't processed what happened.","The two looked at each other in silence.","A few seconds later, she took the initiative to slip her hand into his palm.","The man instantly gripped it tightly, his large palm wrapping around her hand with a slightly trembling force.","After a moment of quiet, the girl suddenly spoke up:","\"Shen Linyan, I don't know how much longer I can keep liking you.\"","An Ling lowered her eyes and said softly, \"I'm sorry... I might not really like your true self, and going out with you isn't fun either. Maybe it's because the Shen Linyan from before would never treat me like this.\"","\"I don't mean for you to change back. Pretending must have been exhausting for you before, so just stay like this from now on. I'm just telling you in advance that I might not be able to give you the same kind of response as before. You might be disappointed, but I still hope you can keep our promise.\"","\"You keep watching. I'm going to take a shower.\"","As soon as she finished speaking, the man grabbed her wrist and pulled her into his arms.","Her cheek pressed against his warm chest, and the familiar scent of his cologne filled her nose, making it feel just like how it used to be.","An Ling was stunned for a moment, her eyes instantly turning red. She struggled to get up, but the man held her waist down. His warm palm pressed firmly against her back, rendering her unable to move.","\"You were the one who disliked me first, Madam,\" his voice was hoarse and strained.","An Ling stopped moving.","Shen Linyan's eyes were dark, hiding an indescribable mix of complex emotions.","He looked at her, his jaw tight, his Adam's apple bobbing. \"Last night, Madam said you didn't want to hear me say those kinds of things anymore.\"","\"?\"","An Ling froze and tried to straighten up, but was immediately pressed back into his embrace. She could only awkwardly shift into a more comfortable position, resting her hands against the man's shoulders.","The corners of her eyes were still red. She studied the man in confusion, her voice muffled with a nasal tone.","\"Shen Linyan, with such poor reading comprehension, how do you even run a business? What I meant was that you don't need to put up a gentle front in front of me. It means you can be yourself, and you don't have to deliberately cater to me or worry about my feelings. When did that turn into me not wanting to hear you speak?\"","The man's fingertips wiped away the tears at the corners of her eyes. He said gently, \"Madam, I don't know exactly what you mean by a gentle front. I can't tell the difference, so I didn't know what words would make you upset.\"","He gently stroked her cheek with his thumb, his voice low and soft.","\"I wanted to wait for you to wake up this morning. Does that count as a gentle front?\"","\"I wanted to give you a gift personally. Does that count as a gentle front?\"","\"I wanted to text you to ask what you were doing. Does that count as a gentle front?\"","\"I want to talk to you more, hold your hand, kiss you, and compliment you. But I can't distinguish what is just a persona, and I don't know which of my actions make you feel like I'm deceiving you.\"","An Ling looked at him with red eyes. After a long while, she pursed her lips, looked away, and said in a muffled voice.","\"I don't know.\"","She said softly, \"Shen Linyan, you want me to trust you, but I had to find out about your true colors through other people. You never tell me anything. I married you, yet I know absolutely nothing about you. How am I supposed to trust you?\"","She gently pushed the man. \"Let go of me, I want to take a shower.\"","Shen Linyan let go and looked at her back. He suddenly spoke up, \"Madam, if I tell you everything right now, will you believe me?\"","An Ling's back stiffened slightly. She turned to look at him but didn't say anything. A few seconds later, she turned back and continued walking toward the bedroom.","Shen Linyan pursed his lips and curled his fingers inward. His long, thick eyelashes drooped, casting a shadow under his eyes.","But the next second, the girl's voice rang in his ears.","\"Turn off the TV. Stop watching that.\"","He looked slightly stunned. Slowly lifting his head, he saw An Ling standing at the bedroom door.","The girl's beautiful black hair cascaded down her back. The corners of her eyes were still slightly red, but her gaze was clear, the lighting tracing the contours of her pretty, delicate face.","Meeting his gaze, she looked away again, opened the door, and walked into the room, muttering softly.","\"It's not good at all, yet you said it was.\"","Only after she entered the room did Shen Linyan snap back to reality. His eyelashes fluttered as he turned off the TV. He picked up the coat she had left on the sofa, draped it over his arm, and stood up. Just as he was about to head back to the room, his eyes caught the gift bag on the dining table.","After a moment of silence, he walked over.","Just as he was about to pick it up, his gaze fell inside, and he suddenly froze.","Reaching out, his long, slender fingers slowly picked up the sticky note.","At the end of the sentence written there, someone had, at some unknown point, drawn a little \"ꐦ≖≖\" symbol.","The man stared blankly for a moment, and then the corners of his lips curved up slightly.","...","Inside the room, An Ling grabbed her pajamas, just about to go take a shower.","Hearing footsteps at the door, she closed the wardrobe and turned to look.","Making eye contact with the man, her gaze dropped to the coat in his hands. She pursed her lips. \"Thank you for bringing that in for me.\"","Taking the coat, she pulled her phone out of the pocket. An Ling turned and walked to the bedside table to plug her phone in to charge.","But that burning gaze still hadn't disappeared.","She paused and looked up, unsurprisingly meeting the man's eyes.","His gaze was scorching, his dark eyes staring fixedly at her. He looked as if he wanted to approach her but was restraining himself from stepping forward.","\"?\"","Why did Shen Linyan keep staring at her?","Could it be because of the movie?","After a moment of silence, she spoke, \"We didn't finish the movie tonight, so it doesn't count. Next time, I'll go to the cinema with you.\"","Shen Linyan looked slightly stunned.","Ripples of emotion stirred in his eyes. His tense lips curved up slightly as he gave a gentle nod. \"Okay.\"","When Shen Linyan came out of the shower, An Ling was sitting on the bed playing with her phone.","Once he got into bed, she put down her phone, lay down, pulled up the covers, and looked at him. \"Are we going to sleep?\"","Shen Linyan paused at her words and looked down at the girl under the covers.","Under the light, her features were beautiful and delicate. She blinked at him as if she had been waiting specifically for him. Her watery eyes were almost irresistible.","Shen Linyan stared blankly for a moment, instinctively reaching out to touch her face.","As soon as he made the move, both of them froze.","An action they were once so used to suddenly felt unusually intimate in this moment.","His movements were a bit stiff. Pretending to be natural, he withdrew his hand and turned around. \"Alright, I'll turn off the light.\"","With a click, the room plunged into darkness.","The faint bedside lamp illuminated a small corner. In the quiet room, there was only the rustling sound of the covers rubbing together.","An Ling lay in bed, sleepiness just beginning to wash over her.","Right then, a warm hand suddenly touched her waist. As if possessed by some magic, a jolt of electricity instantly spread through her entire body.","Her drowsiness instantly vanished. An Ling's body stiffened, and she opened her eyes in the dark.","Perhaps sensing the change in her body, the man also stopped moving.","In the pitch-black environment, the two of them remained frozen without moving. Their breathing was exceptionally clear in the silent night.","Heavy and slow, wrapped in a hidden, lingering affection, it beat against both of their hearts, stroke by stroke.","In the end, An Ling said nothing.","She closed her eyes again and pretended to turn over unconsciously in her sleep.","Shen Linyan immediately pulled her into his arms. With gentle movements, he lowered his head and slowly kissed her cheek, then kissed the tip of her nose. The light, scattered kisses were full of love.","The crisp, cool woody scent on the man was warmed by his body heat, carrying a reassuring fragrance that slowly drifted into her nose.","An Ling slowly opened her eyes in the dark. She lowered her gaze, pursed her lips, and her fingertips slowly gripped the corner of his shirt.","In the morning, the ringing of the alarm clock broke the silence.","\"Hmm?\" An Ling woke up in a daze. With sleep-filled eyes, she was just about to turn and turn off the alarm when, the next second, a sudden force on her waist pulled her back.","\"It is okay, wife, it is my alarm.\" The man's voice was deep, carrying the magnetic laziness of the early morning.","An Ling nodded instinctively and went back to sleep.","The spot next to her shifted slightly as someone lifted the covers and got out of bed.","The sounds were intermittent. After an unknown amount of time, her consciousness returned slightly, and she heard someone approaching.","Then, the hair on her forehead was brushed aside, and someone gently kissed her forehead and cheek.","The footsteps gradually faded away, and the sound of a door closing echoed. Her sleepiness slowly dissipated. An Ling's eyelashes fluttered, and she slowly opened her eyes.","Covering her forehead, her face flushed slightly red. She lay in bed in a daze for a while before sluggishly sitting up.","She threw off the covers, got out of bed, and noticed a bag on the dressing table.","It was still on the dining table last night. Did Shen Linyan bring it in?","An Ling did not pay much attention to it. She glanced at it casually and was about to go wash up when she caught sight of a sticky note on the bag from the corner of her eye.","It seemed to be the same one from yesterday...","But she remembered the sticky note was inside...","As if realizing something, An Ling's footsteps came to an abrupt halt, her eyes widening slightly.","Could Shen Linyan have seen what she drew yesterday?","Her face turned slightly red. She changed direction, walked over, and took off the sticky note.","Looking down, her expression instantly froze when she saw the contents clearly.","Right next to the \"ꐦ≖≖\" emoticon she had drawn, there was an entirely new one: \"つ♡⊂\".","An Ling stood there pinching the note. Only after a moment did she put it down.","Her gaze wandered. She touched her burning cheeks with the back of her hand and muttered softly, \"Where did he learn to draw that?\"","She took another look, then blushing, placed the sticky note back where it was.","...","In the evening, after finishing her overtime work, An Ling planned to go straight home, take a shower, and get a good night's sleep.","Just as she got into the car, Shen Fuyuan suddenly called her.","As soon as she answered, Shen Fuyuan's boisterous voice came through the line.","\"Sister-in-law! Where is Huihui?! Hurry up and have Huihui call me!!\"","An Ling: \"...\"","She looked bewildered. \"What are you talking about? Have you been drinking?\"","\"Hahaha! I haven't been drinking! I want to chat with Huihui!\" Shen Fuyuan's voice was crisp and bright. \"Huihui, let Auntie give you a kiss.\"","Hearing the noisy background music on the other end, An Ling frowned. \"Are you at a bar? Are you alone?\"","\"Hic... yeah, I am alone, hehehe. Sister-in-law, if you bring Huihui over, I won't be alone anymore!\"","\"...\"","An Ling rubbed her temples. \"Where is your manager?\"","\"I don't know! They didn't come!\"","An Ling's tone was filled with disbelief. \"You got this drunk all by yourself?!\"","Is this girl crazy? What if she gets photographed?","Shen Fuyuan chuckled. \"What is wrong?\"","\"...\"","Great, as the on-site producer, she even had to provide after-sales service.","An Ling coaxed and tricked her, \"Give me the address and the private room number, and I will bring Huihui to you.\"","After getting the address, An Ling rushed to the bar. Just as she was about to get out of the car, she paused, grabbed a mask, and stuffed it into her pocket.","She did not know if Shen Fuyuan was wearing a mask and hat. It would be trouble if she got recognized.","She put on a mask herself, pulled down her hat, and opened the car door to step out.","The bar was at its busiest at this hour, filled with all sorts of people. An Ling searched for the private room number. When she reached the door of one of the rooms and confirmed the number, she pushed it open.","The pungent smell of alcohol instantly hit her face.","Sure enough, she saw a drunk Shen Fuyuan inside.","The girl was sprawled on the sofa, her red hair in a mess and her face flushed red. Her hat had fallen to the floor. She was hugging a wine bottle and muttering to herself, while the bottles on the table were scattered everywhere.","Shen Fuyuan was truly the only one there.","An Ling stood at the door and frowned. She walked over, picked up the hat from the floor, placed it on Shen Fuyuan's head, crouched down, and patted her. \"Shen Fuyuan, are you still awake?\"","Hearing this, the girl opened her eyes, looking confused and dazed.","She squinted at the woman wearing a mask and hat in front of her. Realizing she did not recognize her, she waved her hand grandly and slurred, \"Who are you!? How dare you touch me? Do you know who I am??!\"","An Ling: \"...\"","What a sin.","She expressionlessly pulled down her mask to let her take a look. \"I am An Ling.\"","Shen Fuyuan blinked with effort. It took her a long while to suddenly realize, \"Oh! It really is my sister-in-law!\"","\"Yes, it is me.\"","An Ling took out a mask and tried to put it on her. \"Do you have any other friends here? If not, we are leaving.\"","Shen Fuyuan started throwing a tantrum again, refusing to wear the mask. \"I won't wear it! It is uncomfortable! It is stuffy!\"","\"...\"","An Ling patiently repeated herself, \"You don't have any other friends here, right? Then we are leaving right now.\"","\"Friends?\" Shen Fuyuan thought for a moment, frowning as if struggling to remember. \"I think there is one.\"","An Ling paused her movements. \"What?\"","The next second, Shen Fuyuan collapsed onto her, continuously muttering about how sleepy she was.","An Ling had no other choice. She slipped a face mask on her and was just about to go find a waiter to help carry her out.","Suddenly, footsteps echoed behind her. The door to the private room was pushed open, and two men in suits strode in. Without a single word, they grabbed the dead-drunk Shen Fuyuan and hauled her away.","An Ling was completely stunned.","Were they actually kidnapping someone in broad daylight?","Snapping out of her daze, she instinctively reached out to block their path. \"Wait a minute, who are you? You can't just take her away!\"","The two suited men exchanged a glance before one of them spoke up, \"Are you Miss Shen's manager? Then please come with us.\"","\"Huh?\"","Utterly baffled, An Ling followed the two men out of the private room.","Sensing that something was off, she pulled out her phone, intending to secretly send a message to Shen Linyan.","Just then, she heard the voice of the suited man ahead of her.","\"Chairman Shen, Miss Shen's manager is here as well.\"","An Ling: ?"]},{"number":122,"title":"Chapter 122: Acting is My Profession (Word Count Adjusted)","paragraphs":["An Ling had just taken out her phone when she suddenly heard this sentence. Her typing came to a halt.","She lifted her head slightly.","The brim of her baseball cap obscured most of her vision, but she could see the man dressed in an expensive, custom-made dark suit.","His arms hung by his sides, just revealing a luxury watch on his wrist. Between his long, slender fingers with well-defined knuckles, he held a cigarette. Smoke swirled around him, and the silver ring on his ring finger made him look both noble and elegant.","An Ling's eyelids twitched.","Wait a minute...?","The next second, a familiar, deep voice rang out.","\"Are you Shen Fuyuan's manager?\"","The man's voice was flat, his speaking pace unhurried. It was a tone she had never heard him use before.","An Ling froze, slowly tilting her head up to look.","Under the night sky, the man stood beside a luxury car. The stray hairs on his forehead were meticulously styled. He had deep-set features, a high bridge of the nose, and thin lips. His brow and eyes exuded a cool nobility, and his pitch-black eyes held very little emotion.","This handsome, outstanding face unmistakably belonged to her husband.","She blinked. Just as she was about to speak, a woman's voice abruptly interrupted.","\"Big Brother, since the manager is here, let the manager take Shen Fuyuan back. I happen to have something I want to talk to you about.\"","An Ling's expression paused slightly. She turned to look at the woman speaking, her gaze lingering on the other's face for a fraction of a second.","Zhou Wen?","It seemed that only Zhou Wen would call Shen Linyan \"Big Brother.\"","She pulled up her mask. Before she could speak, she heard Shen Linyan say, \"Take Shen Fuyuan back.\"","An Ling was momentarily stunned and stood rooted to the spot.","Whether he noticed her gaze or just hadn't heard a reply, the man suddenly glanced over.","An Ling instinctively lowered her head, using the brim of her hat to dodge his eyes.","Without drawing attention, she slipped off her wedding ring, stuffed it into her pocket, and softly replied, \"Okay.\"","At this moment, Shen Fuyuan, who was beside them, slowly opened her eyes.","Her head was splitting, and she frowned in discomfort.","Realizing she was being held up by people, her eyes instantly widened, and she began to struggle. \"Damn it, who are you guys?! Let me go!\"","\"Shen Fuyuan.\"","The man's faint three syllables instantly sobered Shen Fuyuan up.","She stared in astonishment and stammered, \"...B-Big Brother? Why are you here? Where is Sister-in-law?\"","Shen Linyan paused, put out his cigarette, and frowned. \"You expect your sister-in-law to pick you up when you're drunk?\"","\"No.\"","Remembering what had just happened in the private room, Shen Fuyuan instinctively turned her head to look around. \"Did Sister-in-law leave? Wasn't she going to bring Huihui...\"","When she met the calm, almond-shaped eyes under the brim of the girl's hat next to her, Shen Fuyuan's voice abruptly stopped.","An Ling stepped forward and said to the two bodyguards, \"I'll support her. She is quite sensitive to pain, so you can let go now. I'll take her back.\"","The two men instantly let go.","Shen Fuyuan pretended to have a headache and leaned against her, secretly shooting her a look: Big Brother didn't recognize you?","An Ling closed her eyes and gave an imperceptible nod: Yes.","Shen Fuyuan: \"...\"","An Ling patted her back and whispered, \"Stall for a bit.\"","Shen Fuyuan instantly understood.","When it came to acting, she was a professional.","She closed her eyes, opened her mouth, and unleashed the acting skills of a lifetime, playing the drunk to the extreme.","\"Ah, I feel so sick, I want to throw up. I don't want to get in the car. I'm not leaving.\"","Saying that, she crouched on the ground, pulling at her mask as if she were about to vomit.","An Ling crouched down to pat her back and soothe her, then looked up at the bodyguard nearby. \"Could you help buy a bottle of water?\"","The bodyguard froze and hesitantly looked at his boss.","Shen Linyan glanced at Shen Fuyuan on the ground and nodded in agreement.","When the water was brought over, Shen Fuyuan braced herself and slowly sipped it under the gaze of several pairs of eyes.","Shen Linyan looked down at the time and placed his hand on the car door.","Seeing this, Zhou Wen hurriedly spoke up, \"Big Brother, are you leaving already? We haven't seen each other for so long, shouldn't we chat for a bit?\"","Hearing this, the man glanced at her, then withdrew his gaze and continued to open the car door.","Zhou Wen gritted her teeth and took a step forward, raising her hand to grab the car door. She kept her tone as soft and pitiful as possible. \"Big Brother, then I'll just say it straight. You know I just got divorced and have been out of touch with society for too long. It's hard to find a job right now. I just wanted to ask... can I go back to being your assistant? Like before, as your lifestyle assistant.\"","As soon as the words were spoken, the few people on the scene instantly fell silent.","Shen Fuyuan, who was crouching on the ground, carefully lifted her eyes and secretly peeked at An Ling.","No emotion could be seen on the girl's face.","Shen Linyan's movements stopped.","He glanced at Zhou Wen. \"I don't need one.\"","\"Is it that you don't need one, or is it that An Ling won't allow it?\"","Zhou Wen furrowed her brows. \"Big Brother, you weren't like this before. In the past, whenever I needed help, you would always come to help me. I did a great job when I was your assistant before, and I never caused any trouble...\"","Shen Linyan raised a hand to stop her, casually turned his head, and looked at Secretary Chen beside him.","Secretary Chen instantly understood.","He cleared his throat and spoke fluently in one breath.","\"Miss Zhou, from the time you joined the company until you left, you entered the wrong numbers on reports three times, causing massive financial losses. You scheduled two important meetings at the same time twice, causing chaotic situations. You missed sending out emergency instructions three times, leading to delays in work progress. You once accidentally sent a proposal email to an unrelated group, nearly leaking trade secrets, and even when making coffee for clients on several occasions, you almost spilled it on them.\"","Zhou Wen: \"...\"","As Secretary Chen's voice fell, a very soft sound of stifled laughter came from the side.","Zhou Wen's face looked awful as she turned to glare at the two people nearby. \"What are you laughing at?!\"","After saying that, she suddenly remembered her persona and hurriedly restored her original expression, forcing a smile as she looked at Shen Linyan.","\"No, Big Brother, I was just starting out back then and wasn't very skilled. I will definitely get better and better, and besides, you helped me handle all those things before...\"","\"If I didn't help you, you wouldn't have been able to marry into the Shen family.\"","Shen Linyan let out a chuckle and interrupted her. He looked down and slowly adjusted his sleeves, his tone unhurried. \"You were so stupid, I was afraid Lu Jingshen wouldn't like you anymore.\"","Caught off guard by this sentence, Zhou Wen's face froze. \"...What do you mean?\"","Shen Linyan's tone was indifferent: \"Zhou Wen, I heard you went looking for An Ling several times, and it seems you were the one who posted certain remarks online.\"","Zhou Wen's face stiffened. She saw the man slowly lift his eyes. Those pitch-black eyes that usually held a hint of a smile were completely devoid of emotion right now. Every word he spoke was wrapped in an oppressive and alienating aura that warned strangers to stay away.","\"If I catch you looking for An Ling again, I will make your life even worse than it was before.\"","Zhou Wen's face suddenly turned pale.","She looked at the man in front of her, her eyes full of shock and fear, her lips slightly parted but unable to speak.","Noticing the gazes cast upon her from around, her face flushed with embarrassment, and she turned away, her retreating figure looking rather pathetic.","Once the woman left, Shen Linyan looked down at his phone. Seeing no new messages, his gaze paused slightly, and his fingertips began typing on the screen.","An Ling felt the phone in her pocket vibrate. She took it out and saw the message Shen Linyan had just sent her.","Shen Linyan: [Has my wife eaten dinner yet?]","At the same time, the man's indifferent voice came from behind.","\"Shen Fuyuan, have you seen enough?\"","Shen Fuyuan, who was pretending to drink water: \"...\"","She coughed a few times, trying to pretend to be drunk to gloss over it. \"My head hurts so...\"","When she met the man's emotionless eyes, her voice trailed off. Looking guilty, she turned her face away.","\"I didn't mean to. Zhou Wen said she had something to talk to me about. As we drank, I accidentally had too much. I didn't know she used my phone to contact you...\"","After reading the message, An Ling put her phone away and turned to look at the man.","Sensing her gaze, Shen Linyan glanced over.","But when he met the girl's eyes under the brim of her hat, his originally indifferent gaze suddenly froze, his expression turning blank.","\"...Wife?\"","Seeing that she had been discovered, An Ling took off her mask.","\"You go back first. I'll take Shen Fuyuan home.\"","\"I'll have someone else take her back...\" Shen Linyan took a few steps forward, wanting to reach out and hold her.","But when the girl looked up, his movements instantly stopped.","Shen Linyan pursed his lips. Then, he looked up and cast an unreadable glance at Shen Fuyuan.","Shen Fuyuan: \"!\"","Fuck, fuck, fuck! Fine, fine, fine! She was the soft target here!","She blurted out, \"Sister-in-law, there's no need! I'll drive myself back... Bah! Let someone else take me back!\"","Saying that, she laughed out loud and patted the two bodyguards beside her. \"With you two big bros protecting me, I feel so incredibly safe.\"","An Ling: \"...\"","She looked at the man beside her and ultimately said nothing, just giving a soft \"Mm\" and \"Okay.\"","After sending Shen Fuyuan back, An Ling and Shen Linyan returned home.","From beginning to end, the expression on the girl's face didn't change much, looking exactly as usual, yet she was much quieter than before.","Shen Linyan followed behind her, his fingertips curling slightly.","It wasn't until they entered the door that he asked softly, \"Have you eaten dinner, wife?\"","An Ling turned to look at him and blinked.","She took off her hat and tidied her hair. \"I ate at the company.\"","Then she turned and walked into the bedroom. \"I'm going to take a shower first.\"","She didn't mention a single word about what had just happened at the bar, as if deliberately avoiding it.","Shen Linyan stood frozen in place. Lowering his eyes, he walked over to the sofa and sat down.","An Ling returned to the bedroom. There was a gift bag on the dressing table, with the sticky note from this morning still attached to it.","Her footsteps paused slightly. She picked up the sticky note, stayed silent for a moment, and put the bag aside.","After coming out of the shower, she picked up her phone from the table and found that Shen Fuyuan had sent her some messages.","Shen Fuyuan: [Will my older brother silence me?!]","Shen Fuyuan: [Ahhhh I'm doomed, I'm doomed. Sister-in-law, please put in a good word for me! If I die, your show won't be able to air!]","An Ling found it a bit funny: [If you die, our show will become your final work. The ratings would probably skyrocket.]","Shen Fuyuan: [...? How can you profit off my tragedy?]","An Ling: [Don't worry, you won't die.]","She put down her phone and sat on the bed, hearing the bedroom door open.","After the two exchanged a glance, An Ling spoke, \"Go take your shower.\"","Shen Linyan nodded and turned to the wardrobe to grab his clothes.","When he came out of the bathroom again, the girl was already lying in bed.","Shen Linyan's footsteps halted. He stood quietly watching her for a moment before turning off the lights and lying down as well.","This time, the bedroom was even quieter than usual.","Shen Linyan closed his eyes. He didn't dare to embrace his wife in front of him; he didn't even dare to touch her with his fingertips.","He was terrified of the outcome—","That An Ling would reject him out of fear.","The fear of seeing his true colors, a fear that couldn't be changed.","If An Ling had previously only been afraid that he might make a move against the An family, or that he might have been lying to her all along, those were all unknown variables that could be changed.","But what happened today was something he had personally admitted to doing. If An Ling was afraid of this...","He couldn't even defend himself.","He could no longer change his image in his wife's heart.","\"Honey, please don't be afraid of me, okay?\" The man's voice was hoarse, a slight tremble hidden at the end of his words.","Hearing this, An Ling's back stiffened slightly.","She opened her eyes, remained silent for a few seconds, and then slowly closed them again.","\"Did you always smoke?\" she suddenly asked.","Hearing this question, Shen Linyan was slightly taken aback. He opened his eyes and gave a soft \"Mm.\" \"But I rarely smoke. Only occasionally.\"","An Ling turned around, the fabric of her clothes rustling—a sound that felt somewhat intimate in the dim room. She said softly, \"Don't smoke next time.\"","Shen Linyan pulled her into his arms. Lowering his head, his nose brushed against her face. \"Okay.\"","His scalding body temperature transferred through the thin layer of fabric. His thin lips gently brushed against the corner of her mouth. \"Honey, can I kiss you?\"","His burning breath fell on her skin, wrapped in a warm scent of cedar, sending a tingling shiver through her.","An Ling's eyelashes fluttered slightly as she pursed her lips.","Counting the days, they had rarely been intimate before due to work, and coupled with the conflicts over the past few days, it really had been a long time since they had such close contact.","She gripped the hem of the man's shirt and gave a tiny, subtle nod.","The next second, her lips were gently captured. The man parted his lips and sucked softly, time and time again, cherishing and adoring her. Then he rained dense kisses upon her, his eager movements laced with gentle restraint.","The wet, passionate atmosphere spread throughout the confined space.","\"Honey.\" Shen Linyan's Adam's apple bobbed agonizingly. He cupped her face. Her soft lips gave off a sweet fragrance, and the moment he kissed and tasted her, a rush of pleasure shot straight to his head, making him unable to hold back a sigh.","Their breathing had long since grown ragged. The newlywed couple had already experienced the ultimate depths of love; a tiny bit of friction sparked an electric fire like dry wood meeting a blazing flame.","The simple kiss had long since evolved, and the air instantly combusted.","Their tongues intertwined, exchanging saliva too fast to swallow. Under the cover of night, heavy panting mingled with the intimate sounds of wetness.","Like the rising tide, it washed over the dry beach again and again.","The blanket bulged high, the woman's soft moans rising and falling from time to time, while the man's hoarse coaxing echoed in her ears.","Clatter—","The nightstand drawer was pulled open. The man's arm was strong and sexy, with a few veins slightly bulging, as his well-defined fingers grabbed a few foil packets.","Under the light, the ring on the man's ring finger gleamed with a crystalline sheen.","Outside the window, the night grew thicker, while the temperature inside the room soared.","In this moment, all suspicions were temporarily cast aside, leaving only the deepest love driving their primal instincts.","...","The next day.","An Ling sat at her desk, her entire body aching. She massaged her waist and legs, thinking that if she could travel back to yesterday, she would definitely reject Shen Linyan.","The phone on her desk lit up.","Shen Linyan: [Is my wife still feeling uncomfortable?]","An Ling: [(⩌-⩌)]","Shen Linyan: [(⑉••⑉) Shall we have dinner together tonight?]","An Ling: [I'm going back to my parents' place tonight.]","Looking at the chat history, An Ling's gaze landed on the emoticon the man had sent, looking thoughtful.","\"What a huge contrast...\"","For such a cold person to use this kind of emoticon made it really hard to associate him with the Shen Linyan from the bar.","An Ling: [Is sending these emoticons also part of your disguise?]","Shen Linyan: [I learned it from you, wife.]","Shen Linyan: [つ♡⊂ This way, you won't be afraid of me.]"]},{"number":123,"title":"Chapter 123: Still Not Awake [Word Count Replenished]","paragraphs":["In the evening, An Zhou returned home.","Just as he walked through the door, he loosened his tie, but his footsteps instantly halted when he saw An Ling in the living room.","His gaze fell on a few neatly arranged suitcases, then slowly shifted to An Ling.","An Ling was eating fruit. Noticing his gaze, she shot him a puzzled look. Before she could speak, she heard the man hesitantly ask:","\"Did you... get divorced again?\"","An Ling: \"??\"","Before An Ling could answer, Mother An, who was beside her, said, \"An Zhou, what kind of thing is that to say? Why are you cursing your sister to get a divorce?\"","An Zhou pointed at the suitcases. \"Doesn't this mean she's moving back?\"","The last time this girl came back with a suitcase, the first thing out of her mouth was that she had gotten a divorce.","After what happened a few days ago, this girl hadn't sent him a single message. He thought she was quietly pulling off something huge again.","An Ling calmly put down the fork in her hand. \"These aren't my suitcases.\"","An Zhou: \"Then whose are they?\"","Mother An answered from the side, \"They belong to your dad and me. We're going traveling.\"","An Zhou: ?","\"Ah?\" An Zhou rubbed the bridge of his nose. \"Going traveling? When did this happen? Why didn't I know?\"","\"We just decided today. Seeing that you were too busy, your mom and I didn't bother you. It's not a big deal anyway, we're just going for a few days.\"","Hearing Father An's words, Mother An nodded in agreement.","An Zhou: \"...\"","Now he knew who this girl An Ling inherited her incredibly strong execution skills from.","But then again...","An Zhou glanced at An Ling.","What exactly was the situation between An Ling and Shen Linyan now?","Sitting on the sofa, An Zhou sent her a message.","[Let's talk upstairs.]","Feeling her phone vibrate, An Ling looked down at the message, then looked up at An Zhou.","An Zhou signaled her with a look to go upstairs.","Then he pretended to naturally walk up the stairs, even secretly waving at her halfway up.","An Ling: \"...\"","She stood up helplessly and followed An Zhou upstairs.","Father An glanced at them.","\"What are these two kids doing? Sneaking around like that.\"","Mother An was looking down at a tourist attraction guide. \"I don't know, probably whispering secrets.\"","They went upstairs and entered the room.","As soon as the door closed, An Zhou turned and asked, \"Did things break down between you and Shen Linyan, or not? Did that man confess?\"","An Ling paused, then shook her head. \"We didn't fight, and we don't plan on getting a divorce. We're just going to live like this for now.\"","An Zhou frowned: \"Did he threaten you?\"","Without waiting for An Ling's answer, he continued, \"It's fine. If you really want a divorce, then get one. You know there's no need to be afraid if Shen Linyan threatens you, right? As long as you don't cause trouble, the An family won't be easily brought down by him.\"","An Ling choked on her words. Sitting on the sofa, she blinked, \"Really? Even if I get a divorce, it won't do much harm to the An family?\"","An Zhou, who suddenly remembered he had accepted a lot of \"project bribes\": \"...\"","He quickly changed his tune, \"Actually, not getting a divorce is fine too... An Ling, if you ask me, just treat it as a new arranged marriage. Mutual respect, you know? Besides, I feel like Shen Linyan might not necessarily make a move against the An family. That kid is actually quite good to you.\"","An Ling: \"?\"","Why did her brother have two faces?","\"Did Shen Linyan give you some benefits??\"","An Zhou: \"Hahahaha! What a joke, what do you mean benefits? For businessmen, it's called cooperation!\"","\"...\"","Sure enough.","An Ling stared at him for a moment, then stood up with a smile. \"Alright then. For the sake of the An family, it seems I really can't get a divorce.\"","An Zhou's tone turned serious. \"Of course not. If that kid Shen Linyan treats you badly, you definitely have to divorce him.\"","An Ling smiled and said, \"Got it. So, brother, when are you and Sister Qin You getting married? I heard from Mom that you two have been getting along quite well lately.\"","\"...\"","An Zhou coughed lightly, his gaze shifting unsteadily. \"Not really, just so-so.\"","Seeing him like this, An Ling raised an eyebrow.","Oh ho, it was actually true.","She checked the time.","\"Alright, it's about time to take Mom and Dad to the airport.\"","After dropping off Father and Mother An at the airport, An Ling also went home.","Shen Linyan had something come up unexpectedly tonight, so when she got back, no one was home yet.","She put down her bag and took out her phone, seeing a message from Jiang Mai.","[I'm never online dating again!]","She paused and replied: [What happened?]","Jiang Mai instantly sent a barrage of complaints.","[I met up with him for dinner tonight, and he looks completely different from his photos!! So ugly!! It's a total scam!]","As if finding typing too troublesome, the other side directly sent a 34-second voice message.","An Ling laughed out loud. She tapped on the voice message to listen to her rants, walked over to the windowsill, crouched down, and pet Huihui. She fed it some snacks, then opened her bedroom door, walked in, and replied:","[Hahaha, will there be a next time for online dating, Miss Jiang?]","Jiang Mai: [There won't be a next time. My heart is dead. I'm never opening mystery boxes again.]","An Ling comforted her with a few words, placed her phone on the bedside table, and took her pajamas into the bathroom.","After coming out of the shower, she sat on the bed, opened her laptop, and finished up some pending documents.","Recently, Ms. Chen had taken on a movie, so they needed to start drawing up plans again.","Once she had roughly sorted things out, she rubbed her somewhat tired eyes and checked the time again.","9:10 PM.","It wasn't too late, but probably due to a lack of sleep last night, she was already feeling a bit drowsy.","Sure enough, she really shouldn't mess around with Shen Linyan on workdays.","An Ling shut down her laptop and placed it on the desk. She turned off the main light, leaving only the dim nightlight by the bed.","Originally, she just planned to take a short nap. An Ling was even thinking about whether she should text Shen Linyan to tell him she was going to sleep first.","But after closing her eyes, these stray thoughts gradually faded away with her consciousness, and sleepiness washed over her like a tide.","It wasn't until she woke up again from her dreams that An Ling groggily opened her eyes. The room was still dark and quiet.","Unable to tell the time or how long she had slept, she was still bleary-eyed. Just as she reached out to grab her phone, she felt an arm wrap around her waist. Her back was pressed tightly against a warm, firm chest, making her feel as if she were enveloped by a heater.","She paused her movements and slightly turned her head.","Under the light, the man's features were handsome and refined. His eyes were closed, his breathing steady, and his handsome face was pressed against the crook of her neck. His dark hair fell casually over his forehead. He had lost some of his usual aloofness, replaced by a touch of softness. His warm breath gently brushed against the back of her neck.","Looking at the man's sleeping face, An Ling blinked. She reached out and gently touched the hair falling over his eyes.","He didn't wake up?","The dim light shone on the man's handsome face. His gentle and refined appearance exuded a noble aura of excellent upbringing.","An Ling stared for quite a while. Holding her head turned like that was a bit tiring, so she slowly turned her body around, her forehead ending up pressed right against the man's thin lips.","This movement made it seem as if she had completely melted into the man's embrace, and it also slightly roused him.","Shen Linyan, with his eyes still closed, lowered his head and kissed her forehead. He pulled her back into his arms with a familiarity that suggested he had done it thousands of times.","An Ling looked up at him. Only after confirming that the man was truly still asleep did she slowly raise her hand. Her fingertips gently traced the air, tracing the man's three-dimensional features from a distance—from his eyebrows to his eyes, then to his straight nose, and finally down to his lips.","Little by little, as if trying to brand it deeply into her eyes.","Rather than being afraid of Shen Linyan's personality...","In reality, she was more afraid of Shen Linyan having a change of heart.","Because she could only recognize Shen Linyan's face, she worried even more that one day, this familiar face would show an unfamiliar, cold expression towards her.","If it were anyone else, she would forget them after a single glance, and she wouldn't even need to pretend not to know them when walking down the street.","But Shen Linyan was different...","An Ling lowered her hand and tilted her head up to gently kiss the man's chin, brushing against him lightly like an affectionate little animal.","The touch of her soft lips was fleeting.","Yet it left behind a faint, lingering tickle.","The man slowly opened his eyes, still clouded with sleep. Meeting his little wife's dark, clear eyes, he subconsciously pulled her closer into his arms and lowered his head to kiss her eyes.","\"You're awake, honey.\" His voice was very light, rumbling from his throat with a husky, magnetic quality that was incredibly sexy and alluring.","An Ling closed her eyes under his kisses, her voice thick and soft with sleep. \"Shen Linyan...\"","Shen Linyan paused, his sleepiness fading. \"Hmm?\"","\"Can't sleep?\" He raised a hand to caress her face, his fingertips tangling in her hair before gently pinching her earlobe.","With her eyes closed, An Ling spoke slowly:","\"Find some free time, and let's go watch a movie.\"","Shen Linyan's movements stilled. He lowered his head, rubbing his nose against her cheek, and kissed her lips with lingering breath. \"Really?\"","An Ling nodded.","Then, she felt a kiss on her cheek.","\"Okay.\" The man's voice carried a husky smile.","...","An Ling had always known that Shen Linyan wasn't poor.","But she had never truly realized just how wealthy he was.","Until she found out—","The blue diamond necklace he had given her was worth six hundred million.","An Ling was dumbfounded.","She looked up blankly, pointing at the gift bag on the table.","\"That little thing... is worth six hundred million??\"","Shen Linyan lowered his eyes as he fastened the necklace around her neck, chuckling softly at her words. \"Yes, Madam.\"","\"...\" When they initially divorced, she had ONLY! GOTTEN! TWO! HUNDRED! MILLION!","Sitting in the chair, it took An Ling a long while before she could dryly say:","\"Shen Linyan, while I do really like this necklace, I'll allow you to go buy a six-yuan knockoff and just transfer the six hundred million to me instead.\"","Low chuckles rumbled from the man's chest. He bent down and kissed the tip of her ear. \"I'll give you all my money, and then wait for Madam to be my sugar daddy.\"","An Ling touched her ear, shot him a sideways glance, and gave a soft hmph without saying a word.","Just as she stood up to leave for work, her wrist was suddenly caught.","As soon as she turned her head, she met the man's pitch-black eyes.","He gazed at her, his voice light and his tone gentle.","\"Madam, may I have a kiss?\"","An Ling blinked and nodded. \"You may.\"","The next second, the man held her chin and leaned in to kiss her.","A crisp, clean scent washed over her. He took her lips, sucking gently, and only released her after a while, lowering his head to nuzzle against her cheek.","...","After taking on the new project, everyone threw themselves back into a busy routine.","An Ling gathered her documents and stood up to head to a meeting with a few colleagues. On the way to the conference room, everyone was discussing how the damn weather was getting colder and colder.","\"I can't even get up in the mornings.\"","\"This kind of weather is only good for sleeping at home.\"","An Ling nodded in deep agreement. She couldn't get up this morning either; it was Shen Linyan who had fished her out from under the covers.","Another colleague sighed, \"But it's snowing really late this year. Normally, we'd have heavy snow by this time, but the first snow hasn't even arrived yet.\"","\"Tell me about it.\" The colleague opened the weather forecast. \"The forecast doesn't mention it either.\"","Xiao Yang stood beside them, pressing her hands together. \"I'm still waiting for the first snow so I can go on a date with my boyfriend.\"","Hearing this, An Ling turned her head and asked curiously, \"A date on that day? Does it have some special meaning?\"","\"There's a saying,\" Xiao Yang replied, \"that any wish you make during the first snow will come true.\"","An Ling realized. \"I see. That's quite romantic.\"","Xiao Yang suddenly wiggled her eyebrows suggestively. \"So, is Sister Aleng going to go on a date with Chairman Shen?\"","As soon as the words were out, teasing cheers erupted all around.","\"Ooh~ At the last gathering, a certain comrade was the first to be taken home by her family member.\"","An Ling's face instantly flushed red, and she stiffly changed the subject. \"We're going to be late for the meeting, let's hurry up.\"","She walked briskly ahead, trying to shake off the teasing behind her.","After the meeting ended and tasks were assigned, she was paired up with Nan Zhechuan again. They needed to go out for a site visit.","The two of them stood in the elevator. An Ling was still searching for the site's address when a breaking news headline suddenly popped up.","[Shen Group Exposed for Tax Evasion, Amount Involved Exceeds 100 Million; Relevant Personnel Under Investigation.]","She didn't react at first, thinking she had misread it.","When she clicked on it and saw that it was indeed the Shen Group, An Ling froze in place.","Nan Zhechuan, standing next to her, also saw the news and let out an exclamation. \"Holy crap, is this for real? Such a massive company actually evading taxes? This is no joke, someone's going to prison.\"","For it to be exposed now meant that the investigation and evidence collection were already complete.","An Ling wanted to message Shen Linyan but suddenly remembered that he had come home quite late last night.","Was it because of this?","\"Ding—\"","The elevator doors opened, and An Ling walked out absentmindedly.","For an enterprise as large as the Shen Group, generally speaking, they wouldn't ruin all their hard work over this amount of money. Moreover, Father and Mother Shen treated the Shen Group as their very lives, making it even more impossible. Unless...","Unless someone was deliberately pulling strings behind the scenes.","An Ling's footsteps paused slightly. She lowered her eyes, pursed her lips, and put her phone down.","Beside her, Nan Zhechuan continued, \"With this news out, the Shen Group is finished.\"","Even if they paid the taxes in time, after a scandal like this, the Shen Group and anyone from the Shen family involved in the company's projects would inevitably be investigated. In severe cases, they might even face criminal charges.","They walked to the entrance, and Nan Zhechuan said, \"I'll go get the car first. Wait for me here for a bit.\"","An Ling nodded. She stood at the door, eyes downcast, deep in thought.","Her phone suddenly vibrated. It was a message from Shen Linyan.","Shen Linyan: [Madam, I will be home a little late tonight.]","An Ling: [Okay.]","After sending the message, the status bar on his end showed \"typing...\" for a long time, but no message came through.","After about a minute, a message slowly appeared from him.","Shen Linyan: [つ♡⊂]","An Ling paused, realizing what he was worried about, and couldn't stop the corners of her lips from turning up.","An Ling: [૮(♡♡)ა]","Shen Linyan: [つ♡♡♡⊂]","Seeing this message, An Ling was momentarily stunned before she let out a soft laugh.","Shen Linyan was now even better at using kaomoji than she was.","Just then, a sudden gasp swept through the crowd around her.","An Ling subconsciously looked up.","The next second, her gaze froze.","In the sky, snowflakes were falling gently from the grayish-blue expanse, filling the air with fragmented white.","A blanket of pure white, soft and silent.","A snowflake landed between An Ling's brows, melting into a faint coolness. Her eyelashes fluttered, and she raised a hand to lightly touch it.","Everyone quickly raised their phones to take pictures, and someone called out.","\"This year's first snow is finally here.\"","She hadn't quite processed it, but the excited voices of her colleagues echoed beside her.","\"Wow! It's finally snowing! The weather forecast didn't even mention it. It's so beautiful!\"","An unannounced first snow arrived just like that, silently and without warning.","Of all times, it chose to fall on the day the Shen family met with disaster.","In an instant, An Ling felt as though she had returned to that original ending. On the day the An family went bankrupt and fell apart, it had also snowed just like this.","A few days later, she had died on the coldest snowy night.","After an unknown amount of time, she finally raised her head.","Staring blankly at the scene before her, she murmured softly, \"The weather... is going to get colder and colder.\"","...","Tonight, while visiting sets outside, An Ling and Nan Zhechuan walked all over, constantly changing locations.","It wasn't until the sky grew dark that today's tasks finally drew to a close.","Snowflakes were still drifting in the sky, piling up heavily on the tree branches and casting fragmented silhouettes under the streetlights.","An Ling stood by the street, holding a black umbrella. A thin layer of snow had settled on her off-white cashmere coat. Her pitch-black hair hung loose, and her beautiful, fair face was slightly flushed from the cold wind.","She blinked, her breath forming white puffs of mist in the air. Tilting her head up, a snowflake landed on her eye, making her instinctively close it. She lowered her head, her gaze falling back onto the bag in her hands.","\"Finally, we can go home. I'm freezing to death,\" Nan Zhechuan's voice came from behind.","He closed his umbrella, took out his car keys, and turned to look at An Ling.","Before An Ling could speak, he beat her to it:","\"I'm guessing someone is coming to pick you up.\"","An Ling's expression froze. \"Huh?\"","Nan Zhechuan chuckled, looking confident. \"Because it's like this every time I come out with you.\"","So he could already guess what An Ling was going to say next.","\"This time I'm taking a wild guess it's Shen Linyan, right?\"","An Ling smiled and slowly shook her head.","\"Wrong. This time I'm afraid I'll have to trouble you, Brother Nan, to take me back.\"","Nan Zhechuan was a bit surprised, then joked with a laugh, \"I finally get the chance to drive Producer An?!\"","He hurriedly opened the passenger door. \"Please, get in.\"","An Ling laughed and walked over. \"Thank you, Brother Nan. Sorry for the trouble.\"","\"It's nothing.\"","Once Nan Zhechuan got in the car, An Ling took out a sandwich and placed it on the center console for him. \"This is for you.\"","Only then did Nan Zhechuan notice An Ling was still holding a bag, and he immediately looked delighted.","\"Thanks! I was just wondering what to eat for dinner!\"","Busy until this hour, neither of them had eaten dinner yet.","He tore open the packaging, keeping one hand on the steering wheel and holding the sandwich with the other. \"Have you eaten?\"","An Ling hesitated for a moment before shaking her head. \"I'm not too hungry. I'll eat when I get back.\"","Nan Zhechuan drove her to the gate of her residential compound.","\"Security is strict here, so I can't go in. This is as far as I can take you.\"","\"Okay,\" An Ling nodded. \"Drive safely.\"","Nan Zhechuan gave her an 'OK' hand gesture.","Just as An Ling turned around to enter the compound, before she could take more than a few steps, a black Maybach suddenly drove past and stopped right beside her.","Before she could react, the car window rolled down.","\"Madam.\" The man's familiar, deep voice came from the driver's seat.","An Ling turned her head and, sure enough, saw Shen Linyan's familiar face.","She stepped closer, a look of pleasant surprise appearing on her face. \"Did you just get back too?\"","Shen Linyan's eyes curved as he nodded, speaking in a gentle tone. \"Get in, Madam. It's cold outside.\"","An Ling opened the door and got in. As soon as she sat down, Shen Linyan took her freezing hands, gently rubbing them. \"Did you just finish work?\"","The man's palms were broad and warm, with a thin layer of calluses. His fingers were long and distinctly bony as they slowly intertwined with hers.","\"Yeah,\" An Ling nodded. \"I was visiting sets today, so I finished quite late.\"","Shen Linyan drove the car into the garage. After getting out, he held her hand with one hand and naturally took the bag from her with the other.","An Ling let him lead her toward the elevator. After stepping inside, she hesitated for a moment. She wanted to say something, opened her mouth, but ultimately closed it again.","Shen Linyan noticed her movement. His gaze paused, and his grip on her hand tightened slightly.","\"Beep—\"","Pushing the front door open, An Ling was just about to go to the balcony to check on Huihui.","But she hadn't taken more than a few steps before the man wrapped an arm around her waist.","\"Madam, take a shower and warm up first. You can see the cat later.\"","An Ling turned to look at him and nodded. \"Okay.\"","After getting out of the shower, An Ling sat on the sofa in her pajamas, looking down as she stroked Huihui's fur, but her gaze slowly drifted out the window, lost in thought.","Outside the window, the falling snow drifted down slowly, growing heavier and heavier.","At that moment, the sofa beside her suddenly sank slightly. A crisp, clean post-shower scent, carrying a hint of moisture, drifted over and gently enveloped her senses.","She paused and turned to look at the man beside her.","The man had just showered. The tips of his hair were still damp, and a drop of water slid down his collar, giving him an air of lazy charm.","His pitch-black eyes were deep, like a cold lake under the night sky, yet at this moment, they watched her quietly and gently. His voice was soft: \"Did you eat dinner, Madam? I saw that there was a cake in your bag earlier.\"","An Ling pursed her lips, suddenly setting down the pet brush, and straddled his lap. She reached out and wrapped her arms around his neck, burying her small face in his shoulder and rubbing against it gently.","It had been a long time since she had done something like this to him.","Shen Linyan was momentarily stunned, a rare reaction for him. His heart felt as though it had been lightly brushed by a feather, stirring a faint itch, while his hands had already instinctively wrapped around the girl's waist.","He lowered his head, his nose catching the scent on her. He turned and kissed her cheek, lowering his voice. \"Wife, what's wrong?\"","An Ling remained silent for a long moment before finally speaking in a muffled voice:","\"I bought that cake for you.\""]},{"number":124,"title":"Chapter 124: Honey, I Believe You Now [Word Count Replenished]","paragraphs":["Shen Linyan froze.","He seemed not to have processed it, subconsciously tightening his arms around the girl in his embrace, and asked in a low voice, \"You got me a cake?\"","An Ling nodded.","At the set, she had noticed a bakery next to the shooting location.","Actually, she didn't even know why she bought it at the time.","It was just that in that moment, what Xiao Yang had said suddenly echoed in her ears.","\"Wishes made on the first snow will come true.\"","Well, making a wish requires a cake, right?","So it made perfect sense for her to buy one.","She tilted her head and blinked at him. \"The staff recommended this taro-flavored one. I heard it's really good, so I bought it. Do you not like this flavor?\"","Shen Linyan didn't say anything.","But his heart sank.","This continuous wave of happiness came too suddenly, instead giving him a sense of unreality that almost made him afraid.","From the girl's hesitation to speak in the elevator to her heavy-heartedness on the sofa, everything was telling him that An Ling was acting unusual today.","Her closeness to him came only after the news broke.","Shen Linyan's knuckles tightened slightly, and he suddenly spoke up:","\"Did you see the news about the Shen Corporation today, Madam?\"","The topic shifted a bit too fast. An Ling didn't react immediately, blinking. \"I saw it. Why?\"","Shen Linyan turned to look at her. \"Do you think I framed the Shen family for tax evasion?\"","An Ling was taken aback.","To be honest, she actually... really did think so.","But hearing Shen Linyan's tone...","She blinked, her tone a little hesitant. \"This... wasn't it you?\"","A brief silence followed, making even the air seem to freeze.","Shen Linyan's expression froze, his heart skipping a violent beat.","He almost recalled those words the girl had said before.","Ever since she discovered his true colors, this marriage had been labeled by An Ling as a transaction of interests.","Shen Linyan knew this better than anyone.","The reason An Ling wasn't divorcing him now was to prevent angering him and out of fear that he would harm the An family.","He quietly met her gaze and raised a hand to cup her face. \"So, are you still afraid of me, Madam?\"","Hadn't she already sent a message?","Hadn't she already... stopped being afraid of him?","He stared into the woman's eyes and said softly, \"An Ling, I don't want you to try to please me.\"","\"You are my wife.\"","Not a relationship maintained by interests.","An Ling blinked, letting out a confused \"Hmm?\"","She sat up a little straighter. \"What are you talking about?\"","\"Buying me a cake, and treating me like this now, isn't it because you're afraid I'll make a move against the An family?\"","Shen Linyan's voice was very soft. He raised his eyes, his gaze obscure, as if suppressing some emotion. \"Isn't this what you were worried about today, Madam?\"","An Ling looked bewildered for a moment.","After realizing what he meant, she burst out laughing, chuckling softly. \"What are you talking about?\"","Sitting on the man's lap, she tilted her head and studied him. After a long while, she still couldn't hold back her laughter.","\"Honestly, you've made me not know what to say.\"","The gloominess that had originally been in her heart dissipated slightly with the man's words.","She wrapped her arms around his neck, her tone laced with a smile. \"Have you ever seen anyone try to please their sugar daddy with a cake worth a few dozen bucks from the roadside?\"","On the day she discovered Shen Linyan's true colors, she had indeed thought of trying to please him, so that when they finally laid their cards on the table, he wouldn't be too ruthless to her.","But she never expected that pleasing him wouldn't be necessary at all.","And now, she was being suspected of trying to please him.","The more An Ling thought about it, the more she wanted to laugh. She kissed his lips. \"Is Chairman Shen that easy to please? A cheap little cake is enough? If those people who wrack their brains trying to invite Chairman Shen to dinner found out, they'd cry themselves to death.\"","Ever since An Zhou discovered she took Shen Linyan's project, he had told her about Shen Linyan a few times.","He said that Shen Linyan was notoriously difficult to meet in their circles; getting an audience with him was nearly impossible, and the number of investors wanting to collaborate with him spanned both domestically and internationally.","Seeing the genuine expression on the girl's face, Shen Linyan's tense jaw relaxed slightly. He lowered his eyes, his nose gently rubbing against her cheek, and his Adam's apple bobbed. \"Only for my wife.\"","An Ling smiled and kissed his chin. \"Okay, okay, okay.\"","Hugging the man's neck, the smile at the corners of her mouth faded slightly, and she let out a happy sigh. \"I bought the cake because today is the first snow. Didn't you see it snowing outside today? My colleague said that wishes made on the first snow are very effective, and I want to make one too. Can we take the cake out now?\"","Pausing, she whispered into the man's ear, \"Actually, my colleague also said that you should go on a date with your partner on the first snow. But we are a married couple, so let's just have a date at home.\"","Shen Linyan looked slightly stunned. Staring at the girl in front of him, his heart swelled as if it were soaking in warm water, rising and falling with the ripples.","\"Okay.\" He curled his lips into a smile, kissed the corner of her eye, and got up to get the cake.","The bakery didn't provide candles for this kind of small cake, but they still had some left over at home from celebrating Shen Linyan's birthday last time.","An Ling found the remaining candles and stuck one on top.","Sizzle—","A match burned in the air. She lit the candle and turned off the main lights in the living room, leaving only a dim floor lamp.","She closed her eyes and thought for a few seconds, then slowly opened them and blew out the candle.","The moment the candlelight extinguished, she turned her head and met a focused gaze.","The dim yellow light was reduced to a faint speck, casting light shadows around the man's noble silhouette, his aura elegant and serene.","He gazed at her, his eyes gentle and steady, inexplicably making one feel grounded in this cold, dark night.","The man reached out and held her hand.","His fingers were long and warm. He traced over her fingers little by little, slowly intertwining them with his own.","An Ling blinked, withdrew her gaze, and suddenly spoke slowly:","\"Shen Linyan, didn't you ask what I was worried about?\"","\"Actually, I was worried that my ending might be coming.\"","As soon as the words left her mouth, the man's grip on her hand instantly tightened.","An Ling looked down and smiled. \"I remember, I also froze to death in a heavy snow like this.\"","An Ling couldn't quite describe her feelings about today's sudden first snow.","This snow instantly pulled her back to the plot of the past.","In that moment, amidst everyone's cheers, the thought that flashed through her mind was—","The plot of her death was getting closer and closer.","Although most of the previous plot had changed, An Ling still found it hard to be at ease.","Because no matter what, some plotlines were still somewhat similar to the original story.","\"I don't know what this first snow foreshadows.\"","\"Maybe it's reminding me not to forget that my storyline hasn't finished yet, or maybe it's telling me that everything is over. Who can say for sure?\"","So she thought, if making a wish on the first snow really worked.","Then she wanted to make a wish too.","\"I used to be worried all the time. I was afraid you would change your mind later, afraid you would make a move against the An family, afraid the plot would suddenly change. But today, I'm suddenly no longer afraid.\"","An Ling tilted her head, looked at the man, and slowly curved her eyes into a smile.","\"You told me before to trust you.\"","\"Hubby, I trust you now.\"","Hearing this, the man looked at her, his dark eyes deep and intense.","A moment later, he reached out, gently pulled her into his arms, brushed the hair from her forehead, and softly planted a kiss.","\"Honey, don't worry. I'll be here.\"","...","The news of the Shen Group's tax evasion quickly spread.","Overnight, the once infinitely glorious Shen family fell into ruin.","The person primarily responsible for this tax evasion was Shen Jiandong. Furthermore, after a thorough investigation, it was discovered that Shen Jiandong had used his position to secretly transfer tens of millions out of the company, leading straight to his imprisonment.","Although Lu Jingshen and Father Shen were unaware of the situation, one as a major shareholder and the other as the acting chairman, they could not escape being held accountable.","Following that came astronomical compensation claims for project breaches of contract.","On the night the scandal broke, Father Shen fainted out of sheer anger and was admitted to the hospital.","At the hospital, Shen Linyan walked up to the ward.","Pushing the door open, Father Shen on the bed saw him and instantly flew into a rage.","But remembering the doctor's words, he forcefully suppressed the fury in his heart, his face dark and gloomy.","\"Shen Linyan, you still have the nerve to come see me?\"","Shen Linyan sat down on a chair and replied calmly, \"Right now, besides me, there probably isn't anyone else who would come to see you, Father.\"","He was right. Lu Jingshen could barely save himself, and Mother Shen and Shen Fuyuan were even less likely to come.","Father Shen had a breath stuck in his chest, unable to go up or down, yet he couldn't find the words to refute it.","He stared grimly at Shen Linyan and said after a while, \"Shen Linyan, you have no idea what you've missed out on. You were always the only heir to the Shen Group. Letting you be the acting chairman was only temporary; I had placed high hopes in you.\"","High hopes?","Did high hopes mean the oppressive educational environment over the past dozen years that nearly drove him to a breakdown? Did it mean the indifference—and even participation—when he was retaliated against and tortured by Lu Jincai?","Shen Linyan lowered his eyes, turning the ring on his finger. \"It seems I cannot bear the high hopes Father speaks of. Besides, from the very beginning, I never wanted the Shen Group that much.\"","He slowly raised his eyes and let out a laugh.","\"So, seeing the Shen Group end up like this, I'm actually a bit happy. I'll be taking over those projects of the Shen Group.\"","After saying that, he stood up to leave. \"Rest well.\"","\"Stop right there!!\"","Father Shen gritted his teeth, pointing at his back and shouting, \"Shen Linyan! You ungrateful wretch! I am your father! Even if you cut ties with me, I'm still your only relative in this world! How could you treat me like this!\"","Shen Linyan stopped in his tracks and turned his head.","\"From beginning to end, my only family has been my wife.\"","He had never had a home.","It was because of An Ling that those cold residences could be called a home.","...","With such an incident happening to the Shen Group, An Ling hardly dared to ask about Shen Fuyuan's situation.","She had debuted with the title of the Shen family's heiress and had caused so much trouble in the past. Now that she had lost this status, it was unimaginable how much trouble she would encounter.","But to An Ling's surprise, there weren't many comments about Shen Fuyuan on the internet.","After thinking it over, she still sent a message to her.","An Ling: [If you need help with work, you can come to me anytime. I'll try my best to help with whatever I can.]","If she couldn't help, she could ask Shen Linyan to help.","At first, An Ling didn't have much of a good impression of this eldest miss of the Shen family.","But after interacting with her, she found that aside from having a bit of a temper occasionally, the girl wasn't bad at heart.","A reply came quickly.","Shen Fuyuan: [Minor issue, don't worry.]","An Ling paused slightly.","This girl was so carefree? This was just a minor issue?","Then what would be considered a major issue?","For a minor celebrity with no power or influence who had offended many people, encountering unspoken rules of the industry would be commonplace.","An Ling: [If the company makes any inappropriate demands of you, or asks you to attend any shady drinking parties, you must refuse.]","Shen Fuyuan: [They probably won't make me attend them.]","An Ling frowned slightly.","Before she could type, Shen Fuyuan sent another message.","[The boss of my company is friends with my eldest brother. Things like that shouldn't happen.]","An Ling: \"...\"","No wonder it was a minor issue.","It turned out her debut didn't rely on the Shen family, but on Shen Linyan.","After replying, Shen Fuyuan put down her phone.","She was just about to get out of the car when she saw the court seals pasted on the door of the villa, causing her steps to falter slightly.","Pushing the door open, the sound of arguing instantly hit her ears.","Accompanied by Mother Shen's agitated and shrill voice.","\"What do you mean it's my fault! Lu Jingshen, are you trying to rebel?\"","As her words fell, it was followed by a crashing sound of things being smashed.","She hurriedly walked in and saw Lu Jingshen and Mother Shen arguing in the living room, both of their faces looking exceptionally ugly.","The living room floor was covered with broken porcelain shards, a complete mess, as if it had just survived a massive battle.","Shen Fuyuan carefully bypassed the broken glass. \"Mom, what are you arguing about?\"","Hearing her voice, Mother Shen turned her head, panting, with lingering anger still on her face. \"Fuyuan, look at what your brother is saying. He said he wants me to take responsibility for this matter. Is this how you speak to your own mother?!\"","\"That's just the truth.\"","Lu Jingshen's expression was equally ugly, his eyes filled with resentment. \"Wasn't being the acting chairman what you wanted, Mom! Now that we're bankrupt, I've been dragged down without knowing anything. Isn't it enough that the cars at home were seized? Mom, shouldn't you clean up this mess for me!\"","Mother Shen's blood boiled as she roared, \"Can't you see that the house has also been taken to pay off the debts!\"","If this continued, she would also be admitted to the hospital soon.","Seeing this, Shen Fuyuan quickly helped her to sit down first.","\"Mom, sit down first.\"","Mother Shen was so angry that she couldn't breathe smoothly.","Lu Jingshen frowned. \"Then what do we do next? I've been blacklisted now; I'm not even allowed to take the high-speed rail!\"","Hearing this made Mother Shen's temper flare even more.","What do you mean what to do?!","Still thinking about the high-speed rail!","How did she give birth to such a stupid son!","However much Mother Shen used to dote on Lu Jingshen, after the Shen family's bankruptcy, all that doting turned into bubbles along with their wealth.","She gritted her teeth and pointed a finger at Lu Jingshen. \"Get out of my sight! You useless thing! Now that we're bankrupt, you ask me what to do? What can I do! Conjure money out of thin air?\"","Shen Fuyuan patted her back to help her catch her breath.","However, not knowing which word struck a nerve in Lu Jingshen, his face suddenly darkened, and his voice carried a tone of gritted teeth.","\"Mom, do you think Shen Linyan is better than me?\"","Without waiting for Mother Shen to speak, he turned around with a dark face and walked outside.","That night, inside a bar club.","In the private room, several empty liquor bottles lay haphazardly on the table, and the smell of alcohol permeated the air.","Lu Jingshen lay on the sofa, his face flushed with intoxication, continuously cursing, \"Damn it, why does it have to be me cleaning up this mess!\"","He was clearly so capable, yet things went wrong right when it was his turn!","Wasn't this all Dad's fault? If he had just handed the company over to him to manage earlier, none of this would have happened!","Struggling to get up to pour himself another drink, the phone on the table suddenly vibrated.","Narrowing his eyes, he looked down at it. The contact name clearly read: [Zhou Wen]","Lu Jingshen's expression shifted slightly, and his drunkenness faded a bit.","Did Wenwen see the news and want to comfort him?","He set down his wine glass and answered the call.","He cleared his throat and was just about to speak when Zhou Wen's angry voice came from the other end.","\"Lu Jingshen, what is the meaning of this? You promised to give me that apartment, so why did people come to seize it today?!\"","Lu Jingshen: \"...\"","He took a deep breath and spat out coldly, \"I don't know either. I don't have any money now!\"","He then hung up the phone viciously, his chest feeling heavy and suffocated.","He knew it. How could that woman possibly call to check up on him? She only got together with him for his money. She couldn't even compare to An Ling...","At the thought of that name, Lu Jingshen's expression suddenly froze.","Catalyzed by the alcohol, everything that woman had once done for him flashed before his eyes, piece by piece.","Everyone else was fake...","Only An Ling.","Only An Ling's love for him had been real.","Struck by a sudden thought, Lu Jingshen's Adam's apple bobbed slightly. He slowly took out his phone and dialed a number.","\"Beep... beep...\"","After a long while, the call finally connected, but there was dead silence on the other end.","Sitting on the sofa and resting his forehead in his hand, Lu Jingshen remained silent for a moment before speaking, his voice hoarse and soft. \"An Ling.\"","Meanwhile, on the other side of the phone.","In a dimly lit bedroom, a young woman lay in bed.","The corners of her eyes were flushed red, and her beautiful face bore the enchanting afterglow of passion. Barely able to endure it, she tightly shut her eyes and buried her face in the pillow. Her breathing was rapid, her dark hair scattered in a mess, and she bit her lower lip, letting out a soft whimper.","\"Mmm...\"","Below her, a man with a noble and elegant face slowly lifted his head.","He lowered his gaze, gently licking away the lingering sweetness from his lips and fingertips, before casting a careless glance at the phone lying nearby on the bed."]},{"number":125,"title":"Chapter 125: Didn't Anyone Tell You Not to Chase After Someone Else's Wife [Restored]","paragraphs":["The temperature in the bedroom was rising.","An Ling's pajamas hung loosely on her frame. With a few buttons undone, her collar fell open, revealing smooth, fair shoulders. Her figure, half-hidden and half-exposed, was all the more enticing.","She covered her mouth, taking small, panting breaths as she forced down the overwhelming waves of pleasure, the corners of her eyes glistening with tears.","Pushed to the crest of the wave by the man, her mind went completely blank.","Muffled voices drifted from the phone, faintly calling her name.","She turned her head, casting a glance to the side with wet, glassy eyes.","Her phone lay on the bedsheets, the screen showing an active call.","They had been right in the middle of it, still kissing, when the phone on the nightstand had suddenly started ringing.","It was her phone.","Shen Linyan picked it up for her, but his movements paused when he saw the caller ID.","He lowered his gaze, staring at her quietly.","\"Wife, why haven't you blocked him?\"","\"...\"","An Ling defended herself in a small voice, \"I blocked him on WeChat.\"","After deleting that huge batch of WeChat contacts back then, she had completely forgotten about his phone number.","\"Then I'll block him right now.\"","She was just about to hang up.","From behind, a hand with distinct knuckles slowly pressed down on her wrist. The grip wasn't heavy, but it was impossible to resist.","Scalding thin lips pressed against her ear, his magnetic voice heavy with lust.","\"Answer it.\"","After the call connected, the phone was tossed aside.","An Ling had no idea what the person on the other end was saying.","Shen Linyan was making her body go completely soft; her mind was entirely in a daze.","She raised her eyes, meeting the man's dark, deep gaze.","Both of them remembered the phone call was still connected. The only sound left in the air was their heavy breathing.","Seeing his movements, her face flushed red.","Just as she was about to reach out for him to hold her, Lu Jingshen's voice drifted over from next to them.","\"An Ling? An Ling, are you listening?\"","An Ling paused, turned her head, and reached out to grab the phone from a distance.","She glanced at the man in front of her. Shen Linyan was watching her, saying nothing.","She brought the phone to her ear, trying to keep her tone as steady as possible.","\"Why are you calling me? If there's nothing important, I'm hanging up.\"","On the other end of the line, Lu Jingshen sounded like he had had too much to drink. His words carried a hint of intoxication. \"Can't I call? You used to call me every single day.\"","But that wasn't her.","An Ling was about to reply when she saw the man suddenly lean down.","A thin layer of sweat beaded on his forehead, his dark hair casually swept back.","He lowered his head and kissed her lower abdomen, then trailed his kisses upward. His tall, straight nose brushed against her skin, stirring up a tingling, numb itch.","The man lifted his gaze, his dark eyes staring fixedly at her. His noble, handsome features were tinged with heavy desire, his breathing deep and scorching.","The rough pads of his fingers traced down her lower belly bit by bit, rubbing gently.","An Ling's face instantly burned red. Her eyes widened, and she hastily pulled the phone away. Her eyelashes fluttered softly as she turned her head and let out a soft gasp.","The desire that hadn't completely subsided was reignited, stirring up an even deeper need that made her heart ache with longing.","She clung to the man's shoulders, suppressing her voice as she let out a soft whimper by his ear. The trembling end of her note sounded exactly like a coquettish plea, \"Hubby...\"","Shen Linyan gathered her into his arms, lowering his head to press light kisses to the side of her neck.","On the other end, Lu Jingshen didn't hear a thing. Normally, he would have noticed something was off right away, but the alcohol had gone to his head, and his mind was entirely consumed by memories of the past.","Although the Shen family had gone bankrupt, if An Ling was willing to marry him, it wasn't impossible for them to start over.","But the main issue right now was that An Ling had been hurt too deeply by him in the past; he had to take it slow.","He set down his glass, his gaze falling onto the drinks on the table. \"I'm drinking at a bar right now. Do you want to come over and see me?\"","Being drunk was the best excuse.","He didn't know it, but those words never reached An Ling's ears.","On the large bed, the lighting grew increasingly dim.","The phone fell silently onto the mattress with a soft thud.","The next second, it was picked up by a pair of slender fingers.","Over here, Lu Jingshen had even thought out exactly what he was going to say to An Ling when they met.","Thinking of the girl's extraordinarily beautiful face, he swallowed hard and took another gulp of liquor.","Before marrying Zhou Wen, he could be considered a veteran of the dating scene. He had to admit, An Ling was truly one of the most stunning women he had ever seen. Her face held a perfect blend of coquettish charm and pure innocence, without feeling contradictory at all; instead, it made her all the more alluring.","If she hadn't appeared after Zhou Wen, he might have actually accepted her.","Feeling a faint heat in his body, Lu Jingshen tugged at his tie. Sensing that the silence on the other end had gone on a bit too long, he spoke again, \"Come see me. I'll apologize for everything that happened in the past. And that time you hit me, I won't hold it against you anymore.\"","Pausing for a moment, he added, \"Also, I actually remember all those things you did when you were chasing me. That thread online from before about you pursuing me—I was the one who compiled all those details.\"","As soon as his voice fell, a deep male voice came through the receiver.","\"Lu Jingshen, hasn't anyone ever told you not to go looking for other people's wives?\"","Lu Jingshen froze.","Then he frowned. \"Shen Linyan? Where's An Ling? Give her the phone, I need to talk to her...\"","\"Beep—\" The call disconnected, leaving only the busy dial tone.","Lu Jingshen's face darkened as he smashed his phone down. \"Fuck!\"","His expression was gloomy, his knuckles turning white from how tightly he gripped his glass.","Meanwhile, on the other end, the call was ended.","The man buried his head in the damp crook of the girl's neck, opening his mouth to suckle gently, his voice slightly hoarse.","\"Wife, what thread was he talking about?\"","\"Hmm?\" An Ling panted, her eyes narrowing.","She finally remembered that such a thing had indeed happened.","In the very beginning, right after she had cleared things up, a post blew up online about her chasing Lu Jingshen, listing out all the detailed things she had done for him.","At the time, she had wondered how this person knew even more than she did, writing with such detail. It turned out Lu Jingshen had posted it himself.","She knew Lu Jingshen was no good. On one hand, he claimed to love the female lead, while on the other, he reveled in being pursued by other girls, even taking pride in it.","If Lu Jingshen hadn't brought it up himself, An Ling would have almost forgotten about it entirely.","Her words trailed off softly, sounding wet and winding as if soaked in water, as she answered between breaths, \"It was a post from a long time ago... It blew up the night we posted our rings. It detailed how I used to chase... mm!\"","Just as she uttered the word \"chase,\" An Ling's eyes widened. Her pitch suddenly spiked, and her breathing grew heavier.","The man leaned down, pinning her, and captured her ear in a kiss.","\"Wife, I want to see it too.\"","That thread had been deleted a long time ago, but An Ling had saved a document of it.","She had originally intended to keep it to make it easier to get back at Lu Jingshen later, but so much had happened since then that she had completely forgotten about it.","After taking another shower and lying back in bed, An Ling was drowsy.","The man beside her was swiping through her tablet. The document was open, displaying everything the system had done to pursue Lu Jingshen over the past two years.","She really couldn't understand what was so interesting about it.","Just as An Ling was groggily drifting off to sleep, the man's voice slowly rang out by her ear.","\"Knitted a scarf, delivered homemade lunches, helped him block drinks, sent him flowers, picked him up when he was drunk, asked him out to dinner.\"","\"Why are there even chat logs? You sent Lu Jingshen so many confession messages. So this is what they call a 'little essay'.\"","An Ling: \"...\"","See, you just had to look.","Now, An Ling was completely unable to sleep.","With a jealous sourpuss muttering right next to her, how could anyone sleep?","She opened her eyes, saw that the man was still reading the document, and reached out to place her hand over the screen.","\"Haven't you seen this before? I remember this post disappeared very quickly, wasn't it you who took it down?\"","Shen Linyan looked at her. \"I took it down, but I didn't read the contents.\"","Saying that, he added, \"Besides, I had no interest in reading it.\"","\"...\"","An Ling: \"Then why do you want to read it now?\"","\"Because I care about it now.\"","Because he cared, he wanted to know.","Shen Linyan put down the tablet, slipped under the covers, and pulled her into his arms.","An Ling looked up and blinked.","\"You should know, I didn't do this.\"","Shen Linyan lowered his head and kissed the top of her hair. \"I know.\"","But even knowing that another entity had occupied An Ling's body, seeing his wife's familiar name in the document still inevitably bothered him.","An Ling reached out to touch his face, comforting him, \"Are you jealous? It's all fake. I don't even know how to cook. The only time I cooked was for your birthday. Moreover, that system before was just fooling Lu Jingshen; it couldn't cook either, it hired someone else to do it.\"","Shen Linyan nuzzled her cheek and chuckled, \"I'm not jealous. My wife burns the cookies when she bakes.\"","An Ling huffed and turned around. \"That was an accident. The first time is always a failure, but next time will definitely be a success.\"","\"Alright, close your eyes and go to sleep.\"","After doing it for so long, she was dead tired.","The man pressed against her back.","After a while.","In the dark of the night, the man's deep voice sounded faintly.","\"My wife never sends me long essays. The word count of my wife's messages is always very low.\"","An Ling: \"...\"","And he said he wasn't jealous.","An Ling opened her eyes and picked up her phone from the side.","Right in front of Shen Linyan, she opened an AI app.","[Please help me write a 300-word confession to my husband. It needs to be sincere and moving enough to bring tears to his eyes.]","Then she copied, pasted, and sent it to him.","She gave him a sidelong glance, the corners of her eyes lifting. \"Now you have one. Are you happy?\"","A laugh rumbled from the man's chest as he lowered his head to nuzzle her cheek.","\"I'm happy. Thank you, honey.\"","...","It was all because of Lu Jingshen's phone call last night.","Originally, she and Shen Linyan had only planned to do it briefly once, but they couldn't hold back later on.","Returning from a meeting and sitting in her office chair, An Ling was just about to revise a proposal when her phone lit up beside her.","Shen Linyan: [I love my wife too ^^]","She was slightly taken aback.","This message was responding to that AI text from last night.","Thinking of how a certain someone had clung to her last night, An Ling pursed her lips, a faint smile touching the corners of her mouth.","She reopened that document and scrolled through it line by line.","To be honest, even with the memories of those systems, she herself didn't remember these things very well.","Shen Linyan seemed quite bothered by it last night. Should she do a few of these things for him too?","Knit a scarf?","That would take too long.","Deliver a homemade lunch?","But Shen Linyan would always find her to eat together at noon if he was free.","Pick him up when he's drunk?","An Ling silently covered her face.","Don't even mention that.","There had been several times when Shen Linyan had to pick her up when she was drunk.","After thinking it over, it seemed that only giving flowers was a slightly better option, but she didn't know if Shen Linyan would like them...","Just as she was thinking, a colleague's voice reached her ears.","\"Ah Leng, we have a dinner with the other production company tonight. Please revise that document as soon as possible and send it to me.\"","An Ling pulled her thoughts back: \"Okay.\"","She had to close the document for now.","After sitting at her desk and revising the text for a while, a voice suddenly came from the doorway.","\"Which one is Yang Jia? Your boyfriend sent you a bouquet of flowers.\"","She looked up.","Amidst the cheering of the crowd, she saw Xiao Yang blush and stand up to take the flowers from the delivery man.","It was a beautiful bouquet of blue roses, exquisitely packaged with a layer of white cardstock on the outside, tied with a silk ribbon.","A colleague teased, \"Showing off your affection in public, huh? Have you considered us singles in the office?\"","Xiao Yang was a little embarrassed, her face turning red as she coughed lightly a few times. \"I told him not to send them to the company, but he just wouldn't listen.\"","She said that, but she couldn't hide the happiness on her face.","No one dislikes this kind of public display of affection.","An Ling smiled as she listened to them talk, her gaze landing on the smile on Xiao Yang's face, her eyes thoughtful.","So receiving flowers makes people very happy...","Then Shen Linyan should be very happy too.","Just as she was thinking, her colleagues' teasing reached her side again.","\"Ah Leng, don't copy Xiao Yang. Don't let Chairman Shen send flowers to the company. I'm afraid the office won't be able to fit those 999 roses.\"","An Ling was taken aback, not yet reacting.","Other colleagues laughed and chimed in: \"999? That's too conservative. I say 9,999.\"","\"Then I bet on 99,999!\"","\"You guys might be overthinking it. Maybe Ah Leng has already received them a long time ago.\"","Everyone instantly burst into laughter.","An Ling's hand holding the mouse tightened slightly, not knowing what to say.","Because the truth was the exact opposite of what everyone guessed.","—She had never received any.","She could only smile and say nothing.","After a while, she looked up again at the flowers in Xiao Yang's hands.","...","That evening, the dinner was at an authentic Sichuan restaurant.","The food here was a bit spicy, and coupled with drinking with the others, An Ling unknowingly had a few too many drinks.","She touched her hot face and looked down to send Shen Linyan a message.","Good thing she didn't drive here today.","An Ling: [Hubby, come pick me up (๑ ́0`๑)]","Shen Linyan: [Received, wifey (๑ ́0`๑)]","After the dinner ended, most of the colleagues were a bit drunk, and those who drove were calling for designated drivers.","The weather was a bit cold, and it had been snowing recently.","An Ling watched them leave and was about to go back inside the restaurant to wait when her gaze suddenly paused.","By the roadside, Xiao Yang and her boyfriend were walking together, talking about something. Then they hailed a taxi and left together.","It was very strange.","She could actually recognize at a glance that it was Xiao Yang today.","Was it because Xiao Yang was dressed very distinctively today?","An Ling watched for a while, then slowly withdrew her gaze.","She looked down, took out her phone, and searched online for flower bouquets for boyfriends.","Each flower had a different meaning, and picking one was a bit dazzling.","An Ling noticed what the internet said about different relationship stages.","Getting together, being deeply in love, and marriage—different stages called for different flowers.","It was a bit complicated.","Having had alcohol, her head was a bit dizzy. She put away her phone, planning to visit a flower shop tomorrow.","The colleagues around her had left at some point.","An Ling looked up and suddenly noticed a car parked by the side of the road.","In the snowy night, the man wore a black overcoat, his posture as straight as a pine, his steps crisp and steady.","She blinked, her eyes curving into a smile, and trotted down the steps towards him.","Shen Linyan closed the distance in a few quick strides, smiling as he pulled her into his arms. \"My wife isn't even afraid of falling.\"","He held her chilly hands and lowered his head to nuzzle her cheek. \"Are you cold? Let's get back in the car first.\"","An Ling blinked up at him. The question of whether he liked flowers hovered right on the tip of her tongue, but after a few seconds, she swallowed it back down.","He should like them, right?","Seeing how much Xiao Yang liked them...","Deep in thought, An Ling pulled the car door open.","The next second, her gaze suddenly froze.","The interior of the car was bathed in dim yellow light, permeated with a faint scent of cedar.","There, resting quietly on the passenger seat, lay a bouquet of red roses."]},{"number":126,"title":"Chapter 126: I Want to Be Your Only Gentle Second Male Lead [Added]","paragraphs":["In that instant, An Ling froze in place.","A scene she had never anticipated was unfolding before her eyes right now; she even thought it was an illusion.","Her heart was pounding crazily.","It beat so hard that her eardrums trembled, and even her breathing lost its rhythm.","From behind, an arm wrapped around her waist.","The black overcoat accentuated the man's outstanding, ascetic temperament, and the wedding ring on his long, slender finger was dazzling.","\"Do you like flowers, my wife?\"","An Ling turned her head and looked at him blankly. \"...For me?\"","\"Yes.\"","The man lowered his head and gently kissed the top of her hair. His voice was deep, and his breath brushed against her ear.","\"Yesterday, when I was looking at that document, I finally realized that when I was wooing you, I forgot to give you flowers.\"","He had given An Ling the best material things, giving her everything she could ever want.","If An Ling wanted diamond jewelry, he would bid for it at auctions.","He had always thought that this was love.","Giving the best was love.","Satisfying An Ling's every need was love.","Wanting to treat her well was love.","But it seemed that even an emotionless system knew better than him what it meant to woo someone.","An Ling blinked and turned to look at the bouquet.","On the seat, wrapped in matte black paper with fine golden sparkles, bright red Floyd roses were slowly blooming, their dark red petals still dotted with water droplets.","Tucked among the flowers was a card.","An Ling reached out and picked it up. On the card was his familiar, vigorous and sharp handwriting.","[Day one of wooing my wife.]","Shen Linyan smiled and said gently, \"I'm sorry, it's my first time wooing someone too, so I don't know much about it yet. How about I send you flowers every day from now on?\"","An Ling let out a slow laugh and turned to look at the man.","Her eyes were bright, the corners of her eyes slightly red, whether from the cold or some other reason.","\"Okay.\"","The heavy snow had stopped at some unknown point.","In the cold night, the crowd dispersed. On the dim, secluded roadside, the streetlights cast a faint glow, illuminating this quiet stretch of street.","An Ling brushed away the lingering snowflakes on the man's shoulder, stood on her tiptoes, and kissed his lips.","\"I originally wanted to give you flowers, but I didn't expect you to beat me to it.\"","She looked at the man, her eyes slowly curving into a smile.","\"What do I do now? I don't even know what to give you anymore.\"","Shen Linyan smiled and pulled her into his embrace. \"Then could you promise me two things?\"","An Ling rubbed her face against his chest, looked up, and asked curiously, \"Hmm? What two things?\"","This was much easier than giving a gift.","The man helped tuck the loose hair behind her ear and slowly spoke:","\"First, I hope you won't be afraid of me anymore.\"","An Ling paused, then looked confused. \"Didn't I already say it? That night of the first snow...\"","\"Back then, you said you believed me.\"","Shen Linyan gently interrupted her.","He cupped her face, his dark eyes looking at her with unwavering gentleness. \"But more than that, I don't want you to be afraid of me. Whether it's the things I've done to others, or what I did to Zhou Wen, I will never do those things to you.\"","\"I hope you can continue to treat me as your gentle second male lead.\"","\"An Ling, I want to be your one and only gentle second male lead.\"","The expression on An Ling's face froze.","She stared at the man in front of her. A moment later, she smiled and reached out to hug his neck.","\"Are you really going to be with a vicious female supporting character like me? That doesn't fit the logic of a novel.\"","Shen Linyan lowered his head to kiss her cheek, his lips curving into a faint smile. \"Why doesn't it fit? Don't the female supporting character and the second male lead sound like a perfect match?\"","An Ling was just teasing him, and upon hearing this, she nodded in mock realization. \"That actually makes sense. I think we're a perfect match too.\"","She kissed the man with a beaming smile. \"Then I agree! So what is your second thing?\"","Shen Linyan lowered his eyes, smiling as he held her hand. His fingertips gently caressed the ring on her finger, his movements tender and affectionate.","\"I want to marry you.\"","\"The kind of marriage where we hold a wedding ceremony, honey.\"","Both of their previous marriages had just been low-key registrations without any ceremony.","The first time went without saying.","The second time happened right when Shen Linyan was exposed as an illegitimate child, leaving absolutely no time to plan a wedding.","But Shen Linyan had never forgotten about this.","He gazed at the woman in front of him, his voice very light, as soft as the moonlight tonight.","\"My wife, once this winter passes and your ending is complete, let's have a wedding, okay?\"","An Ling's eyes curved in a smile as she took the initiative to hold his hand.","\"Okay.\"","...","The last time An Ling saw news about the Shen Corporation was on the news.","The Shen Corporation had completely declared bankruptcy and delisted.","Employees jumped ship one after another, the building was acquired by Shen Linyan, and the signboard that once read Shen Corporation had been replaced by AL Group.","Although Lu Jincai still had the Lu family's properties behind her, after so many years, the Lu family had long become a small company dependent on the Shen Corporation. With the Shen Corporation dead, this little bit of property could only support herself and was completely insufficient to bring the Shen Corporation back to life.","In the past, Lu Jincai had doted on Lu Jingshen and wanted him to inherit the Shen Corporation.","But upon returning to the Lu family, she didn't even trust Lu Jingshen herself. She preferred to hold the power in her own hands and wasn't even willing to write a proxy agreement like Shen Zhong did.","All of this was just what An Ling heard from Shen Linyan.","She didn't know if this was the final ending.","Or perhaps, the ending had already changed.","...","At eight o'clock in the evening, at the entrance of the clubhouse.","\"Mr. Wu, looking forward to this cooperation. Have a safe trip back.\"","After seeing off the investor and watching the other party get into the car and leave, Sister Lin Ya turned to look at the two people behind her and smiled, \"How are you guys getting back?\"","Nan Zhechuan rubbed his hands together, exhaling cold air. \"I called a designated driver. They should be here soon.\"","Saying that, he turned to look at An Ling beside him.","\"Ah Leng, are you going back with us?\"","An Ling had just finished sending a message. Hearing this, she looked up. \"No, Shen Linyan will come pick me up later. You guys go ahead.\"","Nan Zhechuan revealed an expression of 'I knew it'. \"It seems the probability of my guess being right is still very high.\"","Sister Lin Ya was curious. \"What probability?\"","Nan Zhechuan: \"Usually when we come out for a banquet or a film set, and it's time to go home, ninety-nine percent of the time Ah Leng has someone to pick her up. I already witnessed the rare one percent last time, so from now on, it should always be Chairman Shen picking her up.\"","An Ling smiled and lifted her chin. \"Alright, I see a designated driver coming. Is that the one you called? Go back and rest early.\"","The designated driver came over and confirmed the last digits of the phone number.","Sister Lin Ya turned to look at her. \"Then we'll be leaving first. See you at the company tomorrow.\"","An Ling waved at them. \"Okay, see you tomorrow.\"","After they left, An Ling reopened her phone. The screen was displaying messages from An Zhou.","An Zhou: [...You there?]","An Ling: [?]","An Zhou: [I have a friend who recently made his girlfriend angry, and she is really mad. What kind of gift should he buy to apologize and coax her back?]","An Ling: [You made Sister Qin You angry?]","An Zhou: [What do you mean me! I told you it's a friend of mine! Just tell me straight, if Shen Linyan made you angry, how would he usually handle it?]","An Ling: [That's a bit difficult. Shen Linyan doesn't seem to have ever made me angry.]","An Zhou: [...]","The other side didn't reply again, seemingly rendered speechless by her.","An Ling chuckled out loud and was just about to reply seriously.","Suddenly, the sound of a man and a woman arguing came from nearby.","\"I told you I don't have any money right now! What else do you want me to do?!\"","\"No money? Doesn't your mother still have her company?! I don't believe you're broke! Believe it or not, I'll sue you in court!\"","\"Fine, go ahead! Do you think I'm afraid of you? Let's see if you can actually win!\"","An Ling had originally just cast a casual glance over.","Just as she was about to look away, she heard the woman's voice grow agitated: \"Lu Jingshen, do you have no shame?! I've been with you for so long, and yet you can't even bear to pay the divorce settlement! If you don't pay, how am I supposed to afford to live? How am I supposed to eat?!\"","At the familiar name, An Ling's gaze instantly froze.","She looked back and forth between their faces again.","It really seemed to be the male and female leads...","Talk about bad luck.","An Ling stepped aside slightly, afraid of getting caught in the crossfire.","Lu Jingshen had failed to secure a project today and was already in a foul mood. Having just stepped out after drinking, his head was heavy and throbbing. He had originally just wanted to go home and sleep.","But as soon as he came out, he ran into Zhou Wen, who had also been drinking here.","His head pounded even harder from the noise, and he rubbed his temples impatiently. \"I said I don't have any money! Can't you understand? Besides, didn't I give you several million before?! You still think it's not enough! What more do you want?!\"","Several million was already a massive fortune for normal people.","But Zhou Wen was long accustomed to a life of luxury, and her friends all knew she had married into a wealthy family. Going from extravagance to frugality was practically killing her.","A few million wasn't nearly enough for her to spend.","Moreover, the house they had agreed upon was gone too.","Her anger flared further, and she let out a cold laugh. \"You have money to drink, but no money to pay me. Lu Jingshen, you're really something! Just like before, you're utterly useless at everything except drinking!\"","Having been married to him, Zhou Wen knew exactly what to say to hit Lu Jingshen where it hurt the most.","Sure enough, Lu Jingshen's temper instantly flared. \"What did you say?! Fuck, what right does a gold-digger like you have to criticize me! You were a wealthy wife for a few days, and now you think you're better than everyone else! Let me tell you, Zhou Wen, you're destined to be poor for the rest of your life!\"","The two traded insults back and forth, drawing the attention of passing pedestrians who stopped to watch.","Zhou Wen was particularly concerned about her public image; she had come here to drink today specifically to hook another rich man.","Noticing the stares from the onlookers, her expression stiffened slightly, her beautifully made-up face struggling to maintain its composure.","She shot Lu Jingshen a look of disgust. Catching a glimpse of An Ling in the crowd from the corner of her eye, her gaze froze completely. Gritting her teeth, she quickly turned and hurried away.","An Ling cast a sidelong glance at her before looking away.","Just as she was about to look down and text An Zhou, a message suddenly popped up on her screen.","Shen Linyan: [Honey, look up ^^]","She raised her head.","A few meters away stood a man with an outstanding aura. His hair was meticulously styled, and his noble appearance in a tailored suit made him stand out strikingly in the crowd.","Smiling, An Ling put her phone away and walked over.","Shen Linyan took her hand and used his other hand to gently touch her face. \"My wife didn't drink too much today.\"","An Ling hummed indignantly. \"Don't make it sound like I always drink too much. I'm just prone to flushing; even a little bit of alcohol makes my face turn red.\"","They chatted as they walked toward the car.","Lu Jingshen, still irritated from his argument with Zhou Wen, looked up and saw An Ling not far away.","He paused for a moment, suddenly recalling the time An Ling had come to pick him up when he was drunk, and a faint light flickered in his eyes.","He was just about to step forward and chase after her.","But when he saw Shen Linyan beside her, Lu Jingshen's footsteps abruptly stopped, and his face turned an ugly shade.","He stood rooted to the spot, watching helplessly as the girl looked up and smiled while talking to Shen Linyan. The two of them held hands, fingers tightly intertwined in an incredibly intimate posture.","Shen Linyan guided An Ling into the passenger seat and closed the door.","Sensing the stare, he slowly lifted his gaze and shot a glance over. There was not a single trace of emotion in his pitch-black eyes.","As their eyes met, Lu Jingshen's expression stiffened slightly.","Remembering that phone call from before, he clenched his fists and ground his teeth.","...","Lu Jingshen dragged his exhausted body home. Just as he opened the door, a stack of dozens of papers was smacked directly into his face with a loud slap.","\"Hiss, you—\"","The edges of the papers were sharp, sending a sting of pain across his cheek. He was about to explode in anger, but when he saw his expressionless mother standing in front of him, all his fury was instantly extinguished.","\"Mom...\"","\"Don't call me Mom!\"","Lu Jincai stepped on the documents scattered at her feet, her eyes icy cold. \"Lu Jingshen, explain to me why you couldn't even hold onto this project!\"","\"Well...\" Lu Jingshen's face paled slightly, his lips parting. \"I can explain...\"","Lu Jincai's voice sharply rose. \"Explain what?! Do you know that every single project is crucial to us right now?! I gave you the easiest one! And this is how you repay me?!\"","Lu Jingshen hurriedly explained, \"Mom, no, it's... it's all Shen Linyan's fault! Yes, Shen Linyan hijacked it halfway! Shen Linyan has been targeting me!\"","\"Enough!\"","Lu Jincai interrupted him impatiently. Her icy gaze harbored disgust, and every word she spoke pierced his heart. \"Lu Jingshen, in the past, I only told you not to be too flashy so Shen Linyan wouldn't notice anything amiss. But look at you! You've actually turned into an incompetent piece of trash!\"","\"I haven't! Mom! This time was really an accident! This time it really was Shen Linyan intentionally targeting me! Give me one more...\"","Before he could finish, Lu Jincai cut him off coldly.","\"How many more chances do you need? Lu Jingshen! How could you be so inferior to Shen Linyan? From childhood until now, I've desperately fought to get you opportunities. I've constantly suppressed Shen Linyan, but what about you?! You can't even catch up to his shadow!\"","Looking at her own biological son, Lu Jincai felt both furious and deeply powerless.","She took a deep breath, frowning as she pinched the bridge of her nose.","\"Forget it. Don't involve yourself in the company's affairs anymore. Just go back to eating, drinking, and playing around.\"","She paused, unable to hold back a disappointed click of her tongue, and turned to head back to her room.","\"You're not even as good as your sister.\"","Lu Jingshen stood in place, gritting his teeth in silence.","The lighting cast dark shadows across his face. His knuckles turned white from clenching them so tightly, and his expression grew increasingly obscure and dark.","It was all Shen Linyan...","It was all Shen Linyan...!","His entire life had been ruined by Shen Linyan!","A surge of deep resentment bred in Lu Jingshen's eyes, gradually spiraling into a violent storm.","...","That night after showering, Shen Linyan stepped out of the bathroom.","The blanket on the bed was humped up in a small mound, and the sound of music from short videos drifted out.","Walking closer, he saw the young woman lying quietly under the covers, lying on her side and scrolling through her phone.","On the screen was a wedding video of another influencer.","After it finished, the system automatically played the next video.","But An Ling swiped back to the previous one, not forgetting to leave a like on it.","He paused for a moment, a certain part of his heart softening. Smiling, he slid under the covers, wrapped his arms around her waist, and gently nuzzled his nose against her hair.","\"What is my wife looking at?\"","\"Hmm? I'm just scrolling through videos.\" An Ling locked her phone and turned to bury her face in his chest. \"I feel like the algorithm is eavesdropping on us. It recommended several wedding videos to me.\"","His little wife muttered, \"They did a really beautiful job with it, though.\"","\"Ours will be beautiful too,\" Shen Linyan smiled, pressing a kiss to her forehead.","The young woman looked up at him with a playful blink. Tipping her head back, she pressed a soft kiss to his jaw, her voice sweet and lingering. \"Thank you, husband.\"","Shen Linyan kissed her cheek. \"Go to sleep. My wife has to work tomorrow.\"","With a soft click, the room went dark.","Shen Linyan closed his eyes, drifting off to sleep with the woman he loved held securely in his arms.","But when he opened his eyes again, the scene before him had completely changed.","In the dead of night, heavy snow drifted slowly from the sky. A woman lay motionless on the ground, the blood pooling beneath her staining the pristine snow a stark red. She just lay there, utterly lifeless.","For a moment, Shen Linyan couldn't process the sight. But as the woman's face came into focus, his pupils constricted in sheer terror. His voice trembled uncontrollably. \"Wife?\"","The horrifying scene flashed by in an instant.","The next second, Shen Linyan jolted awake from the nightmare.","He lay there gasping for air, his eyes wide open. A thin layer of cold sweat coated his forehead, and a lingering panic still danced in his eyes.","The woman in his arms seemed to be roused by his sudden movement. She let out a sleepy, confused murmur.","\"What's wrong?\""]},{"number":127,"title":"Chapter 127: I Am the Plot System That Replaces Your Body [Updated]","paragraphs":["The dream came so suddenly that Shen Linyan didn't even know if it was real or fake.","The dark night swallowed his senses.","In the pitch-black environment, only the sound of heavy, violent panting remained.","His breathing was erratic. He closed his eyes, trying to recall what had just happened in the dream, only to find that he couldn't remember a single thing.","His heart was occupied by an unprecedented sense of panic.","What did he dream about?","Why couldn't he remember?","Shen Linyan frowned deeply.","At this moment, his cheek was gently stroked by a woman, and the sweat on his forehead was tenderly wiped away.","\"What's wrong? Did you have a nightmare?\"","Coming back to his senses, he opened his eyes and wrapped his arms around the woman's waist, tightening his grip slightly.","Burying his face in the crook of her neck and breathing in her faint fragrance, the panic in Shen Linyan's heart finally began to dissipate. \"It must have been a nightmare. I don't really remember it. Did I wake you up?\"","An Ling hugged his waist. \"Do you want me to comfort you?\"","The man seemed to chuckle. His hoarse laughter carried a gravelly texture, adding a touch of sexiness. \"Yes. How is my wife going to comfort me?\"","An Ling cupped his face, kissed him on the lips, and then kissed his cheek. Her tone was like coaxing a child. \"Don't be scared, don't be scared. Dreams are all fake.\"","Shen Linyan smiled and nuzzled her cheek. \"Wife.\"","\"Hmm?\"","\"I love you.\"","An Ling paused. After a moment of silence, her eyes slowly curved into a smile. \"I love you too.\"","The night was deep, and the clock in the living room pointed to two in the morning.","An Ling opened her eyes, gently broke free from the man's embrace, got out of bed, put on a coat, and walked out of the room.","She walked to the kitchen, poured a glass of water, and brought it to her lips but hadn't drunk yet.","A mechanical voice instantly sounded in her ear.","[Can you pay attention to me today?]","She paused but quickly returned to normal, continuing to drink water as if pretending she hadn't heard it.","[You can continue to pretend you can't hear my voice. I will come to find you every day, and then every day I will make your husband dream of the scene of your death.]","\"...\"","An Ling instantly frowned and put down her glass. \"So you were the one who caused Shen Linyan's nightmare tonight?\"","[Yep.]","[But you don't need to worry. After he wakes up, he won't remember it.]","An Ling: \"...\"","One night, after the Shen family officially announced their bankruptcy, this system suddenly came to her.","Its opening sentence was:","[Hello, An Ling. I am the plot system that took over your body.]","Hearing this out of nowhere in the middle of the night was like an evil spirit coming to claim her life.","There was no way An Ling would pay attention to it; she would rather believe she was having auditory hallucinations.","Unexpectedly, this system was quite persistent, showing up every single night.","An Ling sat back on the sofa and pulled her coat tighter around herself.","\"What do you want from me? Hasn't the plot already finished? Or do you want to borrow my body again? How many years will it be this time?\"","[You misunderstand. I do not wish to use your body again. I came this time to apologize to you. I am very sorry for taking up two years of your time.]","\"?\"","An Ling twitched the corner of her mouth. \"You inexplicably made me a vicious supporting female character and made me go through so much, and now you know to come out and apologize? I don't accept it. You can leave.\"","[I know you won't accept it, but for the sake of the plot's completeness, I had to do so.]","The completeness of the plot?","An Ling's expression looked strange. \"Are you sure it's complete? Do you mean... Zhou Wen and Lu Jingshen? They are practically enemies now.\"","Tonight, those two almost got into a physical fight at the entrance of the clubhouse.","[I am only responsible for perfecting the plot during the course of the novel. What happens afterward has nothing to do with me.]","So, the moment the mission was completed, the system never appeared again.","Even when the ending changed multiple times later on, it never showed its face.","[I came to find you again this time simply because I detected that you are about to die, and I wanted to specially offer my apologies.]","An Ling was stunned. \"I'm really going to die? Hasn't the plot already changed?\"","[Are you sure it really changed?]","Hearing this, her expression froze, but the system's voice continued to ring in her ears.","[Miss An, haven't you noticed it too? No matter how much you try to avoid it, certain scenes will still occur, just in different forms or at different times.]","[The plot will not change; it will only adjust according to your actions.]","As its voice fell, An Ling pursed her lips and said nothing.","Sensing that the atmosphere had grown a bit cold, the system's tone changed.","[That's why I am needed to sort out the plot!]","[To express my apology, as compensation, I can help you transfer this death.]","An Ling's eyes widened in shock.","\"...What do you mean?\"","[Just like in your past life when the An family was swallowed up and went bankrupt, so this time, the target of bankruptcy became the Shen family. And your destined death is equally unavoidable; this plot point can only be transferred out.]","[Therefore, I can help you substitute your destined death onto Shen Linyan.]","[Do you really not care? In your past life, he indirectly caused your death, and he was the one who destroyed the An family. He rightfully owes you a life.]","As the system's voice faded, An Ling sat frozen on the sofa.","She didn't speak, her gaze falling on the marble tabletop in front of her.","On it lay the flowers Shen Linyan had given her tonight.","The rosebuds were half-open, their fragrance cloyingly sweet, looking exquisitely beautiful in the night as crystal-clear water drops slid down their petals.","[You can give me your answer anytime within three days. Otherwise, once the time is up, I will assume you have agreed.]","An unknown amount of time passed before the bedroom door was opened again.","An Ling lifted the blanket and tiptoed back into bed.","As soon as she lay down, a scorching hot arm wrapped around her waist.","An Ling was long accustomed to Shen Linyan's muscle memory. She glanced at the man's face, then closed her eyes and drifted off to sleep in his warm embrace.","Amidst the silence, Shen Linyan slowly opened his eyes.","His eyes were completely clear and awake, emotions surging within his pitch-black pupils.","A strange voice sounded in his ear.","[On the day she gives me her answer, do you want to know what her choice will be?]","Shen Linyan lowered his eyelids, looking at his sleeping wife in his arms. He bowed his head and gently kissed her forehead.","\"No need.\"","...","Morning, AL Group Building.","In the conference room, the atmosphere was heavy and quiet.","Everyone sat in their respective seats, holding their breath and concentrating.","The head of the marketing team was presenting at the front.","\"For this quarter's marketing investment, the overall return on investment has increased by 12% compared to the previous quarter. The channel conversion rate is stable, and moving forward, we plan to continue using this strategy...\"","Before he could finish speaking, the man lightly tapped his fountain pen against the tabletop.","\"Click—\"","A very soft sound, yet it instantly silenced everyone present.","For a moment, the conference room was so quiet that only the faint humming of the projector could be heard.","The man lazily lifted his eyelids and pointed at the data chart on the screen.","\"Wait a moment. The parameters here are incorrect; the calculated improvement rate is invalid.\"","The team leader's expression instantly froze, and a thin layer of sweat silently seeped out on his back. \"Apologies, Chairman Shen, this is...\"","\"Verify it again before presenting.\"","Shen Linyan's tone was calm. He lowered his eyes and said faintly, \"That will be all for today. Good work, everyone.\"","The man's face went blank with shock.","He... was let off the hook!?","Obviously, he wasn't the only one dumbfounded.","Everyone even forgot to stand up and see their boss off. They sat in their seats, completely stunned. It wasn't until Shen Linyan left that they instantly gathered together to discuss.","\"Damn, Chairman Shen is acting weird today. He didn't say a single harsh word.\"","\"Scared me to death. I'm not exaggerating, the moment I saw the data error, my heart skipped a beat, but Chairman Shen actually didn't say anything.\"","\"When I messed up the data last time, Chairman Shen definitely wasn't this gentle! Damn it, you got lucky!\"","\"When I saw Chairman Shen this morning, I thought he looked like he was in a bad mood and that whoever was presenting would be doomed. But nothing happened at all!\"","\"Maybe it's not a bad mood? I sneaked a few glances and noticed that Chairman Shen seemed to be spacing out.\"","\"Spacing out? Really? Secretary Chen, did something happen to Chairman Shen recently?\"","Secretary Chen, who was reviewing the assistant's meeting minutes, paused upon hearing this.","He looked up, pushed up his glasses, and slowly spoke under everyone's expectant gazes: \"Chairman Shen, he...\"","He deliberately dragged out the last syllable, then abruptly changed his tone, \"He hates it when people pry into his privacy. If Chairman Shen hears you guys gossiping, I won't speak up for you.\"","Everyone instantly shut their mouths.","After packing up his things, Secretary Chen left the conference room. Standing at the door of the office, he raised his hand and knocked.","\"Come in,\" a deep voice called out from inside.","Secretary Chen walked in and placed the documents on the desk. \"Chairman Shen, this is last month's financial report.\"","Shen Linyan picked up the file. Sensing that Secretary Chen was still standing there, he looked up and asked, \"Is there anything else?\"","Secretary Chen fell silent for a moment. \"Chairman Shen, you have another client to meet later...\"","Shen Linyan paused, then pinched the bridge of his nose and gave a soft \"Hmm.\" \"When?\"","Secretary Chen's expression was complicated. Those colleagues were actually right.","Having followed the young master for so long, he naturally noticed that his mood was a bit off today.","The only person capable of making the young master like this was probably his wife.","But the problem was, it didn't look like they had a fight...","While he was still pondering, the man's voice rang in his ears.","\"Prepare the car. We're taking a trip to the An Group later.\"","He was slightly taken aback, but quickly recovered and replied softly, \"Yes, sir.\"","Sure enough, it was related to his wife.","Just as he was about to turn and leave the office, the man's voice sounded from behind again.","\"Draft another contract for me.\"","...","An Group.","An Zhou had just finished a meeting when he saw an urgent message from his assistant.","[President An! Chairman Shen has made a sudden visit! He is in the reception room right now!]","He froze slightly, his brows furrowing.","He wouldn't visit without a reason.","Why did Shen Linyan come over so suddenly?","An Zhou: [Alone? Or is An Ling with him?]","Assistant: [Just him. No, to be exact, his company secretary is also here.]","An Zhou: [Got it, I'll head over now.]","Arriving at the reception room, An Zhou pushed the door open.","The man was sitting on the sofa. Hearing the sound, he looked up. His features were gentle and refined, his temperament noble, and his pitch-black eyes were as calm as water.","However, this man's terrifying abilities and ruthless methods had allowed him to break free from the Shen family and establish a new company in just a few days. It was no exaggeration to say that everyone was already wary of him.","An Zhou walked over to the opposite sofa and sat down. \"A rare guest. What brings Chairman Shen to see me?\"","Seeing this, Secretary Chen and the assistant tactfully retreated.","Shen Linyan pushed the contract forward.","\"I came this time to sign a contract with President An.\"","\"What contract?\" An Zhou picked up the document.","Before he could even flip through it, he heard the man say:","\"An entrusted operations management contract. The entrusting party is AL Group. After the entrustment, the majority of the company's shares and profits will still belong to Lingling. As the trustee, President An will help manage and operate AL Group.\"","\"Huh?\"","An Zhou looked confused. \"Entrusted management? Why do you need me to manage it? Aren't you still around?\"","Shen Linyan paused upon hearing this.","He lowered his eyes, gently rubbing the ring on his finger, and slightly parted his thin lips. \"This contract... will only take effect after my death. If I die, the company will briefly fall into a panic, and Lingling might not be able to handle it.\"","An Zhou was even more bewildered.","Why was he suddenly talking about dying when he was perfectly fine?","Did he get sick? Or what?","His expression became complicated for a moment. \"You... why do you sound so certain that you're going to die? Does An Ling know?\"","Shen Linyan just shook his head, stood up, and slowly said, \"She doesn't know, and I hope President An won't tell Lingling. I am merely securing a reasonable safeguard for my wife. I have other matters to attend to, so I'll take my leave.\"","An Zhou watched his departing back, then glanced at the document in his hand, completely baffled for a moment.","He took out his phone and sent a message to An Ling.","[Um... have you been very busy lately?]","An Ling: [What's up? Yes, I'm busy.]","On the other end of the phone, An Ling saw that everyone was eating their boxed lunches. After confirming there was nothing pressing, she walked over to a chair on the side to rest.","She unscrewed her water bottle and took a sip, just as a message from An Zhou came through.","[Oh, it's nothing major. I just feel that being too busy isn't good; it's detrimental to a couple's relationship.]","An Ling: [? Are you talking about me?]","This guy had just made Qin You angry yesterday, so why was he here claiming that she and Shen Linyan had relationship problems?","An Zhou: [I'm just saying. A friend of mine got into a fight with their partner because they were too busy.]","An Ling: [Shen Linyan and I have a great relationship. We haven't fought.]","As soon as the message was sent, a familiar mechanical voice rang in her ear.","[It's still hard to believe that you and Shen Linyan have such a good relationship. When going through the plot initially, I evaluated him as the type who has difficulty developing feelings, so I was especially worried that he wouldn't treat the female lead well.]","Hearing this, the expression on An Ling's face was hard to describe.","\"You were worried about his character setting, and you were worried about mine, yet you ended up possessing me? Also, I've wanted to say this for a long time: they've all broken character, so why don't you go possess them to complete the plot?\"","[I tried to correct it, but your likelihood of breaking character is greater than theirs. During the process, at least they can maintain the act. You are too true to your nature and can't pull it off.]","\"...\"","An Ling lowered her eyes and drank her water, ignoring it.","[Have you still not made up your mind about that decision from last time?]","She paused. Just as she was about to answer, her phone chimed again.","But when she clearly saw the contents, her eyes widened in shock.","An Zhou: [Sometimes it's not necessarily what's on the surface; it could be a psychological or physical problem. That's what I've seen people saying online.]","Psychological and physical problems?","Who? Shen Linyan?"]},{"number":128,"title":"Chapter 128: Return Her Husband to Her [Word Count Fulfilled]","paragraphs":["An Ling didn't quite understand this sentence.","Because when she went out with Shen Linyan in the morning, everything was perfectly normal, and there was absolutely no sign of any problem.","[I'll be careful when I go home tonight.]","Pausing for a moment, she slowly typed on the screen again.","[Brother, if I...]","She paused, then deleted it.","[So when are you and Sister Qin You getting married?]","An Zhou: [Ahem, why are you asking this all of a sudden?]","An Ling: [Remember to give me the first invitation when the time comes.]","An Zhou: [You're my sister, of course you'll be the first.]","An Ling lowered her eyes and pursed her lips. From behind, a colleague called out to her.","\"Ah Leng, the director is looking for you.\"","\"Coming.\"","She put away her phone.","She hadn't expected today's scenes to shoot straight until midnight.","Taking the elevator upstairs, she took out her phone and checked the time.","12:30.","The system's voice sounded in her ear.","[Two days left.]","Her movements paused, and her tone was calm, \"You're just like a debt collector.\"","[Because I can tell you want to choose yourself. Why don't you choose Shen Linyan?]","[Are you afraid he'll hate you after finding out? But I guess he probably wouldn't refuse; he actually feels guilty towards you in his heart as well.]","An Ling stared at the jumping numbers in the elevator.","\"I know he wouldn't refuse, which is exactly why I don't want him to die.\"","Shen Linyan had always felt guilty towards her because of that incident. Even if she said it was fine, he wouldn't let it go.","But if she let Shen Linyan die in her place, would she be happy? Would she feel like she had gotten her revenge?","If she survived, she would only suffer even more torment.","Because then it would be her who caused Shen Linyan's death.","An Ling said softly, \"All I want is for my family not to repeat their fate from the previous life, that is enough.\"","For them to escape the destiny of their past lives was already enough for her.","As for Shen Linyan...","An Ling lowered her eyes and rubbed the wedding ring on her hand.","\"I am actually selfish too...\"","The elevator doors opened, and she walked out, arriving at her front door.","\"Beep—\"","The lights in the entryway gently flickered on.","Only a floor lamp in the corner was turned on in the living room. Its warm yellow light spilled over the sofa, wrapping the man's silhouette in an exceptionally soft glow.","He wasn't wearing formal clothes, just a loose, dark set of loungewear. His long legs were casually crossed, and he held a book in his hands, his fingertips quietly turning a page.","Hearing the noise, he looked up. The coldness in his eyes instantly melted away, tinted with a touch of warmth and softness: \"My wife is back.\"","An Ling didn't say anything, just lightened her footsteps and walked over.","The sofa was very soft. She straddled the man's lap, wrapped her arms around his neck and shoulders, and gently rested her chin on his shoulder. Like a small animal, she rubbed against him with a hint of coquettishness.","Shen Linyan naturally put down the book, raised a hand to hold her waist, and pulled her closer into his embrace. He turned his head and kissed her face, his lips pressing against her cheek as he spoke in a low, gentle voice: \"Are you tired?\"","She let out a soft \"Mm,\" her voice mushy and filled with reliance. She was almost half-leaning on him, her nose brushing past the faint scent of cedarwood on his neck: \"So sleepy.\"","He didn't ask any more questions. He raised a hand to stroke her hair, while his other hand steadily supported her, letting her rest in his arms.","The light from the floor lamp fell on their overlapping figures. It was so quiet that only their breathing could be heard.","An Ling leaned into the crook of his neck, her nose gently nuzzling against his familiar scent.","The warm yellow floor lamp shone diagonally across the man's profile.","His eyelashes drooped, casting a shallow shadow under his eyes. The lines of his nose were clean and sharp, his lips pressed into a faint line. His usually cold aura was softened a bit by the lighting.","An Ling blinked.","She just didn't know how long Shen Linyan would miss her after she died, or how long it would take for him to marry a new wife.","Would it be a few days, a few months, or perhaps a few years?","Would he treat his new wife like this too?","A few seconds later, she slowly leaned in and kissed the side of the man's neck.","The moment her soft lips pressed against him, Shen Linyan's body tensed slightly. He looked down and met the girl's clear, beautiful almond eyes.","Her expression was innocent, blinking as if asking him what was wrong.","Shen Linyan looked down at her, his pitch-black eyes like a whirlpool, gentle yet bottomless.","His long fingers hooked under her chin. He slowly lowered his head, parted his lips, and gently took her lips into his own, tenderly sucking and nibbling.","An Ling's eyelashes fluttered. Hugging his neck, she responded with a slightly clumsy cooperation.","Their breaths intertwined, gradually becoming heated and damp in the confined space.","Time ticked by. By the time they parted, both of their breaths were unsteady, and an ambiguous atmosphere filled the air.","There was a faint tendency of things getting out of hand.","But they stopped before crossing the line.","Shen Linyan rose slightly, his thumb brushing past the corner of the girl's lips. His voice was a little hoarse, \"Wife, it's time to take a shower.\"","\"Why do I have to go wash up now?\" An Ling feigned confusion and blinked, even deliberately leaning closer, asking a question she already knew the answer to. \"Can't it wait a bit? Hmm?\"","The girl's touch grew closer, carrying a hint of provocation.","Shen Linyan's movements suddenly froze.","Her fragrance lingered at the tip of his nose, and his temples throbbed.","His Adam's apple bobbed. The hand holding the woman tightened, pulling her closer against his chest. He lowered his head and kissed her earlobe, his hot breath suppressing his desire. \"You want it? You'll blame me again tomorrow when you can't get up for work.\"","As he spoke, his large hand skillfully slipped under the hem of her clothes.","Trying to ease the tension in other ways, just like before.","But An Ling pressed down on his arm. Mimicking his manner, she tilted her head up to his ear and slowly said with a smile, word by word:","\"Hubby, tomorrow I am not going to work.\"","As soon as she finished speaking, she was lifted straight up from the sofa.","An Ling instinctively wrapped her arms around the man's shoulders, and her lips were captured.","\"Click—\"","The door closed, and she was instantly pressed against the door panel.","Before she could even let out a gasp, all her sounds were swallowed up.","...","By the time she came out from her shower, An Ling was too exhausted to speak.","She lay on the bed, her waist embraced from behind. A warm chest pressed against her back, and the man's chin rested on the top of her head.","Everything was just like before.","An Ling groggily thought, isn't Shen Linyan perfectly fine like this?","So what on earth did An Zhou mean by those words?","As she was thinking, the man's voice sounded in her ear, \"Isn't tomorrow a workday? Why isn't my wife going to work?\"","She paused, suddenly remembering what she had planned to do.","\"Another colleague is taking my shift tomorrow.\"","She turned around and looked up at the man, \"Are you busy tomorrow? Can you spend time with me?\"","The man's body paused slightly. The emotions in his eyes were hard to read in the dark night, and his jaw tightened slightly.","He slowly lowered his eyes and tenderly kissed her face,","\"Sorry, honey, I might not be free tomorrow.\"","An Ling was stunned.","After a moment of silence, she pursed her lips, curved her eyes, and said softly, \"Alright.\"","It was a pity she had deliberately finished all her work to clear her schedule for a day off in advance.","She had originally planned to go on a date with Shen Linyan to deepen their relationship.","That way, even if she died, Shen Linyan would remember her for a bit longer.","Maybe his guilt would run a bit deeper, too...","She was selfish.","She couldn't bear for Shen Linyan to die; she wanted him to live.","Yet, she didn't want Shen Linyan to forget her either.","Whether out of love or out of guilt.","At the very least, he wanted her to remember him as her husband.","The night was deep. Shen Linyan slowly opened his eyes.","He cast his gaze down at the girl sleeping soundly in his arms, lowering his head to gently nuzzle her cheek.","The system was just marveling at how good their relationship was when it heard the man suddenly speak:","\"I remembered that dream.\"","He remembered exactly how his wife had died.","On a snowy night, his wife had died on the streets, and he remembered whose hands she died by.","The system was stunned at first, then instantly panicked.","[Huh?? You remembered? That's impossible, I clearly...]","It had clearly sealed away that memory.","Remembering that it often accidentally dropped plot points into people's minds, the system's voice got stuck.","[Then are you going to take her place? I think it'll be difficult; An Ling seems to want to choose herself.]","Shen Linyan didn't speak.","By the faint light from the bedside lamp, he traced the girl's silhouette inch by inch, as if trying to carve her image deeply into his eyes.","He closed his eyes, kissed her forehead tenderly, and spoke in a very soft voice.","\"Then I'll act before she can make her choice.\"","...","Left alone at home with free time, An Ling didn't really have anything else to do.","Remembering the cookies she had failed to bake last time, she decided to finish the task.","Who asked Shen Linyan to laugh at her failure last time?","Before she died, she absolutely had to show him a successful batch.","Besides, she felt that the ingredients she used last time weren't quite right. This time, she was going to follow the tutorial's ingredient list exactly.","There was a large mall near the residential area with a supermarket on the basement floor. In the afternoon, An Ling changed her clothes and went there to shop.","After buying flour and white sugar, and just as she finished picking out the butter based on a picture, her gaze shifted to the yogurt nearby.","Just as she picked it up, the system's voice suddenly rang out,","[Friendly reminder: you walked here, by yourself, alone.]","\"...\"","She turned her head to look; the shopping cart behind her was already half full.","The system twisted the knife.","[Actually, there's no need for you to buy so much. You'll be dead in a few days anyway.]","\"...Can you just not speak?\"","An Ling put down the yogurt, hesitated for a moment, and ultimately put all the snacks back before heading to the checkout line.","After returning home, she took out the ingredients and remade the cookies according to the tutorial.","Mixing and shaping took about thirty minutes in total. Finally, she put the cookies into the oven and waited another fifteen minutes.","Before opening it, An Ling stood in front of the oven, closed her eyes, and prayed.","[What are you doing?]","\"Praying.\" An Ling pulled open the oven.","She looked at the baked cookies on the tray and carefully compared them with the picture on her phone.","The color seemed about right.","Without Shen Fuyuan here this time, An Ling had to pick one up and taste it herself. After taking a hesitant bite, her eyes lit up. \"It's a success!\"","She had actually succeeded!","She took a photo and originally wanted to send it to Shen Linyan, but then she paused.","She could save it as a surprise for him tonight.","Seeing that the sky was already getting dark, she took the opportunity to text him.","An Ling: [Hubby, are you coming home for dinner tonight? I have a surprise! ^^]","Shen Linyan: [Sorry, I'm not coming back.]","She froze slightly.","An Ling: [Alright, then when will you be done with work tonight? Should we go watch a movie sometime in the next couple of days? (๑•.•๑)]","She had promised Shen Linyan to go to the movies last time, but they had kept putting it off. She wanted to watch one with him again before she died.","Shen Linyan: [I'm away on a business trip for the next few days.]","She stood rooted to the spot. The white light from the screen illuminated her face, making the girl's expression look completely bewildered.","An Ling: [You went on a business trip? Why didn't you tell me?]","This time, the other side remained silent for a minute.","Finally, a short reply was sent over.","Shen Linyan: [Did I need to tell you?]","The cold words looked so glaring on the screen.","An Ling's mind went blank for a moment. She gripped her phone helplessly, even thinking she had messaged the wrong person.","All the joy and anticipation that had filled her heart vanished into nothingness in an instant.","Her eyes stung. She pursed her lips tightly, her fingertips trembling so much she could barely type clearly.","She didn't understand why things had suddenly turned out like this.","Everything had been perfectly fine just last night.","[Shen Linyan, what do you mean by this?]","This time, the other side fell into an even longer silence.","She tried calling him, but he hung up immediately.","Shen Linyan: [I'm sorry.]","An Ling's eyes were red. She pressed her lips together as she stared at the message.","Before she could ask him anything else.","More messages followed immediately.","Shen Linyan: [An Ling, I can't pretend to like you anymore.]","Shen Linyan: [I was only good to you because of guilt from our past life.]","Shen Linyan: [I'm sorry, I lied to you.]","The messages came one after another, making the phone buzz continuously.","An Ling's pupils shrank, and she stood there in a daze.","What did he mean pretending to like her...","The system's voice rang in her ears.","[I told you. When I did the assessment back then, Shen Linyan was categorized as someone who finds it very hard to develop feelings. He really was just acting out of guilt towards you.]","An Ling still looked stunned, as if she hadn't processed it yet. Her eyes were red, teardrops clinging to her eyelashes.","The system was silent for a moment before slowly speaking up,","[You still haven't given me an answer.]","[So you can still choose to let Shen Linyan die.]","An Ling's eyelids fluttered slightly.","\"Was it you...\" she suddenly spoke, her voice hoarse. \"You told Shen Linyan about my ending, didn't you.\"","\"System, what exactly is my ending.\"","The air grew quiet for a moment.","A moment later, the system's emotionless mechanical voice sounded.","[According to the original timeline, your ending this time is to die from Lu Jingshen's revenge. Lu Jingshen is jealous of Shen Linyan and harbors deep resentment. He stalked you two multiple times, and finally, during one of your dates with Shen Linyan, he would pull a knife on you in an attempt to get back at Shen Linyan.]","At this point, the system paused, but ultimately continued:","[Just five minutes ago, Shen Linyan advanced the plot for you. He took the initiative to find Lu Jingshen and provoked him...]","An Ling's pupils shrank sharply, her voice trembling. \"What?\"","...","Outside, the sky had grown dark.","The sky, which had been clear for days, began to pour down heavy snow tonight.","Feathery snowflakes fell thick and fast, turning the world into a vast expanse of white, like shredded clouds.","The usually noisy system had fallen silent at some point.","An Ling took a taxi to the location the system provided. A crowd had already gathered there, with police cars and an ambulance parked by the side of the road.","People around were discussing in low voices.","\"What happened here?\"","\"I heard a young man got stabbed, and the killer ran away.\"","\"Oh my god... really?\"","Hearing this, An Ling's body shuddered. Trembling all over, she stared blankly and muttered in a low voice, \"Impossible, it's fake... It can't be Shen Linyan...\"","But when she saw the familiar face of the man on the stretcher, An Ling's pupils dilated in shock, her breath catching in her throat.","Her heart almost stopped beating.","Everything around her instantly became exceptionally quiet, leaving only the sky full of falling snow drifting down slowly, so slow it felt as though time had stopped.","She lost all her strength and slumped to the ground, her heart aching in spasms. Her mind was in complete chaos, her eyes losing focus. Her vision gradually blurred as she let scalding tears patter onto the back of her hands.","How could Shen Linyan die...","He hadn't even eaten her cookies yet,","Hadn't gone to the movies with her yet...","He had promised to marry her.","Unable to suppress the whimpers rising in her throat any longer, An Ling broke down in tears, her voice trembling.","\"I don't want this... I don't want it to be like this...\"","Give her husband back to her."]},{"number":129,"title":"Chapter 129: Madam [Word Count Fulfilled]","paragraphs":["In the hospital, crowds of people came and went.","In front of the operating room, hurried footsteps broke the silence.","An Zhou rushed over immediately after receiving the news.","When he saw the scene before him, the words on the tip of An Zhou's tongue instantly vanished.","Under the pale incandescent light, the young woman sat on the bench. Her clothes were stained with dust, her head hung low, and slightly damp hair slipped from her shoulders, hiding half of her face in the shadows.","The reddened corners of her eyes drooped, concealing the emotions beneath them. She gently stroked the ring on her finger. Her lips were completely drained of color, adding a touch of shattered fragility to her appearance.","An Zhou's expression was complex. He glanced at the operating room, its light still on, and then looked at Secretary Chen beside him.","Secretary Chen sighed and shook his head slightly, his expression equally complicated.","An Zhou remained silent for a moment before stepping forward.","\"Lingling, Mom and Dad are on a flight back.\" He placed his hand gently on the young woman's shoulder.","Hearing this, An Ling merely gave a soft \"Mm.\"","An Zhou hesitated to speak.","He truly hadn't expected things to turn out like this. Just yesterday, he had reminded the two of them to take care of their relationship, and today, this happened...","\"Don't worry, medical technology is very advanced nowadays. He will be fine.\"","An Ling's eyelashes trembled, but she didn't reply.","She tightly gripped the ring in her hand.","The light above the operating room went out, and the doors opened.","Liang Chen, wearing surgical scrubs, walked out from inside.","He took off his mask, exchanged a glance with Gu Xiaochi and Wang Yihong in the corner, and then looked at An Ling in her seat.","\"The patient's bleeding is temporarily under control, but he suffered massive blood loss from the trauma and is currently still in a coma. The next few days are a high-risk period, and complications could worsen his condition at any time. We will do our absolute best to stabilize him.\"","Seeing this, the System, which had been silent for a long time, spoke in a low voice:","[The three-day limit hasn't arrived yet, so Shen Linyan is currently still in a coma. Tomorrow is the last day. If you still haven't given me an answer by then, I will assume you have chosen Shen Linyan.]","[As for Shen Linyan, he also hopes you will choose him.]","An Ling kept her eyes lowered, her expression very faint. It seemed as if there were no emotions left in her eyes, only a blank numbness.","After a long silence, she finally opened her mouth, her voice hoarse.","\"I want to see him.\"","The scene grew somewhat quiet for a moment.","But right then, a voice came from behind.","\"Miss An Ling.\"","Turning her head to look, she saw several men in police uniforms standing behind her.","The leading man flashed his badge.","\"We are from the Jing City Public Security Bureau. Regarding the attack on your husband, Shen Linyan, we have some questions we'd like to ask you. We hope you can cooperate and come to the station to make a statement.\"","...","The police station.","An officer poured a cup of water and handed it to her. \"Drink some hot water to warm up. It's cold tonight.\"","An Ling took the paper cup. \"Thank you.\"","He sat back in front of the computer.","\"We have currently locked onto a suspect. The surveillance cameras on that street captured the entire process of Lu Jingshen committing the crime. We have also dispatched personnel to apprehend him. We called you over today just to ask a few supplementary questions.\"","\"Moreover, according to Mr. Shen's phone, you were the last person he contacted.\"","An Ling was stunned.","She instantly recalled the few messages the man had sent her.","She subconsciously tightened her grip on the paper cup, lowered her eyes, and nodded gently.","\"I will cooperate.\"","The police asked a few routine questions.","\"Where were you on the night of the incident?\"","\"At home.\"","\"How is your relationship with your husband normally? Do you usually argue?\"","\"It's very good. We have never argued.\"","Just as they were speaking, a burst of noise suddenly erupted outside.","\"I really don't know where he went. It's useless for you to look for me. I stopped caring about him a long time ago.\"","This somewhat familiar tone and speaking style made An Ling pause.","She slowly raised her eyes and met the gaze of the middle-aged woman outside.","After their eyes met, the woman's voice abruptly stopped, and her expression stiffened slightly.","The officer was taking notes. Looking up, he saw the young woman staring elsewhere. Following her gaze, he subconsciously spoke:","\"After Lu Jingshen went into hiding, we brought her in, but she says she knows absolutely nothing about what Lu Jingshen did. We are still investigating.\"","Hearing this, An Ling had already recognized who the woman in front of her was.","She took one look, then indifferently withdrew her gaze.","After simply finishing the statement, the officer stood up. \"Thank you for your cooperation. We will find him as soon as possible to give you and your husband an explanation.\"","\"Alright.\" An Ling nodded and stood up to leave.","Just as she turned around, she was called back.","\"Oh right, please wait a moment. There's still something to give you.\"","She turned her head back, and her gaze paused slightly when she saw the item on the desk.","Inside a transparent sealed bag lay a mobile phone.","\"This is your husband's. You can take it back now.\"","After leaving the police station, she had barely taken a few steps.","The woman's voice came from behind her.","\"Wait a minute.\"","Recognizing the voice, she didn't stop and continued walking forward.","Seeing this, Lu Jincai wanted to get angry, but remembering tonight's events, she suppressed her temper. \"I just came to tell you that I truly don't know where Lu Jingshen is. As for the things he did, I am completely unaware.\"","She wasn't foolish enough to let Lu Jingshen do such a thing. After all, if he got caught, the reputations of the Lu family and Shen Fuyuan would be destroyed along with him.","An Ling stopped in her tracks and turned her head to look over.","Her gaze fell on the woman's face, her voice devoid of any fluctuation.","\"So? What are you trying to say?\"","Lu Jincai gritted her teeth. \"So it's useless for you to retaliate against us. If you want revenge, go get revenge on Lu Jingshen, but I don't know where Lu Jingshen is either.\"","An Ling looked at her for a few seconds before suddenly speaking:","\"I will get my revenge.\"","With that said, she turned and left.","...","Making the statement at the police station took over an hour. By the time she returned to the hospital, the night was already deep.","The hospital corridors were somewhat desolate, with only a few nurses doing their rounds. A faint smell of disinfectant floated in the air.","An Ling stood in front of the hospital room, her hand resting on the door handle.","Click—","The door lock turned. Inside the room, the lighting was dim, and it was so quiet it was almost deathly still, leaving only the rhythmic beeping of the monitor.","The man lay quietly on the hospital bed, IV tubes meandering along his arm. His usually tall and straight figure now looked thin and frail under the white sheets, and his face was an almost transparent pale.","His eyelashes drooped, lacking any of his usual gentle aloofness, leaving only a fragile serenity. A transparent oxygen mask covered his face, rising and falling gently with his faint breaths.","It was just as if he had fallen asleep at home like he usually did.","An Ling's eye sockets gradually reddened. She walked over slowly and sat on the chair.","She lowered her eyes, raised her hand, and, just like before, her fingertips slowly hooked around the man's fingers.","But this time, the man would no longer give her any response.","\"Shen Linyan, how could you fall asleep here...\"","In the quiet hospital room, the young woman's voice was very soft.","\"Aren't you going to sleep at home?\"","\"If you don't go home to sleep, I'll be angry. I won't sleep in your room anymore.\"","The hospital room remained completely quiet.","No one gave her a response.","No one would wipe away her tears.","And no one would gently coax her anymore.","An Ling stared at the man's fingers. Tears flowed down unconsciously, the scalding drops smashing against the back of the man's hand.","Her lips trembled, her eyes were entirely red, and the end of her sentence quivered.","\"Hubby, you've picked me up so many times. This time, let me take you home... okay?\"","She didn't want to go home alone.","Please don't let her go home alone.","...","In the end, it was An Zhou who came over and took her home.","When the car arrived downstairs at her apartment complex, An Zhou stuck his head out of the window.","\"Go home and take a hot shower. I'll come pick you up for the hospital later. It's okay, don't worry, Shen Linyan will wake up.\"","An Ling nodded gently. The corners of her eyes still bore the red flush from crying. As if suddenly remembering something, she looked up again. \"Brother, can you help look after the AL Group for now...\"","\"Shen Linyan already spoke to me about it.\"","An Zhou rested his elbow on the window. Whenever he thought about this matter, he couldn't help but click his tongue in astonishment.","\"Does that guy have prophetic abilities? Two days before his accident, he suddenly came to me and said he wanted to sign a contract with me. The general gist was that if he died, I would need to help manage the AL Group.\"","Hearing this, An Ling froze.","She pursed her lips, saying nothing, merely nodding to show she understood.","......","Beep—","Opening the door, the interior of the house remained exactly as she had left it.","The cookies she had baked were still on the table, though they had long since gone completely cold.","An Ling glanced at the cookies on the table and walked over to sit on the sofa.","Huihui jumped up, rubbing its head against her embrace, meowing constantly.","\"I'm sorry, are you hungry?\"","She had rushed out in such a hurry earlier that she forgot to put food out for Huihui.","She got up to pour some cat food.","As Huihui buried its head to eat, she simply sat beside it, looking down and stroking its fur.","As the clock struck past midnight, the System's voice rang out.","[It is the last day. Are you still not going to tell me your decision? Will it be yourself, or do you choose Shen Linyan?]","She lowered her eyes, slowly petting the kitten's head, and spoke unhurriedly:","\"You said before that you chose to have Shen Linyan die in my place because he indirectly caused my death in our past life, right?\"","[Yes, this is meant as compensation for you...]","\"But aren't you the one who truly killed me?\"","Caught off guard by this statement, the System paused.","[What?]","\"Is that not the case?\"","An Ling's tone was flat, devoid of any discernible emotion. \"You said it yourself, my temper wouldn't follow the original plot at all. If you had just let me handle it from the start, I might not have died.\"","She slowly raised her eyes. \"So the one who truly caused my death is you, the System, isn't it?\"","The System froze for a moment, and then its mechanical voice sounded somewhat hesitant.","[Uh... well, although that is true, I do not have a physical body, so I cannot die in your place...]","\"Then just possess someone else and die.\"","An Ling blocked off its escape route. \"Don't tell me it can't be done. You said that if you wanted to alter the plot, you could actually possess anyone at will.\"","[...]","It wished it hadn't chatted so much earlier.","[Then who do you want me to possess?]","By now, this question already had an answer.","The corners of An Ling's eyes were tinged with red as she slowly spat out three words:","\"Lu Jingshen.\"","The moment this name came out, her heart gave a violent lurch under the constraints of morality.","She had never thought about going against anyone; she just wanted to live her own life well.","But not holding grudges had only resulted in things escalating.","If this was the behavior of a vicious supporting female character.","Then she could truly be a vicious supporting female character for once, for the sake of her husband.","......","After taking a shower and packing some clothes at home, An Ling rode in An Zhou's car back to the hospital.","There was another bed in the companion ward. She placed her luggage bag on the table and sat on the sofa to apply some eye drops.","She had cried quite a few times today, and her eyes were sore.","An Zhou nagged her with instructions from the side.","\"If anything happens tonight, call me. Mom and Dad will be home tomorrow. If you're scared being alone, you can tell me, and I'll take you back.\"","An Ling finished putting in the eye drops, leaned back on the sofa, and closed her eyes. Hearing this, she replied with a muffled voice, \"Got it. It's late, brother, hurry back and rest.\"","An Zhou took one last look at her before finally opening the door and leaving.","Hearing the door close, An Ling touched her eyes and slowly opened them.","After the eye drops, they weren't as dry and stinging as before.","She turned her head to look at the man on the hospital bed and got up to walk over.","The man on the bed had a peaceful sleeping face. Even wearing a ventilator mask couldn't conceal his handsome features.","An Ling blinked and watched him for a while.","The doctor said she could chat with Shen Linyan, as comatose patients still retained a certain degree of hearing.","She reached out and gently brushed aside the stray hairs on his forehead.","\"I'm going to wipe your face.\"","Taking a wet wipe from her bag, she meticulously wiped his face.","She leaned close to the man's ear and whispered, \"This is what you get for carelessly trusting that System. See, you didn't even get to eat my cookies. I succeeded this time, so you can't laugh at me anymore.\"","Remembering those messages, An Ling's movements paused.","She muttered, \"You even sent me those messages. I was really angry at the time...\"","After wiping his face, she stared at his face in silence for a moment, then leaned down and kissed his eyes.","\"Forget it. Just wake up soon, and I won't hold it against you.\"","She had previously gotten Shen Linyan's ring back from the nurse, and she slipped it back onto his finger.","It was already very late. An Ling took off her coat and lay down under the covers.","The quiet, high-class ward was empty and silent. All that remained around her was the rhythmic and dull sound of the ventilator, thumping one by one like a heartbeat suspended in midair.","An Ling's eyes were sore and she wanted to sleep, but her mind was completely awake. The unfamiliar environment and unfamiliar scents left her without a trace of sleepiness.","She sat up, got out of bed, and walked to the man's bedside, her gaze sweeping over his large bed a few times.","She leaned into his ear and whispered, \"Shen Linyan, can I sleep with you?\"","After waiting a few seconds, she nodded. \"If you don't speak, I'll take it as a yes.\"","She climbed onto the edge of the bed as lightly as she could, not daring to touch the tubes on his body. She only dared to carefully hook her fingertips around his fingers, which were pierced with IV needles.","She closed her eyes. At the tip of her nose, she could smell the faint scent of disinfectant mixed with the crisp aroma of cedarwood emanating from him.","This time, sleepiness quickly washed over her.","Her consciousness gradually blurred.","When she opened her eyes again, An Ling found herself standing by a street.","Her pupils dilated slightly, almost instantly recognizing that this was the place where Shen Linyan had been killed.","Memories flooded her mind. Her eyes stung with tears, and she backed away continuously, wanting to leave this place, only to suddenly bump into a warm chest behind her.","The next second, an arm wrapped around her waist.","The familiar scent of cedarwood enveloped her.","Her expression froze, and she looked up in a daze.","The man before her had a handsome and refined face, his dark overcoat dusted with a thin layer of snow.","Snow fell on the top of his head and his brow bone, condensing into a very faint frost, making his facial features appear even more distinct and cold.","He lowered his eyes to look at her gently, his lips curving into a very shallow smile. Raising his hand, he tenderly cupped her face.","\"My wife.\""]},{"number":130,"title":"Chapter 130: I Come to Find You [Word Count Supplemented]","paragraphs":["Under the night sky, snowflakes fluttered. The man's eyes curved gently, his familiar deep voice, the warm touch of his palm.","It was so beautiful, like a false dream.","Yet in reality, her husband was lying comatose on a cold hospital bed, his life hanging by a thread.","She stared blankly at the man before her. Her heart ached and swelled. Her lips parted, but she couldn't utter a single word.","I missed you so much...","I missed you so much.","She reached out and carefully gripped the hem of his clothes.","Noticing her movement, Shen Linyan looked down, smiling as he took her hand and tucked it into his pocket. \"Are you cold? Why did you come out wearing so little?\"","This once-customary gesture now left An Ling frozen in place.","A sour ache rose in her nose, and her eyes grew red. She lowered her head as tears slid silently down her cheeks. Her trembling lips parted slightly.","\"I came to find you.\"","\"Why didn't you come home...\"","\"Shen Linyan, I couldn't find you. I couldn't find you...\"","Her cheeks were held by his hands, his thumbs gently wiping away the tears at the corners of her eyes. The man leaned down and placed a soft kiss on the corner of her eye, kissing away the bitter teardrops.","\"My wife, don't cry.\"","He pulled her into his embrace, cradling the back of her head with his palm. He lowered his head to kiss the top of her hair, coaxing her softly, \"I went to buy flowers for you. I'll come home as soon as I'm done.\"","An Ling pressed against his chest, so close she could almost hear his rapid yet steady heartbeat.","With every breath, her nose was filled with the man's clean, crisp scent.","She looked up at him, her voice muffled and choked with sobs, \"Will you come home right after you buy them?\"","Shen Linyan looked down into her teary, red eyes. He slowly lowered his head until their noses touched.","He tilted his head slightly, his high nose bridge brushing her cheek, and planted a doting kiss on the corner of her lips.","\"I'll come home right after, honey.\"","\"Will you bake cookies for me when I get back?\"","The man's breath brushed against her skin, warm and lingering.","An Ling looked slightly dazed as tears instantly spilled from her eyes.","In that moment, she couldn't even tell if this was an illusion or reality.","She hugged his waist and gave a soft, tearful affirmative hum.","The surrounding scenery began to fade, and the man's face before her grew increasingly blurry.","Her consciousness gradually awakened from the chaos.","An Ling slowly opened her eyes.","Sunlight from outside the window filtered through the curtains. The bed was wide. The man lay quietly on the other side, his face pale and his long eyelashes resting on his cheeks. His breathing relied on the machine, his throat rising and falling slightly.","The cold, mechanical hum of the machine instantly dragged An Ling back to reality.","She slowly sat up and raised a hand to touch her face, only to feel cold, dried tear tracks.","She sniffled, her eyes red as she looked at the man beside her.","\"Did you do that on purpose?\"","\"You're not allowed to enter my dreams again until you wake up, do you hear me?\"","The comatose man naturally did not respond.","An Ling got out of bed and put on her coat. After washing up, she came out and wiped Shen Linyan's face and neck.","Just as she sat down, the ward door was opened from the outside.","Seeing a doctor and a nurse enter, An Ling was about to stand up and greet them.","Liang Chen quickly raised his hand and pressed it down, gesturing for her not to bother.","He smiled and said, \"I'm just here to check on Shen Linyan's condition.\"","He took out a penlight and checked Shen Linyan's pupils, then checked his temperature, blood pressure, and other vital signs.","\"Everything looks pretty good so far, so don't worry too much. You can talk to him more these days, and you can also help massage his muscles.\"","An Ling nodded. \"Okay, thank you, Doctor.\"","After Liang Chen finished filling out the chart, he glanced at the man on the bed and handed the clipboard back to the nurse behind him. \"You can head out first.\"","\"Okay, Dr. Liang.\"","The nurse took the chart and turned to leave.","Seeing the door close, An Ling asked, \"Is there something else?\"","A trace of tension was hidden in her voice.","Liang Chen quickly waved his hands. \"No, no, everything is perfectly normal. It's just that there were too many people around earlier to properly say hello.\"","An Ling was taken aback. \"Say hello?\"","Her gaze swept over Liang Chen's face.","Did she know anyone who was a doctor?","Seeing the confusion in her eyes, Liang Chen spoke up to remind her, \"When Shen Linyan had a fever last time, I was the one who treated him.\"","Seeing An Ling's expression of sudden realization, he smiled and said, \"Actually, I'm also Shen Linyan's friend, Liang Chen. There were two others at the door of the operating room yesterday. The three of us are Shen Linyan's good friends of many years.\"","An Ling blinked, her eyes curving into a polite smile as she spoke. \"I see. I'm sorry, I wasn't in a very good state last night, so I didn't really pay attention.\"","Last night, it did seem like two unfamiliar men had come to the hospital, but she had been in no mood to care about such things at the time.","Besides, even if she had greeted them, her face blindness meant she wouldn't have remembered them anyway.","\"It's fine. The circumstances were special, and they didn't want to bother you too much.\"","Liang Chen revealed a slightly helpless smile. \"Mainly, we just never expected to meet you under these circumstances.\"","An Ling paused, lowered her eyes, and let out a soft chuckle.","\"I didn't expect it either.\"","Liang Chen stated the purpose of his visit: \"So I'll help out with everything else, you don't need to worry. No one should be coming to visit Shen Linyan for now. I've told everyone outside that he needs quiet rest, so those two friends won't come over either.\"","An Ling was slightly startled, then nodded. \"Okay.\"","She had just been worrying about her face blindness and how she would recognize people if they came to visit.","Fewer people around was actually a good thing.","After saying that, Liang Chen looked down at his watch. \"I have other patients to see. If you have any questions, you can come find me in my office. I'll be there whenever I'm free.\"","A moment before closing the door, Liang Chen's gaze lingered on the man in the hospital bed.","A couple of nights ago, Shen Linyan had suddenly taken the initiative to call him out for drinks.","It was an extremely rare move, and he had been quite surprised.","He never expected that the very first sentence upon meeting would be:","\"I might die in a few days.\"","That single sentence had completely shocked him.","He thought Shen Linyan was joking.","But then, the man stated the location of his death, and even the murderer.","Hearing this, Liang Chen immediately realized something was wrong. He frowned. \"Are you planning your own murder? Since you know Lu Jingshen wants to kill you, why don't you just stop him now?\"","He didn't believe Shen Linyan lacked the power to do so.","However, Shen Linyan merely replied in a calm tone, saying something he couldn't understand.","\"If I dodge it this time, there might be other accidents in the future. I'm worried that I won't know when that time comes.\"","Knowing in advance that his good friend was going to die left Liang Chen with complicated feelings.","\"What about An Ling? She'll definitely be heartbroken if you die.\"","Hearing this, the man's previously indifferent eyelashes trembled ever so slightly.","He slowly lowered his eyes, the emotions in their depths unreadable, and said softly, \"It will pass. Even without me, someone else will love her.\"","His death would ultimately fade away with time.","But by next spring, his wife would be completely free from all this.","Liang Chen didn't quite understand what was really going on.","But for Shen Linyan to willingly go to his death, it meant that this matter was already incredibly, incredibly serious.","He lost all mood for drinking, his brows furrowed tightly without relaxing.","\"Then why did you only call me out this time? Is there something else?\"","The man on the sofa remained silent, quietly staring at the liquor in his glass.","After a long while, he finally spoke softly:","\"The hospital might get very chaotic later. Please help me take care of her and don't let too many people wander around in front of her.\"","...","After Liang Chen left, An Ling received a call from Ms. Chen.","She walked to the window and answered the phone.","\"Ah Leng, I saw the news.\"","The news of Lu Jingshen stabbing Shen Linyan had already spread all over the internet the night of the incident.","Ms. Chen comforted her, \"Put the rest of your work aside for the next few days. I will arrange for other colleagues to cover for you.\"","\"Thank you, Ms. Chen. I'm sorry for causing trouble.\"","\"It's nothing, this is a special situation. Everyone understands, and you've pretty much finished your work anyway.\"","Ms. Chen paused before tentatively asking, \"So, is your husband doing okay right now?\"","An Ling turned her head to look at the unconscious man behind her and pursed her lips.","\"He's still unconscious. I'm not sure when he'll wake up.\"","After saying those things last night, the system only replied with an \"I understand.\"","There were no further messages after that.","It seemed like it wouldn't let Shen Linyan die.","But she wasn't sure if Shen Linyan would remain unconscious forever.","After all, that system had screwed people over way too many times.","Ms. Chen's tone carried a hint of emotion. \"Don't worry, everything will get better.\"","\"I still remember when I first met you, you said that you and Shen Linyan were just in a marriage of convenience and your relationship was average. Yet, a few months have passed, so much has happened, and your feelings for each other have grown stronger and stronger. Time truly is a magical thing.\"","Upon hearing this, An Ling paused slightly.","Following Ms. Chen's words, her memories uncontrollably drifted back to that time.","Let alone Ms. Chen, when she first met Shen Linyan, even she hadn't expected things to turn out this way.","She lowered her eyes and smiled softly.","\"Yeah...\"","Truly magical.","After waking up in the morning, An Ling hadn't eaten anything yet. She simply packed up her things, turned to look at the man on the hospital bed, walked over, and gently hooked her finger around his.","\"I'm going out to eat.\"","Just as she stepped out of the room and pressed the elevator button, she held her phone and checked her messages.","Jiang Mai had also seen the news and sent her a message, her tone carrying a careful probing.","Jiang Mai: [Lingling, are you okay?]","An Ling: [I'm fine. Shen Linyan is still unconscious.]","Jiang Mai: [Scared me to death. That damn Lu Jingshen, how can someone like him be the male lead?? How could he stab someone?! Did Shen Linyan actually have a plotline like this?]","She paused, pursed her lips, and slowly typed.","[Actually, this was my plotline. I was supposed to die by Lu Jingshen's hands, but Shen Linyan took my place.]","Once this was sent, the other side fell into a brief silence, followed immediately by a series of shocked messages.","[Holy crap???? Is Lu Jingshen crazy? He really wanted to kill you?? Is he sick in the head?]","Thinking of what happened last night, An Ling hesitated and tapped on the screen.","[Actually, I was also planning to let Lu Jingshen go...]","Just as she typed the words, she stopped, eventually deleting the sentence and sighing.","\"Ding—\"","The elevator arrived. Inside, there was only a girl wearing a mask and a hat, and their eyes met.","After making eye contact, the other person seemed to freeze for a moment.","An Ling didn't notice anything unusual. She walked in and pressed the button for the first floor.","The elevator doors closed, and the numbers on the screen changed one by one.","An Ling was still thinking about what to eat later when a tiny female voice suddenly sounded from behind her.","\"...Sister-in-law.\"","Hearing this, she paused slightly, turned her head to look again, and her gaze lingered on the other person's red hair. \"Shen Fuyuan?\"","Shen Fuyuan nodded hastily, pulled at her mask, her eyes darting away as she pursed her lips and whispered, \"I... I came to see Big Brother and you...\"","Saying that, she hurriedly explained, \"I had no idea Second Brother would do those things, really! When I found out, I was completely stunned. I don't know where Second Brother is either, he even blocked me!\"","An Ling was taken aback, realizing what the girl was worried about.","\"Ding—\"","The elevator doors opened. She glanced back, then looked at the nervous-looking Shen Fuyuan.","After a few seconds of silent eye contact, she suddenly spoke:","\"Have you eaten breakfast?\"","Shen Fuyuan: ?","A few minutes later, in a breakfast shop.","An Ling sat on a chair, a steaming bowl of wontons placed in front of her.","She picked up the vinegar on the side, poured a little with a spoon, and raised her eyes to look at the girl in front of her.","\"Are you sure you don't want to eat? There are very few people here, no one should be able to recognize you.\"","They were sitting in the innermost part of the shop, and Shen Fuyuan had her back to the others. Just looking at her back, no one else should be able to recognize her.","Shen Fuyuan still shook her head. \"I've already eaten, you go ahead.\"","An Ling nodded and lowered her head to scoop up a wonton with her spoon.","She blew on it, but the freshly made wonton was still a bit hot, so she could only take a small bite.","It seemed to taste a little different from the ones Shen Linyan had brought back before.","While she was focusing on the taste, she caught sight of the slightly uneasy Shen Fuyuan out of the corner of her eye.","She blinked, ate the wonton from the spoon, her cheeks puffing out slightly.","Shen Fuyuan was feeling a bit nervous inside right now.","During the previous incident with the Shen Group, Big Brother had already spared the Lu family from complete ruin for her sake, leaving a way out for their mother and Second Brother.","But now that Second Brother had done something like this, she didn't know how to face Big Brother and her sister-in-law.","Just as she was thinking this, An Ling's voice rang in her ears.","\"You don't need to be so nervous. This matter has nothing to do with you.\"","Shen Fuyuan paused, and the eyes beneath her hat looked up.","An Ling stirred the wontons in her bowl, her tone no different from usual.","\"This is what Lu Jingshen did. Neither Shen Linyan nor I will think differently of you because of this. Don't worry, just act as we always have.\"","Shen Fuyuan was slightly taken aback, her tone carrying a hint of pleasant surprise.","\"Really?\"","\"Really.\"","An Ling lowered her head to blow on a wonton. \"If you want to go see Shen Linyan, you can. It's just that he's still unconscious right now, and I don't know when he'll wake up.\"","Hearing this, Shen Fuyuan finally breathed a sigh of relief.","She pursed her lips and said, \"I don't know when the police will be able to catch Second Brother either. Sister-in-law, don't worry, if Second Brother contacts me, I will definitely report him.\"","Hearing this, An Ling's movements paused slightly.","Her eyelids drooped, and she stayed quiet for a moment before speaking:","\"What if he dies while on the run?\"","Shen Fuyuan's expression froze.","The dining table fell quiet for a moment.","An Ling sighed inwardly, put down her spoon, and said softly, \"I'll first...\"","The next second, the girl's hesitant voice caught her off guard and interrupted her.","\"Sister-in-law, are you telling me to take out Second Brother?\"","An Ling: \"...?\"","Has this girl been acting in too many dramas?"]},{"number":131,"title":"Chapter 131: Truly Extravagant [Word Count Fulfilled]","paragraphs":["Realizing what she meant, An Ling found it a bit amusing, yet at the same time, she felt a little helpless.","\"I was referring to death caused by an accident.\"","Shen Fuyuan blinked, and after a long while, she slowly let out an \"Oh.\"","\"Well, there's no helping that kind of death.\"","She paused, then whispered, \"This shows that even God probably couldn't stand watching anymore.\"","God...","There was no God.","It was all bought with Shen Linyan's life.","An Ling didn't answer. She pulled out a tissue and wiped her mouth.","\"I need to go home for a bit later. Do you want to come with me? I actually want to ask you for a favor.\"","Shen Fuyuan: \"What favor?\"","She looked up and smiled, \"I might not be able to take care of Huihui for the next few days. Could you help me look after him?\"","Shen Fuyuan: \"!!!\"","She immediately sprang to her feet.","\"I'll help, I'll help!\"","...","Going home last night had been too rushed, so An Ling came back today intending to reorganize her things.","After changing into a new set of clothes, her gaze fell on the table, and she paused.","A gift box worth hundreds of millions was sitting right there on the table.","She walked over.","The previous tag was still on it.","[A gift bought for my wife last week. I hope she likes it.]","[ꐦ≖≖]","[つ♡⊂]","She lowered her eyes and looked at it for a long time, the corners of her mouth curling up very slightly.","\"What a spendthrift.\"","She raised her hand to take off the necklace around her neck, took out the sapphire pendant inside, and slowly put it on in front of the mirror.","After packing her things, she opened the door and went out.","Shen Fuyuan was on the sofa, playing with Huihui.","An Ling picked up the cookies on the dining table.","She had forgotten to seal them last night. Left out all night, they had gotten damp and soft.","An Ling sighed and eventually dumped them all into the trash can.","She poured herself a glass of water, took out her phone, and checked the news online.","The top trending search was—","#Second Young Master of the Shen Family, Lu Jingshen, stabs Shen Linyan! Still missing!#","#Shen Linyan remains unconscious.#","Scrolling down to the comment section, most people hadn't processed it yet. At first, some suspected it was fake, but after several verified accounts posted the news, the doubts were gradually replaced by shock.","[So dramatic? This is surreal.]","[I'm stunned.]","[And he ran away after stabbing him? Where could he go? They have his fingerprints, photos, and blood.]","[Can't rich people just change their names and identities? Maybe someone is protecting Lu Jingshen behind the scenes.]","[Give it a rest. The Shen Corporation went bankrupt, and Shen Linyan is the head of the AL Group; his power is much greater than his now.]","As An Ling was reading the comments, a call suddenly came in.","After answering, a male voice spoke from the other end.","\"Is this Miss An? This is the Municipal Public Security Bureau. Would it be convenient for you to come over now? There are some new matters we'd like to ask you about.\"","\"Yes, it's convenient. I'll head over shortly.\"","Hanging up the phone, An Ling looked at the person and cat on the sofa. \"I have to go to the police station. Are you going to stay here? You can temporarily take Huihui to your place for the time being.\"","Shen Fuyuan raised her hand and made an \"OK\" gesture. \"Then I'll play with Huihui for a bit longer.\"","As soon as she finished speaking, the phone on the table suddenly rang as well.","She picked it up, glanced at it, and answered, placing it against her ear.","\"Hello?\"","\"Ah, yes, this is she.\"","Whatever the other person said, Shen Fuyuan's face first went blank.","Then her gaze slightly hardened, gradually turning complex.","She turned her head and met An Ling's eyes, hesitating to speak.","\"Okay, I understand. I'll be right there.\"","Putting down the phone, the atmosphere in the living room was a bit quiet.","Shen Fuyuan stood up. \"The police just called me too and asked me to come over.\"","She pursed her lips and slowly spoke:","\"They said they found my second brother.\"","...","\"A man found Lu Jingshen under a bridge while walking his dog this morning. By the time the doctors arrived, he was already gone.\"","Even though she had guessed this might be it, hearing it with her own ears still made An Ling's eyelashes tremble imperceptibly.","She lowered her eyes and gave a soft \"Mm,\" her hand unconsciously tightening its grip on her clothes.","The police officer glanced at the computer and continued, \"The forensic doctor's preliminary judgment is that the time of death was around 1:00 AM last night.\"","1:00 AM?","Did the system strike that early?","While she was thinking, she heard the officer speak again:","\"The cause of death was homicide.\"","Her expression froze slightly as she looked up. \"Homicide?\"","\"Yes.\"","The officer flipped through a document. \"There were wounds on the body. So, where were you at 1:00 AM last night? What were you doing?\"","\"I was at the hospital with my husband.\"","An Ling still hadn't fully processed it.","Shouldn't it have been suicide? Or at the very least, a death like in the original plot.","Did the system find a helper?","And... where did the system go?","After finishing her statement at the police station, An Ling had a bit of a headache.","She had no idea what the situation was right now.","Was the death ending arranged by the system this time a homicide?","Exiting the police station and just walking up to her car, someone sent a message to her phone.","Mom: [Lingling, mom and dad are back. Where are you now?]","An Ling: [I'm at the police station. I'll be home in a bit.]","Just after sending the message, a woman's cold voice sounded from behind her.","\"An Ling!\"","She turned her head, her gaze lingering on the other person's face for a few seconds before quickly realizing who it was.","Lu Jincai walked over quickly, her face dark and a sneer hanging on the corners of her mouth.","\"I really didn't expect you to play so dirty. I originally thought you just wanted to bring Lu Jingshen to justice. But now it seems you wanted his life outright. He's dead now, you must be very happy, you murderer!\"","In her eyes, this matter absolutely had everything to do with An Ling.","An Ling put away her phone and looked at her calmly. \"Do you have evidence? If you don't, I can go right back into the police station and sue you for defamation.\"","\"Does this even need evidence?! Who else could it be but you!?\" Lu Jincai said with absolute certainty. \"You must have hired someone. No wonder you said yesterday you were going to take revenge on Lu Jingshen. So this is the kind of revenge you meant!\"","An Ling's figure paused slightly, her voice devoid of emotion.","\"Then I welcome you to go find the truth and see who actually killed Lu Jingshen. But will you really do that?\"","From the very beginning of the incident, she had been eager to clear herself of any responsibility. In Lu Jincai's heart, none of these children were as important as her own status and interests.","Shen Fuyuan couldn't inherit the Shen Corporation, so she didn't receive much affection from Lu Jincai.","Now that Lu Jingshen was not only unable to inherit the Shen Corporation but was also faring worse than Shen Fuyuan, this was even more true.","Asking her to find the truth behind Lu Jingshen's death might just seem like a waste of time to her.","Sure enough, Lu Jincai's originally furious face stiffened slightly.","A moment later, she gritted her teeth and said, \"So it is you! You didn't deny it! Shen Linyan married such a vicious woman like you! Now the AL Group belongs to the An family too. Maybe you even framed Jingshen for Shen Linyan's death, and in reality, it was you...\"","\"Slap—\"","Before she could finish her sentence, a crisp slap landed unexpectedly on her face.","Lu Jincai looked stunned, the burning pain on her cheek seemingly reminding her of what had just happened.","\"Have you said enough?\"","The woman's cold voice rang in her ears.","With that one slap, the surrounding air seemed to come to a standstill.","An Ling looked at her, her eyes completely devoid of emotion.","\"I've put up with you for a long time, you know? Where do you get the nerve to care about Shen Linyan now?\"","\"Have you forgotten all the things you did to him?\"","Lu Jincai was stunned by the slap, her face freezing as she failed to recover her senses for a long time.","Having been Mrs. Shen for nearly thirty years, no one had ever dared to treat her like this.","Just as she was about to explode in anger, she heard the young woman say coolly:","\"Sparing the Lu family was out of respect for Shen Fuyuan. You didn't actually think Shen Linyan did it for you, his adoptive mother, did you? If you can't learn to behave, then there's no need to keep it around.\"","Lu Jincai's expression instantly shifted. Cupping her cheek, she couldn't speak, only glaring at An Ling with a dark, gloomy look.","An Ling tightened her slightly trembling hand.","It was her first time slapping someone, and she still felt a bit uneasy.","She stuffed her hands into her pockets, keeping her tone cold.","\"I've said it before. If you think I did it, go find the evidence. Without evidence, keep your mouth shut. If you want to extort compensation, wait until the police find the murderer.\"","Meeting Lu Jincai's gaze, she curved her eyes slightly in a smile that didn't reach her eyes.","\"Also, I am indeed very happy that Lu Jingshen is dead.\"","With that, she got straight into her car and left.","After driving for a distance, An Ling finally pulled the car over.","She looked down at the hand she had used to strike, clenched it into a fist, and murmured thoughtfully, \"So this is what it feels like to slap someone...\"","At the moment of impact, there was an indescribable feeling.","It felt a bit like venting.","Now she really seemed a bit like a vicious supporting actress.","...","After filling out forms and giving a statement at the police station, it was already afternoon by the time she returned to the An family home. Father An and Mother An were waiting for her in the living room.","Seeing An Ling come back from outside, Mother An's eyes grew completely red. She originally wanted to say something, but Father An gently pressed her hand.","She paused, taking a moment to calm down, and tried to keep her tone as normal as possible: \"Lingling is here.\"","An Ling set down the bags in her hand. \"Mom, Dad, when did you arrive?\"","\"We got here at noon,\" Father An replied. \"We originally wanted to go to the hospital to see Linyan, but we didn't know if it was convenient. An Zhou said he needs to rest quietly, so we didn't go bother him.\"","\"You can go, it's just that he hasn't woken up yet.\"","An Ling put down her things and sat on the sofa.","Seeing the worry in her parents' eyes, she curved her eyes into a smile and asked gently, \"How was your trip? Did you have fun?\"","\"It was okay, the scenery was quite nice.\"","Seeing that the young woman didn't want to talk more about the topic, the elderly couple didn't pry further and followed her lead in the conversation.","Mother An took out a piece of yellow paper folded into a triangle from her pocket and handed it to her.","\"Take this, and tuck it under Shen Linyan's pillow tonight.\"","An Ling took it, confused. \"What is this?\"","An Zhou answered, \"It's from that Taoist priest Mom and Dad found when they suspected you were possessed by something unclean. They said it could ward off evil, but I didn't think it was of much use at the time.\"","Mother An scolded him dissatisfiedly, \"What do you mean useless! Didn't Lingling get better in the end? That means it was useful! It just took some time to take effect!\"","\"...\"","An Ling froze for a moment, then let out a helpless laugh. \"Alright, I'll put it under Shen Linyan's pillow.\"","After chatting with her parents for a while at the An house, An Ling could tell they were worried about her emotional state, so she didn't show any abnormalities.","By the time they finished dinner, the sky had already darkened.","An Zhou walked her to the door.","Before she got in the car, he suddenly asked, \"Is Lu Jingshen really dead?\"","An Ling's movements paused slightly, and she gave a gentle nod.","An Zhou stared at her for a moment, then smiled, his tone carrying a hint of emotion. \"It's truly unbelievable... I'm even starting to wonder if Mom's evil-warding talisman actually works.\"","An Ling's eyes curved as she laughed aloud. \"Maybe it really does.\"","An Zhou wanted to say something else, but his phone suddenly rang.","He took it out, and An Ling caught a glimpse of the caller ID.","Miss Qin.","Facing An Ling's slightly teasing gaze, An Zhou's eyes darted around. He coughed a bit embarrassedly, but instead of hanging up, he waved his hand at An Ling.","\"Well, you should hurry back to the hospital. Drive carefully on the way.\"","Then he turned around and answered the call.","In the air, his lowered voice could still be heard.","\"What is it? Miss me? Didn't you say you'd call later?\"","\"Don't! What do you mean cancel tomorrow's date? I'm free! That won't delay our date. Everything is mostly fine now, my sister's side is okay.\"","\"Then can we eat at a restaurant tomorrow? Fat-loss meals again? Let me eat something good, my lady.\"","\"Fine, fine, fine, I'll eat it! But who was that senior student who brought you an umbrella last time?\"","\"What do you mean jealous? I'm just asking.\"","\"Fine, I am jealous. Can you tell me now?! ... Are you laughing?!\"","An Ling watched for a few more moments, then smilingly withdrew her gaze.","This could also be considered an unbelievable thing.","...","Back at the hospital.","The inpatient building was completely quiet. Especially as one approached the VIP wards, the corridors became even more silent.","Going from the bustling streets to the desolate hospital.","It always gave people a very disjointed sense of loneliness.","Gently pushing open the ward door, the regular and monotonous beeping of the monitoring equipment echoed repeatedly in the spacious room.","An Ling put down her things, looked at the unconscious man on the bed, and smiled. \"Sorry, sorry, I'm back late. I didn't expect so many things to happen just going out for breakfast.\"","She took out some wet wipes and helped wipe his face and hands.","\"Are you bored being here all alone? I ran into Shen Fuyuan when I went out today. Should I ask her to keep you company and talk to you next time? Though she'd probably prefer playing with Huihui.\"","\"I also went to eat wontons today, but they didn't seem as delicious as the ones you bought for me last time.\"","\"I also wore the necklace you bought me today. Don't you want to see it? Those cookies went soft, so I threw them away. I'll make you a new batch next time. I can succeed next time too.\"","\"Mom and Dad came back today too. Mom even gave me something. Do you want to guess what it is?\"","\"Ta-da—\"","She mysteriously took the talisman paper out of her pocket and smilingly waved it in front of the man's eyes.","\"It's a talisman. You couldn't guess that, right? I heard it can ward off evil. I'm going to put this under your pillow. If you don't say anything, I'll take it as a yes!\"","She carefully tucked the talisman under his pillow.","\"You have to wake up quickly, you know?\"","In the quiet ward, only the sound of her own voice remained. There was no response, and even the sound of breathing was exceptionally clear.","The man lay on the bed, his eyelashes drooping, casting shallow shadows under his eyes. His handsome side profile was tinged with a bit of sickliness.","The smile that An Ling had forced into her eyes gradually faded.","She pursed her lips, sat back down on the chair, and lowered her head, silently picking at her hands.","After a moment of silence, she slowly spoke:","\"Shen Linyan, let me tell you a secret. I'm only telling you, I haven't told anyone else. I've become a bad person lately, because I wanted Lu Jingshen dead. I tried to teach you how to be a bad person before, and you used to laugh at me. Now I even know how to hit people. Do you think I'm a bad person?\"","Her voice grew softer and softer, carrying a faint, choked hoarseness.","\"If you don't say anything, it means you don't think so.\"","The surrounding air seemed to sink, falling into absolute silence.","A few seconds later, scalding tears rolled silently down the young woman's cheeks.","An Ling pressed her lips tightly together, her eyes red, and hurriedly pulled out a tissue to wipe away her tears.","She rested her face against the edge of the bed, gently taking the man's hand and pressing his palm snugly against her cheek.","Closing her eyes, she murmured in a muffled voice, \"I was only joking this morning. You can come into my dreams. It's your own fault for not being able to comfort me right now.\"","Inside the hospital room, the silence was wrapped around the soft, gentle sounds of breathing, rising and falling in a steady rhythm alongside the hum of the medical machines.","The clock on the wall slowly ticked to midnight.","The cold, white light spilled over the distinct knuckles on the back of the man's hand.","The very next second, a finger on that long-motionless hand gave a faint, gentle twitch."]},{"number":132,"title":"Chapter 132: Then will you continue to sleep with me tonight [Word count supplemented]","paragraphs":["An Ling didn't notice this anomaly at all.","She opened her eyes, wiped her tears, and got up to wash up in the bathroom.","After washing up, her sleepiness had mostly dissipated.","Having just cried, her eyes felt a bit sore, so she rummaged through her bag for eye drops.","Just as she found them, her gaze suddenly fell on the phone in her bag.","This was the one the police had given her last time.","They said it was Shen Linyan's phone.","She took out both the eye drops and the phone, climbed onto the hospital bed, tilted her head back, and applied the eye drops.","As she closed her eyes to rest, a familiar voice suddenly rang out in her mind.","[Miss An.]","She paused, keeping her eyes closed, and gave an \"Mm\" in acknowledgment.","\"I thought you were dead.\"","[...]","\"Didn't you die with Lu Jingshen? Why was Lu Jingshen murdered?\"","[I went to consult my superiors at the time. Right after I came back and possessed him, a group of people suddenly appeared, and Lu Jingshen was killed by them.]","An Ling was surprised: \"You have superiors?\"","This kind of thing actually has a superior?","[Yes, compensating you was also proposed by my superior.]","[So Lu Jingshen didn't commit suicide. He was caught by those bad friends he used to hang out with. Some of them had disliked him for a long time, and moreover, it seems someone secretly helped them find Lu Jingshen...]","\"Huh?\"","Someone helped?","It had been so long that An Ling had almost forgotten Lu Jingshen once had a wild and unruly youth.","The system didn't go into too much detail, simply stating:","[I have now died for you once using Lu Jingshen's body. Your compensation is complete. Do you have any other requests?]","She opened her eyes, rubbed them gently, and looked at the man in the bed next to hers.","\"Then when will Shen Linyan wake up?\"","[That depends on him. I can only guarantee that your husband's life is not in danger.]","That was as good as saying nothing.","It seemed this system could only hijack other people's bodies and do nothing else.","An Ling pursed her lips and sighed.","\"My only request is that you never appear again.\"","[Understood.]","[Wishing you a happy and joyful life in the future.]","After that, her mind returned to silence.","Yet, An Ling felt a sense of unreality.","It really left?","She looked down at Shen Linyan's phone.","He had been in a coma for the past two days, and there were many unread messages on the screen.","An Ling had no intention of snooping into Shen Linyan's privacy. Noticing the battery was low, she was just about to charge it.","Suddenly, a new message popped up.","She subconsciously glanced at it, and her gaze froze.","Flower Shop: [Mr. Shen, sorry to bother you so late. Do you not need the flowers you ordered for today either? We called you, but you didn't answer.]","Flower Shop: [If you don't need them, I will refund the remaining money to you, as you prepaid for two months.]","She blinked and looked up at the man in the opposite bed.","This doesn't count as privacy, right?","She unlocked the phone, opened the chat box,","[I need them. Can you deliver them?]","Flower Shop: [Yes, please send me the address (Rose emoji). Will you still write the greeting card yourself?]","An Ling sent the hospital's address and her own phone number.","[Please change the flowers to tulips. I'll write the card myself. Call this number when they arrive.]","Flower Shop: [Okay.]","After sending the message, An Ling got out of bed and sat back down beside Shen Linyan's bed.","She propped up her chin and playfully hooked her fingers with his.","\"I almost forgot, you still owe me flowers twice. Remember to make up for it when you wake up.\"","The faint light fell on the man's sharply defined profile, tracing soft lines. He had his eyes closed, clearly in a coma, yet it still couldn't hide his inherently noble and calm aura.","After staring for a while, An Ling slowly released his hand.","She gently rested her head against the man, closed her eyes, and murmured softly, \"Hubby, don't sleep too long.\"","\"It's so tiring handling all these things by myself.\"","In the ward, the ticking of the monitor was rhythmic and faint.","She leaned quietly against the man, the smell of disinfectant mingling with his familiar scent lingering at her nose.","An Ling was so sleepy that her eyelids grew heavy.","In her daze, a warm fingertip brushed extremely lightly across the corner of her eye.","Her heart trembled violently. She opened her eyes and lifted her head, inch by stiff inch.","The warm light cascaded down. With a quiet tenderness hidden in his eyes, the man was looking at her unblinkingly.","The corners of his eyes curved slightly as he silently mouthed a word.","'Wife.'","...","\"All of his bodily vitals are normal. There are no major issues, he's just been lying down for too long. Do some rehabilitation exercises over the next few days, keep the diet light, avoid large movements, and don't let the wound get wet.\"","Liang Chen took off his stethoscope and smiled at the man on the bed.","\"But it's definitely a pleasant surprise. You woke up earlier than I expected.\"","Hearing this, Shen Linyan gave a soft \"Mm,\" withdrew his gaze from the sofa, and looked up at him: \"Thank you.\"","Liang Chen raised an eyebrow, glanced at the young woman sitting on the sofa with her head down pretending to play on her phone, and instantly understood.","Alright then, this wasn't the time for him to stick around.","\"Alright, I'll take my leave now. Get some good rest.\"","The door closed, leaving only the two of them in the ward.","An Ling pursed her lips, keeping her head down, her fingertips swiping aimlessly across the screen.","She had constantly wanted Shen Linyan to wake up, but now that he had actually woken up, she didn't know what to say.","\"Wife.\"","The familiar voice suddenly rang in her ears.","She paused her movements, slowly looked up, and glanced toward the hospital bed, perfectly meeting the man's gentle, smiling eyes.","He patted the spot next to him.","\"Honey, sit here.\"","She got up sluggishly, shuffled over, and sat on the edge of the bed.","As soon as she sat down, the man's gentle voice sounded in her ear.","\"You're wearing the necklace I gave you. It looks beautiful.\"","Her face flushed slightly, feeling a bit shy. She subconsciously touched the pendant at her neck, looked up at him, and was just about to speak.","When she heard the man speak again: \"So, were all the cookies really thrown away?\"","Her eyes instantly widened in a daze.","Meeting the girl's bewildered gaze, Shen Linyan's eyes curved in a smile. He cupped her face, kissed the corner of her eye, and spoke in a gentle voice.","\"Honey, does your hand hurt from hitting?\"","An Ling stared at him blankly, her eyes gradually turning red.","She reached out and hugged his neck, being careful to avoid his wound, rested her forehead against his shoulder, and gave a muffled \"Mm,\" \"It hurts.\"","Shen Linyan held her waist and took her right hand with his other hand. \"Did you hit with this hand?\"","An Ling nodded obediently.","He turned his head and kissed her palm again and again. \"Then let me kiss it better for my wife.\"","The man had a prominent brow bone and a high-bridged nose that pressed against her palm. His long eyelashes drooped, casting faint shadows. His handsome profile was earnest and focused, making him look exceptionally sexy.","An Ling's face turned slightly red from his kisses. \"So, did you hear everything?\"","Did he also hear her crying her eyes out every time?","Thinking about it now, it was actually quite embarrassing.","\"Not everything. I could hear a little bit when I was conscious.\"","Shen Linyan smiled and leaned close to her ear, deliberately lowering his voice as if whispering a secret, the end of his sentence lingering and deep.","\"But, I did hear that my wife wanted to sleep with me.\"","Why did he have to hear that of all things!","An Ling's eyes widened slightly, the tips of her ears turning red, and she said dryly, \"Because your bed is more comfortable to sleep in than mine.\"","A low chuckle escaped Shen Linyan's throat, and he kissed her bright red earlobe.","\"Then will you sleep with me again tonight?\"","By her ear, the man's low, deep voice sounded almost bewitching.","An Ling's ear tickled a little. She tilted her head to look at him, and unable to resist his handsome charm, she leaned in and kissed his cheek.","\"Okay, but no hugging.\"","She knew the man's sleeping habits all too well.","And she herself wasn't a very still sleeper.","\"I'm afraid of hurting your wound. We should just lie next to each other like this.\"","The man smiled and touched her face. \"Alright.\"","That night, lying in bed, An Ling still hadn't fully processed everything.","Was Shen Linyan really awake?","Could she be dreaming?","She quietly opened her eyes and turned her head to look beside her.","As if sensing it, the man opened his eyes and unexpectedly turned to look right at her.","As their eyes met, An Ling's face flushed slightly. She immediately looked away and decided to strike first.","\"Why are you looking at me?\"","\"I want to kiss my wife.\"","\"...\"","An Ling silently turned her back to him, the ears hidden beneath her hair turning a faint red.","\"Stop talking nonsense in the middle of the night. Go to sleep.\"","\"Wife, I've been sleeping all day.\"","\"Husband, then close your eyes anyway.\"","The man's chuckle came from behind her. \"Alright.\"","Despite saying so, a certain someone's gaze remained scorching.","An Ling's back stiffened slightly.","After waiting for a few minutes, she slowly turned around.","Sure enough, she met the man's wide-awake eyes.","Seeing her look over, he unhurriedly closed his eyes, though who he was trying to fool was anyone's guess. \"Going to sleep now.\"","An Ling: \"...\"","The air was quiet for a moment before the sound of rustling blankets suddenly rang out.","A shadow fell over his face, and Shen Linyan slowly opened his eyes.","Seeing the girl hovering over him, he feigned surprise, though a faint smile lingered in his eyes. He reached out to caress her face, his thumb brushing the corner of her eye. \"What's wrong, honey?\"","An Ling blinked, stared at him for a few seconds, and slowly lowered her head to take his lips.","Imitating his usual manner, she gently sucked on his lips. It was soft and tender, like a soothing comfort, yet carried a unique kind of temptation.","Shen Linyan's Adam's apple bobbed slightly, and his eyes darkened. He raised a hand to cup the back of her head, the veins on the back of his hand bulging slightly.","Parting his lips to take control, the tip of his tongue effortlessly pried open her lips.","His kiss pressed in step by step, invading deeply. It was gentle but threw her breathing into chaos, like a long-starved traveler eagerly drawing sweet nectar.","As their lips and teeth tangled, all reason was crushed into pieces, leaving only their burning body temperatures and ragged breathing.","An Ling let out a soft whimper. A misty haze gathered in her eyes, and the arms supporting her against the bed gradually lost their strength.","Still mindful not to press on his wound, she mumbled, \"Wait, I have no strength left. Your wound...\"","Shen Linyan gently sucked on her lip, lowering his eyes and whispering, \"It's fine. You can lie on my arm, and I'll hold you with one hand, hmm? How about that?\"","An Ling shook her head, insisting on sleeping on the side. \"I'll hurt your wound once I fall asleep.\"","Lying back down, she had just closed her eyes.","When the man's soft voice suddenly sounded by her ear.","\"I'm sorry.\"","At those words, An Ling's body stiffened as she instantly thought of that chat history.","Her eyelashes fluttered. She pursed her lips and kept her eyes closed without saying a word.","Shen Linyan turned to look at her, seeing that the girl had no reaction.","Under the covers, he gently hooked her finger, his thumb softly squeezing her fingertip.","\"Wife, actually, I couldn't bear to leave you behind. Whenever I thought about how, after I died, you would likely end up with someone else, and someone else would get to see how wonderful you are, I felt so jealous. I was so jealous I even wanted to drag you down to die with me, so we could be together forever.\"","\"But if you died, your family would be heartbroken. I know you can't let go of your family.\"","\"The people you love include them, and me.\"","\"But the only person I love is you.\"","\"Having you mourn for me is enough.\"","The man's soft voice slowly echoed in the room.","In this choice of death, no matter who was chosen, it would result in immense pain.","So Shen Linyan had chosen what he believed to be the most appropriate solution.","The air was completely still, leaving only the sound of their faint breathing.","\"Are you saying this on purpose so I'll love you more?\" the girl's voice suddenly rang out.","Shen Linyan paused at her words, then chuckled softly.","\"So do you love me more now?\"","\"I'm not telling you.\"","An Ling turned around and quietly shifted her body, resting her head gently on the man's arm. She whispered, \"If I bump your wound, I'm never sleeping with you again.\"","Shen Linyan's eyes curved in a smile as he nuzzled the top of her head. \"You won't. You're a very good sleeper.\"","An Ling closed her eyes and suddenly spoke up:","\"Shen Linyan?\"","\"Hmm?\"","\"It's different now.\"","She opened her eyes and said softly, \"It's all your fault. My reliance on you now is even stronger than it is on them.\"","Shen Linyan's expression froze.","Once he processed her words, the corners of his lips curled up. He smiled so brightly his eyes crinkled with joy, low chuckles rumbling from his chest as he kissed her forehead.","\"Baby, don't say things like that. If I laugh too hard, my wound will tear open.\"","An Ling: \"...\"","She gritted her teeth in embarrassment and immediately covered the man's mouth. \"Shen Linyan, I hate you. I really hate you. Stop laughing!\"","Shen Linyan nodded, his eyes still curved in amusement, and kissed the palm of her hand.","But it was still too late.","The next day.","Liang Chen stood by the hospital bed, looking at the slightly bleeding wound on the man's abdomen, and silently pushed up his glasses.","\"...You two should know that you can't engage in strenuous exercise before the wound is healed.\"","\"...\"","An Ling stood to the side, her face flushed red. She lowered her head and guiltily looked away, secretly glaring at Shen Linyan.","The person in question on the hospital bed looked completely unfazed, a slight smile on his lips. He seemed to be in a very good mood.","\"There was no strenuous exercise. I just laughed too hard.\"","\"That's not allowed either.\" Liang Chen glanced at him, finishing replacing the gauze, and stood up straight.","After a moment of silence, he spoke slowly:","\"But I still need to say this: it's best to wait three months. If you can't wait that long, then at least wait two months.\"","An Ling: \"...\"","She swore—","She! Would! Never! Mess around! With Shen Linyan! Again!","That night, before going to sleep, An Ling climbed into the other bed.","Shen Linyan was reading documents. Hearing the noise, he turned to see the girl in the adjacent bed. Looking slightly stunned, he closed his laptop.","\"Wife, let's sleep together.\"","An Ling only left him with a cold back, completely unmoved. \"No, I'm sleeping by myself.\"","While doing walking rehabilitation exercises, Shen Linyan wrapped his arms around the girl's waist and was just about to lower his head to kiss her cheek.","The very next second, the girl covered his mouth.","\"No.\"","An Ling looked serious.","\"No kissing until your wound is healed. What if it tears open again?\"","Shen Linyan: \"...Just a kiss won't do that, honey.\"","An Ling: \"No, absolutely not.\"","Shen Linyan's brow twitched: \"...\"","He needed to call Liang Chen back."]},{"number":133,"title":"Chapter 133: Good Luck Charm [Word Count Fulfilled]","paragraphs":["After Shen Linyan woke up, Father An, Mother An, and An Zhou came to visit him a few times.","The real culprits who murdered Lu Jingshen were caught a few days later. They were a few thugs whom Lu Jingshen had bullied in the past.","Among the bad crowd Lu Jingshen used to associate with, some frequently relied on his reputation to do evil, offending quite a few people.","An Ling even heard a familiar name: Huang Long.","Not having heard this name for a long time, An Ling didn't react at first. Later, she remembered that she had seen this person in a bar shortly after she returned.","They even had a dispute at the time, and later Mother Shen demanded that Shen Linyan apologize to Huang Long.","Huang Long was indeed very important to Lu Jingshen.","Having followed Lu Jingshen for so long, he knew all about the shady dealings between Lu Jingshen and others. Furthermore, he basically took the blame for everything, since money makes the world go round.","When those matters suddenly blew up later, the group found out the leak came from Huang Long's side. They assumed that Lu Jingshen intentionally sold them out to clear his own name and wash away his past.","But at that time, Lu Jingshen was the second young master of the Shen family. Even if they harbored hatred, they could do nothing. Once the Shen family went bankrupt, they had been looking for an opportunity for revenge.","According to their statements, someone had sent them a message telling them Lu Jingshen's location, but they themselves didn't know who this informant was.","The IP address of the message was from abroad. It was unknown whether it was real or disguised. There were no further developments, and all clues ended there.","But with Lu Jingshen's murderers caught, the matter was considered temporarily settled.","An Ling stopped paying attention to this matter afterward, leaving it entirely to Shen Linyan to handle.","On the day of his discharge, everyone from the An family came to the hospital to celebrate Shen Linyan's recovery.","Mother An walked over and dug out the yellow talisman from under Shen Linyan's pillow.","\"Look! I told you this talisman was useful! I remember Xiao Yan woke up the very night I gave him this.\"","An Ling was checking messages on her phone. Shen Linyan was finishing the discharge procedures and would be back soon. Hearing this, she looked up.","She had almost forgotten about this talisman paper. Before she could react, she saw Mother An take out her phone.","\"This master is truly effective. I need to seek him out again.\"","\"...\"","An Zhou couldn't help but complain, \"Mom, there won't be that many disasters in the future. We don't need talismans.\"","An Ling also persuaded her, \"Yeah, Mom. If you don't buy them, nothing bad will happen. Hoarding these things is useless.\"","Father An, standing to the side, spoke up leisurely, \"Your mother isn't trying to buy evil-warding talismans.\"","\"Then what is she buying?\"","Father An didn't say, merely lifting his chin. \"Just ask your mother and you'll know.\"","Hearing this, Mother An looked up, her tone natural and casual. \"Nothing special, just a fertility talisman.\"","A good luck talisman?","That's pretty good. It would be best if it could change her destiny as the vicious female supporting character.","An Ling suddenly understood and nodded in strong agreement. \"That works. Can it change my luck if I carry it? I was really unlucky before. If it works...\"","Mother An interrupted her unhurriedly, \"I mean fertility, as in pregnancy.\"","\"???\"","Holding her phone, Mother An glanced at An Zhou next to her. \"Don't fight over it when the time comes. Both of you siblings will get one. An Zhou, I'll give you yours after you get married. I'll ask for one for Lingling first.\"","An Zhou: \"...\"","An Ling: \"...\"","No, who was going to fight over it anyway!?","An Ling's face turned slightly red. Fortunately, Shen Linyan wasn't in the ward. If that man heard this, it would be disastrous; she wouldn't get any sleep at night.","She had finally managed to rest for a dozen days.","\"Mom! Shen Linyan and I don't need that kind of thing at all!\"","\"Having it is better than not. A fertility talisman is just a blessing. Don't feel so burdened by it.\"","Mother An suddenly glanced behind her. \"Xiao Yan, don't you agree?\"","An Ling's eyes suddenly froze.","The familiar low chuckle of a man suddenly sounded from behind.","\"Mom makes a good point. We can definitely have this.\"","An Ling: \"...\"","She pretended not to hear him and turned to grab the bags on the sofa.","\"Everything is packed, it's time to go. You guys keep chatting, I'll take these things down first and wait for you.\"","Just as she picked them up, her wrist was gently held by the man.","Shen Linyan's gaze fell on his little wife's reddened ear tips, and he smilingly took the luggage from her hands.","\"Madam, let me do it.\"","...","Two weeks had passed from his coma to his discharge.","An Ling only occasionally went home; most of the time, she stayed at the hospital to accompany Shen Linyan.","Returning home after a long time and looking at the familiar scenes, An Ling even felt as if a lifetime had passed.","\"It feels like we haven't been back in ages.\"","The front door closed behind them with a soft click.","Her waist was gently embraced by someone. Shen Linyan rested his chin on her shoulder and glanced at the empty cat bed.","\"Is Huihui still with Shen Fuyuan?\"","\"Yes. We'll find a time to bring it back later.\"","An Ling was just about to take a step forward when the arms around her waist gently tightened.","The man tilted his head slightly, rubbing against her hair and kissing the tip of her ear. His deep voice softened, \"Honey, about what Mom said earlier...\"","\"Ring, ring...\" A phone rang unexpectedly.","\"Oh, it seems my phone is ringing!\"","An Ling immediately jumped out of the man's embrace and rummaged through her bag with a flushed face. She knew she had almost lost her self-control again.","She answered the phone, \"Hello?\"","Shen Linyan's arms grasped empty air, and his movements paused slightly.","He slowly raised his eyes, his dark pupils looking at the girl pretending to talk naturally on the phone, and gently rubbed his fingertips together.","The flowers An Ling ordered for Shen Linyan had arrived, and she went to the door to fetch them.","The flower shop employee was already very familiar with her.","Smiling as they handed over the flowers, they said, \"Miss An, here are your flowers. Are they for your husband again?\"","Ever since the phone number was changed last time, An Ling had used up all of Shen Linyan's remaining balance at the flower shop.","The shop assistant gradually got to know this special pair of customers.","What started as a small surprise bought by the husband for the wife gradually evolved into the wife sending flowers to the husband.","An Ling took the flowers and nodded with a smile. \"Yes, thank you for delivering them. Thanks for your hard work.\"","Closing the door, she looked down and picked up the greeting card attached.","This time she could write \"Happy Discharge.\"","She turned around and just as she looked up, her footsteps paused slightly.","In the living room, the man was standing casually with one hand resting on the back of the sofa. His long legs were casually bent, his figure tall and slender, and the lines of his shoulders and back were sharp and clean.","His posture was loose and relaxed, yet an air of refined nobility radiated from his very bones.","An Ling, struck by his beauty: \"...\"","She stared for a few seconds, gave a light cough, walked over, and calmly handed the flowers to Shen Linyan.","\"Do you like them? These are the flowers I'm giving you today.\"","Shen Linyan reached out to take them, a faint smile in his eyes. \"I like them. Thank you, Madam. This is already the seventeenth time Madam has used the card I topped up to buy flowers for me.\"","\"What, am I not allowed to use it?\"","An Ling curled her lips. \"Who told you to be in the hospital? Since you couldn't send them to me, it's better for me to send them.\"","\"You can use it.\" Shen Linyan put down the flowers, rested his arm on her waist, and pulled her into his embrace. He lowered his head and kissed her cheek. \"I'll make it up to Madam later.\"","His eyelids slowly lowered, his nose pressing deeply into her warm cheek, and his lips drew closer bit by bit. \"What kind of flowers does Madam like...\"","The man's voice was low and gentle. His hot breath brushed against her ear. Just as he opened his mouth to capture her lips, the girl covered his mouth the very next second.","An Ling blinked, her eyes curving into a smile.","\"What are you doing, Hubby?\"","With his mouth covered, Shen Linyan's eyes crinkled in amusement.","He took the opportunity to kiss the palm of her hand.","\"What does Madam think I want to do?\"","\"Madam, we haven't kissed in sixteen days and thirteen hours.\"","An Ling was surprised.","How did this guy remember it so clearly?","She steadied herself slightly and waved her hand. \"No, no, your injuries haven't fully healed yet.\"","She wasn't stupid. After what her mother said today, if she gave in to Shen Linyan, she would be doomed!","She could never resist Shen Linyan's kisses. Once they started kissing, things would get out of hand, and his wounds would tear open again.","So she had to nip it in the bud!","Thinking of this, An Ling blinked and smiled at the man. She stood on her tiptoes and kissed the back of her own hand.","\"There, that's enough! Hubby, I'm going to pack my luggage. My leave is all used up, and I have to go to work tomorrow.\"","Watching the girl's retreating back, Shen Linyan stood frozen in place.","After a moment of silence, he chuckled, sighed, and walked toward the bedroom.","\"What does Madam want to eat for dinner?\"","...","With the New Year approaching, the previously agreed-upon wedding preparations slowly began.","An Zhou and Qin You were already prepared; they planned to hold their wedding during the New Year holiday, while An Ling's wedding was scheduled for the spring.","Knowing that An Zhou was having his wedding before hers made An Ling quite happy.","With someone going ahead of her, she could take the chance to familiarize herself with the process.","While she was revising a project proposal, the phone on her desk suddenly lit up.","Hubby: [Wifey, I won't be coming home for dinner tonight ^^]","An Ling: [Okay~ ^^]","Great! She finally had time to bake cookies tonight!","Lately, Shen Linyan had been home every day, so she hadn't had the chance to make cookies.","She couldn't do it in front of Shen Linyan. If she failed, it would be a disaster, so she had to make them secretly.","And then give Shen Linyan a surprise ( ̆▽ ̆)っ!","...","Nighttime, Golden Palace Club.","Downstairs on the dance floor, the crowd surged. Colorful lights flashed, and the rhythmic music was accompanied by waves of cheering.","Wang Yihong walked to the VIP room on the second floor and pushed the door open.","\"I just dealt with a drunk guest causing trouble. So annoying, these drunks...\"","Sensing the unusually quiet atmosphere in the room, his voice came to an abrupt halt.","Shen Linyan sat right in the middle of the sofa, his long legs crossed. He was looking down at his phone, his facial expression obscured by the shadows, his jaw tense and devoid of emotion.","Beside him, Gu Xiaochi turned his head, suppressing the corners of his mouth as he drank silently.","On the other side of the sofa, Liang Chen was slowly pouring wine, looking completely composed.","He paused slightly. \"What's wrong? Why are you guys so quiet?\"","Walking over and sitting on the sofa, Wang Yihong saw the wine glass in front of Shen Linyan and instinctively asked out of concern,","\"Brother Shen, are your wounds healed? How can you still be drinking?\"","This single sentence instantly made Gu Xiaochi lose his composure.","Covering his mouth, he tried hard to hold back his laughter. \"Wang Yihong, you're dead meat. I can't believe you actually dared to say that! Brother Shen can't bear to hear anything about whether his wounds are healed or not right now.\"","Wang Yihong: \"?\"","Shen Linyan lightly lifted his eyes. \"Is it funny, Gu Xiaochi?\"","Gu Xiaochi immediately wiped the smile off his face and said seriously, \"Not funny at all.\"","Wang Yihong sat down in confusion. \"What exactly happened?\"","Gu Xiaochi threw an arm around his shoulder, his lowered voice still unable to hide his amusement.","\"Because our Chairman Shen has wounds on his body, it's been over a month now, and he hasn't even been able to kiss his wife once.\"","Liang Chen took a sip of his drink. \"What I meant at the time was no intercourse for two months. I never said he couldn't even kiss for two months. That was Sister-in-law's own decision.\"","Shen Linyan lowered his eyes, his fingertips lightly tapping his knee.","He naturally knew this had nothing to do with what Liang Chen said. There had to be another reason why An Ling didn't want to kiss him.","But right now, he still hadn't figured out that reason.","Moreover, over the past few days, his wife had been intentionally or unintentionally asking him if he had any social engagements at night. It seemed she didn't really want him staying at home in the evenings.","Suddenly, Wang Yihong's voice rang out unexpectedly.","\"Could it be a lack of novelty?\"","As soon as the words left his mouth, the room suddenly fell dead silent.","The air itself seemed to stagnate slightly.","The man's movements paused, the corners of his mouth tightening into a straight line. He slowly raised his eyes and looked at him expressionlessly.","Beside him, Gu Xiaochi and Liang Chen both cast glances at him as if looking at a brave warrior.","Wang Yihong hurriedly raised his hands to prove his innocence.","\"...I'm not trying to pick a fight, I'm genuinely offering Brother Shen some advice. I've seen too many of these relationship issues in the bar. A lot of men and women still love each other, but they lose the passion. They lose that sense of novelty with one another, and their relationship gradually exists only in name.\"","\"How does that saying go? Love is like a flower. Flowers need 'preservatives,' and love also needs 'novelty'.\"","Hearing this, Shen Linyan lowered his eyes and didn't speak.","After a long moment of silence, he slowly stood up and methodically straightened his suit. The wedding ring on his ring finger glinted with a cold light as he spoke in a flat tone.","\"Utter nonsense.\"","...","\"Beep—\"","The sound of the door opening rang out. An Ling poked her head out from the kitchen and took a look. \"Hubby, you're back.\"","Shen Linyan gave a hum of acknowledgment. He unbuttoned his suit jacket, slightly loosened his tie, and walked over. \"What is Madam making?\"","An Ling blocked the items behind her. She was still wearing an apron. She raised her eyebrows, a mysterious little expression on her pretty face.","\"Guess!\"","Shen Linyan caught a glimpse of the oven behind the woman, a smile flashing through his eyes.","He casually leaned against the kitchen island, his long legs bent. Even such a simple action looked exceptionally pleasing to the eye.","He feigned a thoughtful look on his face and pondered aloud:","\"It couldn't be cookies, could it?\"","\"...\"","How boring!","An Ling harrumphed and turned around.","Shen Linyan smiled, walked over, and wrapped his arms around her waist. His chin gently rubbed the top of her head as he glanced at the cookies on the baking sheet, a full tray.","His voice carried a bit of husky magnetism. \"Madam made this many?\"","\"I'm taking them to Mom and Dad tomorrow, as well as my brother and Sister Qin You.\" An Ling had used up all her ingredients today.","She picked up the best-looking cookie, turned to look at Shen Linyan, and handed it to him, blinking. \"Do you want to try one?\"","The man lowered his head, opened his mouth, and took a bite right from her hand. His Adam's apple bobbed gently. His eyelashes drooped, casting a faint shadow, and the lines of his side profile looked sharp and cold under the light.","Even though An Ling had looked at this face many times, it was a new visual impact every single time.","The tips of her ears turned slightly red, and she asked softly, \"Is it good?\"","\"Has Madam tasted it herself?\"","She made it herself, so of course she had tasted it.","Just as An Ling was about to answer, she saw the other party suddenly take another bite.","With that noble and ascetic face biting into the cookie, the man used his long fingers to lift her chin, leaning down wanting to kiss her.","Over the past month, An Ling had formed a habit. Before her brain could even react, her hand had already instinctively blocked him.","In an instant, Shen Linyan's movements froze in place, his heart tightening slightly.","He maintained that posture without moving. Stray hairs fell across his forehead, and his gaze flickered slightly under the light. Countless complex emotions seemed to surge in the depths of his eyes.","An Ling paused in surprise. Just as she was about to speak, she saw the man let go of his hand.","He lowered his eyes obscurely, slowly ate the rest of the cookie, and said softly:","\"It's delicious.\""]},{"number":134,"title":"Chapter 134: Madam, Why Are You Hiding Didn't You Say You Would Teach Me to Be a Bad Person [Word Count Fulfilled]","paragraphs":["The air in the kitchen was somewhat quiet.","An Ling blinked, realizing it a beat too late.","Even though she had refused him before, Shen Linyan's gaze was strange this time.","Why did she feel like a heartless scoundrel?","\"Shen Linyan, you...\"","She hesitated, swallowing her words.","Hearing this, the man slowly raised his eyes, his dark pupils fixing on her.","\"Wife, it's been over a month.\"","\"Huh? Over a month of what?\" An Ling was momentarily stunned.","\"Every time I want to kiss you, you always reject me.\"","An Ling: \"...\" So it really was because of that.","Has it really been that long?","She had been so busy with work lately that she hadn't noticed how fast time had flown by.","An Ling touched her face, a little uncomfortably. \"You want a kiss...\"","It wasn't actually out of the question.","If she could just control herself, they could share a kiss.","The main issue was that she had just rejected Shen Linyan, and he seemed quite unhappy about it.","Thinking of this, she looked at the man. \"Then wait a second.\"","Turning to pick up a cookie from the table, An Ling walked up to him.","She took a bite, wrapped her arms around his waist, and holding the cookie between her teeth, stood on her tiptoes to lean close to his lips, blinking at him.","\"Hubby?\"","The girl's voice was muffled, the ending note lifting softly. Her fair, delicate face looked smooth and flawless under the light.","Shen Linyan lowered his eyelashes, the emotions in his eyes dark and indiscernible.","His slender fingers pinched her chin as he slowly lowered his head, his thin lips parting slightly to capture those soft petals.","His warm, wet tongue slipped into her mouth, sweeping away the piece of cookie, and just as he was about to deepen the kiss...","The very next second, the girl immediately turned her head away, speaking rapidly, \"That's enough.\"","It was as if she were just completing a task, without the slightest bit of lingering attachment.","Shen Linyan froze, his pupils dilating in slight shock.","This had never happened before.","It was as if... she truly had no feelings for him anymore.","Recovering himself, his Adam's apple bobbed. He didn't speak, just lowered his eyes to hide his emotions while his thumb wiped away the moisture at the corner of her mouth.","An Ling hugged his waist, coaxing him, \"Hubby, we're not kissing because your wound hasn't healed yet. We can do it once you're better.\"","This excuse again.","But looking at his wife in his arms, Shen Linyan ultimately forced himself to ignore the stirring of unease in his heart. He didn't say anything more, just giving a soft \"Mhm.\"","His wife was just worried about his health.","It couldn't possibly be because the novelty had worn off.","Seeing that she had finally placated him, An Ling breathed a sigh of relief.","She licked her slightly numb lips.","To be honest, it had been so long since she had kissed Shen Linyan that she had almost lost control just now.","But she really didn't want to have to go see Dr. Liang again.","\"You've been tired all day. Go take a shower first, and then get some rest early.\"","Saying this, An Ling turned around to pack up the remaining cookies on the table.","Just then, her phone nearby suddenly lit up.","She glanced over at it.","An Zhou: [We're doomed, An Ling. I just saw the 'good luck charm' Mom prepared. She's going to give it to you tomorrow.]","\"...\"","An Ling's eyelid twitched, and she swiftly flipped the phone face down.","Feeling that this action was too much of a giveaway, she subconsciously looked at the man.","Only to meet a pair of dark, quiet eyes.","Under the incandescent light, the man's figure was tall and straight. A shadow fell from the bridge of his high nose, his facial features were sharp and distinct, and the corners of his lips were drawn into a tight line.","He stood there quietly meeting her gaze, and she had no idea if he had seen the message.","He probably couldn't see it, right? There was quite a distance between them.","An Ling blinked and smiled at him, putting her phone away as if nothing had happened.","Just as she turned around to head back to the bedroom, the man's deep voice suddenly came from behind her.","\"Are you keeping secrets from me now?\"","His tone was slow and gentle, making it impossible to discern his emotions.","An Ling's footsteps stiffened slightly. \"...No, I'm not.\"","\"You never used to hide from me when reading your messages.\"","\"...\"","Gripping her phone, An Ling stayed silent for a few seconds before turning her head.","She put on a look of utmost sincerity.","\"I wasn't hiding it. It's not an important message anyway, so why would I hide it from you?\"","A \"good luck charm\" really wasn't a big deal.","It was just that Shen Linyan was very sensitive to the topic of physical intimacy tonight, and his reaction to her touch had been intense.","He had been clinging to her ever since they got back.","If this charm were brought up, who knew what this man would say, and she just so happened to be unable to resist his temptations.","So her first instinct was to not let Shen Linyan see it.","An Ling silently chanted to herself three times: Health comes first.","\"Go take a shower. It's getting late. It's the weekend tomorrow, let's go out and have some fun.\"","The girl's attempt to change the subject was far too obvious, and how could Shen Linyan not hear it? He stood frozen on the spot almost instantly.","An Ling untied her apron as she walked toward the sofa.","Sensing no movement behind her, she stopped and turned around.","Sure enough, the man was still standing where he was.","She narrowed her eyes, watched him for a few seconds, and walked back to him.","\"Shen Linyan, are you that curious about that message? Do you want to check my phone? Do you not trust me? Are you worried I'm cheating on you?\"","\"When you were in a coma in the hospital, I never even looked at your phone.\"","It wasn't that she was opposed to him checking her phone, she was just surprised that Shen Linyan had suddenly become so sensitive.","In the past, when she chatted with Jiang Mai, she would occasionally hide from Shen Linyan, but he was never curious. Even if he noticed, he wouldn't press the issue; he would just close his eyes, hold her, and go back to sleep.","Hearing this, the man's eyelashes trembled.","A moment later, he took out his own phone, placed it on the table, and voluntarily pushed it toward her.","\"You can check my phone.\"","He said softly, \"It's not that I don't trust you, and your messages are indeed your privacy.\"","An Ling: \"...\"","She glanced at the phone on the table, then looked back at the man in front of her.","She pushed the phone back to him.","\"No need to check. I trust you too.\"","It wasn't like Shen Linyan would cheat, so what was the point of checking?","Hearing this, the man's body stiffened, and his fingers resting at his sides slowly curled into fists.","An Ling didn't notice his strange reaction; her brain hadn't quite processed the situation yet.","The usual Shen Linyan wasn't like this.","Standing was too tiring, it would be better to go talk on the sofa.","She was just about to reach out and hold his hand.","When a hoarse voice sounded by her ear.","\"Has the novelty worn off for you?\"","An Ling: ?","What novelty?","She paused, stopping her movements in confusion. \"What?\"","Shen Linyan raised his eyes. His dark depths were completely still, yet a few fractured glimmers of light floated within them.","\"Wife, kissing won't tear my wound open at all. You just... don't want to touch me, right?\"","As his voice faded, the living room instantly plunged into silence.","An Ling's expression blanked slightly as she looked at him.","The crystal chandelier overhead shone blindingly bright. Shen Linyan stood there in his sharp suit, his dark hair falling over half of his eyes. His elegant, noble silhouette was bathed in shadow; despite his inherently dignified aura, he inexplicably exuded a fragile sense of loneliness.","The corners of his eyes drooped slightly, and his Adam's apple bobbed gently:","\"Did I do something wrong? For over a month now, it seems like you've lost all interest in me.\"","\"Didn't you say... you relied on me? But now, it feels like you don't care about me at all anymore. Is it because the novelty has worn off, or do you just find me boring?\"","The man's voice was gentle, but every word sounded as if it had been crushed before being spat out, hanging in the air, aching with bitterness.","From beginning to end, he didn't actually care what that message was.","He just wanted to be closer to An Ling.","He just wanted to prove the intimacy of their relationship.","Meanwhile, on the other side, An Ling was completely dumbfounded.","She had never thought Shen Linyan would think this way.","To be exact, she didn't even know where Shen Linyan had learned the word \"freshness.\"","A husband who didn't even really understand the concept of keeping male models actually knew what \"freshness\" meant?","Who taught her husband that?","She opened her mouth to say something, but her gaze fell on the table.","After a moment of silence, she picked up the man's phone, grabbed his wrist with her other hand, and walked toward the sofa.","\"Who taught you about freshness? When we're together normally, when have I ever treated you badly? I even specially made cookies for you today as a surprise.\"","Sitting on the sofa, An Ling turned her head and saw the man staring straight at her, a lingering trace of blankness still in his eyes.","After their eyes met, she leaned in and gave him a peck on the lips.","\"As for that kiss, it was really a subconscious reaction at the time. We hadn't kissed for over a month, and I didn't process it. If you don't believe me, let's kiss again right now.\"","An Ling was referring to the kiss from when she fed him the cookie.","After all, in her view, that was the only kiss that had an issue; there were absolutely no problems with anything after that.","The two fell silent for a few seconds. The man propped his hand on the sofa, his eyelashes drooping slightly. The lighting outlined the increasingly smooth and distinct contours of his profile as he slowly lowered his head.","The familiar scent of cedar washed over her. The man pecked at her lips little by little, gentle and cautious, like a probe, yet also like a confirmation.","An Ling tilted her head back, letting him kiss her.","After a while, someone cupped her cheeks.","The man opened his mouth and took her lower lip, his tongue gently licking over it. His warm breath brushed against her ear. \"Madam.\"","He tilted his head and kissed her cheek again. \"Madam.\"","The delicate kisses trailed downwards, landing on her snow-white neck.","\"Wife, I like you.\" The man's voice grew deeper, his tone lingering and affectionate.","An Ling wrapped her arms around his neck, not realizing when she had been pulled onto his lap to be kissed.","He buried his face in the side of her neck, his wet and warm kisses unceasing.","Her eyes grew misty, her lower back went soft, and she let out a soft moan.","She knew this would happen.","Now there was no stopping it.","Later, a certain someone was going to complain that she lacked freshness again.","Just as she was thinking this, her earlobe was suddenly bitten lightly, and the man gave it a gentle lick.","\"Since Madam doesn't hate it, why won't you let me kiss you? My wound obviously won't tear open. Besides, when Madam kissed me back, you only kissed me for a moment before stopping.\"","An Ling: \"...\"","Was she supposed to say she was losing control of herself?","An Ling's breathing was unsteady. She hummed but didn't answer, turning her head to grab Shen Linyan's phone, speaking with a slight pant.","\"Alright, stop kissing. Didn't you want me to check up on you? Come on, I'll check.\"","It was a good way to distract herself.","Shen Linyan's phone was very clean, and the apps were all basic ones, pretty much as An Ling expected.","That was why she said there was nothing to check!","Seeing the photo album, she turned and asked, \"Can I look at the album?\"","Shen Linyan kissed her cheek. \"Of course.\"","An Ling tapped it open, only to find that there were very few photos inside.","The most recent photo was actually from when Shen Linyan took a picture of the ring to post online.","She was about to exit when her gaze suddenly paused.","In the photos above, she saw two familiar pictures.","One was the photo of her and Shen Linyan's wedding rings from when they first clarified the rumors.","The other... was a screenshot of a memo.","[Guidelines for Shen Linyan to act like a bad guy.]","[First, Shen Linyan must listen to An Ling. If An Ling tells Shen Linyan to refuse, Shen Linyan must refuse. Second, when An Ling scolds someone, Shen Linyan must also scold them; if he doesn't know how, he can just listen, but he cannot play the peacemaker. Third... An Ling]","An Ling was slightly startled.","The man hugged her from behind, resting his chin on her shoulder, and let out a gentle laugh.","\"Does Madam still remember this?\"","An Ling's eyes grew red. She turned to look at him, her voice muffled, \"Why did you save this?\"","Shen Linyan caressed the corner of her eye and said with a smile:","\"Because someone sent me the picture back then and told me not to forget. Chat logs can get lost, so I had to save it.\"","His gaze landed on the screen, his fingertip tapping on the fifth rule.","\"Does Madam still remember this one?\"","[Before the mutual interest relationship between the two parties ends, neither party is allowed to develop feelings for anyone else. Once feelings are developed, the relationship of interest will be immediately terminated.]","Of course An Ling remembered. \"You even asked me at the time if I would develop feelings. How could I possibly develop feelings for Lu Jingshen?\"","Shen Linyan's eyes curved into a smile. \"Actually, what I asked back then was, if I developed feelings for Madam, would that count as a violation? Madam said it would.\"","He lowered his head, his eyes curved and his tone carrying a faint smile.","\"Madam, it seems your rules for teaching me how to be a bad guy ended a long time ago.\"","From his initial interest to later on, he didn't even know when his heart had fallen.","Perhaps the very moment this rule was established, he had already subconsciously fallen for An Ling.","Only then did An Ling realize the truth. Her face flushed slightly, and she muttered softly, \"I knew you were playing word games!\"","Shen Linyan smiled and nuzzled against her cheek.","\"Then Madam can teach me how to be a bad guy all over again. I won't play word games this time. I promise to follow the rules, alright?\"","An Ling shot him a few glances before humming softly, \"I reluctantly agree.\"","She took out her own phone, looked down, and opened the memo app.","\"Then I have to delete the fifth rule. No, I'm going to revise all the conditions.\"","\"Shen Linyan must unconditionally obey all of An Ling's requests and instructions.\"","Making such an edit, she couldn't even hold back her own laughter. She turned to look at the man and raised an eyebrow.","\"Do you have any objections, Mr. Shen?\"","Shen Linyan smiled and shook his head. \"None at all, Miss An.\"","As An Ling was looking down and typing, the man's voice slowly rang in her ear again.","\"So what exactly was that very first message? Why won't Madam tell me?\"","\"...\"","An Ling paused her movements and raised her eyes to glance at him.","After a moment of silence, she still dug out that message from An Zhou to show him.","Anyway, even if she didn't say anything, Mom would tell Shen Linyan.","Shen Linyan finished reading the message and didn't speak.","His eyes stared fixedly at her, and only after a moment did he slowly speak up:","\"Why hide it? Do you not want to do it with me?\"","An Ling: \"...\"","Did this man have any self-awareness at all?!","\"You're still injured.\"","Hearing this, the man gently kissed the tip of her ear. His voice was very light, deep and sexy, carrying an indescribable allure.","\"Actually, I'm fully healed, Madam. Really.\"","His slender fingers slipped in under the hem of her clothes, his warm palm pressing against the dimples of the woman's lower back, his rough fingertips rubbing in circles.","\"Mmh...\" An Ling's body trembled. Biting her lip, she almost couldn't hold back. Gripping her phone tightly, the corners of her eyes flushed red. She turned her head and met the man's exquisitely noble face, which looked even more aloof and handsome under the light.","Shen Linyan's eyes curved in a smile as he bit her lip and softly murmured, \"Let's try, okay? Madam, there won't be any problems.\"","An Ling still wanted to struggle up. \"I need to revise the rules. We can talk about this later.\"","The man directly picked her up, startling An Ling so much that she hurriedly hugged his neck. \"Shen Linyan, your wound!\"","\"Madam, I already told you I'm healed.\"","Shen Linyan's footsteps were steady as he smiled and lowered his voice,","\"Besides, aren't we revising the rules? You can ask me while you revise them, my wife.\"","The door clicked shut, and the soft, intimate sounds of kissing instantly echoed from within.","Late into the night, suppressed pants and muffled groans filled the dimly lit bedroom. Moonlight spilled through the gap in the curtains, illuminating the tangled mess of men's and women's clothing scattered across the floor.","Covered in love bites, An Ling lay on the bed, utterly exhausted. Yet, the man pressed down on her from behind again, pressing kisses along her spine.","Biting her lower lip, she let out a muffled whimper, wanting to weep but having no tears left. \"I can't do this anymore...\"","It was too much; she really couldn't take any more!","Why did Shen Linyan keep going?! So what if they hadn't done it in a month!","To make matters worse, he kept asking her if the revised rules were good while they were at it. He relentlessly badgered her about when she would start teaching him how to be a bad guy, and whenever she failed to answer, he would thrust harder.","Be a bad guy, my foot!","Propping herself up against the mattress, An Ling's eyes brimmed with tears. Trembling and weeping, she tried to crawl off the bed, only for a large hand to wrap around her ankle and drag her right back.","The familiar, crisp scent of cedarwood enveloped her. The man tilted her chin up, his deep voice laced with amusement as his scorching breath brushed against the tip of her ear.","\"What are you running from, my wife? Didn't you say you were going to teach me how to be a bad guy?\""]},{"number":135,"title":"Chapter 135: Did My Wife Do It on Purpose","paragraphs":["On the second to last day, it was still Shen Linyan who delivered the cookies to the An family's home.","An Ling was sleeping groggily when, in the next second, she was pulled into a warm embrace.","Catching that familiar scent, she turned over with her eyes still closed, her voice soft and slightly drawn out at the end, \"Have you finished delivering the cookies?\"","Shen Linyan kissed her forehead. \"I dropped them off. Mom even asked me why you didn't come.\"","Was it that she didn't want to go?","An Ling let out a soft snort with her eyes closed and pushed his arm away. \"And whose fault is that?\"","She had originally planned to go on a date after delivering the cookies!","\"My fault, my fault.\"","The man's tone held a smile as he pulled her back into his arms, gently massaging her waist. \"I booked a restaurant for tonight.\"","An Ling didn't even know how many times they had done it last night; everything below her waist felt numb. Being massaged by him felt so comfortable that she grew drowsy.","Halfway through the massage, his movements suddenly stopped as if he was reaching for something.","\"Honey, Mom said to give this to you.\"","\"Hmm?\"","She groggily reached out to take the item, her slender, fair arms covered in hickeys.","\"What is it?\"","Opening her sleepy eyes, she glanced at the object in her hand.","When she saw the familiar piece of yellow paper, her sleepiness vanished instantly. Her face flushed bright red, as if she were holding a hot potato.","\"Why did you bring this back!\"","Didn't Mom say it was for her?! How did it end up in Shen Linyan's hands!","\"Mom asked me to bring it over, saying you should put it under your pillow,\" Shen Linyan said, smiling as he held her hand.","His lips were practically brushing against her ear as he spoke. \"If I had known, I would have gone to get it last night, right, honey?\"","The man's voice was wrapped in a smile, deep and magnetic.","Last night, he had used this exact same tone, leaning into her ear to say, \"Honey, just one last time,\" only to trick her again and again.","Yet, the moment she heard his voice, she completely lost her temper.","An Ling silently muttered a few times about how a pretty face could ruin a person. With red ears, she stuffed the talisman paper under her pillow. \"What do you mean 'right'? I don't understand. I'm a materialist, I don't believe in this stuff.\"","\"So what my wife means is that if we try a few more times, then...\"","\"I didn't say that!\"","An Ling covered his mouth and turned her back to him. \"I'm going to sleep. I'm ignoring you.\"","Shen Linyan smiled, hugging her again and gently massaging her waist. \"Alright, go to sleep, my wife.\"","Outside the window, sunlight slipped through the gaps in the curtains and crept onto the edge of the bed. An Ling kept her eyes closed, listening to the breathing of the man behind her, before slowly opening them again.","She sluggishly turned her head to cast a glance.","\"Didn't you want to know why I haven't kissed you for the past month?\"","\"Hmm?\"","An Ling's eyes curved into crescents. Clinging to his shoulders, she looked up, leaned close to his ear, and slowly whispered something.","In an instant, the man's breathing turned ragged.","The muscles in his arms tensed slightly, his Adam's apple bobbed, and his eyes darkened. He lowered his head, just about to kiss her lips.","But the girl simply tilted her head away and flopped back onto the pillow with her eyes closed.","\"Ah, I'm so tired, so tired, so tired... Hubby, I want to sleep. My body is so sore, I don't want to move at all.\"","Her tone was feigning pitifulness, and her beautiful face still bore a lingering flush, making it impossible for anyone to be mad at her.","Shen Linyan paused. He slowly lowered his head, lightly pressing the tip of his nose against the girl's cheek. His breath was scalding, and his voice was a bit hoarse. \"Did you do that on purpose, honey?\"","An Ling opened her eyes and blinked at him. \"What on purpose? You were the one who asked.\"","She absolutely did it on purpose.","Who told Shen Linyan to keep tricking her last night.","In order to avoid being seduced by his good looks, An Ling smartly closed her eyes and turned her back. \"Alright, now I'm really going to sleep.\"","But in the very next second, her back was pressed against the man's burning chest, and dense, gentle kisses rained down on the side of her neck.","\"My wife,\" a low chuckle escaped his throat. \"There are actually many other ways.\"","An Ling: ?","The next second, her wrist was gently grasped.","\"?!?\"","She widened her eyes in shock, turning her head only to meet the man's curved, smiling eyes.","He tenderly kissed her face, then kissed her lips over and over again. Accompanied by heavy panting, his cold and noble features looked increasingly sexy due to his restrained lust. \"Baby.\"","An Ling: \"...\"","Her husband was so handsome.","...","On the day of An Zhou's wedding, the banquet hall was filled with white roses.","The crystal chandeliers poured out a warm, golden, soft light, shimmering brightly. The sides of the runway were covered with creamy white velvet carpets.","The area below the stage was packed with guests. An Ling sat on the groom's side, looking up at the stage.","An Zhou was dressed in a black suit, his posture straight and proper. His hair was meticulously styled, and there was a touch of maturity in his features.","Finding it somewhat novel, An Ling took out her phone, snapped a picture of him, and showed it to Shen Linyan beside her. \"This is my first time seeing my brother like this.\"","Normally, An Zhou always had a careless, laid-back attitude. She didn't expect him to actually look quite handsome when he got serious.","Shen Linyan lowered his eyes to take a look.","\"It is indeed very different.\"","\"Right? Even I haven't seen him much like this—\"","\"My wife seems to have never taken a photo of me.\"","\"...\" Here he goes again.","An Ling turned her head to look at him.","After a few seconds of silent eye contact, she looked around. Seeing that no one was paying attention to them, she opened her camera, switched to the front-facing lens, and, with smiling eyes, curled her finger at the man.","\"Come here, hubby.\"","\"Coming.\" Shen Linyan smiled, gently resting his chin in the palm of her hand.","As the shutter clicked, the corners of the man's lips curled up slightly. He suddenly turned his head and planted a feather-light kiss on her cheek.","As the music in the banquet hall began to play, Qin You appeared in a trailing wedding gown. The hem of her dress was adorned with crushed rhinestones and pearls, and her veil lightly brushed over her shoulders. She looked exquisite and beautiful, carrying an air of elegant and quiet gentleness.","Following the schedule, they said their vows and exchanged rings. The moment they embraced and kissed, thunderous applause erupted throughout the hall.","Confetti and flower petals danced in the air, and the lights flashed, freezing the most romantic moment in time.","An Ling sat below the stage, staring at the scene in a trance. Suddenly, under the dining table, someone gently hooked her finger.","She turned her head and met the man's gentle gaze.","She slowly curved her eyes into a smile and hooked her fingers around his in return.","...","After the wedding, the New Year was also approaching.","An Ling and Shen Linyan had their New Year's Eve dinner at the An family home. After the meal, the family was watching TV on the sofa when Mother An suddenly spoke up.","\"An Zhou, Lingling, do you want to play mahjong?\"","An Zhou: \"...\"","An Ling: \"...\"","Qin You, who was sitting to the side, hadn't even reacted before An Zhou pulled her up. \"Mom, I'm taking Youyou outside to set off fireworks.\"","Qin You stood up with him, completely confused. As they walked to the door, her puzzled voice could still be heard, \"Mom said she wanted to play, why aren't we playing?\"","An Zhou quickly shushed her twice and lowered his voice. \"If we start playing, it'll go on until midnight. Can your healthy sleep schedule handle staying up that late, my dear lady?\"","Qin You: \"Aren't you the one playing? Why do I have to stay up?\"","An Zhou: \"You're not going to keep me company?!\"","Qin You: \"Yeah.\"","An Zhou: \"...\"","He sounded as if he were gritting his back teeth. \"No way! Our family has a mahjong tradition: a wife must accompany her husband when he plays.\"","Mother An's voice leisurely drifted over: \"No we don't. Last time Xiao Yan even went to Lingling's room to rest.\"","An Zhou: \"...Mom!\"","A woman's faint laugh could be heard in the air.","\"Go ahead and laugh at your husband!\" An Zhou said, pulling her out the door.","Following the sound of the door closing, Mother An looked at An Ling beside her.","An Ling: \"...\"","She silently stood up, her gaze shifting evasively. \"Honey... let's go out for a walk too. Didn't you say you were curious about what fun things there are to do around here?\"","Mother An looked suspicious. \"Is that true?\"","An Ling hid her hand behind her back, secretly signaling the man.","Shen Linyan grasped her hand, smiling as he gave Mother An a slight nod. \"It is true, Mom.\"","Mother An sighed and waved them off. \"Go on, go on.\"","Once everyone had left, she picked up her phone.","These kids, honestly. Now she could only play digital mahjong.","She patted Father An beside her.","\"Lao An, hurry up and enter the lobby. I sent you an invite.\""]},{"number":136,"title":"Chapter 136: I Love You [End of Text]","paragraphs":["Stepping outside, the evening breeze carried a slight chill. The sound of fireworks echoed in their ears, and the dim yellow streetlights cast a warm, bright glow over the road.","An Ling's hand was held by the man and tucked into his overcoat pocket. Walking along the familiar street, she suddenly looked up. \"I remember you walked me home once before. It was this exact road, wasn't it?\"","Shen Linyan smiled and said gently, \"Yes. My wife told me not to walk her all the way back.\"","\"Of course. After all, we were going through a divorce back then. Plus, my brother warned me time and time again not to be with you.\"","Though in the end, he still couldn't prevent it.","The memories of the past rushed back in this moment, feeling almost like a lifetime ago.","\"Time flies. I still remember when we first got divorced.\"","Hearing this, Shen Linyan paused his steps slightly.","His tone was soft and slow. \"Does my wife only remember what happened after the divorce?\"","An Ling's eyelids twitched. \"...I remember before the divorce, too.\"","\"Is that so? I remember too. Before the divorce, my wife even celebrated my birthday with me.\"","\"...\"","\"That was the first birthday I ever celebrated, but my wife brought up divorce on my birthday. I was truly heartbroken back then. And after the divorce, my wife pretended not to know me.\"","\"...\"","An Ling shot him a sideways glance, her brow suddenly relaxing.","She spoke slowly, \"Hubby, those messages you sent me back then, saying that your love for me was all fake... I was truly heartbroken too.\"","\"You also said you only treated me well out of guilt. Was that true? Is it still true now?\"","Shen Linyan: \"...\"","Recovering himself, a laugh rumbled from his chest. He stopped, leaned down, and kissed the girl's forehead, then kissed the corner of her eye. \"I apologize to my wife. It was my fault.\"","An Ling huffed. \"I'll have to think about whether to forgive you.\"","Shen Linyan was about to say something when An Zhou's voice suddenly rang in their ears.","\"An Ling!\"","Looking over, they saw An Zhou and Qin You standing not far away. An Zhou was holding small sparklers in his hand.","He gestured with them. \"Want to go to the nearby park to light some sparklers?\"","That was the only place nearby where fireworks were permitted.","An Ling's eyes lit up. She turned to Shen Linyan, \"Shall we go?\"","Shen Linyan smiled and nodded, \"Let's go.\"","An Ling snagged a few sparklers from An Zhou, and Shen Linyan lit them for her.","Under the night sky, the pale gold sparks burned and bloomed in the air, clear and bright. The fragmented, crystalline light fell to the ground like embers scattered by the wind.","Holding the sparklers, An Ling handed her phone to Shen Linyan.","\"Hubby, record a video for me.\"","\"Okay.\"","Shen Linyan took the phone and pressed record.","His gaze gradually settled on the girl's face on the screen.","The sparkling light fell on her cheeks, making her skin look translucent and white. Even her fine peach fuzz was softly visible. As she looked down at the sparklers, her long eyelashes fluttered gently like butterfly wings.","He stared, entranced.","The next second, the girl suddenly turned to look at him.","Her eyes were sparkling, her cheeks warmed by the glow of the fireworks, and her beautiful features blended into the soft halo of light.","Her eyes curved into a smile, her gaze looking straight at him through the screen.","\"Shen Linyan, Happy New Year.\"","\"Let's celebrate your birthday anew this year.\"","In that instant, the noisy, clamoring sound of the fireworks seemed to have been muted by someone. The world suddenly fell quiet.","The surrounding voices faded away, and even the crackling of the fireworks dissolved into nothingness.","All that remained was the girl's soft, slightly sweet voice, landing gently by his ear.","Shen Linyan's eyes widened slightly in a daze. A moment later, his usually cool and aloof eyes slowly curved, and a very faint, yet incredibly tender smile graced his lips.","He moved the phone away slightly, smiling as he lowered his head to kiss her cheek. His nose gently brushed against hers, his voice full of doting affection.","\"Okay, my wife.\"","...","The weather gradually warmed, and the ice and snow melted away bit by bit.","The wind no longer carried a biting chill; instead, it held a gentle, moist warmth.","Luxury cars were parked outside the top-tier hotel, and big shots from various commercial brands had arrived.","Inside the banquet hall, both sides of the stage were surrounded by layers of massive floral arrangements. White roses, champagne lisianthus, and misty eucalyptus intertwined into a sea of flowers, spreading all the way from the entrance to the main stage. The floral scent was light yet rich, exuding high-end luxury.","Damian stepped out of his car and walked into the banquet hall. Seeing the man at the entrance, he smiled and waved.","\"Hey! Shen!\"","The man wore a custom haute-couture black suit. His posture was tall and lean, his features warm and refined, and his aura as noble and elegant as the moonlight.","Hearing the voice, he lifted his eyes slightly, a faint smile on his lips. He reached out his hand, \"Damian, thank you for making the trip.\"","\"What are you saying? Of course I had to come to your wedding!\"","Damian's gaze fell on his face. After observing him for a few seconds, he grinned. \"You really are a happy man, it's completely different. Your smile today is so much more genuine than before!\"","Shen Linyan paused for a moment, then curved his lips into a smile. \"Thank you.\"","Damian winked playfully. \"Looks like I finally get to see your wife with my own eyes this time. I heard she's very beautiful.\"","Shen Linyan smiled and said, \"Yes, she is very beautiful.\"","It was an undisguised compliment, his words carrying a tender love that even he hadn't noticed.","Hearing this, Damian's eyes widened in surprise. Once he processed it, a teasing glint appeared in his eyes, and he smiled and nodded.","Wow, seeing Shen Linyan like this was truly a miraculous sight.","After a brief exchange of pleasantries, Damian went off to chat with others, letting Shen Linyan get back to his duties.","Shen Linyan stood there for a moment before turning and heading toward the private elevator.","\"Ding—\"","The elevator doors opened, and the man stepped out with his long legs, walking toward the room.","A sign hanging on the door read [Bridal Waiting Room].","He raised his hand and knocked gently.","Footsteps sounded from inside, and the door was opened.","He asked gently, \"Are you still doing makeup? Can I come in?\"","Jiang Mai was stunned for a second but quickly recovered. Smiling, she stepped aside to let him in. \"The makeup is done, and she's changed into her dress. We were just taking pictures. Come in, I was just about to head out and take a look around anyway.\"","As she left, she thoughtfully closed the door behind her.","Shen Linyan walked in and turned the corner.","Then, his footsteps paused slightly.","He saw An Ling sitting in front of the mirror. Her soft, long hair was pinned up, and the custom haute-couture wedding dress hugged her figure, accentuating the elegant lines of her shoulders and neck, and her delicate collarbones. The skirt was adorned with crushed diamonds, and her skin was dazzlingly white.","Seeing him through the mirror, she turned around and said in pleasant surprise, \"Why are you here?\"","\"To see my wife.\"","An Ling was already naturally stunning, possessing the kind of beauty that took one's breath away at first glance—both delicate and glamorous. With her makeup done, her face looked even more gorgeous.","He took a few steps closer, lowering his eyes as his thumb gently brushed her earlobe. The girl's eyelashes were long, the corners of her eyes tilted up slightly, and her crimson lips were full.","His eyes curved as he spoke in a gentle tone, \"My wife is very beautiful today.\"","An Ling raised an eyebrow and looked up. \"Am I not beautiful normally?\"","\"My wife is beautiful all the time.\" Shen Linyan smiled and lowered his head. Afraid of ruining her makeup, he ultimately just placed a soft kiss on the gemstone earring dangling from her earlobe.","An Ling raised her hand to help him adjust his tie. \"Well, my hubby is also very handsome today.\"","Shen Linyan stared into her eyes. His Adam's apple bobbed slightly, and his voice was very soft.","\"Does my wife like today's wedding venue?\"","An Ling had already gone to see the venue earlier. Her eyes lit up as she nodded, \"I love it! It's even more beautiful than the ones I saw in videos before!\"","Looking into the girl's joyful eyes, he couldn't hold back. He gently brushed his lips against hers, his eyes curving into a smile as he whispered,","\"My wife, we are finally getting married.\"","...","The ceremony began, and music echoed through the banquet hall.","As the spotlight turned on, the grand doors slowly pushed open.","An Ling walked in, her arm linked with her father's, and made her way toward the main stage step by step.","The moment An Ling's hand was placed into his palm, Shen Linyan immediately clasped it tightly, as if he were holding the sole treasure of his life.","He cast his gaze down at her. A gentle softness washed over his usually aloof features, the corners of his lips turning up with a faint smile in his eyes.","An Ling looked back at him, her eyes curving into a sweet smile.","After the rings were exchanged, Wang Yihong's teasing voice rang out from the audience.","\"Kiss her!\"","Immediately after, a chorus of cheers followed.","\"Kiss her!\"","\"Kiss her!\"","An Ling's face flushed a delicate shade of red. The hazy light, a beautiful weave of cool white and warm gold, fell upon her face, making her skin look exceptionally fair and flawless.","Her long eyelashes fluttered. She lifted her gaze to the man standing before her, locking straight into a pair of incredibly gentle eyes.","Shen Linyan smiled and lowered his head, affectionately rubbing the tip of his nose against hers. His voice was so soft that only the two of them could hear it.","\"Mrs. Shen, spring is here.\"","Winter had faded, and spring had arrived.","The ending of the past had been rewritten.","From this day forward, through every morning and night, their happiness would never come to an end.","Amidst the cheers of the crowd, Shen Linyan smiled, gently cupped her face in his hands, and lowered his head to capture her lips.","\"An Ling, I love you.\"","[End of Main Text]"]},{"number":137,"title":"Chapter 137: Extra: If Scenario","paragraphs":["An Ling was woken up by a knock on the door.","\"Knock, knock—\"","She struggled to open her eyes, her head splitting. Frowning, she rubbed her forehead and turned to grab her phone.","8:13 AM.","She had stayed up late last night writing a proposal, finally handing it over to Ms. Chen, and hadn't gone to bed until four in the morning.","Auntie Wang's voice sounded from outside the door: \"Miss, Madam is asking if you're awake. If you are, she wants you to come down. We have guests.\"","\"...\"","Well, wasn't I woken up by the knocking?","She answered with her eyes closed, \"Okay, I'll be right down.\"","What kind of guest comes to visit this early in the morning?","She opened her eyes, stretched, and got out of bed to go wash up in the bathroom.","Standing in front of the mirror brushing her teeth, An Ling leaned in closer and touched her dark circles. \"Should I conceal this a bit...\"","Didn't Mom know she had face blindness? She could have just said she wasn't home. Why did she specifically ask Auntie Wang to come up and call her?","After tidying up simply, she grabbed a jacket and opened her bedroom door.","Just as she went downstairs, Mother An saw her and quickly waved her over.","\"Lingling, come quickly and say hello to your Auntie Lu.\"","Sitting in the living room was an unfamiliar woman, along with a man she didn't recognize.","She sat down next to her mother and smiled politely. \"Hello, Auntie Lu.\"","\"Hello,\" Mrs. Shen replied with a smile, her gaze casually sweeping over her.","The girl in front of her had delicate and refined features, smooth white skin, a small nose, and full lips. Her slightly wavy long hair was soft, and her smile was very comforting, lacking any aggressiveness.","She looked quite obedient and easy to control.","After a brief thought, she smiled at Mother An, \"Mrs. An, you are so lucky to have such a beautiful daughter. Unlike this son of mine, who always makes me worry.\"","Saying that, she turned to the side and introduced him to An Ling, \"An Ling, this is my younger son, Lu Jingshen. You two are about the same age, so it's a good opportunity to get to know each other and make friends.\"","Lu Jingshen's expression was a bit unnatural, as if he was impatient but holding back from lashing out. Still, he nodded at her in greeting.","An Ling's eyelid twitched.","What was going on?","Something about this scene felt off.","She forced a smile as a greeting.","She secretly shot her mother a look, but Mother An subtly shook her head, seemingly a bit helpless herself.","She put down her teacup and returned the polite flattery, \"You're too modest, Mrs. Shen. Jingshen has returned to the company now, hasn't he? I heard he's already the CEO, so his abilities must be impressive.\"","At the mention of this topic, Mother Shen's smile deepened.","But immediately after, Mother An's next words made her smile stiffen slightly.","\"And I remember that Mrs. Shen's eldest son also returned to the country recently. He took over the Shen Group as soon as he came back. With two such capable sons, Mrs. Shen is truly blessed.\"","Mrs. Shen quickly adjusted her expression, \"Not at all, my eldest son is just busy with work...\"","She smoothly changed the subject, \"An Ling, why don't you and Jingshen exchange contact info? You can keep in touch more in the future.\"","Unable to refuse, An Ling had to add him.","After they left, before she could even ask, Mother An spoke up first: \"You saw that, right? That was the Shen family. They suddenly came to visit early this morning. It looks like they want to renew the marriage arrangement.\"","An Ling knew her family and the Shen family had an arranged marriage agreement.","But after so many years had passed without the Shen family bringing it up—or even initiating contact with the An family—everyone had stopped taking the engagement seriously. Now, they suddenly showed up today proposing a marriage alliance.","She yawned and stood up, \"I was wondering why I was suddenly called down. I'm going back upstairs to catch up on sleep.\"","Mother An didn't reject this kind of marriage alliance, but it mostly depended on An Ling's attitude. \"That was their younger son just now. See if he catches your eye. If you guys hit it off, you can give it a try. If not, forget it.\"","Give it a try?","An Ling pondered for a moment, then turned her head and blinked.","\"I've already forgotten what he looks like.\"","\"Besides, he doesn't catch my eye.\"","She had no good impression of him the moment she saw him.","Coming for a visit with a long face—who owed him anything?","...","Sleeping in until the afternoon, An Ling emerged from her blankets. Her hair was scattered across her fair cheeks, and her face carried the drowsy, lazy look of someone who had just woken up.","She grabbed her phone from the side and checked the time.","While she was sleeping, Jiang Mai had texted her, asking if she wanted to go out tonight, saying she had found a really interesting place.","Just as she agreed, a message suddenly popped up.","Lu Jingshen: [When are you free? We could go out for a meal together.]","Who is this?","Still a bit groggy from sleep, An Ling didn't react immediately. She squinted her eyes, thinking for a few seconds before remembering that she had added someone that morning.","She twitched the corner of her mouth, rubbed her hair, sat up, and replied to the message.","An Ling: [Sorry, I don't have time.]","Who does he think he's ordering around?","...","At 8:00 PM,","The night was heavy. The neon lights at the entrance of the Golden Palace were shining brightly, and the loud music from inside could be heard, dividing the inside and outside into two different worlds.","An Ling stepped out of the car in high heels, the hem of her skirt brushing against her slender ankles. She closed the car door and glanced up at the signboard.","\"This is the fun place you were talking about? Isn't this a bar?\"","Jiang Mai, who was taking photos, heard her and replied, \"This isn't just a simple bar. It's really famous online. I heard a lot of rich people come here to hang out. I saw it on my feed before but haven't been here yet. Let's go in and have fun.\"","After they went in, a black Bentley stopped smoothly at the entrance.","The attendant at the door hurriedly stepped forward to open the car door.","Into view came shiny black leather shoes lightly tapping the ground, and suit trousers sharply wrapping around long, straight legs.","The man was dressed in a crisp suit, boasting excellent body proportions with broad shoulders and a narrow waist. His hair was meticulously styled.","As soon as he got out of the car, he instantly attracted the attention of the people around him.","The manager, who had been waiting, quickly came forward to greet him: \"Chairman Shen, President Wang asked me to take you over.\"","The man gave a hum of acknowledgment and followed the manager into the club.","Inside the bar, the music was deafening, and the crowd was packed shoulder to shoulder.","In the dim space, colored lights flickered on and off, blinding to the eyes. The noise and the smell of alcohol tangled together, creating a chaotic atmosphere that made it hard to breathe.","An Ling rarely came to places like this. To be precise, she didn't like going to crowded places.","Her ears ached from the noise as soon as she walked in. She looked up at the second floor.","Noticing that the upstairs space was spacious with fewer people, An Ling then looked towards the center of the dance floor.","Jiang Mai was already mingling and having fun with the crowd. Not wanting to disturb her, An Ling picked up her glass and left the bar area.","Just as she reached the stairs, a few bodyguards in suits saw her trying to go up and reached out to stop her. \"Sorry, Miss. Upstairs is the VIP member area, it's not open to the public.\"","Member area?","No wonder there were so few people.","An Ling nodded. \"Alright.\"","Just as she was about to turn around and head back to the bar, the rhythmic sound of footsteps echoed behind her, approaching the stairs.","She turned her head to look in the direction of the sound.","She happened to meet a man's eyes.","The bar's lighting was dim, but his eyes were deep and pitch-black like a deep well. The light fell on the side of his face, making his handsome profile look even more refined and elegant. His expression was calm.","After their eyes met, An Ling was slightly startled.","The man, however, calmly withdrew his gaze and stepped upstairs.","She took a sip of her drink, blinked, and turned to walk back to the bar.","At this moment, the man's footsteps going upstairs suddenly paused. He turned his head and looked down with lowered eyes.","His gaze fell on that figure from behind, paused for only a brief moment, and then slowly shifted away.","Inside the private room.","Wang Yihong signaled for the waiter to leave, then turned his head toward the man sitting on the other side.","\"Brother Shen, how does it feel to be back?\"","On the sofa, the man held a wine glass between his long, well-defined fingers. Hearing this, he slowly raised his eyes. \"It's alright.\"","Gu Xiaochi sat with his legs crossed, toying with his phone. \"You've already made quite a name for yourself right after coming back.\"","Shen Linyan had returned to the country a few months ago. Within a month of landing, he had parachuted straight into the position of Chairman of the Shen Group.","\"That old woman seems desperate right now.\"","He held up his phone. \"Shen Fuyuan just told me that to pave the way for Lu Jingshen, that old woman even dug up a marriage agreement from over twenty years ago. Today, she even took Lu Jingshen to the An family's residence for a visit.\"","Wang Yihong was a bit surprised. \"Damn, seriously? She's going that far? Even resorting to a marriage alliance?\"","But it was true; the An family was a massive enterprise. An alliance with them would only benefit Lu Jingshen.","\"He won't be able to go through with it,\" Shen Linyan chuckled lightly.","Seeing his reaction, the other two raised their eyebrows.","Gu Xiaochi changed his posture and asked quietly, \"Why? Did you do something? Or are you going to marry her instead?\"","\"I don't need to do anything. He will refuse it himself.\"","The man set down his glass, his tone flat:","\"I have no interest in an arranged marriage either.\"","No interest?","Wang Yihong and Gu Xiaochi weren't surprised by this answer.","With Shen Linyan's power, he didn't need to rely on a marriage alliance.","\"Still, I've never even seen what that eldest daughter of the An family looks like.\"","Wang Yihong pondered, \"I've only met the CEO of the An Group; he occasionally comes to my place.\"","But as for the An family's daughter, very few people had ever seen her.","She was probably the most low-profile heiress out there.","\"Shen Fuyuan said she's quite pretty,\" Gu Xiaochi glanced at his phone. \"But she only heard that from others. Who knows if it's true.\"","Pretty?","Shen Linyan lowered his eyes and took a sip of his wine, showing little interest in the topic.","He didn't care whether the An family's daughter was pretty or not.","After all, it had nothing to do with him.","Seeing the two of them getting more and more enthusiastic about discussing this An family heiress, he rubbed his temples and set down his glass. \"I'm going out for a bit. I'll come back when you guys are done talking.\"","Stepping out of the private room, he passed the corner.","Just as he was about to reach the viewing balcony, his footsteps suddenly halted.","Not far away, a young woman was leaning against the railing. She wore a dark velvet dress that cascaded smoothly down her waistline, the hem just covering her ankles, revealing only a glimpse of her slender ankles.","Her long hair was loosely pinned behind her head, with a few stray strands falling against the snowy white curve of her neck. She wore no extra accessories, save for a pair of small diamond studs that glimmered faintly in the dim light.","She leaned against the railing, holding her phone with one hand to record something. Her side profile was beautiful, her eyelashes lowered, exuding a quiet and noble elegance.","Almost instantly, Shen Linyan recognized her as the girl who had been stopped by the bodyguards downstairs earlier.","After a moment of hesitation, his long legs carried him over.","An Ling was currently recording a video of Jiang Mai dancing in the center of the dance floor.","As expected of the VIP section, the view from the second floor was indeed excellent.","After recording for a while, she had just pressed stop when the sound of footsteps came from beside her.","She instinctively turned her head to look. When she saw the man's somewhat familiar face, she froze for a moment before quickly and politely withdrawing her gaze.","He looked a bit familiar.","Was this the man she met on the stairs earlier?","The man stood on the other side of the railing, politely maintaining a safe distance from her, quietly watching the dancing crowd on the first floor.","An Ling was truly curious.","Mainly because she had had a bit to drink, making her face blindness a bit worse, so she wasn't entirely sure if it was him.","But on the entire second floor, the only devastatingly handsome man who could leave a slight impression on her seemed to be the one she had bumped into at the staircase.","The main issue was that during their previous encounter, An Ling felt the other party was a bit aloof, making her hesitant to strike up a conversation.","She cast another glance from the corner of her eye, and this time, her gaze happened to meet the man's eyes.","An Ling's face flushed slightly.","Why did she always end up making eye contact with people?","Feeling a bit embarrassed, she was just about to look away.","Unexpectedly, in the very next second, the man suddenly spoke to her, his tone gentle: \"Hello.\"","Startled, she nodded in response. \"Hello.\"","This person's voice was actually quite nice.","The thought flashed through her mind.","An Ling blinked.","He didn't seem that cold after all; he spoke quite gently.","After hesitating for a few seconds, she tilted her head to look at the man, her eyes curving into a smile as she blinked. \"Um, sir, you look a bit familiar. Did we just run into each other at the staircase?\"","The girl's voice was clear and soft, her tone polite and laced with a hint of curiosity. Her eyes were as clear as if they were soaked in shattered starlight.","Shen Linyan's gaze paused for an imperceptible moment.","After a moment of silence, he slightly lowered his eyes and nodded gently. \"Yes.\"","\"I knew it,\" An Ling smiled, her eyes curving, as this was the first time she had remembered a stranger. \"I told myself I wouldn't mistake you.\"","Sure enough, being handsome made one very distinctive.","She looked down to check the video she had just recorded.","Beside her came the man's gentle voice.","\"Did your friend bring you up here?\"","\"Hmm?\" An Ling looked up.","The man seemed to be asking casually, his eyes lowered to watch the dance floor below. Sensing her gaze, he looked up at her, his tone mild.","\"I saw you being stopped earlier. If your friend was upstairs, you could have let me bring you up with me then.\"","An Ling chuckled and quickly waved her hand. \"No, no, my friend is downstairs. I was able to come up because I got a membership.\"","The membership required proof of funds, and as long as one met the qualifications, they could get it. An Ling hadn't expected it to be so easy either.","She blinked at the man. \"So they can't stop me anymore.\"","The girl's beautiful face bore a proud expression, like a proud little cat.","Shen Linyan was slightly taken aback, then let out a low chuckle and nodded. \"I see.\"","His gaze fell on the girl's phone. \"Recording a video?\"","\"Recording a video for my friend, she wants to watch it later.\" An Ling had originally come up to air out the smell of alcohol, but when Jiang Mai found out, she asked her to help take a video.","Shen Linyan gave a soft mm in response.","His gaze landed on the girl's earnest side profile, and he unconsciously stared for a few seconds.","In the next second, the girl suddenly turned to look at him and blinked.","Shen Linyan's eyelashes trembled slightly. Realizing he was being a bit impolite, he shifted his gaze away.","And in the next moment, the girl's voice rang in his ear.","\"I'm heading down first.\"","He paused his movements and turned to look.","An Ling put away her phone, smiling and waving at him. \"My friend just called for me. I'm leaving now, bye-bye.\"","Shen Linyan's expression was a bit dazed as he stood frozen in place without speaking.","His knuckles unconsciously tightened around the railing.","He felt a bit strange.","He had actually chatted with a stranger here for this long, without even knowing her name.","But there seemed to be no need to know her name anyway.","They were just people to pass the time with for each other.","Chances were, they would never meet again."]},{"number":138,"title":"Chapter 138: Extra: If Line 02","paragraphs":["In the cafe, a melodious piano melody floated through the air, soothing and relaxing.","Sitting at a window seat in the corner was a man and a woman.","An Ling took a sip of her coffee, ignoring the burning gaze from Jiang Mai at the front counter, her expression calm.","\"Mr. Lu, I'll be blunt. I have no intention of going through with this marriage alliance. Seeing as you have no interest in me either, let's not waste each other's time. I hope you can speak directly to Aunt Lu, explain the situation, and cancel the engagement.\"","An Ling had no interest in an alliance with the Shen family.","With the elders of both families having passed away, the engagement naturally didn't count.","They called it an engagement, but it was really just a business alliance.","An alliance could, of course, be rejected.","But if she were the one to bring it up, it would definitely offend the Shen family and make things ugly.","So it was best for Lu Jingshen to clear things up himself.","She could tell he wasn't interested in her either, which was why she spoke so straightforwardly.","However, hearing this, Lu Jingshen paused.","\"No, I can't say it.\"","\"?\"","An Ling frowned. \"Why not?\"","Lu Jingshen's expression turned somewhat complicated.","Why else?","Because ever since his older brother returned, his mother's demands on him had grown higher and higher, insisting that he must secure this alliance.","He looked at the girl across from him. \"I don't have feelings for you either, but I can't tell my mother right now. At least... we have to wait a while.\"","He paused, then added, \"So for this period, it's best if we cooperate. When the time comes, I will bring up canceling the engagement with my mother.\"","\"...\"","An Ling looked at him strangely.","What kind of logic was this?","Well, at least she knew canceling it right now was impossible.","She pinched the bridge of her nose. \"How long do we have to wait?\"","\"At least half a month.\"","\"...\"","Meaning they had to pretend for another half month?","She stayed silent for a moment, then picked up her coffee cup. \"Got it. You'll cancel it in half a month, right? Then you don't need to text me during this time. Let's just pretend the other doesn't exist.\"","Texting was just annoying.","Lu Jingshen was about to say something when a call suddenly came in.","Seeing the name on the screen, his face stiffened. He immediately hung up and placed the phone face down.","But An Ling still caught a glimpse of the caller ID.","[Zhou Wen]","Who was that?","Lu Jingshen hurriedly grabbed his phone and stood up. \"I have something to do. I'll take my leave first.\"","An Ling glanced at him and gave a casual \"Mm.\"","After the man left, Jiang Mai quickly slid into his seat.","\"Was that your fiancé? How did it go? Did he agree to cancel the engagement?\"","An Ling took a bite of the cake on the table. \"He said it can't be canceled right now.\"","\"Why not?\"","\"God knows. But as long as it gets canceled eventually, I can wait a bit.\"","Although this method was a bit slow, at least it wouldn't harm the An family's interests.","Jiang Mai nodded, her eyes lighting up. \"Then do you want to go out and have fun tonight?\"","An Ling shook her head. \"No, I have a dinner to attend tonight.\"","Both families had a dinner arranged for tonight; she had only chosen today to bring it up because of this gathering.","Mainly, this dinner was arranged by the Shen family, so it was hard to decline.","\"Ah, I was going to suggest we go to the Golden Palace again. I didn't even get to check out the second floor last time,\" Jiang Mai said regretfully.","Hearing this, An Ling paused, instantly recalling the man she met that night.","She took another bite of cake, lost in thought.","What did he look like again?","It was a pity she had a bit to drink that night; all she remembered was that he seemed quite handsome.","...","Inside the Shen Corporation building, the conference room doors were pushed open from the inside.","A man with a steady, commanding presence walked out with unhurried steps, returning to his office.","Secretary Chen followed behind. \"Young Master, the financial reports for the past few quarters and the project proposals have been placed on your desk.\"","The man gave an \"Mm\" and put on his suit jacket. The sharp tailoring accentuated his broad shoulders and narrow waist. He looked down to adjust his cuffs. \"Let's go.\"","Secretary Chen paused, asking tentatively, \"...Young Master, are you going to the Golden Palace again tonight?\"","\"Mm.\"","Just as he thought.","He had been going to the Golden Palace for several days in a row now. He didn't know when the Young Master had become so fond of drinking.","Could it be that the recent constant nitpicking from the other board directors was putting too much psychological pressure on him?","Secretary Chen pondered inwardly but still spoke up to remind him.","\"Then are you not attending the dinner? Tonight, Young Master Lu is having dinner with the An family. It looks like they'll be discussing the marriage alliance.\"","Shen Linyan slightly raised his eyes. \"The dinner?\"","So she hasn't refused yet?","His expression remained unchanged as he cast a faint glance outside. \"Where is Zhou Wen?\"","Secretary Chen's expression turned a bit complicated, and he lowered his voice. \"She already found out about this matter and left work early today.\"","Everyone in the company knew about Zhou Wen and Lu Jingshen's relationship. Just recently, the two had gotten into a fight and nearly broke up.","Zhou Wen only found out about the marriage alliance today?","He had hidden it quite well.","It seemed something was going to happen at tonight's dinner.","Shen Linyan raised his hand to check his watch. It was still early to go to the Golden Palace.","\"Let's go take a look at the dinner first.\"","...","On the second floor of the Chuandexing Restaurant, inside a private room.","Shen Fuyuan sat in her chair, resting her chin on her hand while playing on her phone. Her gaze occasionally swept over Father Shen and Mother Shen beside her.","\"Mom, is Second Brother still not here?\"","The An family was almost here, but her second brother hadn't arrived yet.","A cold female automated voice came from the phone. Mother Shen frowned, hung up, and spoke with a hint of irritation.","\"No one is answering. Did he reply to your messages?\"","That wretched boy better not cause any trouble for her.","\"No, he's ignoring all my texts,\" Shen Fuyuan said, showing them her lit screen.","Father Shen frowned. \"Where could he be at this hour?\"","Just then, footsteps sounded at the door, accompanied by a waiter's voice.","\"Sir, it's right in here.\"","The three of them looked up at the sound.","As the door opened, Mother Shen's face instantly changed, and she stood up.","\"Why are you here?\"","The man walked over with his long legs and sat down in a chair, his lowered eyes looking gentle and harmless. \"I don't quite understand what you mean, Mother. Since we are discussing a marriage alliance, shouldn't I, as the eldest brother, be here?\"","Mother Shen's eyes flickered for a few moments before she finally forced a smile. \"No, I just meant this is your younger brother's engagement dinner. It's a bit inappropriate for you to show up, and aren't you very busy with work?\"","Shen Linyan raised his eyes, a faint smile on his lips, though his tone was flat. \"Why is it inappropriate? Is Mother worried I might steal his marriage alliance?\"","Mother Shen's expression stiffened as her hidden thoughts were exposed.","\"How could I—\"","\"Alright, the most important thing right now is, where did Lu Jingshen go?\"","Father Shen interrupted her.","He looked at Shen Linyan. \"Linyan, have you seen your brother?\"","Shen Linyan lowered his eyes, adjusting his watch. \"No.\"","Just as he thought, there was nothing worth seeing here.","It was about time to leave.","Just as he was thinking this, several footsteps echoed at the door.","The waiter pushed the door open.","A woman walked in with a smile. Dressed in a dark green qipao with jade pendants dangling from her ears, she exuded an elegant and dignified aura, her face kind and amiable.","\"I'm so sorry, Mrs. Shen. We're late.\"","Seeing that it was the An family, Mother Shen's expression slightly froze before she forced another smile. \"Mrs. An, you're here. Not at all, you're not late.\"","Hearing the voices, Shen Linyan looked up, his unhurried gaze landing on Father and Mother An.","The next moment, his gaze suddenly froze.","Behind Father and Mother An, a figure stepped out slowly.","The young woman wore a waist-cinching red dress that highlighted the slender, elegant lines of her shoulders and neck. Her collarbones were faintly visible, and her soft, jet-black hair cascaded down her back. Fine diamond earrings shimmered faintly under the lights.","The corners of her eyes curved upward, her gaze clear and beautiful. Just like that night, simply standing there made her incredibly captivating.","Ripples stirred in his heart. A faint light flickered in Shen Linyan's eyes as an unprecedented impulse surged within him, making him almost instinctively want to stand up.","As if sensing his gaze, the young woman glanced over.","But upon seeing him, her eyes first registered a blank surprise. The joy and pleasant surprise he had anticipated never appeared.","She furrowed her brows. The way she looked at him was clean, distant, and completely devoid of emotion.","It was as if she were looking at a complete and utter stranger.","Shen Linyan's expression suddenly froze, his movements halting in place.","It was like a bucket of cold water had been poured over him, extinguishing the joy that had just begun to rise in his heart.","At this moment, the happiness of their reunion was entirely replaced by the panic brought on by this shift in identity.","Did she not recognize him, or... did she not want to recognize him?","Beneath the table, his hands slowly clenched into fists, his knuckles turning white from the force.","When An Ling withdrew her gaze, she took a few extra glances at him, her brows furrowing in suspicion.","Is this Lu Jingshen?","No way, right?","I don't remember him being this handsome.","After taking her seat, An Ling noticed that the man kept looking at her.","His pitch-black eyes stared straight at her, following her every move.","Puzzled, she turned her head to look back at him a few times.","Why is this guy staring at me?","Meeting the young woman's dissatisfied and confused gaze, Shen Linyan's eyelashes trembled. A certain light in his eyes wavered, and then died out.","He lowered his gaze, concealing the emotions in his eyes, and sat quietly in his chair, his jaw slightly tense.","He looked just like a husband who had been wounded by cold words.","An Ling was bewildered by her own bizarre sense of déjà vu.","What husband?","She stared at the man's face for a moment before slowly shifting her gaze away.","He looked inexplicably familiar.","But this face was genuinely good-looking.","At that moment, Mother An's voice sounded beside her.","\"Why haven't we seen Lu Jingshen? Is he not here yet?\"","Mother Shen offered a strained smile. \"Something came up at the company at the last minute, and Jingshen went to handle it. He might be a little late.\"","Father Shen changed the subject. \"Let's all sit down first. There's no need to wait for him.\"","At a time like this, such an excuse seemed exceptionally feeble and pale.","Sure enough, Mother An and Father An's expressions became somewhat meaningful.","\"I see. Well, we should still wait for him.\"","After ten minutes of waiting, hurried footsteps finally echoed from outside the private room.","Lu Jingshen pushed the door open. His forehead was covered in sweat, and he was panting. \"Sorry, I... I'm late...\"","An Ling glanced at him, her brows lifting slightly as the corners of her mouth curled up.","It seemed like she wouldn't need to wait half a month anymore.","Fantastic. He just delivered an excuse right to her doorstep.","She turned her head gleefully, only to unexpectedly lock eyes with a pair of deep, dark pupils.","The man seemed to have been watching her quietly all along. His refined features were illuminated by the light, casting a layer of shadow over his brow bone, making him look even more handsome.","His thin lips were pressed together slightly, his eyes filled with a dark, obscure depth.","The smile on An Ling's lips froze.","After staring at the man in silence for a few seconds, that inexplicable sense of familiarity surged up again.","In a flash of realization, her body suddenly stiffened. Her eyes widened slightly in disbelief.","Huh???","No way, right?","This looks like that man from the bar!","The man she had only met once was now appearing right before her eyes. An Ling never expected to see him again, let alone in this capacity and in such a setting.","Worst of all, she hadn't even recognized him at first.","So embarrassing.","No wonder he kept looking at her. He probably wanted to say hello, but she hadn't given him the time of day.","Her ears, hidden beneath her hair, turned red. An Ling touched her burning cheeks and stiffly turned her head, pretending to be calm as her gaze darted away.","Meanwhile, Lu Jingshen's arrival managed to break the deadlock.","Mother An cast a sidelong glance at him, took a sip of tea, and spoke mildly: \"Mrs. Shen, regarding the marriage arrangement you wanted to discuss with me earlier, I stand by what I said. After all these years, it's merely a verbal agreement. The children are grown now. If they aren't willing, we can't force it upon them.\"","Mother Shen immediately sensed something was wrong. Knowing she was in the wrong, she struggled to find the right words. \"No, Mrs. An, our Jingshen really likes Lingling. It's truly Jingshen's fault for behaving poorly today.\"","After saying that, she looked at Lu Jingshen beside her. \"Isn't that right?\"","Yet the man remained silent.","Her voice grew heavier. \"Lu Jingshen!\"","Lu Jingshen gritted his teeth. Recalling how Zhou Wen had cried in his arms half an hour ago, begging not to break up, he suddenly spoke up.","\"Mom, I actually have someone else I like. I won't marry An Ling. I originally wanted to tell you after the project ended, but she is the only person I want to marry!\"","As soon as the words left his mouth, the private room instantly fell silent.","An Ling was also taken aback. Once she processed it, the corners of her mouth twitched from sheer joy, though she quickly forced the smile down.","This is great! She didn't have to wait half a month anymore!?","She didn't care why Lu Jingshen had changed his mind. All that mattered was that he had finally done something right for once.","Afraid she would look too happy, An Ling gently covered her mouth with her hand, feigning a look of disbelief.","She subconsciously glanced at Shen Linyan, but upon meeting his gaze, she quickly looked away again.","Her reaction, which looked akin to disgust and aversion, deeply stung Shen Linyan's eyes.","He stared blankly at the scene unfolding before him.","His mind kept flashing back to the young woman in the bar that night, winking and smiling at him.","But now, those very eyes held nothing but distance and unfamiliarity toward him.","Why did she smile at Lu Jingshen...","Why wouldn't she smile at him...","Why was she so cold to him, of all people...","It clearly wasn't like this that night.","Shen Linyan looked dazed, his breathing hitching slightly. He kept his head down, remaining silent as his fingertips clenched tight.","Why did his heart ache?","It felt as though he had lost something important.","The person he had yearned to see again, day and night.","In the end, turned out to be Lu Jingshen's arranged fiancée.","...","This dinner ultimately ended in a flurry of chaos.","Father and Mother Shen didn't even bother to apologize, angrily calling Lu Jingshen back home.","Mother An, however, remained calm. She picked up her bag and stood up. \"Let's go, Lingling.\"","\"Okay.\"","An Ling followed her out. Turning her head, she saw the man still sitting in the private room, and her footsteps paused slightly.","Is he not leaving?","An Zhou's voice came from ahead.","\"What are you looking at? Let's go.\"","\"Coming, coming.\" An Ling took one last look before turning and hurrying away.","Hearing her voice, Shen Linyan's eyelids fluttered slightly. He raised his eyes, only to see the young woman's retreating back.","As he sat in his chair, his phone screen lit up with a message from Secretary Chen.","[Young Master, are you still going to the Golden Palace?]","Lowering his eyes, he remained silent for a long time before slowly typing a reply.","[No need.]","Shen Linyan locked his phone. Just as he was about to stand up, the sound of footsteps reached his ears.","He paused and looked up.","The next second, he met a familiar pair of eyes.","The young woman poked her head in from the doorway, her hair swaying slightly with the movement. Her eyes curved as she blinked at him.","\"Um... have we met before?\""]},{"number":139,"title":"Chapter 139: Extra: If Line 03","paragraphs":["Seeing the other person looking at her without saying a word, An Ling felt a bit embarrassed.","\"I'm sorry, my memory isn't very good. I didn't recognize you at first.\"","This was the only excuse that made sense.","She confirmed once more, \"Was it at a bar?\"","Shen Linyan snapped back to reality. With lowered eyes, he gave a soft \"Mm.\"","She didn't recognize him.","Makes sense...","In other people's eyes, he was just a stranger she had met once by chance, and that night was just the most unremarkable of encounters.","He was the only one still reminiscing about that night.","Even he didn't know why he kept recalling it, yet he couldn't bear to let it go, even yearning for a next time.","He concealed his emotions, stood up, and spoke in his usual tone, though his voice carried a hint of hoarseness. \"Did you not go back with your family?\"","An Ling shook her head. \"I told them to leave first. I'll go back a bit later.\"","The bar that night had been dimly lit, but right now, the restaurant was brightly illuminated. The striking advantage of the man's chiseled features became even more apparent. With his long legs and narrow waist, just standing there in the private room made him look like he was posing for a magazine shoot.","She felt a momentary flash of doubt.","An Zhou said Shen Linyan was Lu Jingshen's older brother. Were they really biological brothers?","Are they sure they were born to the same parents?","\"How could Lu Jingshen fall so short in comparison?\"","\"What?\"","It wasn't until she saw Shen Linyan's stunned expression that she realized she had spoken her thoughts out loud. Her face instantly flushed red.","\"Ah! No! That's not what I meant! Just pretend I didn't say anything!\"","How mortifying! Who talks bad about a younger brother right in front of his older brother!","Seeming to notice her embarrassment, the man recovered his composure, curled his lips into a smile, and said gently, \"It's fine, I won't tell anyone. Lu Jingshen and I don't have a very good relationship anyway.\"","He stepped toward her. \"It's too late, getting a taxi won't be convenient. Let me take you home.\"","Was it very late?","An Ling was still pondering.","But then she heard the man speak again. \"I know about his girlfriend. She's one of my assistants. They are dating in the office, and everyone else in the company knows too. He hid his relationship to enter this arranged marriage with you. I only found out about it today myself.\"","\"He arrived late today, probably because he was fighting with his girlfriend. They've argued in the office area before, too.\"","Oh?","Oh, really?","She subconsciously walked alongside the man, blinking. \"Are you really allowed to tell me this kind of stuff?\"","This was the scandalous romantic history of the Shen Corporation's CEO, after all.","The man chuckled softly. \"It's fine. Like I said, he and I don't get along. Plus, this is nothing; everyone knows about it.\"","An Ling recalled a phone call Lu Jingshen had taken earlier today. \"Is his girlfriend named Zhou Wen?\"","Shen Linyan's steps paused slightly. After a long moment, he slowly nodded.","He pursed his lips, his tone unreadable. \"You... knew he had a girlfriend?\"","\"I didn't know. But when I met with him today and he got a call from this person, his expression completely changed.\"","An Ling had guessed right then that this person's identity was unusual, but she hadn't expected it to actually be his girlfriend.","\"If I had known he had a girlfriend, I would have brought up breaking the engagement right then and there. He even told me to wait half a month before bringing it up.\"","Shen Linyan looked stunned and turned his head to look at her. \"Break the engagement? You don't like Lu Jingshen?\"","\"Huh?\" An Ling also turned her head, bewildered. \"...Like Lu Jingshen?\"","She burst out laughing, her eyes filled with deep amusement.","\"How is that possible?\" She wagged her finger with absolute seriousness. \"I'm dying to break this engagement as soon as possible. Besides, I have my own standards, and Lu Jingshen absolutely does not make the cut.\"","\"What standards?\"","\"Of course, they are—\" An Ling's voice abruptly stopped.","Wait a minute.","Why was she suddenly spilling all her secrets?","She quickly changed her tune and said with a smile, \"Of course, it's about finding someone pleasing to the eye!\"","Shen Linyan's pace slowed slightly, quietly falling behind her. He raised his eyes slightly, silently gazing at the girl's slender back.","By the time they walked out of the restaurant, the night had long since fallen. The evening breeze blew against their faces, carrying a slightly cool dampness and the unique chill of a winter night.","An Ling walked a few steps before belatedly realizing that Shen Linyan was no longer right beside her.","Just as she turned her head to look for him, her shoulders suddenly grew heavy. A suit jacket, still carrying his residual body heat, was draped over her shoulders, and a crisp, woody scent of pine and snow instantly enveloped her.","The man's deep voice sounded from behind her.","\"The wind is strong at night. The driver will bring the car around shortly.\"","Wearing the jacket, she nodded obediently and twitched her nose. \"Thank you.\"","Shen Linyan smelled quite nice.","A faint quietness permeated the air. As the night wind swept past, the surrounding leaves rustled.","An Ling was staring absentmindedly at the side of the road when the man's voice suddenly rang in her ears.","\"Do you absolutely have to cancel the engagement?\"","\"Hmm?\"","She snapped back to reality and smiled. \"Under these circumstances, it should be canceled, right? Don't tell me I should still go through with the wedding?\"","The man didn't speak; he just slowly turned his head to look at her.","His eyelids were slightly lowered, and his noble, elegant features seemed to soften with a layer of tenderness under the warm light.","\"What I mean is, could you consider marrying me instead?\"","The man's deep voice was as light as the wind, yet every word fell clearly into her ears.","An Ling's eyes went blank; she even thought she had misheard him.","After a long moment, she opened her mouth, just about to speak.","But Shen Linyan suddenly raised his hand. His long, slender fingers tucked a strand of hair behind her ear as his eyes slowly curved into a smile.","\"You're going to reject me, aren't you?\"","\"Actually, truth be told, this marriage arrangement should have gone to the eldest son. But I'm not very well-liked at home, so I only found out about this engagement today.\"","\"I know you wouldn't just marry someone casually because of an arrangement. I just want you to give me a chance.\"","His eyelashes lowered, and his warm fingertips inadvertently brushed against her earlobe.","\"Consider me as a potential marriage candidate too, okay?\"","The man's gaze was as gentle as being immersed in warm water. There was no urgency, no probing; he just looked at her quietly.","The sounds of the surrounding crowd seemed to have hit the pause button.","An Ling's mind went completely blank.","The surrounding leaves rustled, and the sound of the wind brushed past the hair by her ears. But as it settled, it couldn't take away the lingering warmth the man had left on her earlobe—a heat that made her heart pound wildly.","Thump, thump.","She felt like she had lost her ability to think, or perhaps there were too many thoughts to sort through at all.","I'm doomed...","This seems to be my exact ideal type.","Why did Shen Linyan have to use such a handsome face to say things that were so easy to misunderstand?","She had never considered that Shen Linyan might actually like her; after all, they had only met twice.","Looking at it this way, a marriage of convenience was still the much more likely motive.","She remembered that Shen Linyan had recently taken office and did indeed need a marriage alliance to consolidate his interests.","Moreover, Shen Linyan had just mentioned that he wasn't well-liked at home, though she didn't know if that was true or false.","After recovering for a moment, she slowly spoke, the tips of her ears red. \"...Do chairmen really go to such desperate lengths for a marriage alliance nowadays?\"","He was even selling his looks.","A low chuckle rumbled from the man's chest. He raised a hand to pull the jacket tighter around her, his movements gentle. \"An Ling, this is my first time.\"","\"...\"","First time for what?","Don't say it in such an ambiguous way!","And who isn't on their first time?","An Ling's cheeks burned, and she slowly uttered an \"Oh.\"","It was truly magical. If any ordinary person she had only met twice said they wanted to marry her, she would have completely ignored them.","But now that the person in question was Shen Linyan, she didn't find it repulsive at all.","Just like back at the bar, she actually knew that anyone who could be on the second floor was either rich or powerful, mostly people from their social circle. She had never liked getting to know people from that circle, and generally ignored them whenever possible.","But the first impression Shen Linyan gave her that day was truly too special, so when he struck up a conversation, she couldn't help but follow the topic and keep chatting.","So at the end of the day, it was all to blame on this man's handsome face!","\"My standards are very high, you know.\" Her eyelashes fluttered slightly as she looked up, her gaze crashing right into the man's smiling eyes.","\"Then once I meet your standards, will you marry me?\"","\"...\" Why was marriage the only thing on his mind?","Seeing the girl's subtle expression, Shen Linyan smiled and took a step closer, his tone carrying a comforting warmth. \"Sorry, it's just that I'm terrified you might marry someone else first.\"","An Leng's brows relaxed slightly. \"I doubt anyone else would be like Chairman Shen, wanting to marry someone after only meeting them twice, unless someone else comes looking for a marriage of convenience.\"","Hearing this, Shen Linyan's movements paused slightly.","\"I didn't expect it either, that I would want to marry someone I've only met twice.\"","He slowly raised his eyes, the corners of his lips curving into a gentle smile, and said softly,","\"Does this mean I like you even more than I imagined?\"","An Leng froze, her cheeks flushing slightly. She turned her head away, her eyes darting around as she stammered.","\"How should I know... Where is the car? Why isn't it here yet?\"","Shen Linyan's eyes were filled with amusement as he reached out, wanting to hold her hand.","But he stopped halfway, ultimately just silently helping the girl adjust her clothes.","\"It will be here right away. Are you hungry? You haven't eaten anything all night.\"","...","An Leng eventually returned home carrying a bag of bread.","As soon as she opened the door, An Zhou, who was playing on his phone on the sofa, saw her and casually called out.","\"You're back.\"","\"Yeah.\" An Leng placed the bag on the table. \"Do you want some bread?\"","\"You actually bought bread?\" An Zhou put down his phone and got up to grab the bread, asking as he tore open the packaging.","An Leng paused. \"I didn't buy it.\"","\"Your friend bought it?\"","She hesitated for a moment and was just about to speak when she heard An Zhou continue, \"But tonight's dinner was definitely worth going to. After what happened tonight, this arranged marriage is basically ruined.\"","Even if nothing happened, it would have been ruined sooner or later.","An Leng blinked. \"Brother, are you close with Shen Linyan?\"","\"Just average.\" An Zhou looked down, scrolling through the news on his phone. \"He hasn't been back in the country for long, but he's quite capable.\"","To be able to secure the position of chairman at the Shen Corporation, he definitely had some solid skills.","He looked over. \"Didn't you ask about him once before at the restaurant?\"","\"It's nothing, I was just suddenly a bit curious.\"","An Zhou cast a suspicious glance at her, then looked down and clicked his tongue softly. \"But to be honest, if you were really going to have an arranged marriage with the Shen family, you'd be better off choosing that Shen Linyan. It's just that I heard it's quite hard to even get a meeting with him...\"","As he spoke, he suddenly looked up, sizing An Leng up and down, then slowly shook his head with a look of pity.","\"Never mind, never mind. Since you never leave the house, it would probably be even harder for you to see him. It seems the shortcut of an arranged marriage won't work for our An family.\"","An Leng: \"...\"","What is that supposed to mean! She didn't like hearing that at all! How was it hard to see him? Hadn't she just run into Shen Linyan before the dinner?","And who said it wouldn't work?","An Leng snorted and went upstairs with her bag without saying a word.","After taking a shower and lying in bed, An Leng turned on her phone. She had added Shen Linyan's contact information before getting out of the car. She clicked on his Moments, but it was completely clean, with absolutely nothing posted.","Just then, a message suddenly popped up.","Shen Linyan: Are you free tomorrow?","An Leng: Yes, why?","Shen Linyan: I want to see you tomorrow.","This unexpected message caught An Leng off guard, and she didn't react at first, though the temperature of her cheeks rose slightly.","An Leng: Since you put it that way, I'll reluctantly agree ^^","As soon as the message was sent, the other side went silent for a dozen seconds before sending another message.","Shen Linyan: Are you going to sleep?","An Leng: Not yet.","Shen Linyan: Then can we video call?","Shen Linyan: Actually, I really miss you right now too ^^","She froze, the corners of her mouth turning up slightly. Lying in bed, she held her phone and initiated the video call, which connected almost instantly.","The man was sitting at the head of his bed. The tips of his hair were still slightly wet from a recent shower, and a few stray strands fell over his eyes, hiding some of his sharp edge. The dim yellow light washed over his handsome profile, creating a soft, warm haze.","Seeing only the blanket on the screen, his eyes curved, and a faint, gentle smile graced his lips.","\"Lingling, I can't see you like this.\"","The sound of fabric rustling came through the phone, followed by her voice.","\"I never said I was going to show my face.\" The girl's voice was soft and light, carrying a hint of coquettishness. The end of her sentence tilted up slightly, sounding pure and gentle.","A few seconds later, she silently turned the camera around anyway.","The girl was lying on her pillow, half her face buried in the blanket. Her clear, bright eyes sparkled beautifully under the light.","\"Can you see me now?\" The corners of her eyes curved slightly, looking so soft and adorable that it made one's heart feel light.","Shen Linyan's gaze paused slightly, his fingertip gently brushing across the screen.","He really wanted to get married...","His Adam's apple bobbed slightly as he smiled and said softly, \"I see you.\"","An Leng felt a bit shy under his intense gaze. Her cheeks flushed slightly beneath the blanket, and she silently looked away.","\"Now that you've seen me, hang up. It's almost time for sleep.\"","The man gave a soft \"Mm,\" and said, \"Goodnight.\"","\"Goodnight.\"","They had said their goodnights, but neither of them hung up the call. They just looked at each other through the airwaves, leaving only a tranquil silence.","An Leng blinked, her fingertip slowly hovering over the screen. \"I'm really hanging up now. Get to sleep early and rest.\"","As soon as she spoke, the screen in front of her suddenly zoomed in.","The man lowered his head, his lips landing gently on the screen.","\"I love you.\" His magnetic voice came through low and husky, restrained yet wrapped in an affection that was shockingly hot.","Under her stunned gaze, he slowly lifted his head and smiled, his eyes curving.","\"Goodnight, Lingling.\"","Even after the video call ended, An Leng still hadn't fully recovered her senses.","She put down her phone and sat up in a daze, touching her own face, which was already burning hot.","With a flushed face, she fell back into the blankets and closed her eyes.","\"How could he cheat like that.\"","After a moment of silence, she opened her eyes again and picked up her phone once more.","After the video call ended, the man had sent another message.","Goodnight ^^","She typed with a blushing face.","Didn't you say this is your first time pursuing someone? How are you so good with words? Are you lying to me?","A moment later, a reply came from the other side.","Shen Linyan: I'm not lying to you.","Once I think of you as my wife, these words just come naturally."]},{"number":140,"title":"Chapter 140: Extra: If Line 04","paragraphs":["In the massive living room, An Ling leaned against the sofa, looking entirely uninterested.","Mother Shen's voice buzzed in her ears.","\"Lingling, Jingshen was just bewitched by that woman the other night. Don't take it to heart. Auntie has already scolded that boy for you.\"","Given how the dinner ended last night, logically speaking, this engagement should have been null and void.","But An Ling hadn't expected Mother Shen to call her and offer to explain what happened that night all over again.","She had just been about to head out when she received the call, and she couldn't exactly refuse to come.","Yet after arriving, it turned out to be the same old tune.","An explanation? An apology?","An Ling pressed her temples, feeling a headache coming on.","This was nothing but pure sophistry.","And because she came here, she had to push back her scheduled meeting with Shen Linyan.","Right now, she just wanted to get this over with as quickly as possible so she could leave.","\"Auntie Lu, I've heard your explanation. If there's nothing else, I'll be taking my leave.\"","Just as she stood up, Mother Shen grabbed her wrist, a smile plastered on her face. \"Lingling, Auntie isn't finished yet. Since the matter has been resolved, shall we proceed with your engagement to Jingshen as planned?\"","An Ling: ?","She pulled her wrist away with a slight tug, frowning. \"Proceed? You mean to say that even after such a thing happened, I'm still supposed to marry Lu Jingshen?\"","How could these people even say such things?","As soon as she finished speaking, the sudden sound of the front door opening caught them off guard.","\"Beep—\"","The living room fell silent for a moment as everyone instinctively looked toward the door.","The sound of steady footsteps slowly echoed through the room.","A tall man walked in, his eyes lowered. His fingers were loosely tugging at his tie. With refined and elegant features, he exuded a sense of aloofness under the light.","Noticing the commotion in the living room, he lifted his eyelids and glanced over.","\"Mother.\"","\"...Miss An.\" His voice was deep. His gaze lingered on An Ling for a moment, and his words were imperceptibly slower by a few seconds.","Memories of last night flooded back, and An Ling's face faintly began to burn again. She gave a soft \"Mm,\" averting her gaze somewhat unnaturally, before sneaking another peek at the man.","It was a bit strange; she had actually recognized at a glance that this was Shen Linyan.","Just as she was thinking this, Mother Shen's slightly displeased voice rang in her ears.","\"Why are you back?\"","It was like looking at a completely different person from the one who was just lovingly offering explanations.","An Ling paused slightly, raised an eyebrow, and turned to look.","Shen Linyan's tone remained unchanged. \"I needed to see Father about something. I'll head upstairs first then.\"","With Shen Linyan present, An Ling's headache actually eased a bit.","Just as she was about to find an excuse to leave, she heard Mother Shen suddenly speak up in a slow drawl.","\"Lingling, Auntie knows that what happened wasn't great, but Auntie still wants you and Jingshen to go through with the marriage. Do you know why?\"","\"You're still young and don't understand the twists and turns of our social circle. Honestly, this isn't a big deal. Some women will do absolutely anything to marry into the Shen family. Later on, when you become the Second Madam of the Shen family, you'll see that illegitimate children and mistresses are everywhere in this circle. These people are as disgusting as rats hiding in the house.\"","In wealthy families, there was never a shortage of mistresses; infidelity had long become the norm.","Hearing this, Shen Linyan, who was heading upstairs, turned his head and cast a faint glance over.","Mother Shen met his gaze, a barely detectable hatred flashing in her eyes as she forced a smile.","\"I used to hate it too, but now I realize that sometimes rats just can't be exterminated. You can only ignore them as long as they don't affect your life.\"","\"So, you know how men are. The ones on the outside are just for novelty; they can never compare to the one at home. Besides, Jingshen was completely tricked by that woman. Auntie has already taken care of it for you, so you don't need to worry.\"","She withdrew her gaze and turned to look at Lu Jingshen beside her.","\"Hurry up and come over here to apologize and explain things clearly to Lingling. Tell her you've broken up with that woman now.\"","Lu Jingshen fell into a brief silence.","After a long while, he slowly nodded, his voice hoarse. \"I'm sorry... An Ling. I really was deceived by that woman that day. Let's just continue with our engagement...\"","An Ling's face was completely devoid of expression now.","At this very moment, she only had one thought—","Are these people crazy?","Did they think she was simple-minded and easy to fool?","Or was Lu Jingshen some kind of hot commodity that she just had to marry?","She furrowed her brows, her gaze shifting between Mother Shen and Lu Jingshen before she slowly spoke, \"Deceived? But wasn't that girl your girlfriend? You were seeing me while you had a girlfriend. That was wrong from the very beginning, wasn't it?\"","\"And if I remember correctly, that girl's name is... Zhou Wen?\"","As soon as she said this, the expressions on Mother Shen and Lu Jingshen's faces shifted slightly.","Mother Shen quickly squeezed out another smile. \"Nothing of the sort, Lingling. That girl and Lu Jingshen just had an ambiguous relationship; they weren't actually together. I don't know who told you these things, but it's absolutely a rumor. If you don't believe me, I can bring that Zhou Wen—\"","\"I was the one who said it.\"","The man's flat voice cut her off.","\"Is that not the case?\"","Stepping down the stairs, his eyes remained completely unchanged from start to finish—calm and indifferent. \"Do I need to be clearer? Didn't you also give Zhou Wen a few million?\"","\"What!\"","Lu Jingshen stood up abruptly. \"Mom! You gave Wenwen money!\"","No wonder she asked for a breakup! He knew it was too sudden!","\"Didn't I tell you not to interfere in this? I would have—\"","\"You shut up!!\"","Mother Shen's face darkened as she roared at Lu Jingshen, \"I told you to break it off with her ages ago! What is wrong with you!\"","Lu Jingshen, however, kept a dark expression. Without saying a word, he grabbed his jacket from the sofa and stormed out the door.","\"You come back here!!\" Mother Shen's tone grew even more furious.","The only response she got was the sound of a slamming door.","An Ling, who was standing on the sidelines overdosing on the drama: \"...\"","She felt like some sort of supporting female character. Lu Jingshen and Zhou Wen were acting out some melodramatic soap opera, and she was just the cannon fodder being used.","Mother Shen was burning with rage. She had gone through so much trouble to settle the matter between Lu Jingshen and Zhou Wen, and now it was all ruined!","She didn't even care that An Ling was still present and turned her glare to Shen Linyan.","\"Shen Linyan! I knew you never liked your brother! Are you satisfied now! Using any means necessary to destroy Lu Jingshen's engagement! Is this all you're capable of!\"","\"You're a bastard selfish to the bone. Just to satisfy your own filthy desires, you didn't hesitate to ruin your brother's happiness. Your conscience has truly been eaten by dogs!\"","An Ling furrowed her brows.","What was going on?","The man, on the other hand, calmly lowered his eyes. Even after being scolded so viciously by his own mother, his expression remained normal, as if he had long grown accustomed to it.","She tentatively spoke up, \"Um...\"","Mother Shen's chest heaved violently with anger. Although she looked terrible, she still tried her best to control her tone.","\"Lingling, you absolutely must not believe what Shen Linyan says. Everything he told you is false. I will handle Jingshen's matters properly. I'll have the driver take you home now, and we can discuss the engagement again another time.\"","An Ling's mouth twitched.","She was still thinking about the engagement?","Just for an engagement, wasn't she cursing her eldest son a bit too harshly?","Is Shen Linyan really this unwelcome in his own home?","She looked up at Shen Linyan. The man paused slightly, then his eyes curved into a gentle smile, as if comforting her that it was alright.","An Ling paused.","\"Um, Auntie, please don't get worked up...\"","When Mother Shen looked over, she met her gaze with sincere eyes and spoke slowly,","\"I will marry Shen Linyan. That way, the engagement can still continue.\"","As soon as the words left her mouth, the entire living room fell into dead silence.","Mother Shen's face was filled with utter disbelief.","\"What did you say? Marry Shen Linyan!?\"","As if oblivious to her shock, An Ling smiled, her eyes curving. \"Yes. The engagement agreement didn't specify exactly who I have to marry, right? I can spend some time with Shen Linyan first; we might just be a perfect match.\"","After saying that, ignoring whatever reaction Mother Shen might have,","she turned and walked over to the man's side.","\"What do you think? If you're okay with it, we can get to know each other.\"","She gave him a stealthy wink and, hidden from view, gave the corner of his shirt a little tug.","A hint of amusement flashed in Shen Linyan's eyes. He discreetly covered the back of the girl's hand with his palm and said gently, \"I am okay with it.\"","An Ling looked at Mother Shen with an obedient smile. \"Alright, alright, the problem is solved. Let's leave it at that. Auntie, we'll be taking our leave now.\"","Just as they reached the door, the woman's icy voice suddenly rang out behind them.","\"You two, wait right there!\"","Mother Shen was no fool. How could two people who originally had no interest in an arranged marriage so coincidentally reach an agreement in an instant?","Coupled with the fact that the matter regarding Zhou Wen had been leaked, she realized what was going on.","Gritting her back teeth, she seethed, \"You two are really something! You actually got together behind my back!\"","\"No, no, no.\"","An Ling turned around, having long since dropped her docile act.","She slowly wagged her index finger. \"This isn't called 'behind your back,' nor is it 'getting together.' It's called making a choice, getting to know each other. I'm supposed to choose someone I like for an arranged marriage anyway. I didn't fancy your second son, so can't I take the eldest son? They both belong to the Shen family anyway, so what's the problem?\"","The girl's beautiful face was completely serious. Her soft lips parted and closed as she spoke, and every single word she said was in his defense.","This was the first time someone in this house had spoken up for him.","Shen Linyan's eyes widened slightly in a daze. An indescribable emotion gradually spread through his heart. The corners of his eyes lowered slightly, and the corners of his lips curled up into a faint smile.","As An Ling was speaking, she suddenly felt her fingers being hooked. Her body stiffened, and she instantly forgot what she was about to say.","The man's strong, warm fingers grasped her knuckles, gently and slowly caressing them from top to bottom, bit by bit.","It was an extremely intimate touch. She turned to look at him, didn't say anything, and silently consented with reddened ears.","The noisy commotion finally attracted Father Shen, who was practicing calligraphy upstairs.","He came out of his study, frowning at the scene downstairs.","\"What are you doing!? Why is it so noisy!\"","Mother Shen said in an agitated tone, \"Shen Zhong, look at this! Shen Linyan stole your youngest son's engagement! You promised this engagement to Jingshen!\"","Father Shen's gaze swept over the two of them. \"Shen Linyan, what is going on here?\"","Shen Linyan pulled the girl behind him. \"It is exactly as you see it, Father.\"","Father Shen choked on his words. \"You, this was originally...\"","But when the man looked up at him, he paused again.","Holding An Ling's hand, Shen Linyan turned and prepared to leave the villa.","However, Mother Shen's cold, sinister voice suddenly rang out behind them.","\"An Ling, are you really comfortable marrying Shen Linyan? You've only known each other for a few days. Aren't you afraid he'll cheat on you? I can guarantee that Shen Linyan will cheat.\"","An Ling stopped in her tracks and turned her head to look at her. \"Why would you say that?\"","\"Why?\"","The smile on Mother Shen's lips twisted slightly.","\"The son of a mistress. With a mother like that, how good could his genes possibly be?\"","As soon as the words fell, the atmosphere in the living room suddenly froze.","\"Lu Jincai!!\" Even Father Shen hadn't expected her to suddenly blurt that out.","An Ling felt the man's grip on her hand suddenly tighten.","She glanced down, then looked up at Mother Shen. After a few seconds, she blinked and spoke slowly,","\"If you want to put it that way, I actually feel...\"","\"The genes you passed down to Lu Jingshen seem to be even worse.\"","Mother Shen's face stiffened. \"What did you say? How dare you say that?! An Ling, if you marry an illegitimate child, just wait for the An family to become a laughingstock!!\"","But as the sound of the door closing echoed, the sharp fury was completely shut inside the villa.","After leaving the villa, An Ling got into the car.","She buckled her seatbelt. Once the sound of the car door shutting faded, the cabin fell into complete silence. Neither of them spoke for a while.","An Ling fidgeted with her seatbelt, not knowing what to say to comfort Shen Linyan.","Even she had been momentarily stunned.","Suddenly finding out that he was an illegitimate child, Shen Linyan must be having an even harder time accepting it, right?","She pursed her lips, still trying to organize her words.","The man suddenly spoke softly, \"I won't cheat, and I won't let the An family become a laughingstock.\"","An Ling was taken aback.","She blinked, then her eyes curved into a smile as she reached out and touched his chin.","\"Why are you only focusing on that? I didn't even listen to all the other things she said.\"","The moment the girl's soft fingers touched him, Shen Linyan's body paused, and he caught her hand.","Hesitating for a moment, he gently kissed her fingertips, his voice soft. \"Because I already knew about my identity.\"","He had known about it since he was abroad.","Shen Linyan kissed her fingertips again. \"I'll take you home.\"","The girl suddenly spoke up, \"Did you only want to see me for such a short amount of time?\"","Shen Linyan froze, then reacted and turned to look at her.","An Ling leaned against the back of the seat, looking down and playing with her hair. \"Someone said such sweet words yesterday, but today, after seeing me for barely a few minutes, he wants to send me home.\"","It was quiet for a few seconds. Not hearing the man's reply, she was just about to sneak a glance at him.","Suddenly, a crisp \"click\" sounded in the air.","The seatbelt was unbuckled.","Her eyelashes fluttered. She slowly raised her eyes and met the man's gaze.","In their silent exchange of glances, Shen Linyan propped his arm against the seat and gradually leaned closer, as if constantly testing the waters. The crisp scent of cedar wrapped in a burning heat pressed down on her, leaving An Ling with nowhere to hide.","\"Lingling said you chose me because you like me. Is that true?\" he asked in a slow, gentle tone. His deep voice brushed against her ear, carrying a hint of bewitchment.","Her face flushed red. Leaning back against the seat, she whispered, \"Guess.\"","The man's chest vibrated slightly as he let out a low chuckle.","He slowly lowered his head, his nose almost brushing against her cheek. There were only a few centimeters left between them, close enough to see the fluttering of each other's eyelashes. Just a little closer, and they would completely touch.","But in the next second, Shen Linyan turned his head and pressed a very light and restrained kiss to the hair by her ear.","\"It's okay if it isn't. I will work hard to make Lingling like me.\"","Looking down into the girl's wide, staring eyes, his own eyes slowly curved into a smile. He kissed her hair again and again, as if deliberately flirting. \"Do you still want to hear me say sweet things today, hmm?\"","With the man's scent lingering at the tip of her nose and his magnified, handsome face right in front of her, An Ling's heart skipped a beat. \"Haven't you already said them today?\"","Shen Linyan's eyes curved as he laughed aloud. He lowered his head and nuzzled her cheek. \"Will you come out and spend time with me tomorrow too?\"","He was just about to get up and go back when his arm was suddenly tugged gently.","Just as he was about to look down.","Soft lips suddenly pressed against his.","His movements came to an abrupt halt. He lowered his head, meeting the girl's pretty, eager eyes.","\"I haven't even told you if your guess was right,\" An Ling turned her head away, her ears flushed red.","The next second, her cheeks were cupped by his hands.","A familiar scent slowly drew near, and his hot, thin lips gently pressed against hers. As their breaths intertwined, the man let out a heavy, ragged exhale.","\"Can I kiss you, baby?\"","Her eyelashes fluttered. She didn't speak, merely closing her eyes.","The man kissed her deeply and thoroughly, gently licking her lower lip. With his nose pressed against her cheek, he slowly and methodically tasted every inch of her.","The air inside the small, intimate space of the car grew warm and humid.","An Ling felt dizzy, dazedly touching her own lips.","She pushed at the man who was still kissing her lips. \"Alright, stop kissing me.\"","They were completely numb.","\"Okay,\" Shen Linyan smiled and kissed her cheek.","Just as he buckled his seatbelt, the girl's voice suddenly rang in his ear.","\"When we get back, I'll talk to my mom about our marriage.\"","His eyes instantly froze in shock.","An Ling was touching up her lipstick in the mirror. She turned to see the man staring at her and blinked.","\"Why are you looking at me? ...You don't think I was joking just now, do you?\"","She capped her lipstick, raised an eyebrow, and said seriously, \"If she doesn't want you to get married, then you should do it anyway. And after we marry, we have to announce it publicly. If we don't get married now, she'll definitely be thrilled... Why are you unbuckling your seatbelt?\"","Seeing the man lean in, An Ling's eyelid twitched.","\"Wait a minute, I just touched up my lipstick. Shen Linyan, my mouth is still...\"","Her chin was gently lifted, and her unfinished words were instantly swallowed by hot lips and teeth. Only the man's low chuckle remained in her ears.","\"Wife, shall we go get our marriage certificate tomorrow?\"","[End of IF route]","The main plot of the IF route is whether Chairman Shen and Lingling will get married. If there were no system, Lingling wouldn't agree to a marriage of convenience with Chairman Shen if she didn't like him, hahaha. Because it's an extra chapter, the romance progresses relatively fast. If we took it slow, it would be way too long (horrified). But they really do love each other a lot, after all, one is superficial about looks and the other fell in love at first sight without realizing it (nodding affirmatively).","Alright, I'll update the extra chapter for the brother's romance line tonight~"]},{"number":141,"title":"Chapter 141: Extra Story: An Zhou × Qin You","paragraphs":["\"Miss Qin, to be honest, my family background is not much worse than yours. After marrying me, you just need to focus wholeheartedly on staying at home, supporting your husband, and raising the children.\"","In the cafe, the man wore a designer black suit. The cut was stiff and ill-fitting, looking as if it had been forced onto him. His hair was combed meticulously, heavy with hair gel, with a few strands deliberately teased high at the forehead, exuding a sense of overexerted elegance.","Even across the table, Qin You could smell the unpleasant scent of hair mousse.","With her legs crossed, she slowly lowered her eyes and took a sip of her coffee, attempting to dispel the smell with the coffee's aroma.","Another pig-headed nouveau riche.","The man completely failed to notice her coldness. After all, this woman had maintained the exact same expression from the moment she walked in and sat down.","As he raised his hand, he casually revealed the luxury watch on his wrist.","Then, he discreetly placed his luxury car keys on the table.","After this sequence of moves, the look he gave Qin You carried a bit more confidence.","But then again, if he could go on a blind date with the eldest daughter of the Qin family, didn't that mean his status wasn't bad?","\"After we get married, that dance studio of yours... I remember you teach kids how to dance, right? Don't run it anymore. It's a loss of face for a wealthy young lady like you to do such things outside. My wife only needs to be beautiful. You don't need to go out and work; I will provide for you.\"","Qin You put down her cup, her cold eyes slowly looking up.","\"Provide for me?\"","She lowered her gaze and leisurely admired her manicure, her tone light. \"My family gives me one million in living expenses every day. Can you do that?\"","The man's expression changed instantly.","Every day?","\"You're joking, right? One million? What do you do that requires so much money? Besides, once you're a wife, you need to look after the family. You can't spend money so extrava—\"","\"If you can't do it, go out the door and turn left.\"","Qin You interrupted him, making a 'please go ahead' gesture. \"Walk straight for three hundred meters, and there's a public restroom. Go in, take a piss, and look at your own reflection.\"","\"You!\" The man stood up in anger, but remembering the identity of the woman across from him, he could only suppress his fury and stride out.","From behind him came the woman's unhurried voice.","\"Don't forget your car keys, or you'll have to compensate the rental agency.\"","\"Fuck!\" The man's face turned ugly with shame and anger. He grabbed the car keys and turned to leave.","Before leaving, his defenses broke, and he cursed.","\"A woman like you, no man would ever dare to want!\"","After he left, Qin You picked up her bag and stood up.","Just as she reached the door, her phone rang.","Upon answering, her friend's voice came through.","\"Another blind date failed?\"","Qin You gave a hum of agreement, opened her car door, and got in. \"Another brainless nouveau riche.\"","\"Oh, Miss Qin, you know those men are just like that. I told you to look within our circle, but you refuse.\" Her friend sounded helpless.","When she first started going on blind dates, Qin You had completely excluded all the wealthy heirs in their social circle.","\"The people in our circle are even more rotten. They play around wildly and are too cunning. I don't have time to play those games with them; I might as well find a dumb one.\"","Qin You calmly buckled her seatbelt. \"Hanging up now. I'm driving to the hospital to see Grandma.\"","...","Arriving at the door of the hospital room.","Before Qin You went in, just as she was about to push the door open, voices suddenly came from inside.","\"Did Youyou go on another blind date?\" Grandma Qin's aged voice sounded.","Her footsteps stopped instantly.","Mother Qin replied, \"Yes, recently she has been seeing about one a day, but none have caught her eye.\"","\"Sigh, this child...\" All the words ultimately dissolved into a sigh on her lips.","Only when there were no more sounds inside did Qin You walk in, a smile hanging on her face. \"Grandma.\"","\"Youyou is here.\" Grandma Qin quickly waved her hand. \"Come sit here.\"","Seeing this, Mother Qin stood up from her chair. \"Youyou, chat with your grandma for a bit. I happen to have something to do, so I'll step out for a while.\"","Qin You placed the fruit on the table. \"I bought oranges today. These are really sweet. I'll peel one for you to taste.\"","Grandma Qin smiled and nodded. \"Okay.\"","Qin You picked one, sat on the chair, and wrapped her fingers in a tissue to peel the orange so the juice wouldn't get into her nails.","Halfway through peeling, Grandma Qin suddenly spoke up. \"Your mother said you've been going on blind dates every day lately. You silly girl, don't get married just for my sake. This kind of thing still depends on fate. My body is still strong, I can definitely wait until—\"","\"No.\"","Qin You lowered her head and interrupted her. \"I'm not going on blind dates for you. I just feel that I've reached the right age.\"","She placed the orange in the elderly woman's hand and smiled. \"Besides, I'm not going to marry just anyone. Aren't I picking and choosing? We'll see when there's a suitable one. You have to cooperate with the doctors; you still have to attend my wedding when the time comes.\"","Grandma Qin sighed inwardly, a helpless smile in her eyes. \"Don't worry, Grandma will definitely attend. You also need to take care of your health with your recent work. Don't get too tired.\"","After chatting about family matters for a while, Mother Qin also returned.","After keeping the elderly woman company for a bit longer, she finally picked up her bag from the sofa.","\"Mom, Youyou and I are leaving now. Youyou still has classes this afternoon. You need to listen to the doctors more and make sure to rest.\"","\"I know, I know. You two go on and get busy.\"","Leaving the hospital room, they walked to the elevator and pressed the button.","Mother Qin turned her head to look at Qin You, who was playing on her phone beside her. \"Did today's fall through too?\"","\"Yeah.\" Qin You turned off her phone screen. \"Another weirdo.\"","Mother Qin hesitated for a moment but still spoke up. \"Actually, Mom has one in mind here too, and Mom thinks his character is pretty good. Do you know the An family?\"","Qin You instantly refused. \"Not considering it.\"","\"Oh, Mom knows you don't like these young masters in our circle, but this time is different. I often play mahjong with his mother, and I feel that her personality is quite gentle. The An family is quite low-key. Their daughter was even married to the heir of the Shen family before. You surely know the Shen Corporation, right? Such a huge company.\"","Mother Qin was still persuading her. \"Besides, aren't the people you've been going on blind dates with a mixed bag anyway? The ones Mom chooses have at least been filtered once.\"","Qin You didn't speak, seemingly a bit moved.","Mother Qin quickly took out her phone. \"Anyway, just add him first. Chat and see how it goes. If you agree, I'll send your contact info to them.\"","\"Ding—\"","The elevator chimed. Qin You gave a soft \"Mm\" and stepped inside. \"Go ahead and send it.\"","She naturally knew this was a connection between her mother and her mahjong friend. It wouldn't be good to refuse too directly.","Anyway, having met so many people, one more wouldn't make a difference.","Mother Qin's face lit up with joy. \"Then I'll send it right now.\"","The progress was faster than Qin You expected.","Just as she drove to the dance studio, she received a friend request from the other party.","An Zhou: [Hello, Miss Qin, I am An Zhou. Very happy to meet you!]","She changed into her dance shoes and cast her eyes down for a glance.","The An family... she really hadn't heard of them. She could search for some information when she got back later.","Just as she tapped accept.","A colleague's voice came from behind. \"Teacher Qin, it seems it's time. Aren't we going?\"","She paused, put her phone back into the locker, closed the door, and locked it.","\"Coming.\"","...","After finishing her classes and returning home from work.","Having finished teaching the kids how to dance, Qin You was covered in sweat. After taking a shower in the bathroom, she sat at her vanity table, drying her hair.","After looking down and replying to some messages from parents, she finally noticed a solitary chat box buried underneath.","She had forgotten to reply to his message.","She opened the chat window.","[Sorry, work has been a bit busy. Hello Mr. An, I am Qin You.]","After replying, she opened a search engine and typed in \"An Group.\" A bunch of information instantly popped up.","The An family had one son and one daughter.","It was pretty much as her mother had said; the An family's daughter did indeed marry the heir of the Shen family, though they had recently divorced.","Qin You didn't usually pay attention to such things, so she had missed out on all this gossip.","She took a quick look; it was all standard, unremarkable stuff.","The person on the other end was still awake and sent a reply.","An Zhou: [No worries, Miss Qin. You're doing this for the blind date arrangement too, right? Actually, so am I, hahaha. Plus, it's my first time going on a blind date, so I might not be totally up to speed on the etiquette. The elders in our families want us to grab a meal and get to know each other, but I see you're pretty busy with work. If you don't have time, it's totally fine.]","Qin You: \"...\"","He talks so much.","Out of all the blind dates she had been on, this was the first time she had encountered someone so chatty.","She glanced at her calendar, confirmed her schedule, and sent him a time.","[Sunday at noon, lunch at the Fuli Hotel.]","As soon as the message was sent, the other side fell completely silent.","Over on his end, An Zhou had carefully crafted that massive paragraph, but seeing the woman's curt reply made him instantly feel defeated.","\"Damn it.\" He slapped his phone down onto the table.","Crossing his legs, he leaned back. \"I'm not replying.\"","He decided to play the aloof card too.","Five minutes later, he silently picked up his phone again.","An Zhou: [Sounds good.]","He. Was. A. Gentleman.","...","On the day of the lunch date, Qin You stepped out of her car.","As she walked toward the restaurant, she passed by a couple.","Catching a glimpse of the man's face from the corner of her eye, she paused and turned to take another look.","The heir to the Shen family?","When she was looking up information last night, the man in the photos did seem to look like him.","Her gaze lingered briefly on the girl next to him before she looked away.","Entering the restaurant, Qin You finally saw her blind date for the day.","The man was sitting in his chair, looking down at his phone. He had a clean-cut appearance, giving off the vibe of a young entrepreneur, pretty much matching the photos she saw online.","At the very least, he was better than her previous blind dates.","She walked over, lowered her eyes, and said evenly:","\"You must be Mr. An, right?\"","Hearing her voice, the man's movements stiffened. He slowly raised his head, his eyes filled with surprise and a trace of barely perceptible panic.","...Panic?","She paused slightly, thinking she must have misread his expression.","Immediately, he locked his phone screen, hurriedly stood up, and extended a hand with a smile. \"Hello, hello, Miss Qin. I'm An Zhou.\"","She reached out and shook his hand. \"Just call me Qin You.\"","The man nodded repeatedly. Suddenly, he bent down, picked up a bouquet of flowers from the table, and seemed to want to hand them to her.","Qin You paused and raised a hand to politely decline. \"I'm sorry, could you put those down? I'm allergic to pollen.\"","At her words, he let out an awkward laugh and stiffly lowered his arm, setting the flowers back down. \"Sorry... I didn't think that through.\"","\"It's fine, it's my own issue.\"","Qin You was already used to this.","A few of her previous blind dates had also given her flowers. Usually, this kind of rocky start with a rejection meant that the rest of the date wouldn't go too smoothly.","Qin You hadn't held out much hope for this blind date, but she realized... the man sitting across from her seemed incredibly nervous.","During the meal, the man wore a smile and pushed a plate of pre-cut steak toward her, his movements a bit unnatural.","\"Um, here, you can have this. I cut it for you.\"","Qin You reached out and took it. \"Thank you.\"","\"You're welcome.\"","Their fingertips accidentally brushed against each other. He froze, immediately withdrew his hand, and pretended nothing had happened.","She paused slightly, picked up her glass to take a sip of water, a thoughtful look in her eyes.","Throughout the entire meal, the man would occasionally bring up new topics, seemingly terrified of awkward silences.","She didn't really like talking while eating, so she merely gave light, agreeable responses.","Later, they went to see a movie. Qin You had actually already seen this film once, but she still accompanied An Zhou to watch it again.","Feeling a bit bored in her seat, she propped her chin on her hand and casually glanced over at him.","In the dimly lit theater, the man sat perfectly straight. He didn't look like he was here to watch a movie; it looked more like he was attending a board meeting.","When a funny scene came on, he slightly raised a hand to cover his mouth. The corners of his lips twitched from the effort of holding it in. He looked like he desperately wanted to laugh but didn't dare, making his entire expression look somewhat bizarre.","\"...\"","She stared at him for a few seconds, raised an eyebrow, and silently curled her lips into a smile.","Interesting.","...","On the sofa, Mother Qin was holding her phone, chatting with Mother An.","Hearing the sound of the front door opening, she looked up.","\"Youyou is back.\"","Qin You gave a hum of acknowledgment, put down her bag, opened the fridge, and took out some ice water.","Mother Qin stood up and asked with a look of anticipation, \"You met the An family's boy today, right? How was it?\"","Qin You's movement of twisting off the bottle cap paused for a fraction of a second before returning to normal. \"It was fine. I'm quite satisfied.\"","Although the guy was a bit silly, she could at least tell he didn't have a bad heart.","He fit her criteria.","Mother Qin was shocked.","To think it was such high praise!","\"Really? Then I'm going to tell your Auntie An.\"","\"Really.\"","Thinking back to the man's behavior today, Qin You leaned her hands against the table and mused, \"However, he didn't seem too satisfied with me.\"","It was only after meeting him that she realized he seemed a bit averse to the whole blind date thing.","She turned to look at her mother. \"Before we get married, An Zhou and I will spend some time interacting and getting to know each other better first.\"","...","Their first official date.","An Zhou actually didn't really want to go on a date. It was just a loveless arranged marriage, so what was the point of nurturing feelings? Besides, given Miss Qin's demeanor, was she even willing to nurture feelings with him?","But before heading out, An Zhou still dressed up a bit.","Parking his car at the gate, he sent a message to a certain young lady, then stepped out of the car to wait for her.","The villa's front door opened. The woman was wearing a plain, off-white long dress. It was simple and understated, yet exuded the elegance of a good upbringing. Her lightly made-up face looked cool and aloof.","An Zhou walked over to open the car door for her.","However, the woman stopped in her tracks, glanced over, and swept her gaze up and down his outfit a few times.","An Zhou was used to her cold and indifferent expression, but being stared at like this made him think there was something wrong with what he was wearing.","Just as he was about to look down and check, the woman's voice suddenly rang in his ears.","\"You look nice today.\"","This unexpected sentence made him freeze instantly. He stood there stupidly holding the door handle, unable to process it.","\"Huh?\"","Holy crap? Did she just compliment him?","Or was there something wrong with his ears?","By the time he finally snapped out of it, the woman had already gotten into the car.","He closed the door, walked around to the other side, and got in. Still somewhat in disbelief, he started the engine while glancing at the passenger seat.","\"Were you... genuinely complimenting me just now?\"","Or was she being sarcastic?","The woman was leaning back against her seat with her eyes closed, resting. Hearing this, she replied calmly, \"I was genuinely complimenting you.\"","Her tone lacked emotion, yet it inexplicably made one feel that she wasn't lying.","An Zhou was delighted to hear this.","After all, this aloof young lady almost never had a word of praise cross her lips.","And today, she had actually taken the initiative to compliment him.","He knew he definitely looked handsome like this.","Unable to hold back, he fussed a bit with his perfectly styled hair. \"Keep it low-key, low-key. I just threw this together.\"","Despite what he said, the smile on his face was impossible to hide. His tone brimmed with pride, and he couldn't even stop himself from humming a tune as he drove.","Qin You cast a sidelong glance at him, the corners of her lips curling up slightly before she closed her eyes again.","He really was quite silly."]},{"number":142,"title":"Chapter 142: Extra Story: Anzhou × You Qin 02","paragraphs":["The second date.","An Zhou drove to a dance studio following the address Qin You had given him.","He got out of the car and looked up at the sign above the entrance.","\"So she teaches dance?\"","Arriving over ten minutes early, An Zhou stood downstairs for a while, but couldn't resist his curiosity and went inside to take a look.","Faint music drifted into his ears, accompanied by a woman's voice counting beats.","After going inside, there were already some parents waiting upstairs, so his presence didn't seem out of place.","To allow parents to better watch their children dance, the studio had transparent glass walls, offering a clear view of the inside from the hallway.","An Zhou instantly spotted that familiar figure.","Inside the dance studio, the woman was wearing a light purple leotard that hugged her curves, highlighting her long legs and slender waist.","She was helping a little girl adjust her posture. Her eyes were lowered, a faint smile graced her lips, and her hair was tied in a low ponytail, revealing a stretch of fair neck.","An Zhou paused slightly and raised an eyebrow.","So this Miss Qin actually knew how to smile.","After class, Qin You wiped her sweat. Glancing up accidentally, she saw An Zhou standing outside.","Their eyes met. The man froze for a moment before giving a small, discreet wave.","She paused slightly as a student's voice rang out in front of her.","\"Bye-bye, Teacher Qin~\"","She snapped back to reality, smiling as she looked down and waved. \"Bye-bye.\"","Looking up and seeing An Zhou still watching her, she grabbed her things and was just about to walk over when a shrill woman's voice suddenly pierced her ears.","\"You little slut! Seducing my husband!\"","Turning her head, she saw a woman marching over aggressively. Stopping right in front of her, the woman raised her hand to strike.","Qin You stepped back, intending to dodge, but her wrist was suddenly grabbed. In the next second, she fell into a warm embrace.","The man's displeased voice sounded from above her head.","\"Hey, why are you getting physical?\"","The woman missed her slap and looked even more furious. \"Me, getting physical? This little tramp seduced my husband! Doesn't she deserve to be hit?\"","As she spoke, she looked at the bystanders. \"Look at this! A homewrecker like her is a teacher! Are you really comfortable leaving your children with this kind of teacher!?\"","Qin You recovered her wits and frowned as she looked at the woman in front of her. \"You seem to have misunderstood something. What seduction? I have never done such a thing.\"","\"Ha! Never done it! I have proof right here!\" The woman took out her phone and pulled up some chat records. \"You message my husband every few days! Are you saying you don't have feelings for him? No wonder he's been volunteering to pick up the kid lately, it turns out you've been luring him here!\"","Qin You got a clear look at the chat contents and the profile picture, and her eye twitched. \"Ma'am, this is normal work communication and check-ins. I do this with every parent. There is absolutely no seduction involved.\"","The woman remained highly agitated. \"Bullshit! Then why didn't you message me? You only messaged the child's father. To put it bluntly, you just wanted to seduce him!\"","Exhausted, Qin You pinched the bridge of her nose. \"Because the phone number left on our file was the father's.\"","The woman wanted to keep arguing, but a man's voice cut her off.","\"She has no reason to seduce your husband. He's completely beneath her notice.\"","The woman frowned and glared at him. \"Who are you?\"","An Zhou's tone was calm. \"Her fiance.\"","The woman paused slightly.","Qin You also froze, looking up at him.","An Zhou didn't think there was any problem with this. Their families had already met, and Qin You had kissed him before, so of course he was her fiance.","He took out his phone. \"I will call the police. Everything you've just said has already caused reputational damage to my girlfriend.\"","As the CEO of a company, managing thousands of employees, An Zhou truly exuded a sense of oppression when he got serious, his face completely devoid of expression.","The woman's expression changed slightly. \"What slander! I have proof right here that she seduced him!\"","As soon as she finished speaking, the voices of several other parents drifted over.","\"Oh, you must be mistaken. Teacher Qin is very responsible; there's no way something like this happened.\"","\"I received those messages too. There's nothing wrong with them.\"","\"You shouldn't slander the young lady.\"","As the murmurs spread, the woman's face turned ugly. Unable to swallow her pride, she said stiffly, \"Keep believing her then! You'll regret it when it happens to you. Anyway, I won't let my child stay here anymore!\"","After saying that, she turned and left.","Seeing her run off just like that, An Zhou was about to speak when someone pressed down on his arm.","Qin You shook her head at him. \"Forget it.\"","After packing up her things and heading downstairs, they got back into the car. An Zhou's expression was a bit complicated.","After holding it in for a while, he finally couldn't help but ask, \"Do the people at your studio not know you're Miss Qin?\"","Why was she staying silent while being bullied as a teacher, instead of just using her status to crush them?","Qin You buckled her seatbelt. Hearing this, she was stunned for a moment before letting out a soft laugh.","Suddenly hearing her laugh, An Zhou paused and turned to look at her. \"What are you laughing at?\"","Qin You raised a hand to fix her hair. \"Things like this happen often. In this line of work, there are always some troublesome parents. I'm used to it.\"","She turned to look at An Zhou, a very faint smile still lingering on her face.","\"But thank you anyway.\"","An Zhou's body stiffened slightly, and he almost slammed his foot on the brakes.","He coughed, feeling a bit embarrassed. \"You're welcome. It was nothing.\"","Taking advantage of a red light, he glanced over at the passenger seat.","The woman was looking down, handling some matters on her phone, her face having already reverted to its usual indifferent expression.","He clicked his tongue and silently turned his head back. She really changed faces fast.","She looked so pretty when she smiled; she really ought to smile more.","...","Later on, An Zhou truly realized just how hard to please this Miss Qin was.","She only ate fat-loss meals, checked the calories even for snacks, disliked talking while eating, and only ate fruit that was already peeled and cut. After class, she had to go home and shower before a date. When chatting, he had to be the one to initiate, and she would reply selectively, only gracing him with a smile if she was in a good mood.","Was he looking for a wife or an ancestor to worship?","Moreover, he had no idea why she had agreed to this marriage alliance in the first place, as she didn't look like someone who wanted to get married at all.","That was until later. During one of their dates, he was playing a claw machine while Qin You watched him from the side. Suddenly, her phone rang.","After answering, whatever the person on the other end said caused her expression to change instantly.","Before he could react, she suddenly turned and walked out, completely forgetting to take her bag that was slung over his shoulder.","Snapping back to his senses, An Zhou quickly chased after her and grabbed her wrist. \"What's wrong? Everything was fine, why...\"","But when she turned around, he saw the panic and unease in the woman's eyes.","\"I need to go to the hospital.\" Her voice was very soft, hiding an almost imperceptible tension.","Hearing this, An Zhou paused slightly and made a decision almost instantly, taking her hand and leading her outside.","\"Okay, I'll take you.\"","...","Once they arrived at the hospital, An Zhou finally understood what was going on.","Qin You's grandmother had terminal cancer, and her condition had suddenly deteriorated, sending her into the emergency room.","By the time they arrived, the surgery was already over. Fortunately, it was successful. The elderly woman had been transferred to the intensive care unit and was currently under observation.","An Zhou stood by the bed, his gaze falling on the unconscious elderly woman.","Then, he turned his head to look beside him.","The woman sat in the chair wearing an isolation gown, tightly holding the elderly woman's hand. Her head was lowered, her expression obscured, but her shoulders trembled slightly.","An Zhou's gaze softened in a slight daze. He slowly raised his hand, letting it hover in the air for a moment. Just as he was about to lower it, a voice caught him off guard.","\"Grandma... didn't you say you wanted to see me get married?\"","His movements instantly stopped.","The woman's tone was very light and slow, yet it sounded distinctly clear in the quiet intensive care unit.","\"I'm not married yet, so you can't leave. Didn't you say you'd only be at peace after seeing me happy? I'm not happy yet.\"","Her trailing words trembled more and more, eventually carrying a faint sob.","An Zhou fell silent for a moment before finally lowering his hand. He didn't say a word, just slowly stroked her back over and over in silent comfort, while her trembling sobs gradually grew clearer.","An Zhou went out to buy some water. When he returned, Qin You was sitting on the bench outside. He walked over and handed her a water bottle. \"Drink some water.\"","Qin You took the water, her voice still very soft. \"Thank you.\"","An Zhou didn't know what to say. He sat beside her, trying his best to find a topic of conversation. \"Are your parents still out of town?\"","Qin You nodded.","The air fell into a momentary silence.","An Zhou was still trying to think of something to say when he heard the woman say hoarsely, \"You heard it, didn't you?\"","He paused.","The woman kept her head bowed. Her hair slipped gently down the side of her face, covering a small portion of it and revealing a slender chin with faint tear stains still lingering on it.","She raised her hand to gently wipe a teardrop from the corner of her eye and said softly:","\"The doctor said Grandma has a few months left at most. Since then, I started going on blind dates. I've met all sorts of bizarre men.\"","Her only requirement for them was to have a decent moral character, someone she could take back to show her grandmother.","\"Whether I get married or not doesn't really matter to me. But Grandma wants to see me happy, and I don't want her to leave this world feeling guilty.\"","She looked up, the corners of her eyes tinted with a faint red.","\"So, could I ask you to put on an act with me? I can tell you don't want to get married either. After Grandma passes away, I promise to grant you a divorce.\"","But for the CEO of a major corporation, a marriage of convenience followed by a divorce would spark quite a bit of public gossip, and could even impact the company's finances.","That was partly why Qin You hadn't wanted to go on blind dates with anyone from their social circle in the first place.","But right now, no one was more suited for this role than An Zhou.","Hearing this, An Zhou looked at her without speaking, his eyes carrying complex emotions.","Qin You clenched her palms. \"I will do my best to compensate you for any losses caused by the divorce.\"","The air was quiet for a moment before the man suddenly let out a sigh.","He reached out and pulled her into his arms, his palm gently stroking the back of her head.","\"Sigh, Miss Qin, you might not understand my family's situation. If I get married and then divorced, my family will beat me to death.\"","His tone was deliberately helpless and bright, yet it carried a reassuring steadiness. \"Isn't it just acting? Don't worry, my sister is a producer. I'll have her teach me when the time comes. I guarantee you'll be satisfied, okay?\"","\"It's one thing that you give me a cold face every day and the number of times you smile can be counted on one hand, but why are you crying now?\"","An Zhou thought for a moment and added, \"If you want to thank me, just let me skip a few of those fat-loss meals on our future dates. I really want to eat at a proper restaurant.\"","Qin You pressed her lips tightly together. Tears seeped out silently, falling onto the man's shoulder, but she still let out a soft laugh.","\"...That's a no.\"","An Zhou: \"...\"","Heartless little thing.","...","After Grandma Qin woke up, An Zhou went to see the elderly woman.","Before Qin You could speak, he set down the gifts in his hands and took the initiative to smile and say, \"Hello, Grandma. I'm An Zhou, and I'm also Youyou's fiancé.\"","Grandma Qin knew of this An Zhou, but today was the first time they were meeting. She replied warmly, \"Good, good.\"","An Zhou chatted with Grandma the entire time, leaving Qin You sitting to the side without even a chance to get a word in.","Taking advantage of the moment he poured hot water, he turned his back to Grandma Qin and, looking as if he were claiming credit, raised an eyebrow. \"How did I do? Am I not excellent at controlling the room?\"","Qin You was beside him picking out fruits. Hearing this, she gave a faint nod.","\"Much more natural than on the day of our blind date.\"","An Zhou: \"...\" During the blind date, a certain someone didn't smile the entire time. How could he not be nervous?","Qin You handed him an apple. \"Peel this for Grandma. I'll take the hot water back.\"","An Zhou: \"Do you want to eat one?\"","Qin You thought about it and handed him another one. \"Yes.\"","\"Okay.\"","Grandma Qin sat on the hospital bed, watching their interaction with a faint smile in her eyes.","When Qin You came over with the hot water, she suddenly smiled and said softly:","\"Grandma is at ease now.\"","She was slightly taken aback, and then the corners of her lips curled up.","...","If you asked Qin You what her most regrettable decision was, it was telling An Zhou that she had been on many blind dates.","Because ever since they got married, An Zhou would bring it up from time to time to make comparisons and elevate himself.","\"Do I look handsome in this? Am I not much more handsome than your previous blind dates?\"","\"...\"","\"I was very much a gentleman during our blind date, wasn't I? Your other blind dates definitely couldn't compare to me.\"","\"...\"","\"You shouldn't have gone on blind dates in the first place. A high-quality man like your husband right here is a hundred times better than those blind dates of yours.\"","\"...\"","\"Hey, what kind of weirdos were those blind dates anyway? What did they do at the time? Tell me about it, won't you? I want to hear.\"","Qin You couldn't bear it any longer. If this continued, her ears would develop calluses.","She simply turned her back to him, closing her eyes to sleep, her tone cold.","\"If you keep being noisy, you can go sleep in the living room.\"","\"...\"","An Zhou instantly shut his mouth, but his muttered tone still carried a hint of dissatisfaction. \"You were the one who begged me to act with you in the beginning, and now that the acting is done, you treat me like this? Even if we're married, you can't just use me and ignore me.\"","He glanced at the back of the woman beside him again, fell silent for a moment, and then spoke up anyway, \"Hey, if I agreed to divorce you, would you divorce me now? You wouldn't be able to find anyone better than me, right? Which of those blind dates was better than me?\"","Qin You paused slightly, unexpectedly catching the underlying meaning in An Zhou's words.","She opened her eyes and turned her head to look at the man behind her.","An Zhou was also looking at her. \"What? Would you really go on blind dates? I'm telling you, those guys out there—\"","Before he could finish his sentence, his hand was grasped.","\"I won't go on blind dates with anyone else. I'll only marry you, is that okay?\"","An Zhou paused and said hesitantly, \"Really? Even though it's impossible, hypothetically, if a man with better conditions than me appeared, would you—\"","\"No one will be better than you.\"","Qin You looked at him, her tone serious. \"You are the best.\"","An Zhou was delighted to hear this.","He smiled brightly and leaned over to hug his wife.","\"Youyou is the best.\""]},{"number":143,"title":"Chapter 143: Extra: London","paragraphs":["The dark, heavy sky pressed down. A drizzling rain drifted under the eaves, looking like fine silk threads beneath the streetlights.","At the entrance of a high-end Japanese restaurant, An Ling saw off the investors.","Having had a few drinks in the private room just now, her face felt faintly hot. She stood there and took out her phone to call a designated driver. The cool night breeze blew rain against her face, dissipating the heat.","Only after someone accepted the order did she return to the private room.","The two interns who had tagged along, a man and a woman, were still there. The man was currently passed out drunk at the table, while the girl sat in her chair.","Seeing her approach, the girl quickly stood up. \"Sister Ah Leng, is there anything else we need to do later?\"","\"No, that's all.\" An Ling glanced around the private room. \"Where's Brother Nan?\"","\"Brother Nan went to the restroom.\"","Just as she spoke, the door to the private room opened, and Nan Zhechuan walked in.","An Ling pointed to the passed-out intern on the table. \"Brother Nan, I called a designated driver. You take that intern back, and I'll take the other one.\"","\"Alright,\" Nan Zhechuan agreed.","At this moment, the female intern suddenly raised her hand to interrupt. \"Um... actually, my boyfriend is waiting for me outside right now, so you don't need to go out of your way, Sister Ah Leng.\"","An Ling paused upon hearing this, inexplicably feeling that these words sounded familiar.","But she didn't think much of it and simply nodded. \"Okay, you go on ahead then. Be safe on the road. You've worked hard these past few days. The upcoming tasks will be lighter, so get some good rest.\"","\"You've worked hard too, Sister Ah Leng.\" The intern quickly grabbed her bag and hurried out of the private room. \"I'm leaving now, bye-bye.\"","An Ling waved at her, then turned to see Nan Zhechuan holding up the drunk intern. \"Need some help?\"","\"No need.\" Nan Zhechuan draped the man's arm over his own shoulder.","As he stood up and walked out, he suddenly smiled and said, \"That intern just now really resembles you.\"","An Ling was taken aback. \"Huh?\"","\"I mean, finishing up a business dinner and having a partner come to pick you up.\"","Nan Zhechuan raised an eyebrow. \"But things seem different now. We've been out checking venues these past few days, and I haven't seen Director Shen come to pick you up. Is this just how an old married couple gets along?\"","An Ling couldn't help but laugh. \"No, Shen Linyan recently went abroad on a business trip. He won't be back until next week.\"","Besides, because the business trip was going to be so long, Shen Linyan had asked her to go with him, suggesting they treat it as a vacation. But she was too busy with work these past few days and simply had no time, so she flat-out refused.","Because of this, the night before his trip, the man pestered her several times. It was truly overwhelming, and the hickeys on her body took days to fade.","\"No wonder,\" Nan Zhechuan said as he got into the car. \"I'm actually a bit unaccustomed to him not being here.\"","Watching the car drive away, An Ling blinked.","Unaccustomed?","The designated driver called, snapping her back to reality. She looked down and answered the phone.","...","\"Beep—\" the sound of the lock unlocking rang out.","An Ling entered and changed her shoes.","Huihui trotted over and rubbed against her pant leg.","\"Give Mommy a kiss before you can have treats.\" She bent down, scooped up the cat, and kissed its furry little head.","Setting the cat down, she walked to the living room, opened a pack of treats for Huihui, and took out her phone while feeding it.","At this hour, it should be noon where Shen Linyan was.","An Ling: [Hubby, have you eaten lunch yet? ^^]","Just as she finished feeding a small dried fish, a reply came through.","Hubby: [I've eaten ^^ I'm at the hotel right now. Is my wife done with work?]","An Ling: [Yes! I'm home now, feeding Huihui dried fish.]","Hubby: [I want to see.]","She snapped a picture of Huihui munching on the dried fish and sent it over.","An Ling: [(Image) Cute, right?]","Hubby: [Cute, but actually, I want to see my wife.]","An Ling paused for a moment before the corners of her lips curled up. Instantly understanding the man's meaning, she tapped the video call button.","She stood up, tossed the treat bag into the trash can, and walked back to her room with her phone. The video call connected at the same time.","Before she could speak, a voice came through the phone first.","\"My wife is back earlier than usual today.\"","The man's voice drifted through the receiver, deep and magnetic. It fell softly on her ear, laced with a faint trace of fatigue, yet incredibly gentle.","On the screen, Shen Linyan appeared to be sitting on a sofa. His dark suit was impeccably ironed, and he was wearing the tie she had given him. The light fell on his sharp contours, making him look pale, aloof, and noble.","\"I didn't go to the set today. I had dinner with the investors.\"","An Ling opened her bedroom door and walked in. \"Are you busy this afternoon?\"","Shen Linyan nodded. \"I have to go meet Damian in a bit.\"","An Ling lay on the bed, holding up her phone to look at him. She blinked, her eyes clear and transparent under the light, shimmering with a faint watery glint.","Shen Linyan was also looking at her. He was most familiar with this look of his wife's. His eyes slowly curved into a smile, and his voice was deep and soft. \"Have you been drinking?\"","An Ling gave a soft hum of agreement and turned on her side. Her soft hair slipped down her cheek. She raised a hand to tidy her hair, her fair cheek sinking into the dark quilt. Her voice was softened by the alcohol.","\"After dinner today, I was planning to take an intern home, but the intern said her boyfriend was coming to pick her up. Then a colleague said she was a lot like me. Do you know why?\"","The man gently played along, \"Why?\"","An Ling's eyes brimmed with a smile. \"Because he said I used to always be like that too. I didn't need them to take me home, saying you would come to pick me up.\"","Shen Linyan seemed about to say something, but his movements suddenly paused. Then, he pressed a fist to his lips, turned his head aside, and let out a few deep coughs.","She was startled. \"Do you have a cold? I saw the weather forecast, and the temperature in London is very low. You need to wear more clothes; what you have on isn't enough.\"","\"No, honey, I just accidentally choked.\" Shen Linyan's tone held a smile, though his voice carried a hint of hoarseness from coughing.","An Ling wanted to say more, but then she heard the man's gentle voice.","\"So, did you miss me?\"","She instantly stopped, a slight blush creeping onto her face. After a few seconds of silence, she held out her hand and gestured a tiny amount. \"Probably about this much.\"","Shen Linyan smiled and held out his hand, gesturing a width twice as large as hers. \"Then I must miss you this much. There's still a bit of wrap-up work to do, and I'll be back next week.\"","\"Okay.\" An Ling still couldn't help but add worriedly, \"Remember to take care of yourself, don't get sick.\"","\"I will. You too, my wife. Rest early.\"","After hanging up, An Ling lay on the bed with her eyes closed, but she didn't feel very sleepy. Without the man's voice, the large bedroom felt empty.","When she was busy before, she would come back so tired that she'd fall asleep the moment her head hit the pillow. Now that she finally had some free time, she suddenly felt for the first time that this house was a bit empty and quiet.","A moment later, she opened her eyes, grabbed her phone from the side, and opened a ticket-booking app, muttering softly:","\"I really am a bit unaccustomed to it.\""]},{"number":144,"title":"Chapter 144: Extra Story: London [The End]","paragraphs":["Landing at Heathrow Airport, An Ling finally felt that she must have truly had too much to drink when she bought the ticket last night.","To think she actually came here on a whim.","Did she really miss Shen Linyan that much?","Her face flushed slightly, and she gave a soft cough. Soon after, a voice sounded by her ear.","\"Ma'am, please get in the car.\" Secretary Chen placed her luggage in the trunk and opened the back door for her.","An Ling got into the car. \"Shen Linyan still doesn't know I'm here, right?\"","\"Yes, the young master is out today, and he doesn't know I came to pick you up either.\"","Heaven knows how shocked Secretary Chen was when he received An Ling's message yesterday.","He glanced at the backseat through the rearview mirror, hesitating for a moment before asking, \"But, why did you come so suddenly?\"","An Ling looked up from her phone. \"I came as soon as my work was finished. Will it interfere with your work?\"","\"No, not at all.\" Secretary Chen paused. \"The young master will definitely be thrilled that you're here. However... did you know that he caught a cold recently?\"","An Ling was stunned.","\"A cold?\"","...","\"You've had this cold and cough for days now, are you sure you don't need to see a doctor? Why do you catch a cold every time you come to London?\"","Damian's voice sounded from behind.","Shen Linyan stopped coughing, pulled down his mask, took some medicine out of his pocket, popped a pill into his mouth, and swallowed it dry.","His voice was hoarse and carried a hint of exhaustion. \"It's nothing serious. It will clear up on its own in a few days. Going to the hospital here won't do much good; I might as well wait until I return to China to get it checked.\"","Damian walked out of the building, raising an eyebrow with a smile. \"True.\"","Seeing this, he chuckled. \"It reminds me of the first time I met you. You were sick and coughing just like this, with heavy dark circles under your eyes. It was obvious you hadn't been getting any good sleep. And sure enough, working four jobs a day—I really admire you.\"","Shen Linyan paused and gave a soft \"Mm.\"","Damian sighed. \"But I'm still disappointed your wife didn't come. You promised you'd bring her along next time.\"","\"She's busy with work.\" Shen Linyan's tone softened a bit.","Damian got into his car and turned to look at Shen Linyan. \"Aren't you leaving? I remember your secretary isn't here, right? Let me drop you off at your hotel.\"","Shen Linyan shook his head. \"No need, you go ahead.\"","After the car drove away, he slipped his hands into his pockets and turned to look at the street.","The foreign streets, unfamiliar faces, and strange language pieced together almost nine years of Shen Linyan's life.","From the first time he set foot on this land, he had lived merely to survive. Pushing himself to the limit, draining his body, his daily sleep was brutally compressed to just two or three hours, like an endlessly running machine.","Later, he was finally noticed by Damian, and his life seemed to take a turn for the better.","But to him, it was no different from before.","Shen Linyan didn't even know what he was doing all this for. Was it to take revenge on the Shen family? To gain that momentary thrill—and then what?","Even if he just stayed silent like this and died quietly abroad, no one would remember the eldest son of the Shen family. No one would know all the suffering and humiliation he had endured, and certainly no one would feel an ounce of pity for him.","The only one who could exact revenge on the Shen family was himself.","So every time he returned to London, during countless silent nights, he felt as if he had gone back to the past.","Back to the old him—having lost his soul, leaving only hypocrisy, an empty shell forcefully stuffed with hatred and obsession.","Shen Linyan lowered his gaze, coughed softly twice, and adjusted his mask. The wedding ring on his ring finger stood out as he took out his phone.","He remembered there was a very famous chocolate shop nearby.","Although Shen Linyan had never tasted it, the female students used to talk about it a lot when he was studying here.","His wife would probably like it too.","He walked into the shop, took a picture, and sent it to An Ling.","Shen Linyan: [Does my wife like chocolate?]","Wife: [Love it, love it! (≧∇≦)ノ Is hubby going to buy some for me?]","A smile flashed through his eyes, and his lips curled up.","Shen Linyan: [Yes. (≧∇≦)ノ]","After buying the items, he returned to the hotel.","Shen Linyan carried the bag into the elevator and pressed his floor button.","At that moment, a young woman carrying a suitcase also entered the elevator. A hat and a mask obscured her face, and her soft, slightly curly long hair cascaded down her back.","He didn't pay much attention, stepping aside to make room and waiting for the elevator to go up.","The air was quiet, leaving only the mechanical hum of the elevator.","The woman beside him suddenly spoke up: \"Is that chocolate you're holding?\" Her voice was slightly muffled under the mask, lowered so her tone was indistinct.","He paused, turning his head to see that she was talking to him, and gave a brief \"Mm.\"","The woman pressed on, \"Is it good?\"","\"...Sorry, I'm not really sure.\"","The woman let out a soft \"Oh.\" Seemingly oblivious to his cold attitude, her voice was gentle. \"Then can I try one? Because my husband said he's going to buy some for me too, so I want to taste it first.\"","Shen Linyan's movements froze, and he turned to look at her.","His gaze fell on her suitcase and clothes, and he blanked for a moment. Finally, his eyes landed on the wedding ring on her ring finger, and his pupils suddenly dilated in shock.","\"Ding—\"","The elevator doors opened, but neither of them moved.","Finally, An Ling looked up at him, her eyes curving into a smile from under the brim of her hat.","\"What a coincidence, you live on the same floor as my husband.\"","Shen Linyan stared unblinkingly at the person in front of him. Countless emotions seemed to surge in the depths of his eyes, so clear they were almost scalding, yet he forcefully suppressed them.","After a moment of silence, he handed over the bag of chocolates, took her suitcase with his other hand, and led her by the hand out of the elevator.","The man's fingertips were cool, but he held on very tightly.","An Ling blinked and smiled as she walked out with him.","Shen Linyan's voice was very soft. \"When did you get here? Why didn't you tell me?\"","\"I just arrived not long ago. I wanted to give you a surprise. Were you surprised?\" An Ling tilted her head to look at him.","Shen Linyan's eyes curved. \"Very surprised.\"","Entering the room, An Ling took off her hat and mask, looking around the room.","\"Are you tired, dear?\"","\"A little.\"","She sat on the bed and lay back. \"Mostly just sleepy. I caught an early flight today, so I had to get up super early to pack my bags.\"","\"Have you had lunch?\"","\"Not yet, but I was planning to—\"","An Ling looked up and saw the man standing by the table, watching her, and her voice abruptly cut off.","She blinked and patted the spot next to her. \"Why are you standing so far away? Come sit here.\"","Shen Linyan pursed his lips. \"I have a cold. I'll pass it to you.\"","\"I know.\"","An Ling shifted her position, propping up her head to look at him. \"It doesn't matter, I don't mind. Come over here.\"","Shen Linyan met her gaze for a moment before finally compromising, walking over and sitting on the edge of the bed.","An Ling scrambled up and skillfully straddled his lap.","The man's body stiffened slightly, but his hands still wrapped around her waist. He leaned his head back slightly, his tone carrying a hint of helplessness. \"Baby, it's contagious.\"","An Ling blinked, her gaze sweeping over the faint dark circles under the man's eyes. \"So I finally made it all the way here, and you want me to keep my distance from you the whole time? Then I might as well go back tonight.\"","Shen Linyan's arms tightened slightly around her, and he said softly, \"No.\"","\"Then don't go back.\" She smiled, her eyes curving into crescents, and kissed his chin. \"We are husband and wife, we're bound to touch. There's no hiding from it. I still want to sleep with you tonight. Don't you want to sleep with me?\"","Shen Linyan paused. Seeming swayed by her words, he looked down at her.","An Ling took the initiative to kiss the corner of his lips and said with a beaming smile, \"There, now you really can't hide. You have to take responsibility for me. Hubby, sleep with me for a while, okay? I'm exhausted. We can go eat after we wake up.\"","The slight pout in her trailing voice tugged tightly at Shen Linyan's heartstrings, making his entire body tense.","He had missed her so terribly much. Now that she was right here in his arms, a surging desire screamed at him to kiss her, to devour her.","He had never been able to refuse An Ling, nor could he ever.","His Adam's apple bobbed. With a dark, intense look in his eyes, Shen Linyan planted a kiss on her lips, then lightly kissed the tip of her nose. \"Okay.\"","An Ling lay on the bed, his arms wrapped around her waist. She nestled completely into his warm embrace, her nose filled with the man's familiar scent.","Under the covers, the man lowered his head and sucked on her lips, gentle and lingering. He peppered kisses on her face and eyes from time to time, as if trying to make up for all the kisses they had missed during their week apart.","At first, An Ling responded to him, but that response sparked a fire between them, leading to a few more passionate rounds in the bathroom.","By the end of it, she had lost all her strength, lying limply on the bed and letting the man kiss and nibble on her as he pleased.","Now genuinely sleepy, An Ling reached out a hand to cover the man's mouth. \"Alright, time to sleep.\"","Shen Linyan's eyes were filled with satiation. He kissed her palm and helped tuck the loose strands of hair behind her ear. \"Go to sleep, honey.\"","The girl suddenly spoke up, \"You have to actually sleep too.\"","Shen Linyan's expression froze slightly.","He watched as An Ling kept her eyes closed and mumbled, \"Secretary Chen said you go to bed late and wake up early. You video call me every noon instead of catching up on sleep. No wonder you got sick. I told you to rest more before, but you never listen to me. Now I have to come supervise you in person.\"","Coming to his senses, a low chuckle rumbled in his chest. He pulled her closer into his arms, his heart completely full.","\"Okay, honey.\"","An Ling nuzzled her face into his chest. \"Did you study abroad here before? When we wake up, go out with me. I want to see the places where you studied.\"","Shen Linyan lowered his eyes. After a moment, his lips curled into a soft smile. \"Okay, we'll go see.\"","He closed his eyes, smiling as he kissed her forehead, his voice dropping very light.","\"My wife will see it with me.\"","Accompanying him, replacing all that hatred.","So that the next time he set foot on this land, there would be nothing left but memories with his beloved.","—— End of Story ——"]}]);
